window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2601,"title":"Chapter 2601: Chapter 2600 Nice to meet you, greenhorns! II","paragraphs":["A flash of blue.","A glimmer of Extremity.","It was an action that caused even Chamber Master Gayacus and Extremity Ariana among all other Hyperversal Extremities to be utterly shocked!","This was because their mission here was only the Armament of Extremity, and to get their hands on at least a body of the one known as Noah Osmont.","They were supposed to suppress the Hyperversal Extremities here and take their Armament, and that was it! But her wild release of her Hyperversal Haki of Extremity...went to cover the vast lands underneath them as it would smash into any existences- whether they were Apex Aeonic Lifeforms or simply across the Boundary Expansion Realm, or those even weaker.","It wouldn't discriminate as its impact would utterly eviscerate all those it came across!","It was a shocking move they in no way needed to do as it would cause today's incursion to be all that much wilder.","This area of Penumbra was endlessly dark as at this moment, it felt like a blue sun had risen.","Its radiance was so astounding that it reached the Cult of Endless Shadows beneath them in an instant as only now did shouts full of rage and shock rise from the lands below them!","{Preposterous!}","{You dare?!}","{HOLD!}","BOOM!","A shocking impact bloomed.","And chaos of utter proportions unfolded thereafter as an existence of utter Lunacy was released by the Avernus Clan- their child in doing this being a unique one as one wondered what their goals were!","—","Three Hyperversal Extremity Shadows were watching a single being conduct an action that bordered on the realm of impossibility.","It wasn't that the action was an impossibility for an existence to accomplish, but it was simply an impossibility for a being at the same stage as him to do so!","With their senses and the aura that he gave off, they could tell that he at the very most had risen to the 14th or the 15th boundary layer.","He was not close to Extremity.","In fact, the gap from the 15th layer to the 18th layer was a chasm that some beings never crossed their whole lives.","And in the Shadow Sea Plane, they had brought Elders of the Cult of Endless Shadows who had achieved the 17th Boundary Layer and even they took difficult strides just to move a few paces in front of the maddeningly pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of the Shadow Sword.","And yet the one known as Osmont pulsed with string-like vibrations as in the next moment, he turned into a flicker of multi-colored light that instantly streaked across the obsidian tendrils of Hyperversal Authority.","He didn't push these tendrils away nor did they reject him, instead, he seemed to be absorbing them at a shocking pace and speed the further in that he went.","The massive weight that Moona and other Elders of the Cult of Endless Shadows had felt when they first entered this plane holding the Armament of Extremity before them seemed like it did not exist for him- like the shackles of other beings simply did not apply to him!","{What in the world...?}","Moona felt his soul which was already halfway towards Hyperversal Extremity shake at the scene.","Flashing Shadow had his expression become stern as just as he was about to add his input...","His eyes flashed with shock as he gazed up!","{Preposterous!}","He bellowed out with unbridled rage as his vision pierced across the many layers of space and he saw that far above the domains that they were in- a blue light of Hyperversal Extremity Authority was crashing down with malice and danger!","A light that caused even someone like him who had attained Tier 3 Hyperversal Authority to feel a sense of oppression.","He wasn't the only one to bellow out as alongside him was the massive and resounding shout that reverberated out from the depths of the Shadow Fortress.","{HOLD!}","It was a single word stemming from the most powerful being within the Cult of Endless Shadows.","A being who had one of his bodies in this branch that was protecting the Armament of Extremity.","The master of this voice was the one to react the fastest as the instant they noticed the enveloping cerulean Hyperversal Haki of Extremity, an endless sea of shadows erupted from the depth of the Shadow Fortress!","The being known as the Shadow Extremity Overlord had struck out to counter the terrible descending authority that shockingly targeted everything below it.","He wasn't the only one as his authority and the authority of Flashing Shadow, Extremity Gabriella, and over a dozen other Hyperversal Extremities erupted out right away.","The clash...was worse than the fracturing of millions of planes of existence.","BOOM!","The shadowy space in this corner of Penumbra seemed lit up with brilliance and might as if a blue sun had risen.","Reality cracked and splintered.","And in an instant...over half of the domains of the Cult of Endless Shadows in this region were flattened.","And during this whole time, the terrifying Hyperversal Haki of Extremity never faded or erased itself- its grandeur constantly pressing down until from below, the figure of Flashing Shadow and a man wrapped in brilliant shadowy light appeared side by side!","{WHY?!}","The Shadow Extremity Overlord bellowed out as his hand and Flashing Shadow's hands rose as if they were holding the very sky from falling, these two Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities being the ones to stop the raging authority from going any further down.","BOOM!","The overpowering cerulean waves of Haki faded.","It was only now that the surroundings cleared, and the scene of devastation unfolded to everyone's eyes!","Half of the enormous Shadow Fortress which was the size of many Major Planes of Existence was fractured and had pieces falling off.","The Boundary Expansion Realm existences and any Apex Aeonic Lifeforms that were unlucky enough to be in the region that was blanketed by the azure Hyperversal Haki of Extremity...their life force could not be felt.","An unknown number of being had died in an instant as their spirits received a shock of Hyperversal Extremity Authority!","In the midst of such carnage, laughter resounded out from above as the being who had acted raised her whip in the air and thrashed down with terrifying Hyperversal Extremity Authority.","{Nice to meet you, greenhorns.}","...!","A carefree voice of a crazy woman thundered out!"]},{"number":2602,"title":"Chapter 2602: Chapter 2601 A Critical Threshold! I","paragraphs":["Extremity Blue spoke towards the maddened figures of Flashing Shadow and the Shadow Extremity Overlord below her, along with the approximate dozen or so Tier 1 and Tier 2 Extremities who could barely withstand her Haki far below them.","She looked at all of them and smiled with a light of craziness in her eyes.","{You call that flimsy usage of authority that you just released Tier 3? You then ask why? Don't ask such a philosophical question to me now!}","Her voice echoed out as if she had not just slaughtered an untold number of beings.","She was smiling at the beginning of the sentence, and yet her face warped and became rageful towards the end.","{You ask why? Why does reality flow the way it does? Why do we exist and die?}","Her expression changed from rage to a smile once more as she focused on the eyes full of wrath of the Shadow Extremities below her.","{The only why that will matter to you in the next few seconds is...","why are you so weak?}","...!","The reality above became painted blue again as it felt like a massive River of Reality had unfolded from her whip, and it was smashing down with scrutiny towards all those below.","This...was only displaying the might of a single being. And yet, she was not alone.","The moment that she had acted, the beings beside her adapted to the crazy reality she had brought forth and moved right away!","They knew that their objective this time was not a truly powerful Inheritance.","As if to show these there were only two Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities that were able to withstand the might of Extremity Blue at this moment.","Far below the Flashing Shadow and the Shadow Extremity Overlord 12 Tier 2 and 1 Hyperversal Extremities had their eyes burning with rage and incredulity as they secured other locations of the Shadow Fortress and the remaining lands of the Cult of Endless Shadows.","In the depths of the fortress, the figure of Moona and Extremity Gabriella remained as Gabriella's aura shook dangerously- seeming on the border of Tier 2 and Tier 3!","They had to be here to protect the Shadow Sword as it couldn't be left unattended, but at this moment, Extremity Gabriella's gaze utterly changed as she found from the gaps of space...two terrifying auras of Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity Authorities bypassed Flashing Shadow and the Shadow Extremity Overlord who were locked down by the maddening woman radiating blue light as these enemy Extremities made a straight path towards the Shadow Sea Plane that the Armament of Extremity was in.","Extremity Gabriella's face turned utterly sour as she bellowed out for all to hear","{Their objective is the Shadow Sword!}","Her cry was primordial and filled with endless anger.","She couldn't believe the reality currently unfolding as never in recent record had an Inheritance been attacked like this, nor did one ever poach the treasures of another!","Her rage was akin to fuel as she squeezed every ounce of her power.","Even though she knew that the beings coming down were much more powerful than her...she would not let them succeed in their aim.","From her...","{Hyperversal Extremity Expansion}.","...!","{Endless Shadows}!","...!","Reality became distorted as waves of Endless Shadows began to flow.","Beside her, Moona gathered any semblance of Hyperversal Extremity Authority in his body as he struck out as well, their attacks crossing light-years to meet their enemies before they even arrived!","But the enemies that had come were too prepared.","They knew exactly which force they were attacking and how to thwart them. They knew their power as the absolute reality was that they could easily defeat them, with their main goal here being to simply come in and out in a short period of time with everything that they needed.","And so, they did just that.","From above.","Extremity Ariana and Chamber Master Gayacus harrumphed as they exploded with Hyperversal Authority.","Endlessly purple flames cascaded down like a burning sea while a golden light crossed the skies with great speed.","Even further behind them, the veiled Avernus Extremities included in this incursion Erupted with their own authority to clash with the tier 1 and tier 2 Shadow Extremities that mustard up their will to fight back against this unexpected attack!","The whole region was flipped upside down and turned into an apocalyptic chaos as in the midst of all of this...A single being in the very depths of the Shadow Sea Plane ignored all that was happening- his body continuing to shoot towards the massive Armament of Extremity in the distance as before his eyes, more and more prompts rose.","{The 13th Boundary Layer of Shadows has been attained...}","{The 14th Boundary Layer of Shadows has been attained...}","In his vision, everything was pulsing with countless strings all around.","He traversed across the oscillations and vibrations of these strings as the far away Shadow Sword became ever closer, to the point that he knew he needed just a few nanoseconds before he could reach it!","The closer he went, the denser the pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Shadows became as his soul cried out in happiness- absorbing everything endlessly as the cracks within it caused by clashing Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authorities were healed with utmost scrutiny.","But he felt the overwhelming Extremity Authority far above him near.","He felt the ready forces of the Avernus Clan come ever closer!","The Shadow Extremities would not be able to stop them. Gabriella and Moona simply didn't have what it took to stop two powerful Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities from the Avernus Clan for even a few nanoseconds...much less Noah.","His eyes were filled with brilliance and power as in the midst of all of this...he called out softly.","{Domain Expansion}","...!","{Indefatigable Quintessence}.","Indefatigable.","Quintessence!","Many things had changed over the last day as one of these was Indefatigable being taken to the level of a Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity.","Out of the many possible abilities and Domains Noah could have called out, he chose this for no other reason than to erupt and cause even more chaos in the surroundings.","Chaos that may actually stand a chance to affect Hyperversal Extremities!","Chaos to give him enough time to get to the Shadow Sword.","This chaos...was in the form of something deeply connected to the Indefatigable Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity.","BZZT!","The now extremely pure Vacuous Hyperversal Authority within his Soul churned.","Paired with the Domain Expansion of Indefatigable Quintessence he had called out in addition to the extremely pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority he had been absorbing...","CRACK!","It felt like something deep inside his soul broke.","And...","{You have achieved a sufficient level of purity.}","{You are beginning your First Vacuous Awakening!}","...!"]},{"number":2603,"title":"Chapter 2603: Chapter 2602 A Critical Threshold! II","paragraphs":["2602 A Critical Threshold! II","In and out.","Quick was the main objective of the current incursion as the Avernus Extremities wasted no time, and their overwhelming power allowed them to accomplish this with freedom!","Extremity Ariana watched the scene below her coldly as the woman who had tried to release a Hyperversal Extremity Domain finally understood the true gap in their power.","'Barely grasping Tier 3 and thinking you can move faster and with more power?'","Ariana sneered as the scene of the all-encompassing domain of Endless Shadows did not manage to unfold!","Instead, hundreds of massive purple flaming spears the size of realities manifested all around the domain of shadows, piercing it and deflating it like a popped balloon as the one who had called it forth...she had her body pierced by a concentrated purple spear as her stomach was split open while Endless darkness leaked from it!","Beside her, there was a being called Moona.","He seemed to just be grasping Hyperversal Extremity Authority as he...had faced the attention of Chamber Master Gayacus.","'The golden flames of that old man are no joke...'","Ariana thought of such a thing as where the one called Moona used to float, reality around the whole area was scorched as a sea of golden flames erased every record around it!","A Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity facing one that was barely stepping to become Tier 1? The discrepancy in power was so vast that even an instant was enough to erase the weaker side entirely!","This...was how drastic reality had become within the Shadow Sea Plane.","This was how fast Hyperversal Extremities could act!","[The Senatus of Extremity will not stand for this!]","While her Soul and Records were under attack by purple flames filled with a unique Hyperversal Extremity Authority, Gabriella bellowed out with maddening rage.","Yet Extremity Ariana was no longer looking at her as both she and Gayacus were focused on the depths of the plane that was blown wide open and their goals within it.","They saw the massive Armament of Extremity.","They then saw the figure crossing through space was sucking in all the surrounding Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority, his visage about to come in contact with the Shadow Sword!","Seeing his figure ignoring the weight of pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority and even absorbing it en masse, Ariana became stern as before she could even speak, Chamber Master Gayacus caused the above reality to instantly burn liquid gold as the darkness of shadows was being erased rapidly in this region.","[He needs to die with surety.]","They could see it.","His talent.","His potential.","This being making the Avernus Clan an enemy...they had to erase any potential he held early.","They would also let him know that from here on out...he shouldn't expect his ventures to be easy or successful since they had begun their hunt for him!","They wouldn't send Apex Aeonic Lifeforms as just like what they were doing now, Hyperversal Extremities would be the ones to move against him until all of his Records were erased.","Even though Gayacus was making a move as all of nearby reality was turning gold, Extremity Ariana also made a move as an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity leaked from her body- her figure instantly turning into a flash of purple flames.","In front of a Hyperversal Extremity wielding an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity, space was relative.","And Ariana squeezed the space around her in a shocking manner the words of her soul could barely be heard!","[Miniature Wormhole].","...!","Only a glimmer of purple flames flashed as she crossed through and passed all of the raging Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority, her visage instantly appearing before the figure of the being shining with multicolored light!","He had overcome all enemies that Ariana had read about during his conflicts.","He had a talent for overcoming difficulties as Ariana did not want him to even have a sliver of a chance!","Even though she knew that unless this Osmont before her expressed genuine Hyperversal Extremity Authority, he would never be able to even lift the Shadow Sword, much less wield it.","She didn't want him to gain a single thing as at this moment, both she and Chamber Master Gayacus made a move against an existence that had yet to even glimpse Extremity!","If beings like Gabriella were incapacitated while Moona was eradicated, what could Osmont do at this moment?","This was the reality, and yet Ariana didn't let her guard down.","Her visage reformed as her fair hands unfurled to grasp the multicolored being before her.","She had to come in contact with him and spread her Hyperversal Extremity Authority unto him, making sure to trace his Source to all of his bodies and then locating his Records in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity as only then could this being be erased!","Time slowed.","The golden light from Gayacus and the fist hands of Ariana were right there!","Inches away, the True Emperor of Quintessence was about to be grasped by terrifying existences who moved with all their power.","And at such a juncture...","...!","Ariana's deeply purple eyes dilated as her hand that was inches away from Noah's entity changed directions and slapped sideways!","It was because she actually felt a warning as the moment she slapped out, she came in contact with the borders of an emerging obsidian rift of space bordered by a cherry-colored light!","An dark crevice that she had to slap away as an instant later, she also turned her blessed body sideways to evade another emerging rift that was radiating potent Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.","These rifts weren't normal openings of pockets of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.","Extremity Ariana knew them very well as the potency they released confirmed for her that these were the very same Vacuous Hyperversal Domain Rifts that formed in the extreme edges of the Seven Havens!","They also formed in more dangerous regions across the Seven Havens, but the main thing about these crevices was that after one entered them, they could be transported outside of the jurisdiction of the Seven Havens!","If it were the massive established Vacuous Hyperversal Domain Rifts, one could enter them and still find their way back into the Seven Havens by returning to them.","They were stable.","The Vacuous Hyperversal Domain Rifts currently blooming all around...were filled with instability as if they would fade away any second.","If one entered any of these rifts, they would be spat out into an unfamiliar place in the Vacuous Hyperversal Domains as the moment the Rift closed...","their entry to the Seventh Realms was turned away!","They would have to cross outside the range of Space, time, and reality until they found their way back to the Seven Havens!","This was the warning Ariana felt.","Her eyes became even more focused at such a development as all around them, hundreds of such unstable Vacuous Hyperversal Domain Rifts bloomed!","They bought the being who should have landed in the hands of a Ultimate Extremity a nanosecond that he utilized to instantly...","BZZT!","Come in contact with an Armament of Extremity!"]},{"number":2604,"title":"Chapter 2604: Chapter 2603 Awakening! I","paragraphs":["2603 Awakening! I","Armament of Extremity.","To merely hold it, a being that did not have Hyperversal Extremity Authority would find such an action an impossibility.","One could be near it.","One could try to touch it.","But to wield it was an impossibility unless they wrapped their hands in Hyperversal Extremity Authority!","Noah didn't have such an authority in his body, but he did have a soul that had been bathed with Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authority this whole time.","The only thing he was missing was Extremity.","So when his palm landed on a small area of the massive sword anchored in space, what he came in contact with was cold metal that instantly erupted with the most potent Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Shadows yet- along with streams of information on this weapon before him!","And all of it was blasted into his body as it creaked like a vessel taking on too much pressure, and yet he withstood it as the result of such an action...","[Musings of the 16th Boundary Layer of Shadows are emerging within your mind.]","...!","Traces of a 16th Boundary Layer came.","He just needed to hold on until he fully achieved it, and possibly more!","He had released the Domain Expansion of Indefatigable Quintessence as from it, dazzling rifts had emit all around him as they seemed to lead into truly terrible domains.","Alongside it, his Main Body in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven had begun to undergo a change with an uncertain result as the First Vacuous Awakening was occurring!","All of this was provoked by the expansion of Indefatigable Quintessence as even though he did not at all have the power to withstand Extremities, this single cast of a domain had actually granted him precious time.","But that was it.","The enemies that had made a move this time were authentic Extremities.","BZZT!","Behind him, the woman bathed in purple flames evaded all the blooming rifts as if she did not wish to touch them, and when she saw Noah's body surrounded by these very same rifts coming in contact with the Shadow Sword, her dazzling jewel-like eyes blinked as she instantly moved.","Noah felt her shocking movements as Oraculum buzzed in his soul, its authority moving at this time.","Even though it might not work due to the Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority surrounding the Shadow Sword and the enemy Extremities around him.","[Hyperversal Plundering]","WAA!","Noah still tried even more as from above, a bejeweled illusory golden hand formed and plucked down!","And yet, the Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity was much, much faster.","The next time she appeared, she was far above Noah...near the handle of the Shadow Sword.","SAA!","She dodged another set of erupting Vacuous Hyperversal Domain Rifts as her fair hands enlarged and reached out towards the handle of the Armament of Extremity.","She also gazed at the formed bejeweled hand of a Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity as she waved her left hand towards it, a sea of Hyperversal Extremity flames erupting out to devour this hand entirely!","And...","[YAA!]","She emit with even more waves of Hyperversal Extremity Authority with her right hand that instantly restrained the Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Shadows within the handle of the Shadow Sword, Noah's eyes rising and locking with hers at this moment.","\"...\"","[The authority of Hyperversal Plundering has been erased.]","Time felt like it moved at a snail's pace.","Extremity Ariana's eyes burned with purple flames as they seemed to be smiling coldly at Noah.","And he stared back with ferocity as concentrated waves of Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Shadows flowed into him, many prompts rising at the same time as when the being before his eyes pulled the Armament of Extremity upwards!","BOOM!","The pristine Shadow Sword that he was touching the cold metal of was instantly moved back.","And not just that.","The eyes of Extremity Ariana shone coldly while she moved the Shadow Sword back, her Hyperversal Extremity Authority flowed out densely as she tipped the angulation and trajectory slightly.","Just slightly.","And this single alteration turned the sharp blade point of the Armament of Extremity towards Noah's visage.","...!","The single action seemed to have drained a lot from Ariana as her purple eyes dimmed, but she was able to slightly move the Shadow Sword that she now grasped in her hands as she tilted its movement slightly- causing it to point its blade edge towards the one being near it as a moment later- the body of the True Emperor of Quintessence was met with it!","SAA!","A cut appeared in the fold of reality and extended out endlessly, everything seeming like a cut canvas of a painting as in the far distance...","[Ho...]","Chamber Master Gayacus' figure moved sideways to evade this shocking cut of reality.","A cut that stretched out as far as the remnants of the Shadow Fortress and the battling cerulean lunatic who was thrashing the Flashing Shadow and the Shadow Extremity Overlord!","...!","The figure of the True Emperor of Quintessence was the first to face this figure as he faced the sharp end of a wielded Armament of Extremity head on.","The pure pressure and power alone was so shocking that the whole figure of the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity was eviscerated into nothingness right away!","[....]","[Hooo...]","Holding the hilt of Armament of Extremity with a tired gaze, Ariana sighed as her eyes scanned the region below.","Was he really dea-","Her thoughts didn't finish.","Her eyes radiated a profound light of wonder as she saw a bursting singularity near a Vacuous Hyperversal Domain Rift, this singularity instantly emerging to recreate a multicolored stellar existence that stared towards her with an extremely cold gaze!","—","At the same time that Noah faced the sharp end of the Armament of Extremity head on.","The burst of Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Shadows from it was so potent that he drank as much as possible, and by the time he was struck and millions of Damage Values decimated everything about him...","[The 16 Boundary Layer of Shadows has been attained!]","A glorious prompt came.","And then...","[Your Quintessential Hyperversal Vitality Values have been reduced to 1.]","[You have entered a state of Quasi-True Death]","[Due to the nature of the Domain Expansion- Indefatigable Quintessence, your Quintessential Hyperversal Vitality Value will not reduce past 1 until the whole Domain is destroyed.]","[Your Aspects of Existence are reforming.]","...!","A singularity bloomed near a Vacuous Hyperversal Domain Rift as his body reformed!","He gazed at the visage of the purple-flamed Extremity in the distance as countless thoughts crossed his mind.","His enemies this time were actually not dumb.","They moved with precision and power as they just prevented him from making a shocking amount of gains today!"]},{"number":2605,"title":"Chapter 2605: Chapter 2604 Awakening! II","paragraphs":["2604 Awakening! II","Just by being in contact with the Armament of Extremity and being 'killed' by it, he devoured enough Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Shadows to obtain the highest Boundary Layer so far.","The 16th Layer that he couldn't attain from Ahpuch!","It was so pristine as who knew what he could have gained if he was able to remain in contact with the Shadow Sword freely?","Yet the enemies this time actually used their heads as an opportunity was stopped halfway!","And at this time...","[You all are still playing around with him? Wow, let me take a look at this kid.]","The voice of a Lunatic thundered out as an endless cerulean sea descended.","Within it, the figures of Flashing Shadow and the Shadow Extremity Overlord could be seen battling with illusory blue clones of Extremity Blue, her Main Body instantly arriving beside Extremity Ariana as she evaded all the hundreds of Vacuous Hyperversal Domain Rifts in the surroundings!","She was truly battling two other Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities as she found the time to freely gaze at Noah and speak.","[Mmm, another greenhorn. Hey kid, you wanted to spend a little more time with that Armament of Extremity, right?]","Her snow-white hair shone with tendrils of blue as she spoke seriously towards Noah.","Her beauty was utterly devastating as from her serious expression, she smiled like the sweetest being as she continued.","[I'll give it to you...but just let me take a look at your soul for a second. I just want a little peek of your soul, that's it!]","[...]","Ariana shook her head with frustration while muttering under her breath.","'This fucking lunatic...'","She tried her best to control the Armament of Extremity in her hands as she carefully wrapped it with Hyperversal Extremity Authority, turning her head towards Extremity Blue as she spoke out.","[This isn't his main body as I've already killed him once to no avail. The mission is successful for the most part as we need to quickly pull ou-]","HUUM!","Her words didn't finish as she raised her head.","There, in the distance, the auras of fantastically powerful Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities began to appear as Ariana knew their true foes were arriving.","Their faces were masked with white gold masks as without saying a word, their figures moved and erupted with Hyperversal Extremity Authority as they targeted Ariana who grabbed hold of the Shadow Sword, along with Extremity Blue and Chamber Master Gayacus!","Extremity Blue gazed up at this as she smiled gleefully, clapping her hands as if she was seeing the most beautiful scene in the world.","[Haha, look at these guys, always coming in late.]","...!","Her gorgeous visage pulsed with power.","She tapped her lips as she stared at the figure of Noah surrounded by obsidian rifts and the Guardians defending above as she asked Ariana beside her without even turning.","[You have enough of a handle on the Armament of Extremity to leave with it?]","[Almost. Gayacus.] Ariana replied curtly as she called out for Chamber Master Gayacus, his dominant visage appearing beside her to lend his power as well- with this showing just how pristine an Armament of Extremity was as it needed two Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities just to get a hold of it quickly before they branded it with their Authority to have such a weapon recognize them as the owner!","[Good, then I will provide you and the others cover.] A gorgeous blue radiance lit up on her fair skin as her figure emanated even more deadly beauty, her smile heart shaking as she floated upwards to meet oncoming Guardians while still battling with Flashing Shadow and the Shadow Extremity Overlord.","[It's a good day to die...]","While uttering such ominous words, her eyes began to collect every single source of light in all of nearby reality.","In the distance, Noah's gaze pulsed with Oraculum as he saw opportunities closed off on all sides here, the gains he made with the Shadow Sword being abruptly stopped here as at this moment, only bells of danger rang out as it seemed these existence beginning to shine with a blue light was particularly dangerous.","More dangerous than the purple-flamed woman and the golden man beside her as at this moment, Noah felt the life of the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity at risk.","It meant that even the Domain Expansion of Indefatigable Quintessence would be getting erased soon as he was given the same reminder he had gotten many times now.","He could not stand against Hyperversal Extremities.","At least...not yet.","So he didn't linger as before whatever disaster was coming bloomed, his eyes gazed at the myriad of Vacuous Hyperversal Domain Rifts around him as without any ounce of hesitation...he entered through one of them.","...!","Rifts that took one outside of the authority of the Seven Vitalis Havens!","When they faded, one would have to find their own way back or have some capability that allowed them to quickly return to their home.","Rifts such as these weren't things one could conjure freely, with Hyperversal Extremities proficient in Vacuous Hyperversal Authority being the only ones who were able to do so!","And yet with Indefatigable Quintessence, Noah had called them forth.","And now, he entered through one of them as he took this opportunity to escape, as well as do something he had planned on doing for the past few days.","Increased understanding and exploration of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority!","Noah's figure left, but the obsidian rifts remained as a trace of his will was left behind to watch just what would occur.","And the scene was an ecstatic one.","The Extremity bathed in blue made herself the center of attention as her words continued to respond out.","[Reality is particularly dark tonight.]","Her gaze was contemplative as she gazed at the vast darkness of Penumbra all around them.","[Let me brighten it up for you all so that you can see.]","She placed her hand on her left chest and closed her bright eyes, her head beginning to bop back and forth as astoundingly...an upbeat symphony began to blast out.","A smile was painted on her red lips as when she opened her gaze again, she called out lightly.","[Sea of Lunacy.]","...!","Hyperversal Haki of Extremity emerged as the base.","Multiple Absolute Dynamis of Extremity then joined in as in the location where a main branch of the Cult of Endless Shadows was, a blue light shone and lit up this Region of Penumbra for countless light years.","The perpetrator of such a light was a single being, with her might being unsurpassed as she ran wild in the Haven of Penumbra on this day!","There was a major query that very few would ask regarding all this.","A query that needed an answer the most was...where was the Adjudicator of Penumbra during all this time? Could he not see what was happening in this region?"]},{"number":2606,"title":"Chapter 2606: Chapter 2605 Awakening! III","paragraphs":["2605 Awakening! III","An eruption of Endless blue light from a maddened Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity was the last thing Noah's last shred of will saw in the remnants of the Shadow Sea Plane before everything was erased.","His Reified Source of Quintessence had stepped into the folds of one of the Vacuous Hyperversal Domain Rifts as this body...was currently outside of the authority of Vitalis!","Not in the Seven Vitalis Havens.","Not in the Planar Palisades of Extremity.","Elsewhere.","The Vacuous Hyperversal Domains was the name that most beings Noah had come across and devoured the memories of called it.","Such domains may go under entirely different names from the perspective of the natives.","The Vacuous Malignancies mentioned by the Adjudicator of Dissolution!","The Entities that reveled in devouring Hyperversal Extremities...or so Noah was told.","He now appeared in a space of utter nothingness as when Extremities took on the weight of Obsidian or Crimson Haven Albatrosses- they either stood guard or were sent out into established Stable Vacuous Hyperversal Domain Rifts stretched out in different regions within the Seven Havens!","The most powerful of existences always stepped into the Vacuous Hyperversal Domains as in these regions outside the scope of reality itself, it wasn't just Vacuous Malignancies one could come across.","In these regions outside the scope of time and space, wonders unimaginable within the Seven Havens could be found as some Extremities were able to propel their power from Tier 2 to Tier 3 based on the wonders they found.","Some Extremities, of course, perished and never returned!","Dangers and opportunities came hand in hand when it came to such a vast and unknown space as one wondered...what could an area that didn't even have time as a factor be hiding?","How ancient could the existences and treasures within be?","And why were the Lifeforms of the Seven Vitalis Havens all drawn towards these lands of nothingness when those that they considered their greatest foes called it their home?","A great deal of questions.","And no answers.","Noah sought the answers himself without believing any one person's narrative as right now, his body that was surrounded by nothing but genuine, potent Vacuous Hyperversal Authority...had something happen to it before it could even settle.","When Extremities from the Seven Vitalis Havens stepped out, they had to either be ready to expend a great deal of their Extremity Authority to explore and proceed forward, or they had to be existences who had attained some level of usage of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority as in this manner- they could survive without having to expend all of their resources in a quick period of time.","This was why existences who had attained Vacuous Hyperversal Authority were so favored!","It was why scions like Ahpuch were favored, and why Noah was considered a monstrous Mutated Entity when he displayed this ability.","There were some Extremities who had not gained access to the usage of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority even now!","But for the distinguished beings who could utilize this authority...the vast majority stopped at that.","And then, there was Noah.","After inviting Vitalis Hyperversal Authority into his soul by Plundering an Unrecorded History, his soul was forced to under cycles that caused his Vacuous Hyperversal Authority to become so extremely potent that after he took another set of actions that culminated with the casting of the Domain Expansion of Indefatigable Quintessence...the Potency of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority had reached a level that caused him to under the First Vacuous Awakening!","And now, to add a topping on an already overfilled plate...his Reified Source of Quintessence appeared within genuine Vacuous Hyperversal Authority outside the Seven Vitalis Havens.","This multicolored stellar body...vibrated as it acted like a funnel that began absorbing every ounce of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority in the surroundings and allowed it to flow into his Soul.","All the way into his main body that was the center of the beginning Vacuous Awakening!","His Quintessential Hyperversal Soul was instantly bathed black as it spread into his Aspects of Existence.","And the moment this occurred, the stream of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority that was constantly flowing and combating the Vacuous Hyperversal Authority...woke up with an indignant roar as if it was insulted!","Mind you, in Recorded History...Vitalis always seemed to win over Vacuous authority.","So when it sensed the level of purity and potency of the Vacuous Hyperversal Authority trying to occupy the soul of a being that was also infused with Vitalis Hyperversal Authority...it surged out with even more might as the potency of Vitalis within Noah's Soul was quickly raised towards the same level- with the goal of exceeding it!","Now, what would such an action result in?","If Vitalis came to be at the same level of potency as Vacuous within Noah's soul...","...!","His Main Body within the depths of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven had begun to radiate pure black light when an instant later...a heavy transparent glimmer shone on his body!","[The Vitalis Hyperversal Authority fused within your Soul has reached a threshold.]","[You have begun your First Vitalis Awakening!]","...!","Two extremely mysterious Authorities fully covered his existence as a phenomenal change began.","This change very much had his soul at the core, but his Body and Origin were very much involved at this stage as the changes within them were simply ecstatic!","His Origin.","The other part of him that made him as exceptional as he was.","His Aletheian Havens of Extremity!","Currently, his already illustrious Origin was being propelled to an even grander stage as...","[The Aletheian Havens of Extremity are being infused with Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.]","[The Major Planes of Existence within the First Aletheian Haven are transforming into Minor Aeonic Havens.]","...!","At the very base of his Origin, the massive Planes formed from Dreams, Avalon, Prana, Fantasia, Niflheim, Quantum, Mirror, Apollyon, and Elysium instantly expanded as the string like vibrations of Aletheian covered everything with a gorgeous black-gold light.","[The Minor Aeonic Havens within the Second and Third Aletheian Haven are transforming into Major Aeonic Havens.]","[The Major Aeonic Havens within the Fourth Aletheian Haven are transforming into Minor Hyperversal Havens.]","WAA!","Billowing winds of change came.","Within his stellar origin filled with the light of many Decreta that used to be Dimensions...they were entirely transformed into Dimensional Realities to Planes of Existence, Aeonic Havens, and finally into Hyperversal Havens within the Fourth Aletheian Haven of Extremity.","Within his Origin, dense Reality Passages as large as Planes of Existence proliferated as Titanic golden stanchions of light acted like pillars to support everything!","The resources coursing through the stellar towering Reality Passages and rushing across his whole origin to cycle with all his cells when he simply breathed with the means of the Second Volume of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi....","It was enough to cause him to feel full of health and energy with every single breath.","His resource renewal speed was elevating itself towards an astounding degree as since all of his aspects of existence were undergoing a change, so would his Unrecorded Eonic Hyperverse Extremity Foundation!"]},{"number":2607,"title":"Chapter 2607: Chapter 2606 Vitalis and Vacuous!","paragraphs":["2606 Vitalis and Vacuous!","In a distant memory within the mind of an existence locked away from space and time.","Tendrils of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority danced on the fingers of a young woman as in front of her, a massive shadowy figure blazing with extremely potent Vacuous Hyperversal Authority could be seen.","All around them, only darkness and void remained as the entity before her spoke.","[Do you know the difference between us and the Vitalis Malignancies?]","The voice was much kinder than before, seemingly appreciative of the progress that the young woman had made since her Second Vacuous Awakening.","When she opened her apathetic eyes and shook her head, the entity before her continued.","[As we grow, we are closely interlinked with Vacuous Hyperversal Authority as our souls passively absorb and enrich our existence until we have our First Vacuous Awakening. This grants us much more power and possibilities as the Vitalis Malignancies...they only have trace amounts of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority within their bodies throughout their lifetime. Due to how much greater Vitalis Hyperversal Authority is compared to Vacuous Hyperversal Authority, they are not able to undergo any Awakening unless they have traversed far in Extremity and learn to actively refine and absorb Vitalis with greater potency.]","...!","[Our greatest enemies...are the Vitalis Malignancies who are gradually becoming aware of the sheer strength of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority. But they are still young and rudimentary. Were they like us and capable of undergoing Awakenings as easily, this war we fight to defend ourselves would have long since been over.]","As he spoke, the Entity shrouded in Vacuous Hyperversal Authority gazed into the distance with unknown emotions before he continued.","[Others do not admit of the supremacy of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority over Vacuous Hyperversal Authority like I do...but we all inherently know it. Otherwise, how could the Seven Vitalis Havens be so powerful to even deny entry to us? How could its foul tendrils of authority continue to invade our homes? What we need to do to win this war is accept our limitations...and focus on our strengths. We need to win this war before any more of them understand the authority around them. We need more entities like you who can survive within the Seven Vitalis Havens and systematically break them down from within before they learn what they truly have all around them. Do you understand...Svetlana?]","...!","His eyes were deep and filled with immeasurable light.","He seemed to be carrying the weight of countless things on his shoulders as terrifying Vacuous Hyperversal Authority of stupendous power shone in his eyes!","\"I understand.\" And the emotionless reply from Svetlana was simple.","[Mmm. The appearance of the Vitalis Malignancies is a danger as well as an chance for us. Their bodies are like tonics as assimilating then spurs and stimulates the Vacuous Hyperversal Authority within us to be refined at an even greater pace, our power slowly approaching a level where we could even begin to contemplate rising up against...them. The Ones Above Extremity!]","WAA!","An utterly heavy term escaped from his lips as Svetlana gazed at him with her cold eyes after that.","They held hesitation within as she spoke slowly.","\"Master...if we assimilate the Seven Vitalis Havens and obtain their power. If we rise against The Ones Above Extremity and obtain their power...will we finally be done, Master? Will all the fighting and death stop?\"","[...]","Svetlana's words caused the enormous dark entity to turn silent as he continued to stare out into nothingness.","He didn't seem to have an answer for her when it came to this question as he remained silent.","Would it ever stop?","When they reached a certain height, would everything attain a state of peace and prosperity as they spent the remainder of their life in serenity?","The dark entity actually had an answer.","But after all the horrors he had put this girl before him through, he just couldn't bring himself to give her the answer.","As this...would simply be too cruel.","—","The change was not instant.","The change was also not normal.","The First Vacuous Awakening. The First Vitalis Awakening!","All of it was entirely foreign to Noah as out of the many transformations he had, this one did not finish within seconds, minutes, or even hours.","His Main Body had been floating at the very peak of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven that was contained in a Recorded History, the reality around him distorted as the Infinite Hyperversal Haven itself built a circular Minor Haven around him pulsing with life.","His will was also affected in his other bodies as they all continued his soul, with the changes that were occurring around him almost making him want to enter hibernation and entirely close off his Soul!","So he limited how much he was expressing himself in his other bodies.","The visage of Alexander King returned to the Infinite Hyperversal Haven as this part of Noah's soul faced the same transformation.","His will only remained entirely active with a sliver of his concentration in the clones that were with the Adjudicator of Dissolution, the Reified Wealdian Sources of Extremity, Ayame of the Infinite Extremity in the Haven of Helios, and Erikson of the Sima Clan in the Haven of Genesis!","As the Awakening went underway, the repercussions of the actions of the Avernus Extremities were only now beginning to unfold as the conclusion to this event was utterly heartbreaking!","In the Haven of Dissolution.","Noah's clone grasped the Curagulus Mask in his hands as his eyes hid the light of the fact that a majority of his soul was in a state of hibernation, his words calm as he spoke out towards the Adjudicator who seemed lost in thought.","\"The Investiture of Extremity has been talked about a great deal by you and others. And yet...it seems like it isn't worth a shred of shit after the recent actions.\"","...His words were straightforward as they roused the contemplative Adjudicator up to gaze at his visage!","The Investiture of Extremity that was set up by the Senatus of Extremity.","The forces of the Avernus Clan may as well have ripped it to shreds with their recent actions!"]},{"number":2608,"title":"Chapter 2608: Chapter 2607 Sima Ascending Mountain of Extremity! I","paragraphs":["2607 Sima Ascending Mountain of Extremity! I","\"Has the number come out for how many perished in the Cult of Endless Shadows?\"","Noah asked with a cold look as part of the reason events had unfolded the way they did was due to the path he chose.","But he wasn't alone in choosing this as the Cult of Endless Shadows also jumped in the bed with him- neither of them expecting the enemy side to do what they just did!","At his words, Svetlana's eyes pulsed with authority as she replied with anger.","[Quintillions of existences. Hundreds of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms..and two Hyperversal Extremities.]","...!","The number was rather alarming to hear as the losses were devastating!","During the battle, Extremity Blue, Ariana, and Chamber Master Gayacus were the focal points. But the past Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction and other Avernus Extremities were also there as they fought against the Tier 1 and Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity Shadows.","The last Extremity of Destruction was particularly trying to live up to his old name as he had unleashed all of his power to actually erase two Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities from the Cult of Endless Shadows out of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity!","Most of those surviving out of the forces of the Cult of Endless Shadows were those who had left to come to Dissolution, along with the Extremities that came with them as at this moment, rage and outcries were all that could be heard from them.","\"I'm curious to see the great Senatus of Extremity deal with all this. Or at the very least, what is the Curagulus of Extremity prepared to do if the Senatus of Extremity fails to step in? Since during this whole siege in Penumbra, its Adjudicator didn't even let out a squeak.\"","WAA!","His words pulsed with power as he spoke.","And this time, the Adjudicator of Dissolution took a long time before she could even reply.","—","The hours passed with dreariness as tumultuous waves seemed to be spreading within the Seven Havens.","Within the Haven of Genesis.","On the eastern region of this Haven, the most respected Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity were clustered like stellar bodies that rotated around a single behemoth.","This behemoth...was the Sima Clan!","Countless Planes of Existence and even uniquely constructed Minor Havens were established all around the domains of the Sima Clan at the very center, with its Planes of Existence being structured in a way that made it look like a rising stellar mountain from afar.","A mountain made up of Planes of Existence and Minor Havens!","It was known as the Sima Ascending Mountain of Extremity.","Hundreds of Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity were laid out around the Sima Ascending Mountain of Extremity!","Those with strong connections to the Sima Clan could be found at the very bottom of this mountain as going higher, the pure bloodline lineage of those truly belonging to the Sima Clan could be felt as this entire location radiated power.","Towards the peak of the Sima Ascending Mountain of Extremity.","In a Minor Haven that could fit hundreds of Planes of Existence similar to the Abecedarian Sacrarium of the Learnean Lineage that Noah had arrived in when he first came.","This Minor Haven was known as the Neon Sima Haven, with a thriving civilization moving within similar to the tens of thousands of other Planes of Existence and Minor Havens around it!","It was full of life all around as different regions could be seen erecting crystalline structures light years in size as the abodes and homes of quintillions of beings.","The auras of three Hyperversal Extremities could be felt in this Haven alone as the brightest aura was located on top of a massive skyscraper that was millions of light years in length, and at the very peak of this skyscraper...","there existed a circular domain that radiated neon light all around the structures around it.","Within this neon domain of light.","The figure of Erikson could be seen sitting on a neon mat as beside him, a tan figure of striking resemblance also sat- his body pulsing with potent Hyperversal Extremity Authority as he seemed like a larger, older version of Erikson!","Before these two beings, Noah's visage draped in golden robes could be seen as he faced Erikson and a Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity Authority that he had come to know as the father of this Mutated Entity!","The Extremity of Foundation.","The Iron Fist!","It was a renowned Hyperversal Extremity of the Sima Clan who had yet to reach Zenith...but he didn't seem all that far away!","He was the reason why Erikson could speak as if he was speaking on behalf of the Sima Clan.","He was the reason why most Scions and Elders of Inheritances or Clans didn't bat any ill will towards Erikson!","At this moment, the Extremity of Foundation spoke to Noah as unlike his son's beach attire, he was adorned in a simple white robe that hid the bulging muscles within.","[You made them your enemy, so they naturally targeted you. And along the way, they obtained an Armament of Extremity. But even an Armament isn't enough for the Avernus Extremity Overlord to let loose his dog of Lunacy. For them to do this...it only confirms what the Perennial Sima Recorder has been sensing these past days.]","...!","The eyes of this being shone with profound brilliance as he continued!","[Their actions say that they are not afraid of the consequences of their actions being implemented by the Senatus of Extremity. For this to be the case, the musings of Unrecorded Histories about an incoming change that will alter the very workings of the Seven Havens seem to be true. The Avernus Clan must be assured that in the coming chaos, them being held accountable for the destruction of an Inheritance of Extremity would be something far, far below in terms of importance.]","WAA!","[This also makes your path challenging as with my son's trust, you have gained the most up to date information that the Sima Clan has on the military of the Avernus Clan and the capabilities. But against a force that has no restraints binding them down...it will be an difficult reality for their public enemy.]","The Extremity of Foundation spoke calmly like before the protagonist who also rested on a neon mat, dense clusters of round light containing information about the Avernus Clan floated serenely!"]},{"number":2609,"title":"Chapter 2609: Chapter 2608 Sima Ascending Mountain of Extremity! II","paragraphs":["2608 Sima Ascending Mountain of Extremity! II","A force without the shackles of the Investiture of Extremity that stated those more powerful could not attack and oppress others who were weaker!","When this reality set in, Erikson sneered before voicing out grandly.","\"It had been a day since they attacked the Cult of Endless Shadows as their Overlord and remaining Extremities have appealed to the Senatus of Extremity, and yet all that has happened so far...is an Injunction of Extremity being called with the Extremities of the Avernus Clan involved to be put on the stand to answer for their actions! What does this do? If it were me, I would strip the being who massacred trillions of her power as such a defender...will do nothing in the end!\"","Erikson's words were bold as he spoke of stripping the power of the Extremity of Lunacy who openly showed her nature.","Because of her actions, an Injunction of Extremity was called with the forces of the Avernus Clan summoned to be on the stand- the prime culprit being the Extremity of Lunacy- Extremity Blue!","Noah smiled and shook his head when he thought of this as his voice was calm.","\"I've come across many enemies in my life, but the Avernus Clan is the only one that has so far given me setbacks. With this in mind, I don't expect them to face any negative consequences after doing what they did. But since I am their target...I'll be the one to retaliate even if the Senatus of Extremity does nothing!\"","WAA!","His eyes were bright as his Vacuous and Vitalis Awakenings were still underway, and yet his Aspects of Existence were already beginning to express heart shaking changes.","Even in the face of a behemoth coming after him, he did not falter!","Erikson and the Extremity of Foundation smiled at Noah's words as the latter spoke while tapping his chin.","[The Seven Clans had long since expected a change to be coming as the last Haven began Extremity Sanctification, but we didn't know to what extent. Only now are those most in tune with the Aeonic Annals of Extremity beginning to realize the extent of the changes. But due to this, many of us prepared. My preparations...involved assuring my boorish son didn't have an early death as I collected Aeonic Treasures of Extremity and Hyperversal Extremity Treasures to raise his concepts towards the 17th Layer fairly quickly. But just such resources required my power and the utilization of the power of the Sima Clan. For a genius like you...I wish I could give you something similar. But the resources to achieve such a thing are too rare. I can at most get you to attain what was taken from you in the Cult of Endless Shadows- I could ask for you to be granted access to one of the Armaments of Extremity in the Vaults of Sima.]","...!","[The only thing I shall ask is for you to share the values of the Sima Clan, and if in the disorder you manage to attain Extremity...use your power to stand with us in any chaos that unfolds.]","The words of the Extremity of Foundation were heavy!","Noah's potential was known as even the Curagulus of Extremity had scouted him, so how could other Extremities not see it?","Erikson's father wanted to rope him into the folds of the Sima Clan as before Noah's eyes, the possibility of accessing another Armament of Extremity was dangled!","His eyes turned into crescent smiles as in front of him, Erikson laughed boisterously.","\"Haha, my father is more persuasive than I, hmm? Accept it. We already have enemies outside the Havens and enemies within. Having capable allies will not hurt.\"","WAA!","Tendrils of Oraculum shone on Noah's eyes as he nodded lightly.","\"Then...the Infinite Hyperversal Haven shall be an comrade of the Sima Clan!\"","The True Emperor of Quintessence proclaimed grandly.","An unknown power becoming allies with one of the Seven Clans.","One may scoff at this and say what exactly would the Sima Clan gain from this?!","But such beings were not looking into the future.","Such beings did not know what was coming.","At Noah's words, the Extremity of Foundation smiled and gazed out from the neon domain they were in and the vastness around them.","[To prepare for the unknown change, Major Inheritances and the Seven Clans have strengthened themselves to their utmost and collected enough resources to raise a few outstanding Scions and Elders towards Extremity. Now, the Avernus Clan is openly snatching Armaments of Extremity. With all this...","having an extra ally or two isn't bad! I'll send the request for what we talked about. Think closely on whether you wish to remain on the path of War with the Avernus Clan- their Overlord is something that even I am not confident in endure a few strikes of.]","The Hyperversal Extremity of Foundation rose up as he spoke, his figure beginning to walk away after dropping such a bomb as within moments, only Erikson and Noah remained in the Neon Domain!","Erikson had a stern look as he knew his father never spoke lightly.","He gazed towards Noah's calm figure as he spoke out.","\"From the little time I've known you, you've never lost your confidence nor shown fear. What about now as you know the true extent of your enemy? Especially the Overlord of the Avernus Clan...he may likely be above even Adjudicators in power!\"","...!","Fear.","Was this something Noah ever felt against an overwhelming enemy?","The answer was clear as he held a devilish glint while gazing at the actuality around him.","His words were clear as they thundered out.","\"Whether it be him or any others within the Avernus Clan...they will merely join the line of Extras to be stepped under my feet.\"","WAA!","\"They're turning out to be Above Average Extras in this grand tale...but they're still just that. Extras that will come and go with the turning of the pages.\"","These grand declarations Noah made weren't meaningless or baseless.","He knew himself. And he could currently feel his current transformation.","His Awakening!"]},{"number":2610,"title":"Chapter 2610: Chapter 2609 Infinite Oni Haven!","paragraphs":["2609 Infinite Oni Haven!","His First Vacuous and Vitalis Awakenings were so profound that if his enemies wanted to stand any chance of overpowering him, they should have tried their best to scorch him out of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity entirely days ago!","But now...only a grand tale would continue to unfold.","And in this tale- he was the Protagonist!","Well...his very existence was- along with multiple other traits that made him who he was!","He came out of his thoughts as he saw Erikson rising with a smile.","\"Good. I will wholeheartedly accept the grooming of my Clan and whatever my father has prepared. It's a beautiful form of nepotism that I will eat up without looking back as if I don't, I feel like I'll be left far behind. Especially by the likes of you and Ayame. With the nurturing of the whole clan and the coming Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification, Extremity can be attained in a matter of days!\"","...!","His words were full of confidence as they mentioned one being.","Ayame of the Infinite Extremity.","Noah's eyes curved into an even grander devilish smile as he thought about his clone who was beside Ayame at this very moment!","—","In the Aeonic Haven of Helios.","Near the very center of this vast Haven, the light of crimson and gold permeated all around in the form of radiant auroras of light.","Boundless heat and light seemed to be shining from all around as this region held millions of golden suns that radiated heat all around.","Towards the very center of such a region.","A horn-like structure stretched upwards while surrounded by the golden suns all around, the tip of this horn pulsing with a crimson gold light of none other than a rift!","Near this horn-like structure, the figure of Ayame could be seen as Noah's Prana Aletheian Chassis accompanied her.","\"When thinking about what boom from the Infinite Extremity I could grant you, my grandfather pointed me to this. The Infinite Oni Haven where an Armament of Extremity is in the process of being born. My current accomplishments are due to spending time in here as the Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority within this Minor Haven isn't too powerful yet, and even beings like you and.l I could easily absorb it. Though I wouldn't get too close to the naturally forging Armament of Extremity itself...lest your soul be burnt.\"","Ayame spoke calmly towards Noah as the two of them bore the temperature of the blazing millions of suns around them!","In exchange for a Crimson Extremity Panacea, this was among the rewards Noah would collect as for someone like him who was speedily claiming the Layers of Extremity- this type of reward was indispensable.","This location there were in was also very important to the Infinite Extremity as Noah could see the auras of three Hyperversal Extremities surrounding all sides...as well as one within the Infinite Oni Haven!","Seeing his curious gaze, Ayame calmly spoke out while her eyes flashed.","\"Since the actions of the Avernus Clan, security has gotten buffed just a little. But this is of no consequence to us. Let's g-\"","BZZT!","They were about to delve into a majestic Minor Haven.","They were, but a droning and pervasive sound grabbed their attention entirely!","A sound that they followed with their Wills until their eyes became drawn to a certain Structure of massive proportions stretching out endlessly.","There, in the far stretch where the Extremity Vein of Helios could be seen...","this very same massive vein began to pulse.","...!","Pulse!","The Extremity Vein that had been inactive since the Haven of Helios long ago entered the Extremity Step of Extremity Sanctification!","So why...did it begin to shake now?","—","[These fuckers...an Injunction of Extremity? Calling me to stand trial? Haha, they couldn't be more laughable!]","Extremity Blue spoke out while humming a tune, her figure currently situated in a corner of the Haven of Oceanus as she floated amidst an endless stellar blue sea.","She currently adorned a light white dress that hugged her fair skin tightly, her blessing very much visible and not leaving much to the imagination due to the nature of the sea all around her.","Below her, ferocious Piranhas pulsing with auras of the Boundaries at the 17th Layer swam reverently, occasionally trying to nibble on her aura that seemed to calm since it came into the blue sea.","Her soul echoed with the endless cerulean grandeur around her as her Hyperversal Haki of Extremity flowed out naturally, and yet it didn't harm the ferocious beasts below as their actions even caused her to smile!","She killed when she wanted to kill.","And she didn't kill when she didn't feel like it.","All this time, she had been repressed as she couldn't fully express her Lunacy.","But that had all changed when a day ago, the Avernus Extremity Overlord sent her a message telling her she could act freely!","She had an suspicion as to why.","Because for the past years, she had been spreading and training her Hyperversal Haki of Extremity in Oceanus as she had noticed many things.","Things like the titanic Extremity Vein of Oceanus in the distance...ever so slowly altering itself over time!","Things like-","BZZT!","She was taken out of her thoughts as her gem-like blue eyes opened.","She turned towards the outline of the Extremity Vein of Oceanus in the distance as she saw...it began to pulse!","[Mmm...is this it? The beginning of something even more glorious?]","Her gaze was expectant!","She felt like soon enough, she may be able to escape the confines of the Investiture of Extremity!","She was looking forward to whatever change the Avernus Extremity Overlord had predicted as the moment she felt the pulsing vibrations of the Extremity Vein of Oceanus, her will was awakened as she watched carefully.","And it wasn't just in Oceanus or Helios where the Extremity Veins began to vibrate.","It was across all the Seven Havens!","But none of the vibrations were as pronounced and as heavy as the Extremity Vein of Dissolution.","None had begun rising even higher while rhythmically emitting pristine Hyperversal Authority of Dissolution!"]},{"number":2611,"title":"Chapter 2611: Chapter 2610 As Above, So Below! I","paragraphs":["2610 As Above, So Below! I","The last Haven to undergo Extremity Sanctification.","A natural process that had been occurring since the conception of the First Haven of Extremity!","It began with Genesis, and now it was ending with the Haven of Dissolution.","Many powerful existences knew that the last Extremity Sanctification was going to be a grand one.","They knew, but they didn't know exactly to what extent!","At this moment, within the Haven of Dissolution.","The obsidian Extremity Vein that seemed to stretch out endlessly- the vein that had risen from below the stellar black earth! The vein whose ends seemed to vanish below the Walls between the Havens.","At this moment, it acted like all the energy within it had been building up and reached a critical threshold as like a coiled spring, it erupted upwards.","BOOM!","It felt as if the Havens were splitting apart.","It was the beginning of a astonishing and permanent change!","The instant changes caused Apex Aeonic Lifeforms to stare in shock from all around, while the Hyperversal Extremities hidden in the veils of space became entirely serious.","It was the third day after the Apex War of Annihilation within the Haven of Dissolution.","Many more forces had arrived as they were all privy to the astonishing scene of the Vein rising to the very heights of the skies as such an action caused its extreme ends that were stretching into the Walls between Havens to also erupt upwards!","The thick and foggy wall made up of potent Hyperversal Authority of Dissolution and a myriad of Sources of Chaos churned and split open.","It was as if the walls were being torn down!","As if a path had been made with the action of the Extremity Vein rising!","The Vein within Dissolution was obsidian in color, with this color remaining all throughout this Haven. But on this day, if one continued to follow the uncountable trillions of light years of the Extremity Vein of a Dissolution, after it had risen towards the peak of this Haven...They would notice that the part contained within the now fractured Walls Between Havens slowly began changing color.","It was to the extent that if one followed the Northern Side of the Vein of Dissolution- once they crossed the churning Walls Between Havens that were being torn down...they would notice the black color slowly changing to become a shade of gold.","And this shade of gold only became more and more potent as one sped further down trillions of light years across Walls Between Havens until ultimately...","they would enter the Aeonic Haven of Helios.","Helios!","As if spurred by the rising of the vein from the Haven behind it, the golden portion of the Extremity Vein within Helios also rose to the very highest peak of this haven as the part of the Wall Between Havens, on the other side of Helios also became torn and ruptured.","[...!]","Those able to follow watched breathlessly.","If one followed the Northern end of the Vein stretching across Helios until they arrived on another Wall Between Havens, they would notice the color slowly changing from gold to a gorgeous blue.","A blue that only became greater and greater after passing countless trillions of light years of this blue color...one actually arrived in the Haven of Oceanus!","The same scene repeated as throughout all of Oceanus, the cerulean-colored Vein rose to the peak and extended along another Wall Between Havens until its color changed to become purple.","The purple light of Andromeda.","And passing through Andromeda and yet another torn Wall Between Havens, the color changed from purple and into a shade of shadowy darkness.","It was now within the Haven of Penumbra.","The unresigned and unwilling visage of Flashing Shadow and The Shadow Extremity Overlord could be seen in a corner of this Haven above their destroyed Inheritance, their eyes currently turning to gaze at the radiant black Vein in the peak of this dark Haven.","And from this immense shadowy darkness of the Extremity Vein, it continued extending out as this time, the color changed to a light crimson hue that represented Elera!","And from Elera, the Extremity Vein crossed yet another trillions of light years as the crimson color became pink, and eventually the pink faded to become a milky white.","A gorgeous white.","It had arrived in the first Haven to form.","The rising extremity vein was shockingly showing that it extended all the way from Dissolution to Helios, Oceanus, Andromeda, Elera, Penumbra, and ultimately...to the Haven of Genesis.","But it didn't end there.","The walls between havens on the other end of Genesis were also shattered apart as the milky white color once more changed to become obsidian...the Northern end of Genesis coming to be connected with the southern end of Dissolution.","Akin to a loop.","The Extremity vein was not a single construct that was only contained in each Haven separately.","On this day, it was shown to all that the Extremity Vein within the Seven Havens were all intricately interconnected as for the first time in Recorded History, it rose to the skies and pulsed with grandeur!","In the Havens that Noah's body was in...he watched the scene unfold with marvel and wonder.","He was able to get an even more unique look with the clone that was with the Adjudicator of Dissolution as she was the one who waved her hands to show illusory screens of the changing color of the Extremity Vein as it went across one Haven and into another.","It caused one to ponder of the true structure of the Seven Havens.","As if there was a singular massive ringed Extremity Vein running across all of them","As if all of the Seven Havens were massive and endless continents bound onto a ring of pure majesty!","A ringed Vein that after it had revealed its continuity, it pulsed with ever-","increasing a frequency as the distinct colors that were within each respective haven began to flicker and move around.","And then, as if the Authorities of different colors within the vein were spurred into action, they began to move and flow forward.","The inky black Authority of Dissolution began to flow as if it were blood flowing across a vessel.","The ebb and flow felt ancient and fantastical as ahead of it, the golden Hyperversal Authority of Helios also flowed- this reaction continuing throughout this coiling ringed construct!","As the Hyperversal Authorities of different Havens began to flow, Noah watched with wonder as the milky white of Genesis flowed into The Haven of Dissolution!"]},{"number":2612,"title":"Chapter 2612: Chapter 2611 As Above, So Below! II","paragraphs":["2611 As Above, So Below! II","An unbelievable development!","The Hyperversal Authorities of the very Havens flowed across the coiled Extremity Vein- the authorities of different Havens appearing throughout as the ebb and flow of the authorities caused the massive construct to radiate endless light.","A light that brightened up all Havens as at this moment, all eyes of immaculately powerful beings were on this phenomenon!","The force and surging of all of these authorities was so ridiculously potent that for the Scions and Elders who had entered the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands within the Extremity Vein felt a rebounding force of authority wrap around them as they were ejected.","The endless veil of Dissolution that Noah's Reified Sources and Scions of Inheritances were watching and waiting to be torn down this whole time was forcefully pulled away from their eyes as all of them were ejected from the Vein!","HOONG!","And it pulsed and hummed as if it was announcing the grand arrival of something.","Those ejected out of the Extremity Vein gathered like innumerable dots on the stellar space as they stared at it with scrutiny.","From her high position above Dissolution, the brows of the Adjudicator furrowed as she waved her hands- her figure and Noah's figure in their isolated space disappearing as they appeared in close proximity with the Extremity Vein that now surged with multiple colors of light.","[A change like this is unheard of.]","Svetlana spoke lightly as they watched, and they weren't the only ones as from the different factions, the Hyperversal Extremities of Inheritances and Clans arrived in front of their Legions of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms that were going to participate in the Culmination Step of Dissolution as they observed the massive Vein that made them all look like ants cautiously!","This was the phenomenon in Dissolution, but in the other 6 Havens, the forces of a myriad of Inheritances and Clans simply had their Extremities gather and observe the pulsing Vein on their side as they waited to see what this phenomenon would usher forth.","But they were bound to be disappointed.","Because at this moment, the brightest shining portion of the Extremity Vein was Dissolution.","The one that triggered this change.","The Haven currently undergoing the Last Extremity Sanctification!","From it, blinding light radiated out as across the stretches of trillions of light years- the Vein began to flicker as it split open to gush out the boundless light flowing through it!","A light that washed out into the surroundings as if stellar waterfalls of Hyperversal Authority had gloriously burst open.","Thereafter, these points where the Vein split open stabilized and formed into massive radiant rifts.","Rifts that reflected an illusory transparent light that could not yet be seen through at this moment!","And the eyes of all Hyperversal Extremities and Apex Aeonic Lifeforms gathered on these massive transparent rifts of light.","Noah's visage floated forward with a light of glory as within his mind, Oraculum buzzed to try and obtain information- and yet it was blocked off all around as nothing of the future relating to what was happening right now could be seen!","Authority of spatial distortion and the violation of the spacetime continuum heavily occurred around the transparent rifts stretched out across the potion of the Extremity Vein within Dissolution.","Then...","BZZT!","The transparent rifts trembled as their veil was torn down.","Along with this, the veils were entirely fractured and opened wide, revealing gateways connecting one end to another as the Hyperversal Authority of Dissolution, Helios, Oceanus, Elera, Andromeda, Penumbra, and Genesis flowed out endlessly!","The surrounding space felt like it had become heavy and viscous with the continued release of Hyperversal Authorities of the Seven Havens.","Apex Aeonic Lifeforms felt stifled as they realized their movements were slowed down and restricted by at least 80%!","They also felt as if their souls now carried a heavy weight that they had to circulate their essence to overcome and simply move freely.","It was a feeling of oppression that came with the gushing of Hyperversal Authorities of the Seven Havens into Dissolution endlessly.","And then, there were the gateways.","Noah's body felt the same restrictions, with a part in his Soul that held the beginnings of the term [DISSOLUTION] that he had attained at the end of the Initiation Step lighting up and letting off a glow that made the oppressive effects of the surrounding reality become much lesser for him.","And as his will tried to overcome the raging Hyperversal Authorities gushing out to see into one of the many massive gateways before him, he felt the visage of the Adjudicator of Dissolution come in front of him as her hands pushed him back slightly.","As if she was protecting him from something.","What would the Adjudicator of Disintegration need to protect him from?","Before this question could be answered, her serene voice thundered out in this region as it was shockingly spread out by the raging essence and caused to boom out across all of Dissolution.","[As Above, So Below...]","...!","The cryptic words that the Curagulus of Extremity had unearthed from the Aeonic Annals of Extremity!","As the dense number of transparent tears of the Extremity Vein within Disintegration opened wide and released waves of astounding authority, the veil became torn as from within...a scene that many would remember for the rest of their lives unfolded.","The first thing was one that the Hyperversal Extremities observing at the very forefront sensed before anyone else.","It was the aura of Lifeforms.","In what should be the Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification beginning, the dense, numerous, and majestic auras of Supreme Beings unfolded in a maddening fashion!","As the scene behind the portals became clear, it was like they were looking into an entirely different Realm past the radiant gateway.","A Realm that just like they were floating and staring into, innumerable sets of eyes were also floating and staring back at them!","As Above, So Below!","This term was quite literal in nature as it ushered forth the bells of change for the Seven Realms of Extremity!"]},{"number":2613,"title":"Chapter 2613: Chapter 2612 As Above, So Below! III","paragraphs":["2612 As Above, So Below! III","The phenomenon within Dissolution was utterly astounding.","Shielded behind the visage of the Adjudicator of Dissolution, Noah's will gazed past the veil of the gateway as past this doorway, an endless reality seemed to be stretching outwards endlessly.","As if a whole Haven- or multiple Havens were contained within this Extremity Vein that stretched out across all Seven Haven!","And just as he and many others stared into this Haven from Dissolution, there were a dense number of auras from this side that stared back at them.","BZZT!","The Oraculum Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity burned within Noah's eyes.","It locked onto the existences before him as it sought for any Records of their identity, and shockingly...","Golden light bloomed from his eyes as information about them began to appear from the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.","This was a shocking finding in itself as it meant these beings held their own Records, and they were connected to the Aeonic Annals of Extremity as well!","The reason for the Adjudicator of Dissolution stepping in front of Noah and gazing out with caution was because just on the Vein Rift in front of them, the blaring aura of three Hyperversal Extremities was gazing back at them.","Behind them, astounding creatures of Titanic size reminiscent of the Leviathans of Dissolution could be seen as each of them radiated power at the Apex Aeonic Lifeform level!","The three Hyperversal Extremities were beastial in nature as one at the very forefront was almost feline in nature.","Its body was massive with lustrous fur shining with obsidian gold light, the four limbs extending into paws glistening with deadly gold claws as at their base, tendrils of thick Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Dissolution swirled!","Its feline head was glorious in nature as two extremely sharp canines extended left and right from its jaws, its eyes radiating black light that pulsed out with terrifying tendrils!","Before Noah, its identity was a simple one.","[Haven Saber Smilodon]","Similodon!","Magisterial in stature and grand in its power, with tendrils of Hyperversal Extremity Authority surging around it that did not pale in comparison to the Adjudicator of Dissolution before Noah!","And she knew this very well as this was the sensation that caused her to come stand before Noah.","'Zenith...'","This Hyperversal Extremity had long since attained Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity Authority!","These were the thoughts of the Adjudicator.","Behind the Haven Saber Smilodon, the Titanic beasts were variations of Smilodons as on them, Noah's eyes collected slightly more information.","[Earth Saber Smilodon]:: Stemming from the regal lineage of the Saber Smilodons of Extremity, this Entity has achieved Great Proficiency at the stage of an Apex Aeonic Lifeforms. Within its soul, Dissolution courses with great valor as it seeks to cross the Earth and attain Haven- as it seeks to attain Extremity and become a Haven Saber Smilodon...","...!","Earth Saber Smilodon.","Its description came with new terms like [Great Proficiency] when it talked about the stage of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, but the maddening thing was the fact that behind the Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity Haven Saber Smilodon, there were thousands of just these Earth Saber Smilodons floating with valor and majesty!","Thick waves of Dissolution emanated from them as beside them were other Leviathan Beast Lineages.","They caused Noah's eyes to briefly move from the Haven Saber Smilodon and onto the two other Hyperversal Extremities beside it.","One was a unique winged entity that had a slender body with two pairs of veined wings and on its head- oversized multifaceted eyes could be seen as it was a Dragonfly!","In its membranous wings, thick Hyperversal Extremity Authority flowed with as the aura it gave off was no less than the Haven Saber Smilodon.","[Aquatic Eon Dragonfly]","Its identity showed itself before Noah as its cold eyes were enough to cause a common Apex Aeonic Lifeform to turn away in fear.","The other Entity had to be given even more attention to as its size alone exceeded all Entities they currently observed here.","Its pupils held a serpentine glint with dazzling yellow light, obsidian scales radiating black lightning adorning its serpentine body that snaked across the whole region behind it- forming into layers of mountains where others like it but much smaller could be seen slithering about!","This entity had an ancient name as well as it was a beast lost through time.","[Lightning Titanoboa]","3 dazzling Hyperversal Extremities.","All of them standing in front of the single opened Vein Rift just in front of the Adjudicator and Noah as the two sides looked at each other silently...but no one made a move!","The Haven Saber Smilodon, Aquatic Eon Dragonfly, and Lightning Titanoboa all gazed forward silently as a light of ingenuity flashed within their eyes, and yet none made a move.","It was extremely clear that it was due to something else holding them back as when one gazed away from this singular Vein Rift, the other Vein Rifts stretched out across Dissolution held similar scenes.","Scenes of terrifyingly powerful Hyperversal Extremity Entities gazing back at the Scions, Elders, and Extremities of the Inheritances and Seven Clans.","All of this was Unfathomable as this was only the Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification!","In all the 6 previous times, the Extremity Vein had opened to reveal vast lands holding Supreme Eternal Behemoths of the specific Havens and droves of Aeonic Treasures of Extremity, Extremity Relics, and Hyperversal Extremity Treasures.","All of them were at the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms level as towards the end of the Culmination Step, the most dreadful Leviathan to emerge was nearly into Extremity during the Pinnacle Stage of Andromeda.","That was it!","And even when the Extremity Step of Extremity Sanctification began in the past Havens, the Extremity Colossal Beasts to emerge were at most Tier 1 or Tier 2 Supreme Ultimate Behemoths that they had to battle to attain treasures capable of raising their power within the Tiers of Hyperversal Extremity.","This was the experience of Extremity Sanctification Documented in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.","This...was not what was playing out at this moment!"]},{"number":2614,"title":"Chapter 2614: Chapter 2613 Fight! Fight! Fight! I","paragraphs":["2613 Fight! Fight! Fight! I","The last Extremity Sanctification would be different.","It would be grand.","Many powerful beings had foreseen this and knew something was coming.","But even this was out of their wildest dreams!","At the beginning of the Culmination Step of Dissolution...an utterly shocking reality unfolded as from thousands of massive Vein Rifts blooming all across this Haven, the auras of entities no less than Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity could be felt as among some of them...their auras were even more dreadful!","The Extremities of Inheritances who brought their Scions and Elders here for the purposes of the Culmination Step became grim at such a scene as they felt like even they were in peril.","It wasn't even the Extremity Step yet, but Tier 1 and Tier 2 Extremities were already sweating from the sheer pressure released by the Entities showing themselves beyond the Vein Rifts.","In front of a Vein Rift near the region where the Apex War of Annihilation took place.","The main body of Ayame stared with scrutiny ahead as beside her, gorgeous young men and women with crimson gold horns rising on their heads could be seen, with a few hundred more sharing their features floating behind them as in front...five Extremities from their Infinite Extremity were floating with power and valor!","They gazed into a Vein Rift that only showed two Hyperversal Extremities and hundreds of Leviathan Lineages behind them, Ayame gazing at them before she spoke out with caution.","\"[Light Centipede] and [Purple-Flame Mammoth]...entities like these haven't appeared since the first Extremity Sanctification if records are to be believed. Now...\"","She wasn't as fearful as other Scions as in front of her, the 5 Infinite Extremities had three among them that were Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities- her grandfather was included in this group!","The other two were Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities that cautiously gazed at the Light Centipede and Purple-Flame Mammoth whose sheer aura alone caused their scalps to tingle.","Yet even here...the terrifying entities on the other side did not make a move.","They simply stared out with cold eyes of interest and indifference at the same time!","And this was the shocking reality in all regions as even though thousands of Vein Rifts showing terrifying Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities radiated light and continued to gush out the Hyperversal Authority of Dissolution, none of them moved out.","[...]","Their forces were enough to topple Inheritances and Clans, and yet they only stared out into the Seven Havens with a hint of interest and a lot more apathy.","That was until...","[Hey...stop!]","In one region, a shout of shock rang out as many wills gazed over from afar.","Noah and the Adjudicator also gazed out light years away from their position as they saw a cluster of powerful existences adorned in golden white robes.","They held thousands of Apex Aeonic Beings behind them and 7 Hyperversal Extremities at the forefront, with one of the Extremities stepping out at this moment as this group...stemmed from the Orientis Clan!","They were nobles of one of the Seven Clans as the one who had shouted was a man emanating Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity towards a young woman.","A young woman who was adorned in a pure white robe as she had dark hair dripping to her shoulders- with this existence being widely known in the Haven of Elera as the Maiden of the North!","The Maiden of Orientis.","An Apex Aeonic Lifeform who had arrived at the 17th Boundary Layer, with her talent being not so much in fighting- but due to her capabilities in traversing the Aeonic Annals of Extremity that were so terrifying that she exceeded some genuine Hyperversal Extremities!","At this moment, this being had floated past the Hyperversal Extremities of the Eastern Clan as such an action caused one of them to bellow out, and yet her figure was calm as she spoke with valor.","\"Esteemed Rubino, I am only following my intuition. There is nothing to worry about.\"","...!","Intuition.","What intuition would lead an existence towards a Vein Rift that was currently showing Four unknown Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities and Legions of Leviathan Lineages behind them?","Extremity Rubino of the Orientis Clan nearly made a move to stop this genius Lifeforms of his clan, but his own soul buzzed soon after as he watched on with caution- his power ready to erupt at any time.","The Maiden of Orientis floated forward serenely until she came right before a transparent barrier surrounding the Vein Rift.","Not too far away, four Beastial Hyperversal Extremities stood as within this Vein Rift, all four were of similar lineage as they were [Cataclysmic Megalodons]!","Behind them, Lineages of sea-based Leviathans could be seen as the Maiden of Orientis looked at all this while an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity surrounded her whole body and gave off a golden glint of destiny.","And then without a word, she stepped past the transparent barrier and into the Vein Rift.","[....!]","Many eyes were focused here as while watching with bated breaths...","[WO!]","A booming shout instantly erupted from a cold-faced Cataclysmic Megalodon as from the Third Tier Supreme Extremity from Orientis instantly arrived behind the transparent barrier, ready to pull back the Maiden and battle right away!","But...","The Maiden of Orientis put her hand back and shook it as her eyes trembled from the sheer pressure released by the Hyperversal Extremities before her.","And after the initial shout from the forefront Cataclysmic Megalodon, its eyes glinted with a crimson light as it seemed to scan the figure of the young woman before it as its jaws moved again.","[Hughes...step forward!]","...!","The foreign Cataclysmic Megalodon emanated power and undeniable glory as after his call, a black and crimson Megalodon emanating waves of power similar to the Maiden of Orientis came forward.","It was a Minor Apocalypse Megalodon.","Its body was utterly glorious with power as its sharp jaws opened with valor, the 17th Boundary Layer of Dissolution crackling chaotically around its shark-","like body as it moved forward while the Leviathans around it made a clearing!","The massive legions of Megalodons cleared up the surrounding areas as their jaws began to snap with an ancient rhythm and power, a single word booming from them and spreading out at this moment.","\"Fight.\"","\"Fight!\"","\"Tatakae!\"","\"FIGHT!\"","With utmost grandeur and as if she had stepped onto an arena, a glorious atmosphere rose at the very front of a Vein Rift!"]},{"number":2615,"title":"Chapter 2615: Chapter 2614 Fight! Fight! Fight! II","paragraphs":["2614 Fight! Fight! Fight! II","Fight!","This word was repeated over and over again resonantly as the Authority of Dissolution churned.","The scene astonished many as it wasn't anything they had seen before!","Amidst such clamor, the authority of the forefront Cataclysmic Megalodon rose as all the shouts instantly died down, its magnetic voice emanating out.","[You may gain passage so long as you are victorious.]","...!","A shocking development to this new phenomenon!","The Maiden of Orientis had utilized her intuition to be the first existence to come forward as her actions allowed the millions of powerful Scions, Elders, and Hyperversal Extremities of the Seven Havens to get a glimpse of just how the Culmination Step was playing out for the Haven of Dissolution.","After hearing the words of the Cataclysmic Megalodon, the Maiden of Orientis became stern as her body erupted with tendrils of an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity.","Within it, concepts that had achieved the 16th Boundary Layer could be felt along with one that had reached at the 17th Layer!","It was the concept of Ascension.","The moment she heard the words of the Cataclysmic Megalodon, she gathered her power as her soul burned with valor, her voice ringing out!","[Domain Expansion]","...!","[Ascensio-]","BOOM!","Before she could even finish her words, the Minor Apocalyptic Megalodon moved so fast that it disappeared from its current location, the next thing that the Maiden of Orientis observed being its crimson and black tail overshadowing her whole figure!","BOOM!","She was instantly smashed backward as her gathered authority of an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity splintered, her chest becoming caved in as she shot back like a supersonic warhead!","Her white dress became dyed crimson as her figure quickly crossed the transparent barrier of the Vein Rift, the gaze of the Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity Rubino becoming somber as he appeared behind her figure and held onto her injured body.","[WO!]","Within the Vein Rift, the Leviathan Megalodon Lineages cheered and bellowed out rhythmically once more in a grand fashion.","Shockingly, from the body of the Maiden of Orientis- a cluster of white light left her as her injured gaze became increasingly weaker- this light coming to land on the Minor Apocalyptic Megalodon termed Hughes as it entered its body and caused the aura it gave off to be even more menacing!","This reality was captured in the eyes of all.","When Extremity Rubino checked the Maiden of Orientis' body, he saw that her Soul Values were all nearly drained as they were even a fourth lower than what they used to be before!","This allowed him to know that one could step forward and fight, but there would be a price to pay if they were defeated.","But...what if one won?","[...]","Such a thought buzzed in the minds of many.","They heard the words of the terrifying Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity Cataclysmic Megalodon as it stated they may gain passage so long as they were victorious!","And the enemy chosen to face them would seemingly be a being on the same stage of power and accomplishments on the path of Extremity as the Minor Apocalyptic Megalodon that had fought the Maiden of Orientis only held the single 17th Boundary Layer of Dissolution within its body.","So long as they won against such a creature...","These were the thoughts of others.","But the vast majority knew that it would be extremely difficult as they just witnessed a prodigy like the Maiden of Orientis be overpowered before she could even call out her Domain Expansion!","At such a juncture...","[Enough!]","A shout reverberated out as the Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity Rubino holding the injured Maiden bellowed out while carrying her figure with authority behind him.","He then stepped past the transparent barrier and into the Vein Rift as the resonant bellows of the Minor Apocalyptic Megalodons quieted down.","Extremity Rubino floated in grandly as his body boomed out with crackling Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity Authority, the forefront Cataclysmic Megalodon who had spoken initially looking at him coldly as its deep voice rang out.","[Vacadon, step forward.]","...!","One of the Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities behind it came forth.","It was another Cataclysmic Megalodon, its body glistening with a fully obsidian color as the profound Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Dissolution cracked on its massive figure.","At its appearance, space also twisted and churned as in the center of the area immediately within the Vein Rift, a black singularity instantly bloomed as the voice of this entity named Vacadon thundered out.","[Step into the Temporal Field of Dissolution, and we shall battle. You may gain passage so long as you are victorious.]","WAA!","Similar words were echoed as when an Apex Aeonic Lifeform had come, the only difference being the addition of the Temporal Field!","Extremity Rubino harrumphed while gazing at the portal before him.","[Temporal Field of Dissolution?]","[An isolated domain where you can unleash your Hyperversal Authority without worry of the surrounding reality. You can battle for a day, month, or a year within as only a second will pass out here.]","...!","The eyes of the many gazing wills constricted at such words as the benefits of time dilation at their level of power were minimal, with only the most powerful beings being able to dilate time to a state that can actually help them!","Yet these Entities within the Vein Rifts conjured what they termed the Temporal Field of Dissolution so easily!","Extremity Rubino pulsed with power as he gazed at this Temporal Field, the Titanic figure of the Cataclysmic Megalodon known as Vacadon floating and disappearing into the obsidian singularity while its eyes seemed to be gazing down towards Rubino with great disrespect.","It was a gaze that caused this Extremity from one of the Seven Clans to snort and flash into the Temporal Field of Dissolution soon after!","And all wills watched with bated breaths.","In the far distance, Noah's figure remained with the Adjudicator of Dissolution as his eyes seethed with golden light- taking in all the events occurring and analyzing them!","One may gain passage so long as they were victorious.","But...what exactly waited for them if they overpowered any of these frightening enemies?","Just what was the Culmination Step of Dissolution shaping up to be?!"]},{"number":2616,"title":"Chapter 2616: Chapter 2615 Inscrutable! I","paragraphs":["2615 Inscrutable! I","The grand and auspicious changes that occurred within the Haven of Dissolution were spread out to the main forces of all Inheritances and Clans.","In all other Havens, the risen Extremity Vein seemed to only be flowing with authority at this moment as the Vein Rifts only bloomed within Dissolution, and with the information being sent out that there were thousands of Vein Rifts showing Hyperversal Extremities at Tier 3 along with Legions of Leviathan Lineages...","Such a development caused even more segments of Inheritances and Clans to move as they realized they had truly underestimated the last Extremity Sanctification!","The Hyperversal Extremities who had led and guided the Scions and Elders currently within Dissolution were those considered in the middle of lower ranks of power within the Clans and Inheritances.","At this moment, the most powerful upper-tier Hyperversal Extremities began to move- their souls smelling change and opportunity as they made their way into Dissolution!","—","Within the Haven of Oceanus.","The figure of Extremity Blue stared at the risen Extremity Vein in the distance as her soul received waves of information from the forces of the Avernus Clan.","Hair fair hands rose as she reached out towards the pulsing Vein, almost as if she could grasp it in her very hands...but she knew this was only an illusion.","She had to grasp power herself.","She had to always make the right choice.","And with Lunacy by her side, even the wrong choices would always be made right!","[Alright, let's see what the Havens have in store...maybe I shall finally grasp Zenith with this.]","Her dazzling visage rose as she glimmered with a blue light.","She then looked at the risen Extremity Vein and how it extended past the broken Walls Between Haven as she chose a direction and began rushing towards Dissolution!","She was only a glimmer of blue light in the vast expanse of Oceanus as in another region of this Haven, the figure of Emperor Shao could be seen surrounded by tendrils of dense Absolute Dynamis of Extremity by the dozens.","He was also gazing at the risen Extremity Vein in the distance as streams of information flowed into his mind from his own sources.","He assumed a contemplating look as the strands of Authority around him talked to each other.","And after a certain time passed, the authorities seemingly came to a conclusion as soon after, the countenance of Emperor Shao rose!","Zenith.","This was the stage he had reached.","But even this wasn't enough.","What he needed to attain was something exceeding Tier 3.","Something most others only dreamt of, but had long given up on.","His figure vanished into the vastness of Oceanus as he left to seek what his soul wanted the most!","—","Extremity Rubino vanished into the Temporal Field of Dissolution along with a Cataclysmic Megalodon that stood resonantly at Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity.","Into a Field where the passage of months or even a year was akin to the passage of a second from the words of the leading Cataclysmic Megalodon!","They had seen the shocking difference in power when the Maiden of Orientis faced the Minor Apocalyptic Megalodon, the main point being that even if one was in the same Boundary Layer of a Concept of Extremity- it did not necessarily mean they were at the same level of power!","But the existence who was taking up the challenge now was a being from the Orientis Clan.","A man of stature and power that against these unknown Entities...","BOOM!","The thoughts of all beings theorizing what would happen came to a halt when the Temporal Field of Dissolution pulsed and spat out an existence that was pulsing with unstable waves of power, his hand missing up to his shoulder as golden blood spurted out freely!","His dark hair seemed withered as his eyes were dimmer than before, this existence being none other than Extremity Rubino!","[....]","An immense silence descended.","BZZT!","The Temporal Field of Dissolution shook again as the massive figure of the Cataclysmic Megalodon also came out, its sleek obsidian skin spotless and without any injuries as nobody knew just how shocking the battle within the Temporal Field of Dissolution was, nor how long it truly lasted.","They didn't know whether Extremity Rubino had been reduced to this state after the passage of months, days, hours...or even seconds since time worked differently within the Temporal Field of Dissolution!","But for a Level 3 Hyperversal Extremity from one of the Seven Clans to return in such a rugged manner...","The wills watching became utterly somber.","Mind you, this was the Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification.","It was meant for Apex Aeonic Lifeforms for all past Culmination Steps in previous Havens!","And yet the Culmination Step of Dissolution...so far, even a Level 3 Hyperversal Extremity wasn't able to even gain entry!","Extremity Rubino felt as if all the wills watching were gathered around him as his eyes were filled with anger and veiled traces of fear, his figure moving back from the Vein Rift without even being told as the expressions of other Extremities from the Orientis Clan were dark.","Sensing the atmosphere, Extremity Rubino snorted out with anger.","[If you all think it is so easy, why don't you give it a go? Let's see which one you gains entry!]","...!","He felt like he could see the mocking gazes of other Transcendent Masters from the other 6 Clans and Major Inheritances.","He felt as if they were looking down on him!","But they didn't know the terror he faced within.","The Cataclysmic Megalodon that he faced...for a total of 10 seconds.","10 seconds!","Battles against Transcendent Masters could take nanoseconds to finish if there was a large discrepancy in power- like say a Level 3 Hyperversal Extremity fighting against a Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity.","But when both were at the same Tier...such battles could take days or weeks!","And yet, his battle had ended in 10 seconds.","It showed just how much more overpowered the other side was!","All of those mocking gazes on him...didn't know the terror of the genuine Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Dissolution!","So his words thundered out.","And the masses of Scions, Elders, and Extremities couldn't help but look at their own Vein Rifts before their eyes holding terrific Entities within!"]},{"number":2617,"title":"Chapter 2617: Chapter 2616 Inscrutable! II","paragraphs":["2616 Inscrutable! II","The power and confidence dwelling within the Scions, Elders, and Extremities of the Seven Clans and Major Inheritances weren't little.","Even in this shocking reality where they watched a top-tier Apex Aeonic Lifeform knocked back with a single hit and a top-tier Hyperversal Extremity return injured with his arm ripped off...it didn't deter them!","It made them more cautious.","But that was it.","In front of one Vein Rift, an Inheritance known as the Extremity Forgers had their Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity call out.","[Valiant, Gacun, Rosalind...step forward!]","He called from among the strongest Apex Aeonic Lifeforms from his Inheritance as the three called out became serious while floating towards the Vein Rift.","Even at this very moment, the authority of Dissolution mixed with the authority of other Havens continued to spill out and permeate the surroundings, causing the concentration of authority to increase as it made the movements of all beings even harder!","This group of three Scions stepped forward as they received the same message as the one they had heard before- the enemies they faced being those from the Leviathan Lineage of Cosmic Centipedes as three Cosmic Earth Centipedes showing the equivalent 16th Boundary Layer came to face them.","They weren't the only scions to be sent forth as the many Inheritances and forces of Seven Clans here...began to usher their Scions and Elders to continue testing out and gathering more information of this Culmination Step of Dissolution- as well as seek to gain entry if they could defeat their enemy!","The Scions sent weren't the strongest.","The message they received was the same.","[You may gain passage so long as you are victorious.]","...!","They were then matched with equivalent Leviathans of Dissolution as shockingly, the Scions of Inheritances and those from the Seven Clans began taking in loss after loss!","No other Hyperversal Extremity had stepped forward as they continued to observe and gather information.","At the same time, the auras of more Hyperversal Extremities blazed as those from other Havens hearing of this shocking phenomenon made their way over.","All of this...fell under Noah's gaze as his eyes were currently glazed with the gold light of Oraculum!","He sensed boundless possibilities.","He sensed innumerable opportunities!","He just had to grasp them as he asked himself...","'Is it not time?'","WAA!","Was it not time?","His Aspects of Existence cried out as if they heard his call, the majority of his Soul that had been undergoing the Vacuous and Vitalis Awakenings beginning to rouse as it ushered for their completion!","It had taken its time, but the occurring changes were that heavy and thorough as it wasn't anything that Noah had come across before.","Bathed in Vacuous Hyperversal Authority, the Vacuous Malignancies could undergo the First Vacuous Awakening after their bodies reached a level of potency and purity for this authority. This was a simple enough process...but Noah had undergone both this and the First Vitalis Awakening!","Just how ridiculous had he now become?","HOONG!","Spurred by his Will, his Main Body which was currently surrounded by a swirling storm of liquified Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authorities woke up.","\"...\"","He looked at himself and the raging Hyper-dimensional Powers that had materialized even in the outside reality, his eyes blinking as he raised his right hand up because he...couldn't feel anything.","Yes!","He couldn't feel authorities, essences, or anything emanating from his body when he first woke up as it was a new sensation he had to adapt to!","His hand showed fair white skin that held faint stellar obsidian runic tattoos that formed ancient marks all throughout his arms, and they extended upwards as when they met on his chest...a magisterial ecriture of infinity was inscribed.","The runic markings glowed with a simple stellar light as they could barely be seen, but Noah felt that they weren't as simple as they looked because they served a purpose!","He could feel...potent Vacuous and Vitalis Hyper-dimensional Authority coursing through the pathways of these runic tattoos as they cycled over his body and caused a profound reaction!","His Body, his Origin, and his Soul...it all felt so different as he needed to understand and quantify just what had occurred.","When he thought of this, his vision flickered as prompts began to rise.","[You have completed your First Vacuous Awakening!]","[You have completed your First Vitalis Awakening!]","[An unimaginable feat worthy of being heralded across the Eternal Annals of Extremity!]","[Your Soul, Origin, and Body have gained the quality of an Absolute Hyper-","dimensional Inscrutable Existence as all of your authorities will be contained within your body without being expressed outwardly. No existences will be able to discern your Realm, Concepts, Layers, Dynamis, or anything else about you as even when you express a form of authority, you can choose how others perceive it, or you can express it as a formless authority that isn't visible to the naked eye.]","...!","A ridiculous upgrade that came with endless possibilities of applications.","Absolute Hyperversal Inscrutable Existence!","Due to the First Vacuous and Vitalis Awakenings, he attained an Existence that could now not even be perceived of its state of power by others!","It was the reason why when he first woke up, even he was thrown off as he couldn't feel any signs of essence emanating from his body when normally after such a transformation, a whole storm of essence would surround him!","[You have attained the Innate Vacuous Hyper-dimensional Channels and Innate Vitalis Hyperversal Meridians that allow the circulation, accommodation, and utilization of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority and Vitalis Hyperversal Authority.]","[The level of potency and purity of Vacuous Hyper-dimensional Authority is enough for you to actively control and utilize it at the First Vacuous Awakening, but the potency and purity of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority is still too low in relation to its stature as you currently cannot actively control this authority.]","...!","Vacuous Hyper-dimensional Authority could be utilized at Noah's current stage as it seemed...Vitalis Hyperversal Authority placed itself far above.","Thick tendrils of Vitalis Hyper-dimensional Authority flowed within his body, origin, and soul...and yet he couldn't actively command it!"]},{"number":2618,"title":"Chapter 2618: Chapter 2617 Inscrutable! III","paragraphs":["2617 Inscrutable! III","[Transformation into the Vacuous Havenly I Entity is now available.]","[Transformation into the Vitalis Havenly I Entity is not currently available. The advancement of the Second Vitalis Awakening is theorized to open up this pathway for you.]","In the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","Noah continued to gaze as descending prompts calmly as he took stock of his current body.","The stellar glow and shine that always blazed around him was retracted as he seemed simple, the only thing barely giving off a stellar glow being the runic tattoos that came together to form an infinity symbol on his chest.","His hair was dyed entirely lustrous black as Vacuous Hyperversal Authority was embedded deeply into it, his eyes being the most stunning as they held...","9 different colors of overlapping pupils!","Nine-Pupiled!","When one gazed into his eyes, they would tremble and feel like an ancient resistance was gazing at them and seeing through all their secrets, the pupils constantly rotating like engines as they seemed to be absorbing the surrounding waves of authority.","[You have attained the Innate quality of Hyperversal I Assimilation.]","[Hyperversal I Assimilation]:: You can accept all kinds of essences, resources, and entities of reality into your existence and assimilate them to further strengthen yourself- their Source capable of being applied towards your Concepts of Extremity or Any Aspects of your Existence...","Hyperversal I Assimilation!","In the past, when the Adjudicator of Dissolution had been talking to Noah as he discussed devouring his enemies and making their strength his- she had uttered with distaste that he sounded very much like the Vacuous Malignancies who reveled in devouring Hyperversal Extremities as if they were tonics!","And truly...such beings were exactly that.","Their whole existence could be devoured and directed towards any part of an existence that had undergone Vacuous Awakening.","Any form of Loot Noah attained from here on out...he could assimilate it and choose where its source strengthened him- whether it was to build his Aletheian Havens of Extremity, advance his Soul, or towards his Boundary Layers!","His Boundary Layers.","Shadows had long since been placed in his Meridians as at this moment, 81 of Noah's Boundaries had been forcefully taken to the 16th Boundary Layer as well.","The 16th Boundary Layer that was attained from the Shadow Sword that Noah was cut short from!","There were two more opportunities within the Sima Clan and Infinite Extremity for Noah to grasp and see just how far he could go...and then there was the Culmination Step that was astounding even Hyperversal Extremities within Dissolution.","[More information is being quantified regarding the changes brought forth by both Vacuous and Vitalis Awakenings.]","The latest prompt told him he would have to learn for himself just how ridiculous his current body was, with his soul currently calm and without any raging storms as neither Vacuous nor Vitalis Hyperversal Authorities were clashing.","It wasn't because they had suddenly harmoniously fused in some way- but the advent of the Innate Vacuous Hyperversal Meridians made it so that his Soul was coursing with fantastical vessels that isolated and kept Vacuous Hyperversal Authority within, while the Innate Vitalis Hyperversal Meridians did the same with its respective authority!","The two opposing authorities were no longer clashing in Noah's body, but in the time that they were and after the Awakenings he had undergone...Noah was born anew as his power was utterly astounding.","From the hand he raised, Noah closed it into a fist as instantly, the liquified Vacuous Hyperversal Authority and Vitalis Hyperversal Authority swirling in the surroundings were absorbed into his body- the ancient runic tattoos on him lighting up with brilliance as they felt like ancient rivers that pristine authority flowed in!","Everything around him calmed as his Nine-Pupiled Eyes blinked, a dazzling blue-bordered stat panel appearing an instant later.","[Name]:: Noah Osmont","[Realm]:: Fourth Aletheian Haven of Extremity","[Lineage]:: Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor","[Titles]:: True Emperor of Quintessence, Wrathful Quintessential Hyperversal Demon Emperor, One Who Gazes Upon Hyperversal Authority, Aletheian, Indefatigable, Tyrannical Emperor, The Tainted, Anomaly, Home of the Weald, Awakener, Inscrutable, Hyperversal Anomaly...","[Quintessential Hyperversal Mana Value]:: Infinite","[Quintessential Hyperversal Vitality Value]:: 299,999","[Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Value]:: 299,999","[Quintessential Hyperversal Defense Value]:: 299,999","[Quintessential Hyperversal Damage Value]:: 299,999","[Hyperversal Dignity]:: 35","[Hyperversal Mastery]:: 35","[Absolute Hyperversal Authority Resistance]:: 37%","[Absolute Hyperversal Authority Penetration]:: 37%","[Dynamis of Extremity]:: Indefatigable(Quintessential Absolute), Aletheian(Quintessential Absolute), Vitalistic(Quintessential Absolute), Oraculum(Quintessential Absolute), Thanatos(Quintessential Absolute), Lotra(Quintessential Absolute)","[Boundaries of Extremity]:: Quintessence, Infinity, Shadows, Blood, Manadynamics, Loot, Reality, Dimensions, Anima, Body, Origin, Soul, Genesis, Apocalypse, Prana, Dreams, Avalon...","The statistical values of his main body.","Not his Reified Source of Quintessence that had a multiplier of 9.","Not his Reified Wealdian Sources of Extremity that also had a similar multiplier.","His Main Body!","In comparison, three days ago when the Apex War of Annihilation occurred, Ahpuch had his Soul Values approximately 20,000- with Noah's being slightly lower!","\"...\"","And here he was three days later.","His Nine-Pupiled Eyes blinked like ancient sins as he uttered out gloriously while raising his head.","\"Acceptable...\"","WAA!","The True Emperor of Quintessence looked at his progress and claimed it was acceptable!","His gaze went out far as it crossed the Infinite Hyperversal Haven and the Recorded History it was in.","It traversed the Aeonic Annals of Extremity and came to focus on the eyes of the clone beside the Adjudicator of Dissolution who was watching as one Scion after another was thrown on in defeat from the Vein Rifts stretched out across Dissolution!","The eyes of this clone flickered as the single pupil within doubled and then tripled until ultimately, 9 dazzling layered pupils appeared.","The skin begins to peel and flicker away as with this clone as an anchor...the Reified Wealdian Source of Indefatigable stepped forth.","Not with its characteristic and terrifying four faces as its original appearance, but with light complexion and calmness reminiscent of Noah's main physique as at this moment...it stopped giving off any perceive of authority or aura!","One's will and authority wouldn't even be able to perceive him unless they were looking straight at him, this change causing the Adjudicator of Dissolution to physically turn around as her eyes constricted when she gazed at Noah once more.","She had to gaze at him with her eyes.","She couldn't see him any other manner as her Hyperversal Will and Soul sensed him entirely disappearing in the past second!","If she wasn't looking at him, she wouldn't know he was there!","It was such an incredulous phenomenon as Noah didn't address it in any way, his form becoming decorated in light back plants and a loose-fitting obsidian shirt that showed off his glorious physique, as well as a glimpse of ancient runic tattoos forming into an infinity symbol on his chest.","An atmosphere of profound dignity and majesty surrounded him even when nothing about his aura or authority could be felt, his form slowly floating towards the Vein Rift that held the Smilodon Leviathan Lineage along with the Tier 3 Aquatic Eon Dragonfly and Lightning Titanoboa!","The extras had tried and kept on trying to gain entry even now as none were successful.","It was time for the protagonist to step onto the stage!"]},{"number":2619,"title":"Chapter 2619: Chapter 2618 Man of the Hour! I","paragraphs":["2618 Man of the Hour! I","The Haven Saber Smilodon gazed at the millions of The Underdwellers as his eyes could see them plotting.","He could see them scheming as the Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Dissolution allowed to read their movements and even their very thoughts!","They thought they could sneak this way out of this through some unique methodologies, but they would come to find that only pure power was the answer.","And comparing The Underdwellers before him to their Havenly Lineage that was tasked with a glorious purpose...well, the result was apparent in the currently occurring reality.","Matched against equivalent existences from the Havenly Lineages who had achieved the same highest Boundary Layer, the Underdwellers still had yet to produce even a single being that gained entry!","It showed the discrepancy in power as they sought Extremity...but they didn't truly dedicate and sacrifice their very souls to it!","An Underdweller capable of matching even one being from their Havenly Lineage had yet to step forward as if things continued like this...then he had no worries about their Havenly Lineage being the ones to bear the weight of all that was to come.","Tendrils of Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Dissolution raged around the body of the Haven Saber Smilodon as he was gazing at the light years around this Nether Haven when his sharp canines glinted while turning towards a certain direction.","[Hmm?]","His authority pulsed as he nearly missed an Underdweller.","Even now as he stared at his levitating form that was coming towards the Vein Rifts, the Haven Saber Smilodon could not feel an aura emanating from this existence!","He...could not read the power of this being.","Unlike the masses of Underdwellers who easily had their thoughts laid out in the open, even the concepts of Extremity could not be felt from this being!","The Haven Saber Smilodon's eyes released a radiant sheen as the Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Dissolution around him danced, information and possibilities blooming within the mind of the Haven Saber Smilodon as he coldly gazed forward.","'Maybe?'","...!","—","Noah's figure floated out serenely.","He approached the Vein Rifts before him just like many other Scions and Elders were doing, but a few eyes had already glanced over due to the fact that the Adjudicator of Dissolution was here- their wills drawn prior due to Noah being behind her!","There were also many sets of eyes that already had the region around Noah under observation as light years away, the figure of Extremity Ariana and a dozen other Avernus Extremities could be seen floating a distance away from another Vein Rift.","Ariana had purple flames simmering in her eyes as she noted the distance and closeness that Noah showed with the Adjudicator of Dissolution, her eyes revealing many things when a voice that nearly caused her to jump rang out beside her.","[You're so focused when staring at him...do you want to kill or pounce on him?]","...!","Beside her, the lunatic that was Extremity Blue suddenly appeared as Ariana nearly cursed at her!","She gritted her teeth while replying calmly.","[All of these changes have just bloomed as nobody is clear yet on what the full circumstances is. I don't like that he's getting a chance to fight...]","Ever since the events in the Shadow Sea Plane and the Shadow Sword that Ariana had claimed, she had grown even more careful and cautious of the entity that was Noah Osmont!","[You're focusing on the wrong things, little sister...] Beside her, Extremity Blue smiled brilliantly while her gem like eyes shone.","Extremity Ariana kept her annoyance to herself as she wanted to ask this lunatic just who the hell was her little sister?!","Yet this lunatic continued as her smile turned utterly cold.","[Your concentration should be on the fact that at this moment, we cannot feel even an ounce of Concepts or an aura from him, and we're supposedly Hyperversal Extremities while he is an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!]","Brilliance shone in her eyes as around them, the eyes of the Avernus Extremities constricted and focused!","At this time, the figure of Noah stepped foot past the transparent barrier of the Vein Rift as he gazed calmly at the Leviathan Lineages before him.","Smilodons, Dragonflies, and Titanoboas!","Each of their bodies pulsed with power and great might as his languid eyes came to land on the entity emanating the most dangerous aura.","The Haven Saber Smilodon stated back at him coldly as he didn't call out a name yet.","Instead, his regal voice rang out.","[What is the highest Boundary Layer you have achieved?]","...!","A smile formed on Noah's lips.","Inscrutable.","This feature of his entity made it so that even this powerful existence at the same stage if not beyond the Adjudicator of Dissolution to not be capable of seeing through him!","\"The 16th Boundary Layer.\"","He spoke simply as the eyes of the Haven Saber Smilodon flashed, his stature being able to ascertain the truth and falsehood of words as his voice boomed out soon after.","[Miguel, step forward.]","WAA!","A glorious aura blared forth.","The Legion of Smilodons in front of Noah parted ways as from them, the visage of an Earth Saber Smilodon coming through as its fur was drenched inky black.","The power of the 16th Boundary Layer of Dissolution surged on his paws explosively as above his head, an illusory obsidian flaming crown of Dissolution roared to life!","The Earth Saber Smilodon named Miguel stared at Noah, and he was met with eerie Nine-Pupiled Eyes that gave off unseen pressure.","But the might of the Smilodon wouldn't falter.","It would do what many other Havenly Lineages had done against the Underdwellers that had come forth.","It would strike and smash this being back to where he came from!","[HO!]","Flames of Dissolution freely flowed from the body of the Earth Saber Smilodon as he treated this battle with utmost seriousness since the enemy's power couldn't be properly gauged.","SAA!","A flicker of black light.","And an instant later, the pristine sharp claws of the right limb of the Earth Saber Smilodon appeared on the right side of Noah's floating figure!","\"...\"","Disappointment dawned on the eyes of the Smilodon.","His enemy didn't erupt with any power, nor did he even react to turn to the right to defend.","He deserved the loss that was coming if he couldn't even react to his speed!","The claw of the Smilodon thundered down as...","BZZT!","...!","A fantastical scene unfolded.","The Smilodon didn't know when, but the hand of the entity adorned in loose fitting black pants and shirt had risen as two fingers on his hand clamped out...and the claw of the Smilodon carrying the weight of Dissolution behind it was entirely stopped!","Crackles of inky black Dissolution buzzed and erupted as if metal was grating on metal.","The Earth Saber Smilodon felt as if his claws were clamped and held down with the weight of a Haven as the being responsible slowly turned his head to the right.","And the soul of the Earth Saber Smilodon vibrated with astonishment as it stared into nine pupils that now seemed like 9 endless swirling storms of the abyss!!!"]},{"number":2620,"title":"Chapter 2620: Chapter 2619 Man Of The Hour! II","paragraphs":["2619 Man of the Hour! II","All the battles that had occurred so far when Scions and Elders of Inheritances and Clans stepped into the Vein Rifts had ended the same way.","Complete and utter thrashing as the quality of power was on a completely different scale when the Scions and Elders battled against equivalent Leviathan Lineages that had attained the same stage of Extremity!","One of the main causes behind this was none other than the fact that the Leviathan Lineages all pulsed with the authority of Dissolution.","The authority of the very Haven they stood on and the very authority still spilling out senselessly from the Vein Rift!","Fight after fight, the result was the same as the Scions and Elders wouldn't even last a few moves.","So...when an existence facing a Leviathan pulsing with Dissolution showed off a shocking scene of dominance to the extent that he wasn't even moved back by an attack...many eyes and Wills began to draw over!","Who was he?","What was his level of power? Which Clan or Inheritance did he stem from?!","These questions buzzed as a vast number of wills across the indeterminate light years came to focus on a single Vein Rift that showed off a devilishly handsome man.","He arrived and made all others focus on him.","As if he was the man of the hour!","—","The sensation was indescribable.","When the Earth Saber Smilodon began moving. When flames of Dissolution erupted around its body. When its claws came towards him.","It was immeasurably fast in the eyes of others, but for him...it was so slow!","Just his spread-out will allowed him to see it all as his Foundation which had been absolutely jacked by the First Vacuous Awakening and the First Vitalis Awakening was just this frightening!","While the Smilodon was coming in the span of an instant, Noah was able to lock onto it as his Nine-Pupiled Eyes blazed with gold, even more details now being pulled out when he looked at this creature.","[Name]:: Miguel","[Realm]:: Minor Haven of Dissolution","[Lineage]:: Havenly Smilodon Lineage","[Titles]:: Havenly Beast, Saber-Toothed, Havenly Dissolution Extremity Foundation...","[Havenly Dissolution Mana Value]:: 50,000","[Havenly Dissolution Vitality Value]:: 50,000","[Havenly Dissolution Soul Value]:: 50,000","[Havenly Dissolution Defense Value]:: 50,000","[Havenly Dissolution Damage Value]:: 50,000","[Dynamis of Extremity]:: Dissolution","[Boundaries of Extremity]:: Dissolution","...!","The reason why they outclassed Scions and Elders so much.","From their side, they were calling them Leviathan Lineages as on their end, they were known as the Havenly Lineages!","And the values of a single Entity of the Havenly Smilodon Lineage who had achieved the 16th Boundary Layer is Dissolution was two times compared to a Direct Disciple of a Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity like Ahpuch who had also only achieved the 16th Layer as his highest.","The Havenly Lineages were powerful!","If Noah had met them just three days ago before the war, maybe he would be on the same boat as other Scions and Elders like today.","But now...","\"Get ready.\"","...!","His voice was calm as he addressed the astounded Earth Saber Smilodon.","His fingers that were clamping down on the claw released and straightened as they all pointed towards the Earth Saber Smilodon, and an instant later...his fingers were retracted to form a fist!","A fist.","Just the formation of a fist!","The pressure of this formed fist thundered forth as in the eyes of others, a blinding cylindrical beam of multicolored light instantly barreled forth!","And yet, it was the authority of the Indefatigable Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity released from the Reified Wealdian Source of Indefatigable!","ZAA!","The multicolored beam of light disappeared just as quickly as it had erupted.","When it faded, the eyes of the Earth Saber Smilodon before Noah were dim as its long canines were shattered, cracks extending from throughout its inky black body as a number that only Noah could see rose before this beast.","-49,999!","He precisely controlled his output to release a damage value that would leave behind a single Vitality Value on this Entity.","He didn't go for death as there were three terrifying Tier 3 Hyperversal Havenly Beasts right behind this one!","Its body shuddered as golden blood flowed like rivers, immense silence descending in the surroundings as from its body, Noah saw a flash of light be released and flow towards him.","His hand rose to grasp it as it couldn't forcefully make its way into his body unless he allowed it, and after he affirmed there were no issues, it sank in smoothly as a prompt rose!","[You have attained 10 Units of Havenly Aurora!]","...!","When the Maiden of Orientis lost, she had lost a significant portion of her Soul Values as they were even permanently reduced- all of this going towards the victor who had defeated her.","Now after Noah defeated a Havenly Beast, he attained 10 Units of Havenly Aurora!","This unique form of energy was collected into a corner of his soul calmly as when he tried to peer into it...","[The Usage of the Units of Havenly Aurora is currently unknown.]","The information wasn't there.","The reality around him resumed.","The Scions, Elders, and Extremities watching in front of other Vein Rifts had shining eyes as they stared at the unbelievable scene that had just occurred.","For the first time, someone from their side had actually defeated a Leviathan Beast!","In the far distance, in a region where massive vessels and the powerhouses of the Sima Clan were clustered.","The Extremity of Foundation stood behind Erikson and many other Sima Clan Scions as he spoke to his son with a calm gaze.","[You continue to be right about him.]","The words were meant to acknowledge Erikson's foresight, but his expression remained free and unbound as for today's occasion, his beach attire had changed to a shade of orange-red. As if to welcome a setting sun!","He gazed at the figure of Noah in the distance as well as the Vein Rift before the eyes of the Sima Clan.","At this moment, he already began to distort the probability of the events to come as he was ready!","On another side, the figures carrying a sense of despondency and desolation could be seen as they were wrapped in shadows.","The Primeval Shadow Elder Silas and others stood behind Laos, Flashing Shadow, and even the Shadow Extremity Overlord as they also gazed towards Noah!","Their thoughts were hard to read as gazes of maddened rage would occasionally turn towards the region clustering the forces of the Avernus Clan!","Many beings had just begun to react to the shocking first win within a battle to occur on their side as one Scion who had been watching this battle unfold since Noah stepped forward spoke with an incredulous expression as if he had just realized something.","\"Wait...did he say his highest Boundary Layer was the 16th?\"","...!","Before the battle began, the Haven Saber Smilodon had asked Noah his highest Layer. It was only now that some people who held more information fully processed this as their minds began to pound!","Their eyes became stern as they looked at this being ahead of them.","He wasn't even an Apex Aeonic Lifeform until a few days ago as far as they knew, and he had already taken a Boundary to the 16th Layer?!","This was akin to a prized Scion being given the resources and nurturing of a massive Inheritance or Clan!","So what exactly had this being relied on to bring a Boundary to the 16th Layer?!","\"...\"","A question that held no answer.","Within the Vein Rift, the Haven Saber Smilodon looked at Noah with a dazzling obsidian light as his voice thundered out while waves of his authority wrapped around the Earth Saber Smilodon Noah had spared to pull it back.","[You have come out victorious and gained entry-]","[Like hell he did!]","..!","BOOM!","Before the words of the Haven Saber Smilodon ended, a dazzling allure of Blue erupted out as Hyperversal Haki of Extremity thundered from all directions!","The Adjudicator of Dissolution quickly reacted as she was about to make a move, and yet her hand came to a halt an instant later as she felt no need to.","A maddening flicker of cerulean light was surprised at this, but it continued forward nonetheless as the target was the being emanating not even an ounce of an aura!","And yet before her Hyperversal Haki of Extremity or even her visage came close...","BZZT!","Astounding waves of Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Disintegration seethed as everything was wiped away.","After all, there were three Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities just at the forefront of this Vein Rift!","The figure of a woman with snow-white hair adorned in a blue battle dress became clear.","And before her, the glorious visage of a cold-faced Aquatic Eon Dragonfly could be seen- this being the existence that had effortlessly eliminated her Hyperversal Haki of Extremity!","Extremity Blue watched forward and spoke with squinting eyes","[Hey, beastie...] Her expression was calm as she stared at the Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity before her.","[Could you move aside just for a second? I just want to put to sleep that guy behind you there, and I'll leave right after...pinky promise!]","Her fair hand reached out as her smallest finger was raised.","The swirling gaze of the Aquatic Eon Dragonfly pulsed as its voice thundered out.","[You may gain passage so long as you are victorious.]","...!","The same words.","Immeasurable grandeur overflowed as behind the Aquatic Eon Dragonfly, Noah's silhouette became bathed in a wondrous light- the Legion of Earth Saber Smilodons before that being parting as they exposed a hazy mist in the distance that hid unknown lands!"]},{"number":2621,"title":"Chapter 2621: Chapter 2620 Havenly Aurora! I","paragraphs":["2620 Havenly Aurora! I","[You have come out victorious and gained entry into the Supernal Haven of Dissolution. Be mindful of your actions within as if you offend those you should not, your life is not guaranteed.]","...!","The Haven Saber Smilodon spoke while its cold eyes stared at the figure of Extremity Blue who had interrupted him earlier in the corner of his eyes.","\"Supernal Haven of Dissolution?\" Noah's eyes rose as he saw the Earth Saber Smilodon Legion parting ways to reveal a hazy dark mist in the distance that shrouded what lay behind it.","Whatever lay behind was termed Supernal Haven of Dissolution as he sought to see if this horrifying Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity would reveal any more information!","And the Haven Saber Smilodon pulsed with tendrils of Dissolution as an authoritative voice thundered out coldly.","[The Haven you all are in is the Nether Haven of Dissolution. Within it, the potency and purity of Dissolution are at their lowest as most of the Underdwellers within it will not even have the right to embark on Dissolution itself.]","...!","The Aeonic Haven of Dissolution was termed the Nether Haven of Dissolution, with the words of the Haven Saber Smilodon stating that beyond the Vein Rifts, they would appear in the Supernal Haven of Dissolution!","One was below, one was above.","One was outside of the Extremity Vein, the other could only be accessed within!","And Noah along with all those in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution were termed...","[Underdwellers? Us? Haha!] The annoying voice of the Extremity of Lunacy echoed out as her head peeked beside the Aquatic Eon Dragonfly.","Her eyes shimmered with blue light as she continued to speak once more.","[You told him he was granted access and that he should be mindful not to offend those he shouldn't in this Supernal Haven of Dissolution lying ahead...","does that mean there aren't any sort of rulings that would prevent an Extremity from giving an eternal nap to a being of lesser power that offended her?]","...!","Noah's eyes shone dangerously at Extremity Blue's words.","Outside of the Vein Rift, the eyes of the Adjudicator of Dissolution radiated terrifying splendor at the advent of such words!","And then...the Haven Saber Smilodon gazed at Extremity Blue as if he were looking at a fool as he spoke grandly.","[Rulings? The only ruling within any of the Supernal Havens of Extremity is strength. If this being here has offended you and you want to kill, you can kill. You simply need to gain entry.]","BOOM!","Explosive words thundered out as the minds of all those watching buzzed.","Right.","The Investiture of Extremity that stated that those of higher power could not act against those less powerful than them was instituted by the Senatus of Extremity in order to maintain a semblance of order in the Seven Havens!","In the Seven Havens they knew and lived in.","There was no such thing in these lands that the Haven Saber Smilodon termed the Supernal Havens of Extremity!","Strength was king.","Strength spoke for itself as if one had power, they could do whatever they wanted!","When she heard this, Extremity Blue let out a raucous laugh that before it could finish...","[Of course...] The voice of the Haven Saber Smilodon thundered out again as this time it was focused on her.","[...you have offended me just now. So if you happen to gain access into the Supernal Haven of Dissolution, just know that if I feel like it, I may also choose to put you to sleep permanently.]","WAA!","The Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Dissolution crashed madly.","The smile and laugh on Extremity Blue's face were wiped away as a horrifying atmosphere bloomed.","In front of her, a radiant obsidian Temporal Field of Dissolution bloomed as the cold eyes of the Haven Saber Smilodon shone while the dominant voice resonated again!","[Zaman, step forward!]","...!","From behind the Legions of Earth Saber Smilodon.","The obsidian mist churned and roiled as an immediate later, a glorious aura of a Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity bloomed- the visage of a red-striped Haven Saber Smilodon appearing as its aura was much less threatening than the Zenith Haven Saber Smilodon that had been talking this whole time!","Extremity Blue had not achieved Zenith.","She was not matched with any of the three Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity Havenly Beasts that were already here as her match was called out from the Supernal Haven of Dissolution!","The unfolding scene was utterly breathtaking as a great deal of information was unveiled, and immense dangers also showed themselves as Extremity Blue gazed in the far distance where the troops of the Avernus Clan were clustered.","Her eyes sent out a clear message as Extremity Ariana and the others there knew exactly what she stated, the Avernus Extremities moving authoritatively as their troops began to swarm towards nearby Vein Rifts to seek access!","Since if they were powerful enough to enter the Supernal Haven of Dissolution, they would not be bound or restricted by the Investiture of Extremity that they had already begun to violate.","At such a conclusion, Extremity Blue herself smiled crazily as she turned into a streak of light that surged towards the Temporal Field before her, but not before her voice thundered out.","[Wait patiently for me, Little Osmont.]","SHAA!","With a blink of light, she disappeared.","Noah gazed at this scene with profound coldness as he also turned around and floated towards the obsidian mist in the distance!","'Wait!'","The voice of the Adjudicator of Dissolution buzzed in Noah's mind at such a moment as he didn't stop.","He knew what she was going to say. She wanted him to continue being reliant on her power and the power of others to defend against Hyperversal Extremities in these new and unexplored lands that didn't prevent them from acting out against those of lesser power!","But Noah had seen time and time again how even she could not do anything to stop the violations of the Investiture of Extremity.","He had long since decided to not rely on others as he only sent back a single message to the Adjudicator of Dissolution!","'I'm not worried about a mere Hyperversal Extremity. They had been hunting me then, and they're hunting me now. I'll deal with it as I see fit.'","...!","The power of other beings could not be relied on.","Only his own power would give the most guarantee as without looking back, he passed the ranks of the Earth Saber Smilodon that were staring at him cautiously and with a combative battle spirit as he delved towards the obsidian mist in the distance!"]},{"number":2622,"title":"Chapter 2622: Chapter 2621 Havenly Aurora! II","paragraphs":["2621 Havenly Aurora! II","The unfolding reality and exchanged words that revealed a great deal of information caused a buzz to rise in the surroundings, the wills and eyes of many beings observing as the first of their kind delved into the obsidian mist past the Veil Rift as he was the first to be granted entry into whatever this Culmination Step of Dissolution was!","His entry was akin to a rousing fire that began to burn endlessly. Like the match that set off endless suns!","More and more Inheritances and Clans sent their forces forth into the myriad of Vein Rifts stretched out across the Nether Haven of Dissolution, no longer sending their weakest as some of the truly powerful Scions and Elders began to make a move!","In the Vein Rift holding the grand visage of the Haven Saber Smilodon, Aquatic Eon Dragonfly, and Lightning Titanoboa, the Temporal Field of Dissolution that Extremity Blue had gone in pulsed with a bright light as when the Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity called Zaman was about to delve in...","[Wait.]","...!","The Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity Haven Saber Smilodon spoke out once more as Zaman instantly halted and nodded respectfully.","[Yes, Lord Commander.]","Lord Commander.","This was what the Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity was referred to as his voice echoed out with a sneering light when he watched the Temporal Field of Dissolution that Extremity Blue had disappeared into!","[Let her simmer in there a bit longer.]","The words of the Lord Commander Smilodon were astonishing as they showed these Havenly Beasts guarding the Vein Rift were bound by some process, and yet there was some leeway in how they acted in all this!","The actions of Extremity Blue were disliked by the Lord Commander as at this moment, her combatant did not yet enter the Temporal Field of Dissolution.","This scene was observed by many as next, yet another event that caused many wills to buzz occurred.","A veiled figure who actually emanated waves of Dissolution from the Underdwellers came forward and stepped past the transparent barrier of the Vein Rift.","It was the Adjudicator of Dissolution herself as the Lord Commander Smilodon gazed at her calmly, his voice the same as ever.","[You may gain passage so long as you are victorious.]","WAA!","Along with his words, a second Temporal Field of Dissolution opened up in this space as the head of the Lord Commander Smilodon turned towards the massive Lightning Titanoboa on the side!","[Batiatus, accompany her and observe her worth as a Zenith.]","...!","Even more explosive words affirming the stature that the Adjudicator of Dissolution had achieved thundered out as obsidian lightning of Dissolution surged, the massive Lightning Titanoboa moving from the back as it disappeared into a flash of light in the next second that entered the Temporal Field.","The veiled figure of the Adjudicator of Dissolution also didn't delay as a moment later, she also flickered and disappeared!","—","The obsidian mist obscured one's will and vision as nothing past it could be seen unless it was crossed.","It felt similar to the thick wall of Dissolution they had faced at the end of the Initiation Step of Extremity Sanctification, with Noah crossing the Mist of Dissolution speedily as he felt the spacetime continuum distort in magnificent ways!","It meant that this mist wasn't just something like a wall that after a person crossed, they would arrive at some land opposite it.","It distorted space similar to the wormholes that formed to take existences from the Planar Palisades of Extremity and into the Seven Havens as after Noah navigated multiple spatial distortions...","SAA!","He finally saw brightness.","He finally felt something new.","Behind him, an endlessly vertical obsidian Wall of Dissolution stretched up and down as ahead of him...was a fantastical sight that caused his Nine-","Pupiled Eyes to radiate profound brilliance!","First, the surroundings were heavily concentrated with tendrils of Dissolution, but Noah could also see crimson tendrils of light that he recognized as Helios, as well as white tendrils that should represent Genesis!","4 other wondrously colored tendrils intermixed in this space as it seemed like the highest concentration was Dissolution, but the minuscule authorities of the other Supernal Havens of Extremity were also here!","And ahead of him...the astonishing scene of a massive island the size of a Major Plane of Existence could be seen.","Hazy obsidian streams of Dissolution leaked from the ends of the island like a waterfall as atop it, ancient and titanic trees and vegetation rose endlessly!","In addition to this, an overabundance of auras and Lifeforms could be felt on this island as Noah saw endless variations of the Havenly Smilodon Lineage either floating between the innumerable obsidian white trees or walking on its verdant lush grasslands.","They varied in power as most were in the Boundary Expansion Realm, with Noah being able to sense thousands in the Apex Aeonic Lifeform level just on this floating island the size of a Major Plane of Existence before him!","All of this was paired with the blazing auras of four Hyperversal Extremities burning brightly on this landmass.","What was more astonishing was that further away, to Noah's left and right...","similar floating islands such as this could be seen as on the right side, light years away, the outline of another floating island holding hundreds of thousands of the Havenly Titanoboa Lineage could be seen.","To the left, yet another floating island with numerous beasts of the Havenly Dragonfly Lineage could be seen!","Far below Noah, space stretched out endlessly until his eyes met billowing and roiling obsidian mist of Dissolution, and the skies were the same as they stretched out endlessly until billowing clouds of Dissolution obscured everything.","In between...clusters of gorgeous floating islands the size of Planes of Existence were stretched out as Noah was most astonished by a phenomenon at the very peak of these islands!","There, he could see a swirling Singularity that seemed to be collecting the pure authority of Dissolution from all around.","And in addition to this, he caught something with his eyes that others may not be able to see.","He could only see it because his body was currently filled with it as he held its Innate Vitalis Hyperversal Meridians!","He could see faint traces of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority manifesting from the surroundings and mixing with Dissolution in the singularity at the very peak of these floating islands, and then streams of fantastical light washed down onto these islands to form into...wonders.","Wonders was all he could call them.","Atop the island directly before him, dense clusters of what seemed to be Aeonic Treasures of Extremity could be seen surrounded by a halo of transparent light, along with the shocking scene of Golden, Obsidian, and even a few Crimson Extremity Panaceas here and there!","Fantastical treasures and different forms of loot were clustered beautifully across the skies of the floating island, the Havenly Smilodon Lineage moving around it nonchalantly as if it were the norm!","The pristine light floating from the Singularity of the intermixing Vitalis Hyperversal Authority and Dissolution continued to drip down as even now, Noah could see halos of circular bubbles holding half forged Aeonic Treasures of Extremity- treasures that were gradually becoming complete as others like them were littered all across this glorious floating landmass.","For light years.","The scene was mind boggling as Noah's eyes felt like there was something at play here- with the dense auras of Havenly Smilodon Beasts on this island moving about freely and not plucking the treasures before their eyes causing a sense of incongruency.","But he could figure this out slowly.","As he appeared, Noah saw the eyes of many of the Havenly Smilodons turn towards his direction, along with the oppressive wills of the four Hyperversal Extremities just on this island alone.","He began to float towards them as his body began to change, lustrous black fur with cherry-colored stripes appearing on his skin as his form turned beastial.","He went on his four limbs as his head soon transformed into the savage visage of an Earth sword Smilodon carrying shocking handsomeness, a flaming black crown that emanated the aura of Dissolution rising above as below his four paws wielding sharp claws, tendrils of authority that seemed like Dissolution buzzed feely!","His status as an Absolute Hyperversal Inscrutable presence was out to use as he took on the form of an Earth Saber Smilodon, his body giving off the aura and authority of Dissolution outwardly even though he had not grasped this Havenly Concept!","Since there were Hyperversal Extremities coming for him into these lands that only had strength as king, he would find his own ways to survive as at this moment...even if Blue arrived and saw Noah right before her eyes- she wouldn't be able to recognize him with his aura, Realm, body, or anything else as he floated to mix with the Havenly Smilodon Beasts on the massive island before him!","His speed was fast as he arrived within a nanosecond, the Earth sword Smilodons on the edge of the island looking at him with interested gazes as the moment Noah landed on the edge where luscious verdant and black grass grew, the voice of one of the Four Hyperversal Extremities within this landmass echoed out in his mind.","[The First Underdweller to arrive into our blessed Supernal Havens, and an interesting one at that to be able to mimic us so proficiently...Mmm, do you have enemies coming behind you? Well, no matter. Come, you shall have the honor of getting an introduction.]","...!"]},{"number":2623,"title":"Chapter 2623: Chapter 2622 Havenly Aurora! III","paragraphs":["2622 Havenly Aurora! III","The first Underdweller to arrive in the Supernal Haven of Dissolution!","Noah claimed this title as when he landed atop the floating landmass of pristine fantastical grandeur, the voice of a Hyperversal Extremity echoed out as he saw the verdant and obsidian grass around him make way and form a path towards the depths of the island.","The Smilodons around this area only gazed at him briefly before they went back to their prior actions- many of them lying down with their eyes closed as the aura of Dissolution formed into tendrils of light around them.","With his body as a black and cherry-colored Smilodon, Noah went deeper into the island as he began to come across more Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, passing through the groves of thick and ancient trees pulsing with Dissolution until a clearing began to open up ahead of him.","A small mountain rose within this clearing as a stream of stellar obsidian water could be seen circling around it- the small mountain divided into floors as the bodies of Apex Smilodons were sprawled all around it, with the aura of a Hyperversal Extremity Smilodon at the very peak of this small mountain!","It was the only thing in this clearing as the mountain was surrounded by heavy concentrations of Dissolution, and Noah could see that far above this region, the halos of circular bubbles holding profound Aeonic Treasures of Extremity floated majestically!","[My, I really can't tell you apart from other Smilodons...just what did you use to even fool the senses of a Hyperversal Extremity?]","The feminine voice of a Haven Saber Smilodon thundered out as it stemmed from the regal red-furred existence at the top of the small mountain.","Watching it was akin to a habitat of a pride of lions, with the eyes of the Haven Saber Smilodon locked onto Noah as a smile formed on her head!","Noah's visage was calm as he responded.","[Just a trick I came across not too long ago. You mentioned an introduction?]","An introduction. If one didn't want to stumble in these new lands, this was invaluable!","The Hyperversal Extremity before Noah did not release an aura anywhere as powerful as the three managing the Vein Rift as she seemed to be Tier 1 at most, with her serene utterance continuing to echo out at this moment.","[Mmm...you've just arrived in the Supernal Haven of Dissolution and stepped on one of its Havenly Archipelagos. One of the more common Golden Havenly Archipelagos that holds the most basic Havenly Treasures.]","...!","Havenly Treasures!","As she spoke, she pointed her paw upwards and tapped as from the glorious glimmers of light above, one of the halos of circular light surrounding a treasure floated down until it came just below the mountain in front of Noah.","[Reality may be entirely different in your Nether Haven of Dissolution, but the reality in the Supernal Havens of Extremity is one where above the Havenly Archipelagos, Havenly Authority gathers and mixes with the Authority of the Supernal Haven to produce a myriad of Havenly Treasures. And to attain them...well, why don't you take a look and try to take the one before your eyes? It is something that an Underdweller like you would need the most right now.]","WAA!","An entirely different reality.","The Havenly Saber Smilodon talked of the Havenly Authority gathering above the Havenly Archipelagos as she referred to Vitalis Hyperversal Authority, with Noah's mind putting all the information together as he floated up to the halo of light that when coming closer, one could see a dazzling black and white scroll contained within!","Noah's paws went towards the halo of light containing this black and white scroll as...","BZZT!","His hand was rebuffed.","And thereafter, streams of information surged out that for him- they transformed into gorgeous prompts.","[Insufficient Units of Havenly Aurora to acquire the Golden Aurora Accumulation Modus Operandi. 100 Units of Havenly Aurora are required.]","...!","The usage of the Units of Havenly Aurora!","Noah had attained 10 from defeating the Earth Saber Smilodons as it seemed all the Havenly Treasures atop the Archipelagos of the Supernal Haven of Dissolution required such a form of authority in order to be obtained!","[Unique, isn't it?] The voice of the Haven Saber Smilodon continued as Noah stared at the black and white scroll before him with blazing eyes.","[Reality revolves around the Units of Havenly Aurora one has as with a sufficient amount, one can even acquire Havenly Treasures that can take them to Extremity on Obsidian or Crimson Havenly Archipelagos. The bodies of the Havenly Lineages across the Supernal Havens of Extremity have slowly collected Havenly Aurora since they were born, with the Challengers that you Underdwellers are facing having been prepared as they already utilized most of their Havenly Aurora to redeem Treasures before stepping out- just in the case they lost against any of you, they wouldn't lose much of their accumulated Havenly Aurora!]","Even more dazzling words came out as a few truths became clear.","One was that it was possible to slowly build up the Havenly Aurora over time while in the Supernal Havens of Extremity.","Another was that a method to attain Havenly Aurora was to overpower and defeat another being- this in turn transferring their Units of Havenly Aurora to the victor!","And of course, there was the Golden Aurora Accumulation Modus Operandi floating in front of Noah and unattainable by him at this moment.","His eyes were fiery as he gazed at it, the voice of the Haven Saber Smilodon continuing with its smile becoming even wider.","[Ah yes, the faster way to build up Havenly Aurora. Even though it's the lowest tier of the Aurora Accumulation Modus Operandi, the Golden Aurora Accumulation Modus Operandi grants you the wisdom on how to pull Units of Havenly Aurora into your existence faster- this being the major way existences accumulate Aurora apart from Challenges!]","...!","[Challenges...you can participate in these on any Havenly Archipelago you land on as if you step on the Challenger Arena, you can battle others. So long as you win, their Havenly Aurora is yours. And the biggest introductory lesson I can give to an Underdweller like you is if you start battles anywhere else apart from Challenger Arenas and commence massacring Havenly Beasts to acquire their Aurora...you would not live long as just like you massacre others, someone more powerful will arise to do the same to you.]","...!"]},{"number":2624,"title":"Chapter 2624: Chapter 2623 Havenly Aurora! IV","paragraphs":["2623 Havenly Aurora! IV","Strength was king in the Supernal Havens of Extremity as they didn't have something like the Investiture of Extremity!","But this didn't mean their lands were filled with chaos as due to the Havenly Lineages spread throughout, there was actually a sense of profound harmony across the Supernal Havens of Extremity.","Those more powerful of the Havenly Lineages supported and defended their Lineages.","If a powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeform who enjoyed killing came to be as they went wild in such a venture, they would quickly be put down by a slap from a Hyperversal Extremity.","If a Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity wanted to quickly accumulate Havenly Aurora and began massacring the lives within entire Archipelagos for it, they would soon be surrounded by Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities and be erased out of existence!","Strength was king.","And you truly had to be strong to move fearlessly across these fantastical lands.","So when more and more beings from the Nether Haven of Dissolution arrived here and understood the means of Havenly Aurora...any chaos that might arise from it was bound to be an astounding future to look forward to.","For wild beings like Extremity Blue...how long would they be able to survive in these lands if they continued to act the way they did?","[But, that's the serious stuff out of the way. I was going to be nice and obtain this Golden Aurora Accumulation Modus Operandi for you, but your nature has made me curious as I want to see more of a display of your abilities. If you wish to keep your head start against other Underdwellers, you'll need to begin accumulating Havenly Aurora as soon as possible as why don't you...enter the Challenger Arena of this Archipelago? If you can win against other Challengers, you can obtain more Units of Havenly Aurora and gain the capability to springboard your power as you...haven't seen anything yet.]","...!","Her words were valiant as the Apex Aeonic Earth Saber Smilodons around this area pulsed with power.","The feline visage of the Haven Saber Smilodon rose with a yawn and a stretch as a heavy Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Dissolution erupted around her, covering the Smilodons here in addition to Noah as with a devilish glint in her eyes, she echoed out.","[Let's go.]","WAA!","With a glimmer of light, the Smilodons here turned into obsidian shadows that were taken deeper into this extensive Havenly Archipelago- towards a Challenger Arena that was on all such floating landmasses to designate a place for battle!","—","The Vein Rift that held the Havenly Smilodon Lineage was a rowdy one as two Temporal Fields of Dissolution pulsed with radiance at this moment!","The Challenger for the Temporal Field with Extremity Blue had entered after the purposeful delay, with time passing as nobody came out from any Temporal Field.","That is until...","SAA!","Flickers of light erupted from a certain Temporal Field as two auras were spat out!","The Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity Smilodon known as Zaman innumerable wounds stretching across his body, and the visage of Extremity Blue...was utterly gory as half of her body was missing!","Flesh, brain matter, and skeletal structure were wiggling and trying to reform, the scene being utterly shocking for a Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity who held something as unique as Hyperversal Haki of Extremity.","And yet...","[Haha!]","She laughed gloriously.","[8,699 Units of Havenly Aurora? What is this? How do I use it? Hmm?]","She spoke shocking words as Zaman turned his head towards the cold and apathetic Lord Commander Smilodon and bowed down respectfully before he turned into a flicker of light back into the obsidian mist!","But the words of Extremity Blue showed she had actually won as how exactly had she pulled it off?","As her musculature wriggled and tried to reform, the Lord Commander Smilodon gazed at her coldly while voicing out.","[You have come out victorious and gained entry into the Supernal Haven of Dissolution. Be mindful of your actions within as if you offend those you should not, your life is not guaranteed.]","...!","The same words that were said to Noah.","The same words applied to even powerful Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities!","Extremity Blue's laugh faded at such words as it seemed like clarity returned to her, with her body beginning to float towards the obsidian mist in the distance as outside the Vein Rift, many beings began to clamor.","The first Hyperversal Extremity to gain entry into the unknown lands.","And she seemed to be on a hunt as many wondered what would become of the destiny of the First Underdweller to have entered the unknown lands within the Extremity Vein!","Nobody stopped her anymore as with a flicker of light, Extremity Blue disappeared into the obsidian mist.","What many didn't know was just how precious of a gain she had gotten from defeating a Tier 3 Hyperscopic Extremity Havenly Beasts.","8,699 Units of Havenly Aurora!","Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity Celestial Creatures were immeasurably more powerful than one at the Apex Aeonic Lifeform level that Noah had defeated.","Their means of obtaining Units of Heavenly Radiance were many as the number Extremity Blue had attained was that much greater!","Within moments, space warped around her as she very soon found herself in a grand space filled with the dense authority of Dissolution.","Streams of authority of other Havens also flowed serenely as massive floating islands with their edges flowing with authority in the form of waterfalls could be seen!","The moment Extremity Blue arrived, many wills focused on her.","Her eyes were sour as she sensed over a dozen Hyperversal Extremities locking onto her, with her eyes being drawn over to the floating island directly ahead of her that held Smilodons.","She gazed at its peak with the phenomenon of a spinning singularity washing down a treasured light, as well as the auras of circular bubbles holding treasures of Extremity!","She began to float towards it with interest as her aura spread out, her voice echoing out to the Smilodons on the island before.","[You all wouldn't have happened to see a cute young man pass through here before me, would you? Dark hair, fair skin like a newborn's, and confident eyes bordering on arrogance and superiority over all others. He's my weak little hubby that needs to be protected...]","She spoke with a smile towards the Earth Saber Smilodons cultivating below, their eyes opening to gaze at her vibrant aura of a Tier 3 Hyperscopic Extremity as they only blinked calmly before they went back to their business!"]},{"number":2625,"title":"Chapter 2625: Chapter 2624 Havenly Aurora! V","paragraphs":["2624 Havenly Aurora! V","They...actually ignored a Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity.","Extremity Blue was astonished at this, but she nodded soon after as she continued to feel the gazes of multiple Hyperversal Extremities on her!","Strength was king.","And the Smilodons down below knew it.","If she went on a rampage here...it was hard to say what the result would be as for now, she continued forward.","She warped to instantly appear near the dense bubbles of halos of light on the skies of the floating landmass, her authority overtaken by the abundant Aeonic Treasures of Extremity floating calmly without anyone taking them as when she reached out towards own of the more radiant halos of light...","[You have sufficient Units of Havenly Aurora to obtain the Entry Albatross of the Authority of Dissolution. Would you like to obtain it in exchange for 1,000 Units of Havenly Aurora?]","...!","Her eyes flickered with brilliance.","Entry Albatross of the Authority of Dissolution!","Something that would actually allow her to truly embark on the Concept of Dissolution that relates to the very Haven itself!","Something that made the Haven Saber Smilodon she fought nearly injure her gravely.","Her eyes flickered as her will instantly went forth, feeling the streams of authority within her reduce by 1,000 Units as the bubble of light around an entirely obsidian pulsing singularity faded as it was quickly absorbed into her body!","She closed her eyes as within a few nanoseconds...","BZZT!","A weak but profound Authority of Dissolution erupted around her body.","[Haha...]","Her eyes curved into a devilish smile as their blue radiance hungrily went on all the dazzling Halos of light next to her.","This was supposed to be the Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification that Apex Aeonic Lifeforms reigned in under the eyes of the Underdwellers of the Seven Aeonic Havens.","And yet....","There seemed to be boundless opportunities for Hyperversal Extremities!","Extremity Blue gazed at the wonders around her as more information flowed into her mind.","[You have sufficient Units of Havenly Aurora to obtain the Golden Extremity Panacea of Dissolution. Would you like to obtain it in exchange for 100 Units of Havenly Aurora?]","[You have sufficient Units of Havenly Aurora to obtain the Golden Aurora Accumulation Modus Operandi. Would you like to obtain it in exchange for 100 Units of Havenly Aurora?]","[You have sufficient Units of Havenly Aurora to obtain the Fragment of an Armament of Extremity. Would you like to obtain it in exchange for 1,000 Units of Havenly Aurora?]","Many possibilities rose before her eyes as they were things to aid one in traversing the Layers of Dissolution and even Fragments of Armaments of Extremity!","Her bright eyes shone with destiny as she instantly spent another 100 Units of Havenly Aurora to obtain the Golden Aurora Accumulation Modus Operandi, her actions revealing a shocking truth in the future to come.","Those with more power- existences who had already achieved Extremity...","would only have a larger starting point as their power would be getting a major boost once they started going through the Havenly Archipelagos and accumulated Units of Havenly Aurora!","They would further reform their power as the heights they couldn't scale before would become possible for them now.","Extremity Blue felt the fantastical Modus Operandi flow into her mind as she learned a great deal about Havenly Aurora, her smile becoming even wider as before she could do anything else, she felt rousing movements below her.","Towards the center of the floating island, she could see massive stellar black trees surrounding a circular platform meant for battle.","The auras of Smilodons could be seen all around the branches of the thick trees as they bellowed out loudly, seemingly cheering on a finished battle as an obsidian cherry-colored Smilodon with a flaming black crown overpowered another Earth Saber Smilodon!","The phenomenon drew her attention as she instantly warped over to this location, her blazing aura drawing some eyes as the voice of a Hyperversal Extremity thundered out from above the tallest tree.","[And another victory for the Challenger! Truly marvelous...any others to accept his Challenge? He should have reached over a hundred Units of Havenly Aurora now as it's enough to buy a Havenly Treasure helpful in even crossing the Boundary Layers of Dissolution!]","The focus was egging others on as it favored battles, the figure of Extremity Blue arriving here with a smile and observing everything as even more truths of these new lands unveiled themselves.","She wanted to quickly begin searching for the one known as Osmont, this being likely already having run far away from this entry location as searching for him would be a great pain!","So she thought of familiarizing herself with these new lands first as after she arrived in the massive clearing showing a grand arena below her built from obsidian crystalline material pulsing with Dissolution, she voiced out.","[Over a hundred Units of Havenly Aurora? I just spent some as I can refill them now.]","She spoke brilliantly while gazing at the Earth Saber Smilodon with a flaming crown who had just won the battle.","And the Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity Smilodon who had just been speaking...","sneered towards her as she let out a sharp reply.","[Fuck off to another Challenger Arena that has Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities waiting. Why would you want to bully an Apex Smilodon just for a hundred points, Underdweller?]","...!","A Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity spoke towards a Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity like so.","It was enough to cause Extremity Blue to flash with a deadly light as her smile became even more gorgeous and deadly.","[My oh my...the natives of this land don't seem to have an ounce of respect towards those more powerful!]","The Earth Saber Smilodons that hadn't even reached Extremity paid her no heed.","And now, this Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity even told her to fuck off!","In front of thousands of Apex Smilodons and while the auras of other Hyperversal Extremitied watching the surroundings too.","In response to her words, the Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity Smilodon yawned her reply while stretching her body.","[Respect goes both ways. If you act like a dumb bitch, I'll treat you like a dumb bitch. You just won against Brother Zaman to gain entry as you're seriously injured, and he is recuperating in his domain on this very same Havenly Smilodon Archipelago. Sister Seppia with the same power as you is also on this Archipelago, with other Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity Havenly Beasts occupying the Titanoboa Archipelagos and the Dragonfly Archipelagos nearby. If Underdwellers like you want to begin acting rowdy as soon as you arrive...well, I can only tell you to fuck around and find out.]","WAA!","The words were of utmost disrespect.","It was such a shocking reality that Extremity Blue had never faced before as when ascertaining its truth...she could only laugh!","[These new lands...are so very interesting. Alright, then can I take this Challenger Arena and see if any of the Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities you mentioned would want to battle?]","Her eyes still radiated wonder.","She could see the shocking importance of Havenly Aurora as she wanted more of it as quickly as possible!","She needed to ascertain how much she could acquire with the Golden Aurora Accumulation Modus Operandi, but it seemed like the path to obtaining Havenly Aurora quickly lay on fighting and obtaining it from others!","And yet towards her words...the paws of the Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity Smilodon waved dismissively.","[This Arena is currently taking battles for Apex Aeonic Lifeforms. Go to the Titanoboa Archipelagos or Dragonfly Archipelagos, maybe they will want to entertain you. Or just proceed deeper into this Supernal Haven of Dissolution and you'll come across Obsidian and Crimson Archipelagos where Hyperversal Extremities fighting is a norm.]","...!","Extremity Blue was once again rebuffed.","She smiled dangerously as she locked her eyes with the speaking Haven Saber Smilodon, not saying anything else before she moved away from this location!","She thought of many things as she also thought about how the current situation would soon change when more beings like her entered these lands.","If someone like the Adjudicator of Dissolution were to enter and there was nothing stopping her from acting against her...","With this thought and many more in mind, Extremity Blue passed over the skies of the Havenly Smilodon Archipelago and obtained a few more radiant halos of light before she turned into a streak of blue light that shot into the distance- heading even deeper into the Supernal Haven of Dissolution!","Back in the Havenly Smilodon Archipelago she just left, the Haven Saber Smilodon gazed towards Noah's figure on the Challenger Arena below as she sent a mental message.","[What did you do to have such a spiteful woman chasing after you, hmm?]","Noah had only shown good will as wondrously, Extremity Blue appeared right before him without knowing it was him standing before her eyes- and the Haven Saber Smilodon nor any other Smilodons paid heed to Extremity Blue!","Noah got off the Challenger Arena after battling multiple Apex Smilodons who rose to take his challenge, shaking his head towards the Haven Saber Smilodon in reply as his eyes were gazing at the halos of treasured light above.","He had attained enough Units of Havenly Aurora to acquire some things!"]},{"number":2626,"title":"Chapter 2626: Chapter 2625 Shocking the Havenly Smilodon Archipelago! I","paragraphs":["2625 Shocking the Havenly Smilodon Archipelago! I","Through his quality as an Absolute Hyperversal Inscrutable Existence, he expressed tendrils of Dissolution outwardly as his visage of Smilodon moved across space to float towards the Halos of blinding light!","Below him, the visage of the female Havenly Smilodon who had given him an introduction and even sent away Extremity Blue watched silently as a moment later, the aura of another Haven Saber Smilodon appeared beside her.","[Little Sister Laeta, why are you busying yourself with this Underdweller's business?]","The voice stemmed from a Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity stronger than Laeta, and yet she harrumphed towards him while replying.","[I'm not boring like you, Senior Brother Kyle. And anyone who can veil themselves from my eyes like he is...there has to be something special! If I hadn't seen him change right before me, I wouldn't be able to tell him apart from any other Smilodon. Imagine if such a being reached Zenith Tier 3 or even crossed the threshold beyond it...just how much fun and chaos could such a being cause? I just wanted to observe him to see if I can peel his layers of uniqueness as him utilizing the Golden Aurora Accumulation Modus Operandi for the first time will reveal a bit about his Soul and Foundation.]","...!","Laeta's pulsing could already see Noah's figure appear in front of another Golden Aurora Accumulation Modus Operandi surrounded by a halo of Havenly Authority.","Beside her, her Senior Brother shook his head indifferently as he gazed at tens of thousands of Smilodons across the Havenly Smilodon Archipelago who were currently practicing the same Golden Aurora Accumulation Modus Operandi and attracting thin streams of the Havenly Authority intermixed with the Authority of the Supernal Havens themselves as they would slowly become Units of Havenly Aurora!","He spoke dismissively when he thought about the newcomer Underdweller.","[Havenly Beasts that were born within the Supernal Havens themselves and baptized by the Havenly Authority can barely accumulate 5-10 Units of Havenly Aurora daily when they first begin. The Underdwellers who have the most minuscule traces of Havenly Authority within their existence will maybe be able to accumulate half of that if not less. Asking for any surprises from a being such as this may be expecting too much...]","He stated the harsh truth and reality as all incoming Underdwellers would come to find how harsh the conditions were in these lands unless they already had sufficient power!","The First Underdweller to arrive may as well discover first as they watched Noah perceptively.","In the skies, Noah reached the blinding halo of light holding another black and white scroll as a different message appeared before his eyes!","[You have sufficient Units of Havenly Aurora to obtain the Golden Aurora Accumulation Modus Operandi. Would you like to obtain it in exchange for 100 Units of Havenly Aurora?]","121 Units of Havenly Aurora.","This was how much he was able to obtain after taking down three Apex Aeonic Smilodons in the Challenger Arena!","All three held the 16th Boundary Layer of Dissolution as their highest, with their power being something the current Noah could easily overcome as he didn't go wild in battle...yet.","He would see how many Units of Havenly Aurora could be accumulated with the Modus Operandi before him as if his ongoing theories proved to be true...","A blinding light shone in front of him as he felt the halo of light disappear, and 100 thin streams of authority left his soul at the same time as the moment the exchange was completed- the scroll turned into a glimmer of light that vanished into Noah's head!","And this glimmer of light turned into waves of information.","[Golden Aurora Accumulation Modus Operandi]:: A unique tool granted to any being within the Supernal Havens of Extremity as it isn't just a method of operation, but a key that allows the birth and growth of a Havenly Organ that is capable of isolating and drawing in minuscule concentrations of Havenly Hyperversal Authority while also mixing it with the Authority of the Supernal Havens of Extremity the being is currently in. The circulation method of operating the Havenly Organ and growing it to be capable of accumulating even more Units of Havenly Aurora faster is as follows...","...!","A grand method of circulation showed itself as the moment that the Golden Aurora Accumulation Modus Operandi entered Noah's soul- a small minuscule Singularity was born near his heart!","The beginnings of a Havenly Organ.","As Noah read its description, he couldn't help but speculate one more as the so called Havenly Hyperversal Authority he could see above the Havenly Smilodon Archipelago and the other Archipelagos truly seemed like a form of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority!","And the mixing of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority along with the Authority of the Supernal Havens of Extremity seemed to give birth to the astounding treasures floating serenely atop these floating islands as...what would happen if Noah tried to utilize a method of accumulating Units of Havenly Aurora with his body?","With his existence that held Innate Vitalis Hyperversal Meridians that had genuine Vitalis Hyperversal Authority flowing within?!","'Let's find out...'","lightsnοvεl.cοm His soul was calm as while floating in the skies, he began to follow the Golden Aurora Accumulation Modus Operandi.","The barely formed Havenly Organ near his heart that was only a minuscule Singularity...began to spin.","Around him, barely discernible thin streams of Havenly Authority authority began to materialize and draw towards him, becoming mixed with the Authority of the Supernal Haven around before it was drawn towards the Havenly Organ within Noah's body!","And before his eyes...","[.01 Units of Havenly Aurora have been accumulated.]","A small number rose.","In the distance, the figure of the Havenly Smilodon Laeta and Hyperversal Extremity Kyle observed as the former tilted her head while the latter nodded as if it was to be expected!","[You at times expect too many things from others, Laeta-]","Hyperversal Extremity Kyle had only just begun to speak when his words stopped.","The barely visible streams of Havenly Authority and Authority of Dissolution being drawn above Noah stopped at this moment.","And Noah's body throbbed as the action of drawing in Units of Havenly Aurora through the Havenly Organ for the first time caused this organ to be formed as a part of Noah truly at this time.","And the moment this occurred, the calm and lustrous Meridians within his body came to life. His Aspects of Existence that were filled with pure and extremely powerful Vitalis Hyperversal Authority came to life!"]},{"number":2627,"title":"Chapter 2627: Chapter 2626 Shocking the Havenly Smilodon Archipelago! II","paragraphs":["2626 Shocking the Havenly Smilodon Archipelago! II","His body! His soul! His Origin! His Innate Vitalis Hyperversal Meridians!","He couldn't actively control this authority even though he had undergone the First Vitalis Awakening, but at this moment, a natural reaction occurred as the Havenly Organ that was drawing in lesser forms of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority and mixing it with the Authority of Dissolution to create Units of Havenly Aurora...it felt the shockingly Pure Vitalis Hyperversal Authority spread across Noah's body as a quintessential change occurred!","Since the Havenly Organ was drawing in minuscule streams of Havenly Authority, the Vitalis Hyperversal Authority within Noah's Aspects of Existence and Innate Vitalis Hyperversal Meridians surged and instantly flowed towards the Havenly Organ.","But the organ also needed to draw the Authority of Dissolution to ultimately form Havenly Aurora.","And at this moment, it had begun to receive extremely pure Havenly Authority from the body it was in. It needed extremely pure Authority of Dissolution to balance this out and begin forming Units of Havenly Aurora as if it could not obtain such pure authority...it would have to at the very least replace this with enough volume.","And so...","The skies above the Havenly Smilodon Archipelago buzzed.","As if his body was a conduit, tendrils of the Authority of Dissolution began to draw from nearby reality en masse as within a nanosecond- a swirling storm of Dissolution had already gathered above.","It was Dissolution, along with ant streams of authority of the other Supernal Havens of Extremity that were naturally in the surroundings!","It gathered at a shockingly high speed as even more of it continued to come from the surroundings, creating an inverted obsidian mountain of authority that had its sharpest point sinking into the visage of a single being!","...!","BOOM!","An eruption of authority erupted as large volumes of the Authority of Dissolution entered Noah's body and went straight into the Havenly Organ that had shockingly Pure Vitalis Hyperversal Authority flowing in, the organ rotating like a strained engine to very quickly fuse these authorities together!","And the product of all this was a glorious one as prompts rapidly began to flash before Noah's eyes.","[+100 Units of Havenly Aurora have been accumulated!]","[+100 Units of Havenly Aurora have been accumulated!]","[+100 Units of Havenly Aurora have been accumulated!]","Prompt after prompt.","Wave after wave!","Streams of Havenly Aurora began to form en masse as the small Havenly Organ within Noah's body began to expand- and it had to do this, otherwise it would be destroyed from the sheer volumes and purity of authority it had to fuse together!","And at this point as Noah's body released pure Vitalis Hyperversal Authority automatically into the Havenly Organ, they began to feel the natural dwindling and usage of this authority as his Innate Vitalis Hyperversal Meridians pulsed.","They bellowed out with tyranny and majesty as an instant later, what the Havenly Beasts considered Havenly Authority- the authority that was gathering above the Archipelagos...pure, transparent streams of it mixed with a gorgeous white began to be drawn towards Noah until a rising transparent white storm formed below his body.","An inverted obsidian mountain of the authority of Dissolution and other Supernal Havens of Extremity above, and a transparent white mountain storm of Havenly Authority below.","They all rushed into one being's body in a phenomenon of utter incredulity- the eyes of Hyperversal Extremities Laeta and Kyle opening their eyes wide in shock as on the massive Havenly Smilodon Archipelago- the few more powerful Hyperversal Extremities began to rouse...along with the wills of Extremities from the far away Titanoboa and Dragonfly Archipelagos!","All of these eyes and Wills were directed to a single existence.","An existence that continued to experience rows of prompts thundering over his eyes amidst this glorious show of Quintessence!","[+200 Units of Havenly Aurora have been accumulated!]","lightsΝοvεl ?οm [+500 Units of Havenly Aurora have been accumulated!]","[+1,000 Units of Havenly Aurora have been accumulated!]","Even greater volumes of authority were being mixed in as Havenly Aurora was produced, with the process being so glorious and violent that the Havenly Organ began to creak and fracture no matter how big it was growing to accommodate the rapid rate of Accumulation!","[The Golden Havenly Organ is being put under a great strain!]","[To prevent its apocalypse, the rate of Accumulation is being reduced.]","[+800 Units of Havenly Aurora have been accumulated!]","[+500 Units of Havenly Aurora have been...]","[+100 Units of Havenly Aurora have been...]","The rapid churning and spinning of the Havenly Organ slowly and reduced.","The overactive Vitalis Hyperversal Authority within Noah's Aspects of Existence began to calm down as the mountains of authority outside of his body slowly became less intense!","In his body, the Havenly Organ had fractures extending all over it due to the immense level of purity of the authority it had to mix together, its spinning becoming ever so minuscule as a few final prompts flashed before Noah.","[A total of 10,000 Units of Havenly Aurora have been accumulated as the threshold of Accumulation for the Golden Havenly Organ has been reached.]","[Once the Golden Havenly Organ has been repaired and returned to its prime state within 24 Hours, a similar or higher quantity of Units of Havenly Aurora can be collected again.]","[An Obsidian or Crimson Havenly Organ will be capable of bearing the load of authority at much greater levels.]","[For the next 24 Hours, the Golden Havenly Organ will passively accumulate 1 Unit of Havenly Aurora per minute until it is fully repaired.]","...!","Clear guidelines were set as Noah almost broke a recently formed Havenly Organ.","But the results were stupendous as ridiculously, 10,000 Units of Havenly Aurora were gained within a few seconds!","And he could only attain such a number again or even greater after a day passed as his path...was bound to be filled with glory.","He opened his eyes as his surroundings returned to a level of calm, the stormy mountain of the authority of Supernal Havens of Extremity and Havenly Hyperversal Authority dispersing.","But in the surroundings...things were not as calm as they were before as heavy and powerful auras now filled the surroundings.","The visage of Extremity Laeta and Kyle floated right before Noah along with two other Haven Saber Smilodon- one of them being the one who had faced Extremity Blue in the Temporal Field!","On the right side, four massive Titanoboas floated majestically as they pulsed with Hyperversal Extremity Authority, while on the left side- four Extremity Dragonflies looked at Noah as their eyes shone with a profound light!","Stark silence descended in the surroundings as in such an environment...the visage of Laeta responded quickly as her voice thundered out.","[The Havenly Smilodon Lineage will take him into our folds.]","...!"]},{"number":2628,"title":"Chapter 2628: Chapter 2627 Grasping Dissolution!","paragraphs":["2627 Grasping Dissolution!","Noah's soul radiated brightness as around him, a Haven Saber Smilodon proclaimed that he would be taken into the gold of their lineage.","And not a moment later, a Titanoboa pulsing with back flames snorted while booming out.","[Take him on? Why don't you give that option to him? Have him choose which Lineage to join after knowing all the facts.]","On the left, yet another voice followed out thereafter as an austere Tier 3 Hyperversal Dragonfly reiterated calmly.","[And which facts will he receive that won't contain a bias towards one side or against another?]","...!","Hyperversal Extremities spoke out one after another as Noah was gazed at as something they had to enter into their folds.","And of course, they had to after witnessing what just occurred with Havenly Authority and the Authority of the Supernal Havens of Extremity!","As Hyperversal Extremities, they knew how critical Havenly Authority was.","For it to be drawn towards this existence before them at a rate that only powerful Hyperversal Extremities who were lucky enough to find an Obsidian or Crimson Aurora Accumulation Modus Operandi would be able to compare to...it meant this being had a shocking inclination to Havenly Authority!","To the extent they even wanted to ask him some questions about it.","Extremity Laeta was one of the weakest Hyperversal Extremities here being at Tier 1, and yet she harrumphed and spoke freely.","[Hmph, just look at him. Which part of him looks like a Titanoboa or Dragonfly? From where I stand, he is already a Smilodon you all are trying to poach from this Archipelago!]","WAA!","Dazzling words that caused the Hyperversal Extremities to look at each other ironically were uttered out.","They couldn't deny her words even though they knew this being before them was an Underdweller!","But before the environment became even more hectic...","[You all know what it was like when you first gained trenches of Havenly Aurora. Why don't we discuss amongst ourselves and let this young friend here explore the Havenly Treasures atop this Archipelago and the Titanoboa and Dragonfly Archipelagos as well? Decisions can be made after he is more familiar with everything.]","A deep voice of authority announced from an utterly massive Titanoboa that seemed to be at the very precipice of Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity...Zenith just barely out of his grasp.","When others heard it, they remained silent with affirmation as they acknowledged Noah and dispersed.","Laeta was the only one that remained as she stared at Noah with beastial eyes before she stretched and floated back into the depths of the Havenly Smilodon Archipelago.","[Just remember who was the one showing you the ropes when you first arrived...]","Her words penetrated Noah's ears as his eyes emanated brightness.","They calculated the many possibilities for the future as they ultimately landed on the Halos of light floating above this Archipelago.","There were some that were absolutely crucial to obtain as his Will spread out to learn of all the Havenly Treasures here!","And every time his will passed over them, he received a message right after.","[You have sufficient Units of Havenly Aurora to obtain the Flaming Dissolution Circulation Modus Operandi. Would you like to obtain it in exchange for 1,000 Units of Havenly Aurora?]","[You have sufficient Units of Havenly Aurora to obtain the Lightning Dissolution Circulation Modus Operandi. Would you like to obtain it in exchange for 1,000 Units of Havenly Aurora?]","Methodologies on how to circulate authority in one's Aspects of Existence that caused the fantastical effects of flames of Dissolution or obsidian lightning of Dissolution pulsing around the bodies of the Havenly Beasts.","But with his Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi, Noah didn't need any of these as he could at most purchase them as reference materials!","His eyes and will continued to wave outwards.","[You have sufficient Units of Havenly Aurora to obtain the Fragment of an Armament of Extremity. Would you like to obtain it in exchange for 1,000 Units of Havenly Aurora?]","[You have sufficient Units of Havenly Aurora to obtain the Entry Albatross of Armament of Extremity. Would you like to obtain it in exchange for 1,000 Units of Havenly Aurora?]","[You have sufficient Units of Havenly Aurora to obtain the Entry Albatross of the Authority of Dissolution. Would you like to obtain it in exchange for 1,000 Units of Havenly Aurora?]","[You have sufficient Units of Havenly Aurora to obtain the Golden Extremity Panacea of Dissolution. Would you like to obtain it in exchange for 100 Units of Havenly Aurora?]","...!","The things his soul sought for showed themselves.","Something as fantastical as a Fragment of an Armament of Extremity...and an Entry Albatross that gave him access to truly step on Dissolution!","There was even a Golden Extremity Panacea of Dissolution to aid one across the Boundary Layers of Dissolution!","His will was sent out.","And soon after, two Halos popped and faded away as a blinding singularity shot into Noah's head from the distance, while an obsidian flower decorated with stellar black gems that seemed to contain whole realities within it landed on his hands.","The first one was an Entry Albatross of the Authority of Dissolution as the unfinished runic ecriture of [DISSOLUTION] in his soul lit up gorgeous while the rest of the letters began to be completed!","And when the [N] in Dissolution fully materialized...","The heavy concentration of Dissolution in the surroundings seethed again.","Noah sucked the potent Authority of Dissolution nearby as if he was a black hole, a glorious prompt unfolding before him soon after.","[The 1st Havenly Boundary Layer of Dissolution has been attained.]","[An authority connecting to the very Vitalis Havens of Extremity!]","[The Authority of Dissolution has been subtly altered by Quintessence.]","[The Authority of Dissolution is termed a Havenly Boundary due to its nature as elevating it is of utmost difficulty, but attaining Hyperversal Extremity of Dissolution or any Havenly Boundary will allow one to move unhindered within said Haven.]","Waves of information thundered down as yet another glorious concept was anchored to his soul.","The more unique thing in all of this...was the fact that he held Quintessence.","lightsΝοvel.cοm Quintessence had ever so subtly changed Dissolution as in addition to this...","Quintessence deemed that all of Noah's Boundaries would be taken to the 9th Boundary Layer automatically the moment they were expanded towards Extremity!","And so, even though it was stated that proceeding across the Layers of Dissolution was so very difficult...","[The 2nd Havenly Boundary Layer of Dissolution has been attained.]","[The 3rd Havenly Boundary Layer of Dissolution has been attained.]","...!"]},{"number":2629,"title":"Chapter 2629: Chapter 2628 A Weapon Against Hyperversal Extremities!","paragraphs":["2628 A Weapon Against Hyperversal Extremities!","[The First Havenly Boundary Layer of Dissolution]:: While moving under any Vitalis Havens of Extremity, all of your statistical values are increased by 25%. When moving outside the scope of all Vitalis Havens of Extremity, all of your statistical values are increased by 50%.","The Boundary Layers of Dissolution were unique ones as they reveal some truly critical information on these types of Boundaries.","Noah received its information and continued forward as he put his standing as an Absolute Hyperversal Inscrutable Existence to use and reduced any ridiculous flashiness around him- with him steadily controlling the waves of Dissolution coming inside his existence as all it was spread out across his soul, all the way back to his Main Body!","His Main Body.","It remained in the constantly changing and expanding Infinite Hyperversal Haven that had just swallowed up the Noblesse Planes of Existence that were brought to heel under Henry, Aurelia, Orion, and his other Vassals.","While his Reified Wealdian Source of Indefatigable had entered the Supernal Haven of Dissolution, his Main Body was moving in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven to do something just as critical!","—","Pulses of Dissolution went on on the fair hands of his Main Body in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, his body being warped across great distances to arrive in the ever-expanding Prana Aletheian Haven at this moment.","Many changes were being quantified in regards to him, as well as all the wonders that the 15th and 16th Boundary Layers of his most important Boundaries brought forth.","Manadynamics was particularly domineering as its 16th Boundary Layer caused his resource regeneration rate to become utterly obscene!","[The Sixteenth Boundary Layer of Manadynamics]:: As you approach Extremity, understanding the workings of Mana becomes utterly crucial as your Reality Passages, Quintessential Breath of Extremity, Heart, Foundation, and All Aspects of Your Existence now flow in harmony to grant you the most pristine flow of energy. You can now regenerate 100% of all Quintessential Hyperversal Values in 60 Seconds, with any abilities requiring the usage of Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Values having 98% of their cost initially paid for by your Quintessential Hyperversal Mana Values. Be prepared, for you know what the endgame is...","A glorious description that quantified part of his wonders.","And the last sentence of this description was addressed to Noah by the very concept of Manadynamics itself!","For him to be prepared as he knew what the endgame was.","'The endgame...' Noah smiled as he felt his endless reserves of Mana and what this description would be alluding to.","He then gazed around as he arrived at his target location, his eyes feasting at the sight of Seven Quintessential Undead Thanatos Vassals who seemed to have at their base- the Seven Chthonian Sinners of Thanatos!","Currently, two existences were bickering while floating on a verdant crystalline landmass full of life- so absorbed that they barely noticed Noah approaching with his closed off aura.","One had golden hair flowing freely, his fair face showing annoyance at this time as his lab coat fluttered in the wind.","\"The balance towards death has already been tilted too much by you. I say the next phase is to fuse parts of or all of an Ender of Extremity into these 7 Champions of Thanatos. That may complete them to an even greater state...\"","Dr. Hall spoke fearlessly as the one standing beside him was a dazzling Haven Lich Ra'Zan who currently adorned an obsidian black lab coat, his skull radiating deadly green flames as he also spoke with annoyance!","[I've kept a delicate balance of life and death so far with the inclusion of a Prana Aletheian Vessel in their Souls, completing them would require a deathly counterpart...maybe the corpse of a Hyperversal Extremity, or-]","In the midst of his words, the Haven Lich stopped and turned around as his flaming sockets came to land on Noah.","[Ah...Master. I apologize for not noticing your arrival sooner. How may this humble skeleton be of assistance?]","The Haven Lich Ra'Zan bowed down as beside him, Dr. Hall did the same while calling out towards Noah!","\"At ease,\" Noah held a smile as he appreciated the massive Champions of Thanatos these two beings before him had been working on, having the Quintessential Absolute Thanatos Dynamis of Extremity at their core as with his rising strength, they had evolved to become even grander as well.","\"I'm here for another project today. You'll be working with the Wealdian Council of Extremity to come up with...a virus, a plaque, a disease...any form of something that will be capable of infecting a Hyperversal Extremity along with their Recorded Histories in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity that will ultimately lead to their demise.\"","lightsnοvεl.cοm WAA!","Shocking words emanated from him from behind, the Wealdian Sources of Vitalistic, Thanatos, Aletheian, and Lotra appeared grandly- the only ones not joining being Indefatigable and Oraculum as they went about their own business!","Four of the 6 Council Members of the Wealdian Council of Extremity.","They arrived here as Noah was looking for a way to combat Hyperversal Extremities that were hunting him down!","The barrier between those who had attained Extremity and those who hadn't was absolute.","Billions of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms could group up against a single Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity, and they still wouldn't be able to kill such a being!","The line of demarcation between Extremity was just that vast.","Noah would also not be able to threaten an Extremity for the next few days or even possibly weeks as when he gazed at the possible Unrecorded Histories to come through Oraculum, he saw no signs of Extremity in the short term!","Yet he was being chased now.","But even if he could not fight against Extremities in a straightforward manner, he saw a possibility of fighting them in an underhanded manner!","At the core of this possible plan was something he couldn't readily manipulate yet.","Yet a change that had occurred in the last few minutes had triggered the opportunities for Noah as he gathered the different parts of his Soul as well as entities like Dr. Hall and the Haven Lich to design a virus!","He would bring any other worthy Vassals into this project if need be, but he already gave this project of enacting a virus capable of infecting Hyperversal Extremities a time limit of a day!","The key to this 'virus' he was imagining lay in Vitalis Hyperversal Authority.","Something Hyperversal Authorities desperately sought for. Something utilized in the formation of Units of Havenly Aurora!","He already theorized that due to its abundance and more open entry in the Supernal Havens of Extremity, there were likely Hyperversal Extremities that had undergone the First Vitalis Awakening if not even grander opportunities within the Supernal Havens of Extremity.","But among the Underdwellers, this number should be extremely few in ratio to the vast numbers of Hyperversal Extremities out there.","His enemies- beings like Extremity Blue, had not yet undergone any sort of Awakening.","Such a being would be extremely perceptive to a virus or poison carried by Vitalis Hyperversal Authority as their very souls sought for this authority.","And when using the Golden Aurora Accumulation Modus Operandi...this authority would be attracted into one's soul along with the authority of the Supernal Haven they were in!","Herein lay Noah's access.","Herein lay the possibilities!"]},{"number":2630,"title":"Chapter 2630: Chapter 2629 Eons of Change! I","paragraphs":["2629 Eons of Change! I","The goal was clear.","The Wealdian Council of Extremity was convened!","The Haven Lich Ra'Zan adopted an expression of extreme happiness as the Thanatos Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity buzzed around with glory.","[We can already alter the very Records of those who have perished through Thanatos...we just have to apply this to living when creating whatever Master is envisioning! Thereafter...Ka Ka Ka!]","Heavy cackling reverberated out as a flood of authority bloomed.","Noah smiled while waving his hands and causing the concentration of authority in the surroundings to rise to alarming levels, his voice ringing out...","\"The crucial thing to grasp in all this is Vitalis Hyperversal Authority, and how it can be weaponized...\"","The project was led by his main body as along with the Wealdian Council of Extremity, Dr. Hall, and the Haven Lich Ra'Zan...Noah sought a weapon against Extremities before he grasped any concept even close to it!","—","Within the Nether Haven of Dissolution.","The number of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms and Hyperversal Extremities had grown exponentially since the appearance of the Vein Rifts and the shocking changes all throughout the Seven Aeonic Havens.","But the center point remained as countless beings converged here!","Those of the Seven Clans.","Those of the Major Inheritances.","They all made their way over as they could feel...that the Culmination Step of the Last Extremity Sanctification was going to be one that made them experience the changing of eons.","The changing of the very nature and structure of the Seven Havens as after this, it would not be the same!","And at this moment...","HOONG!","A blaring horn reverberated out as if it were announcing the arrival of grand existences, with space twisting a violet light permeated across innumerable light years!","And soon after, a massive vessel the size of a Major Plane of Existence appeared as it looked like an inverted pyramid, its sharp end pulsing with tendrils of violet light as its structure seemed to be forged from the hardest Aeonic Metal.","It was a vessel known as the Courier of Senatus.","It was rarely utilized, but when it was...it represented the power of the Senatus of Extremity making a move!","The Senatus of Extremity that held existences standing above allegiances, Clans, or Inheritances!","The governing body of the Seven Aeonic Havens of Extremity.","At the top of the Courier of Senatus, the presence of a few billion existences could be felt as at the very forefront, the auras of at least one hundred thousand Hyperversal Extremities could be felt.","One hundred thousand!","The vast majority were of the Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity level as only a few thousand were of Tier 3, but the sheer numbers were enough to give one a glimpse of the power accumulated within the Senatus of Extremity over the eons.","The Millions of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms who had survived since the First Extremity Sanctification to now.","Many had died over the years as they defended their borders against Vacuous Malignancies, but many more lived as the power expressed on the Courier of Senatus...was not every single Apex Aeonic Lifeform and Hyperversal Extremities under their banner.","This number was what the Senatus deemed sufficient to explore and take the reins of the occurring changes they had known were coming, but it was hard to say whether they knew just how drastic the changes were!","If groups like the Curagulus of Extremity could learn the words [As above, so below], what about the Senatus of Extremity? Just to what extent did they know or have any control over what was currently unfolding?","Atop the Courier of Senatus.","The few billion Apex Aeonic Lifeforms and One hundred thousand Hyperversal Extremities were all adorned in radiant violet robes inlaid with golden lines- the symbol of the inverted pyramid present on the left side of all robes.","For the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, the inverted pyramid on the robes held an ecriture of [0].","Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities adorned robes with an ecriture of [I], with Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities holding an ecriture of [II] on their violet robes and so forth!","At the very forefront of the Courier of Senatus, past the lines of tens of thousands of Hyperversal Extremities, there were a few that stood at the very forefront and stared at the far away Vein Rifts.","Their bodies gave off a stifling pressure of immensity as these beings...had exceeded the Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity stage.","They had to at the very least be Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities!","And yet the violet robes they adorned...did not have any markings on their etched pyramids.","There were 9 of such beings as a golden-haired man in the middle gazed out into the Vein Rifts while speaking calmly.","[What has been learnt so far?]","lightsnοvεl.cοm His question was laid out in the open, but the voice of a Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity behind him emanated out serenely.","[The contribution goes to the Avernus Clan for this information as one of theirs has already entered. But the theory of entirely separate Havens within the Extremity Vein has been confirmed, with the first things that one can come across being things like Entry Albatross of the Authority of Dissolution- capable of being obtained for a cost.]","[Oh?]","The words of the serene voice raised a few brows as a tan woman on the right side of the 9 existences exceeding Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity spoke out sharply!","[The Treasures of Extremity that have been appearing in the Extremity Step of the previous Havens are freely available at the Culmination Step here?]","...!","Things like the Entry Albatross of the Authority of different Havens were obtained by them before in the previous processes of Extremity Sanctification.","Otherwise, how would beings like the Adjudicator of Dissolution wield the Authority of Dissolution? Or the other 6 Adjudicators of their own Havens wield the authority of the Land they were supposed to oversee?","The words of these existences revealed many things the Courier of Senatus approached closer and closer, some clustered Inheritances moving away as many stared towards them with a combination of calm and fear.","This was how prominent and assertive they were across the Seven Aeonic Havens!"]},{"number":2631,"title":"Chapter 2631: Chapter 2630 Eons of Change! II","paragraphs":["2630 Eons of Change! II","When the massive Courier of Senatus neared close to the Vein Rifts ahead of them, the figure of the golden-haired man flashed forward as he only took a few steps to instantly appear past the transparent barrier of a Vein Rift that held three Tier 3 Havenly Siren Beasts and their Legions behind them!","The three Havenly Beasts became stern at the appearance of this existence before them, their fishlike lower bodies smashing their tails down as their gorgeous humanoid upper bodies veered away- the Legions behind them splitting left and right as they made a path.","...!","It was a shocking phenomenon observed by others as this was the first time that the phrase [You may gain passage so long as you are victorious] was not repeated when an existence approached!","Instead...","[The stage of power you have attained grants you free entry.]","lightsΝοvεl ?οm ...!","The sonorous voice of the Havenly Siren echoed out with glory.","Beings that had exceeded Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity did not need to prove themselves.","The stage of power they had achieved was enough of a deal of approval in itself!","The gaze of the golden-haired man was placid at this development as he waved his hands behind him.","And an instant later, tens of Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities surged forward and appeared behind him, seemingly ready to traverse with him into the misty fog in the distance!","Their appearance caused the expressions of the Tier 3 Havenly Sirens to turn cold as before they could say anything...","[How many?]","WAA!","He didn't ask whether they would allow it or not.","His question was so tyrannical that he already made it known that he would be coming with those behind him, and he simply asked for the limit on the number!","[...]","The gazes of the Havenly Sirens were sharp as the Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity at the very forefront spoke out for all to hear.","[An existence exceeding Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity may at most take 100 other Existences to enter with him. That is the extent their authority can cover.]","...!","The tyranny of Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities was seemingly accounted for as for them, many rules were bent!","The golden-haired personage at the very forefront nodded as he began stepping forward, 100 Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities following his path as very quickly, they disappeared into the obsidian mist as they would find themselves near the Havenly Siren Archipelagos!","Outside of the Vein Rifts, others were shocked at the new development as on the Courier of Senatus, the tan woman whose skin shone with a caramel stellar luster smiled as she also began to float towards a Vein Rift.","[Esteemed Thadeus has gone ahead as the rest of you must follow. For those who have to fight for entry...defeat is not an option!]","Her words were directed to the masses of Existences atop the Courier of Senatus, her figure stepping into a Vein Rift and coming across the same treatment as she also waved her hands to select a chosen 100 Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities that disappeared along with her into the obsidian mist!","The myriad of Inheritances and Clans watched this scene playing out with brilliant eyes as at this moment, all Vein Rifts had multiple beings seeking entry.","One of the more quiet ones held a single Temporal Field of Dissolution that pulsed at this moment, the visage of a massive Titanoboa and the Adjudicator of Dissolution stepping out of it!","The veil on the Adjudicator of Dissolution remained calm as not a shred of evidence of battle could be seen on her, with the massive Titanoboa only nodding slightly towards the Lord Commander Smilodon as even though its massive obsidian scales were just as pristine, one could sense the aura around it being turbid and unstable.","The Adjudicator of Dissolution gazed around with her Will, observing the recent developments as after a few seconds, her figure disappeared into the obsidian mist ahead!","She had made her preparations already as her main body delved into the Supernal Havens of Extremity, her Hyperversal Extremity Clone would remain in the Haven she was leaving as her role...had never ended.","—","Within the Supernal Haven of Dissolution.","In the Havenly Smilodon Archipelago.","[How does a Havenly Boundary feel compared to the concepts you've expanded before?]","The voice of the Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity Laeta rang out as Noah opened his eyes and gazed at the genuine authority of Dissolution around his body.","It had achieved the 9th Boundary Layer through Quintessence as now...his visage of Alexander would place it in his Meridians for it to enjoy the ridiculous boon of matching the highest boundary layer that Noah had achieved!","As he felt how pronounced and different it was compared to other Concepts of Extremity, his reply to Extremity Laeta was mild.","\"It's so so...\"","[It's so so...hmph, come. They allowed me to be the one to tell you more about the Supernal Havens of Extremity and what a being like you fits into all this before you make a decision on where to go.]","As she spoke, Hyperversal Extremity Authority erupted around to encircle their figures- both of them being taken to the depths of the Havenly Smilodon Archipelago!","Not too far from the Archipelago, in front of an endlessly massive obsidian misty wall...the figure of the Adjudicator of Dissolution just so happened to emerge at this time as the auras of many turned towards her- Noah's will also only gazing briefly before he arrived at the depths of the Havenly Smilodon Archipelago.","[Mmm, a Zenith...the big dogs are beginning to come in it seems.]","Laeta spoke with a smile as they went past groves of ancient trees and passed through a veiled barrier, the reality around them changing as they seemed to have entered the depths of the Archipelago!","The massive trees disappeared around them as they appeared in a stellar enclosed domain shining with obsidian Singularities like stars all around, with a huge cylindrical architecture made of obsidian crystals pulsing with Dissolution floating at the very center.","On this massive structure, the auras of the Hyperversal Extremities within the Havenly Smilodon Archipelago could be felt as the figures of Laeta and Noah entered one of the many floors of this grand building- Noah observing pools of golden liquified treasure light on the four ends of this floor as in the center, a long rectangular table holding a dense cluster of Aeonic Treasures of Extremity in the form of ecstatic fruits and herbs overflowed.","Thrones were laid out around this grand table as the feline figure of Laeta began to change at this moment, her visage turning curvaceous and humanoid as a black dress came to drape over her.","Dazzling inky black hair flowed to her shoulders and endlessly black pupils smiled towards Noah as she went to sit on one of the thrones around the grand table.","[Even a Zenith's will can't enter in here. Come, be comfortable.]","At her words, Noah's figure also changed to become humanoid, though his face carried distinct changes as he seemed like a sharp genius of some faction!","Laeta pursed her lips at this as she reached out to grab grapes pulsing with tendrils of Dissolution around them.","[Not your original devilishly handsome face huh...too bad. Have a seat, and let me tell you about the Supernal Havens of Extremity.]","WAA!","Her dark eyes radiated an enticing majesty as she plucked the grapes before her, Noah sitting on an opposing throne naturally as he gazed at this Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity who continued with a smile.","[First, one of the crucial points every Underdweller needs to quickly grasp is that in these Supernal Havens of Extremity, Havenly Aurora is everything.]","...!","Havenly Aurora was everything. Vitalis Hyperversal Authority mixed with the Authorities of the Supernal Havens was everything!","[Units of Havenly Aurora are a currency and a commodity- with the Naturally Formed Havenly Treasures you've seen in this Golden Havenly Archipelago...","being only the tip of the iceberg. In Obsidian and Crimson Havenly Archipelagos, there are things that individuals cannot acquire even if they accumulate Havenly Aurora for their whole lifetime- Hyperversal Havenly Treasures costing millions and Billions of Units of Havenly Aurora to acquire!]","WAA!","[There are Havenly Archipelagos one cannot even near unless they have a backing. Unless they are a part of the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages. And herein lies your conundrum...my dear Underdweller Anomaly.]","...!"]},{"number":2632,"title":"Chapter 2632: Chapter 2631 Unfathomable Depth! I","paragraphs":["2631 Unfathomable Depth! I","His conundrum.","Within the Supernal Havens of Extremity, Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages were reigning over the masses as when it came to the truly critical Havenly Treasures- one couldn't even near the Archipelagos they were in unless they held the right status!","Noah gazed at the visage of Extremity Laeta before him as he asked lightly.","\"Just to what extent do the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages hold sway in the Supernal Havens of Extremity?\"","How grand was their position?","How unshakable was their might?","Noah asked simply to grasp a bit more about the structure of these new lands, but the reply was a heavy one as Extremity Laeta smiled brightly.","[They hold sway over everything.]","...!","[Their influence has reached an unfathomable depth within these Havens as they...hold the most Havenly Aurora in their hands. And since Havenly Aurora is the most crucial thing in these Havens, they hold the most power. And this power...is centered around something forged and built by all Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages- the Havenly Vaults.]","Something enacted by the most powerful entities whose sheer influence across the Supernal Havens of Extremity was unfathomable!","As she spoke about it, Laeta's voice was calm as if all of this was simply the way of life.","When she spoke about the Havenly Vaults, her feline eyes lit up brightly as she continued with enthusiasm.","[Something you may not know yet is when one collects a great deal of the Units of Havenly Aurora, let's say beginning by exceeding 100,000...your body will start emitting a rich aura of Havenly Authority that actually acts like a beacon for others. It invites Challengers whether you like it or not. If you somehow overcome and accumulate 1,000,000 Units of Havenly Aurora for a pristine Hyperversal Extremity Treasure, even Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities will come to Challenge you no matter your stage of power as such a number is extremely enticing!]","[So at any point in time while you're working hard to collect tens of thousands or hundreds of thousands of Units of Havenly Aurora, you can be challenged and defeated as you lose everything- years worth of accumulation. This is why a single being can never truly save up millions of Units of Havenly Aurora over their lifetime as the rich aura they automatically and uncontrollably emit will only become more powerful, inviting terrifying Challengers until they lose everything. And this...was where the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages came in. They forged the Havenly Vaults as they allowed the Haven Races...to willingly transfer their Units of Havenly Aurora to be stored and kept safe as in exchange, one is given...a Havenly Note of Extremity.]","As Laeta spoke, she waved her hands to reveal a gold piece of paper.","It was rectangular in shape as it pulsed with the Authorities of multiple Supernal Havens of Extremity, Noah seeing this gold note inscribed with a myriad of runic markings as it held a runic ecriture of [I] at its very center that pulsed with the authorities of all 7 Havens!","A Havenly Note of Extremity!","Laeta waved it in front of her serenely as she continued with a smile.","[A currency. This single Havenly Note in my hand is worth 10,000 Units of Havenly Aurora as this is the method Existences use to amass large units of Havenly Aurora over the years. They store what they accumulate before it reaches alarming levels to emit a rich aura of Havenly Authority and transfer it into the Havenly Vaults run by the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages for a fee, and whenever they have accumulated enough Units of Havenly Aurora for whatever they wish to attain, they exchange all their Havenly Notes for the equivalent Units of Havenly Aurora within the Sacred Crimson Havenly Archipelagos where no Challenges are accepted.]","...!","[That's how the Havenly Vaults came to be as under the control of the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages, they have amassed Billions of Units of Havenly Aurora- charging fees for all who use their services to store and keep their Units of Havenly Aurora and even Havenly Notes safe before they can be utilized. The fees of Units of Havenly Aurora they rack up alone on a daily basis are more than a lifetime's work that hundreds or thousands of Extremities can accomplish as those in the upper echelons of the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages are the wealthiest of Existences. And the wealthiest...are naturally the most powerful as they can access the most glorious Hyperversal Havenly Treasures!]","Noah's eyes radiated brightness as this being before him spoke, with the things she currently said making Noah think of these Havenly Vaults she was mentioning as some form of a banking system utilized by the upper echelons of power in the Supernal Havens of Extremity.","He even scrutinized the paper currency that seemed to be forged airtight and with profound authority as on the four corners of the Havenly Note of Extremity that Laeta had pulled out, Noah saw four symbols that should represent the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages.","It was a fantastical system as at the crux of it though...lay the question of how.","A question that Noah raised to the Extremity before him.","\"These Havenly Vaults of Extremity that the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages enacted...what exactly are they? Isn't the transferring of Units of Havenly Aurora done person to person?\"","When an existence began exceeding tens of thousands of Units of Havenly Aurora, an uncontrollable scent of Havenly Authority emitted from them that would invite Challenges!","How did the Havenly Vaults remain active and unbothered over the eons and allow the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages to amass the power that they now held?","When arriving at this question, Extremity Laeta became serious as she caused the Havenly Note in front of her to disappear, her words succinct as she stared at Noah closely.","[Because the ones who forged and stand guard over the Havenly Vaults...are those who have undergone Havenly Awakening.]","...!","[For them, an immense authority has been grasped as unlike all of us, the scent of Havenly Authority is able to be controlled and even hidden!]"]},{"number":2633,"title":"Chapter 2633: Chapter 2632 Unfathomable Depth! II","paragraphs":["2632 Unfathomable Depth! II","Havenly Awakening!","The moment Noah heard this term, he affirmed that there were an untold number of beings that had undergone Vitalis Awakenings within the Supernal Havens of Extremity.","Those who had their First Vitalis Awakening were half like him, while those who had undergone their Second Vitalis Awakening were ahead of him as they could actively control Vitalis Hyperversal Authority!","And such beings were considered the most powerful as with their means, they enacted the Havenly Vaults of Extremity.","A massive system that circulated Billions of Units of Havenly Aurora, with the influence of the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages being so vast that they even controlled who could access Archipelagos that could generate the most quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Treasures.","With his unique power and the fact that he had already undergone his First Vitalis Awakening, there were many ways Noah could play things going forward as with sharp eyes, he joined Laeta in enjoying the feast before him as she continued!","[Those who have undergone Havenly Awakening are rare, but they have increased in number over the years as the privilege granted to them is an indescribable one. But don't you worry about them, they're too far from our grasp.]","Her dark eyes let out an enticing light as she stopped eating the grapes pulsing with Dissolution and focused her feline eyes on him entirely, as if she had arrived at the most crucial part.","[Now, your choice to make is which of the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages to join...but at the same time, it's not really much of a choice. The Smilodons, Titanoboas, and Dragonflies you have come across so far...we all stem from the Hyperversal Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage. Under the Animalia Extremity Lineage, there are branches of sub-families like the Smilodons, Titanoboas, Dragonflies, Sirens, Mammoths, Saurischians, and many others. Joining any of us is joining the Animalia Extremity Lineage, with the only difference being the level of power we hold compared to others.]","The Hyperversal Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage!","After Laeta spoke about this one, she continued slowly on what the other 3 were right after.","[The other Havenly Extremity Lineages that you would have to travel far from here to come across are the Havenly Plantae Extremity Lineage, the Havenly Riboviria Extremity Lineage, and Havenly Celestia Extremity Lineage. You're an interesting Underdweller as after drawing our eyes, the Smilodons, Titanoboas, or Dragonflies can grant you a Havenly Recommendation to join any of the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages. The biggest boost I can tell you without being biased is that joining any of them...will allow you access to the Havenly Vaults of Extremity.]","A Havenly Recommendation was required to join any of the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages!",".cοm For all incoming Underdwellers- unless they showed a tremendous level of power as Hyperversal Extremities or displayed something unique like Noah, they could not freely join the Havenly Lineages.","And only by joining would one gain access to utilize the Havenly Vaults of Extremity!","[So those are the basic facts to allow you to make an informed decision. The question for you is...what will it be?]","Extremity Laeta asked with a rosy smile even though Noah's choice was already made.","He wouldn't reveal anything about his First Vitalis Awakening as he needed to collect more information and understand this other side of the Seven Havens more!","This was still just supposed to be the Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification as who knew what more surprises the future held?","The most critical thing remained his path.","The most critical thing remained his enemies!","So he gazed at the feline Extremity before him as he tapped on the glimmering table, his voice steady and filled with majesty.","\"I shall join the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage through the Smilodons.\"","WAA!","His words caused Laeta to smile brilliantly as she nodded and caused waves of Hyperversal Extremity Authority to erupt in the surroundings.","[I'll pass on the good news to the Titanoboas and Dragonflies. See if you want to obtain any other Havenly Treasures in this Golden Havenly Archipelago, or you can save up your Units of Havenly Aurora for where we have to go to in order to officially grant you a status as an existence belonging to the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage...we shall head to an Obsidian Havenly Archipelago. There, you will find Havenly Treasures that can aid you in bringing Dissolution or any of your concepts of Extremity towards the 15th, 16th, or even the 17th Boundary Layer. Along with Havenly Treasures to reinforce your Extremity Foundation or to further elevate your Apocryphal Havens and bring your Realm to an even greater level.]","...!","Fantastical words were released from her as they both rose, her curvaceous figure emanating great power as she continued with a sharp smile while walking towards him.","[You'll come to love the Smilodon Lineage. Our strongest reach the upper echelons of the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage as some even oversee Branches of the Havenly Vaults of Extremity, and you'll come to find that most Smilodons truly know how to have fun...]","As she spoke the last set of words, her hourglass figure and blessed chest were even further magnified as she came to stand beside Noah, tendrils of Hyperversal Extremity Authority rising from her.","Noah raised his brows as he asked calmly.","\"Even you?\"","[Me?] Her dark eyes were filled with a light of innocence as she blinked while letting out a laugh. [Ask me about that again when you attain Extremity. Maybe then I will entertain you...]","The Hyperversal Extremity Authority emanating from her fully wrapped around them thereafter as within an instant, their figures disappeared.","—","In the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","Noah's Main Body was calmly discussing with the Wealdian Council of Extremity along with Dr. Hall and The Haven Lich on the creation of a Virus that utilized the Vitalis Hyperversal Authority at its core, with multiple new Boundaries including Pathogenicity and Plague being expanded for this endeavor as everything was proceeding smoothly this far!","And in the midst of all of this, Noah's will was moving to do something else entirely.","Within his Main Body.","Towards the peak of his Origin where his Fourth Aletheian Haven stood...his soul focused on at as at this moment, an obsidian spark of a singularity bloomed.","An obsidian spark of Dissolution!","Amidst the Havens that were only forged with 9 Dimensions at their base, another entirely different type of Haven sought to come to fruition!"]},{"number":2634,"title":"Chapter 2634: Chapter 2633 Unfathomable Depth! III","paragraphs":["2633 Unfathomable Depth! III","Havens filled with Dreams, Prana, Avalon, Elysium, Fantasia, Niflheim, Mirror, Quantum, and Apollyon at their source were ever present in Noah's Origin.","They enacted his Aletheian Havens of Extremity that if completed up to the Ninth Aletheian Haven of Extremity...Noah would attain a profound level of Extremity!","He wouldn't be like other beings who achieved Extremity in a concept and slowly worked to then bring other concepts to Extremity.","His starting line would be multiple concepts instantly reaching Extremity at the same time as would he truly only be Tier 1 when the time came?","This was a question for the future.","For now, Noah was once more trying something marvelous as in addition to the Havens of past Dimensions, a spark of Dissolution bloomed above the Fourth Aletheian Haven!","And with it, the Havenly Boundary of Dissolution seethed and churned in Noah's Origin as it began to cycle and propagate within his Origin.","The Singularity was a starting point. Thereafter, a construct began to bloom!","[The Source of a New Haven has emerged in your Origin.]","[Due to incongruency with the Havens within the Fourth Aletheian Haven, the New Haven has begun as the basis of the Fifth Aletheian Haven of Extremity!]","Above the Fourth Aletheian Haven, a Fifth one began to form.","It was minuscule in scale compared to the other Four Havens below it, but the breadth and power it displayed was utterly unfathomable!","[The Haven of Dissolution has been born in your Origin.]","[The potential and immensity of the Haven of Dissolution vastly outstrips your prior Havens, and so does its requirement to expand, refine, and strengthen.]","On the Fifth Aletheian Haven of Extremity, Dissolution ran free and rampant as stellar obsidian Cosmos began to rise along with inky black rivers of reality, and they were proliferating quickly as the little essence gathered within Noah's Origin towards it was being used up!","But there was something Noah had at this moment that gave him confidence in being able to successfully enact and expand this new glorious Haven.","And his Reified Wealdian Source of Indefatigable was looking at it at this very moment above the Havenly Smilodon Archipelago as he was obtaining anything he might need before he set off with Laeta!","[You have sufficient Units of Havenly Aurora to obtain Epione's Golden Realm Blessing. Would you like to obtain it in exchange for 1,000 Units of Havenly Aurora?]","[Epione's Golden Realm Blessing].","A profound Havenly Treasure that actually required many Units of Havenly Aurora, but it was the mainstream and one of the more profound treasures to elevate one's Realm!","Noah knew so without even buying it yet as he had seen the Unrecorded History where he had bought such a wondrous thing through Oraculum.","The cost of 1,000 Units of Havenly Aurora was paid as the halo of light around a blinding halcyon statue of a woman could be seen.","She was adorned in a light gold robe as her eyes were forever closed, her beauty never to be seen again! This was Epione's Golden Realm Blessing as the moment Noah attained it in the Supernal Haven of Dissolution, it entered his Vaults of Quintessence that his Main Body instantly pulled it out from as within moments...","SHAA!","It appeared above the barely forming Fifth Aletheian Haven of Extremity!","[Epione's Golden Realm Blessing]:: Epione was an existence trying to scale an unknown Hyperversal Tier of Extremity when she took an action that could affect the Supernal Havens of Extremity themselves. She ultimately failed in her endeavor as her Will, Soul, Concepts, and everything that made her were assimilated into the Supernal Havens of Extremity. To this day Havenly Treasures that are geared towards the ultimate progression of Apocryphal Havens in one's Origin continue to be generated within the Supernal Havens of Extremity...","A fantastical Havenly Treasures whose description revealed a few fantastical things.","But Noah sent his will into it and activated such a wonder as a moment later, the statue cracked and radiated glorious golden light- a massive illusory figure of a woman with her eyes closed appearing above Noah's Havens, her hand waving outwards as seas of golden essence rained down only the forming Fifth Aletheian Haven of Extremity as if it was rain hitting a dry earth!","And the instant the sea of essence cascaded down, the budding Haven of Dissolution trembled as trillions of Cosmos and Realities began to emerge and proliferate.","The size and sheer magnitude of the Haven began to expand rapidly as the illusory figure of the golden woman remained, Epione's Golden Realm Blessing continuing its wonders even now!","And when the growth of the Haven of Dissolution reached a certain threshold...","BZZT!","Noah felt something within his body pulse and react.","Gradually, a devilish smile rose on his main body as he felt...his Innate Vitalis Hyperversal Meridians pulsing!","The meridians holding Vitalis Hyperversal Authority he couldn't control.","At this moment, they pulsed as from them, small streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority rose and sank into Noah's Origin- appearing above the emerging Haven of Dissolution as the obsidian light of grandeur from this Haven rose up to meet the streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority!","[A Unique Quality of the Haven of Dissolution has unveiled itself!]","The streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority and the Authority of Dissolution mixed with each other as in a wondrous turn of events...it resulted in the budding of a blinding halo of light above the Fifth Aletheian Haven of Extremity.","[The authority within the Haven of Dissolution will passively attract Vitalis Hyperversal Authority at the very peak of the Haven, the two authorities mixing naturally to birth Hyperversal Extremity Treasures!]","...!","'Haha!'","Noah had theorized it.","Oraculum had seen the Unrecorded Histories and confirmed it, and Noah proceeded with it!","He had thought that since the Supernal Haven of Dissolution was drawing and mixing with Vitalis Hyperversal Authority to make the shocking Havenly Treasures above the Archipelagos...what would happen if he enacted a similar Haven within him along with his Innate Vitalis Hyperversal Meridians?!"]},{"number":2635,"title":"Chapter 2635: Chapter 2634 Unfathomable Depth! IV","paragraphs":["2634 Unfathomable Depth! IV","The answer was a glorious one.","[The level and size of the Haven of Dissolution within the Fifth Aletheian Haven of Extremity is extremely low as the Hyperversal Extremity Treasures born will be of low tier and of limited amounts. The expansion of the Haven of Dissolution and other types of Havens similar to it will allow for more possibilities.]","[At its current stage, a single Hyperversal Extremity Treasure can be forged within 24 hours.]","It was small.","It was a scale that was miniscule even while comparing it to a single Havenly Archipelago of the countless Archipelagos within the Supernal Havens of Extremity!","But on this day, Noah had managed to replicate an action of unfathomable importance as at this time, his Innate Vitalis Hyperversal Authority pulsed with activity as small streams of it steadily flowed and mixed into a Singularity at the very top of his Fifth Aletheian Haven of Extremity, Dissolution being the other counterpart as together, they created something grand.","Noah's will pervasively gazed at all other parts of him as when his eyes came to land on his Innate Vacuous Hyperversal Meridians...he saw they were utterly still and silent.","They didn't react to any of this as Noah gazed at the Meridians with a pondering gaze, Epione's Golden Realm Blessing in his Origin still continuing as the Haven of Dissolution continued to expand silently!","As this process unfolded.","Outside of Noah's main body.","The voice of the Haven Lich Ra'Zan could be heard as it was filled with power and reverence.","[Council Member Thanatos is right...if Master was forced to undergo cycles of death because of the clash between Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authority, what if the poison veils Vacuous Hyperversal Authority in the midst of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority without causing them to clash, and during the moment that an Extremity is absorbing Havenly Authority into their Havenly Organ...they take in streams of a bomb that is yet to go off in their Havenly Organ?]","...!","Noah smiled at the words another part of him had uttered out that the Haven Lich expanded on.","He then raised his head to stare past the Prana Aletheian Haven they were in as he spoke serenely.","\"Mmm, if this can successfully be done, all that is needed thereafter is a pathogenic element that will allow the virus to spread across all of their existence- to their very Recorded History as well!\"","Utterly dreadful and deadly discussions were taking place as Noah's eyes tore across the veils of space- his will coming to cover the vastness of these lands that were constantly expanding as at this moment, within the Infinite Hyperversal Haven itself...","Noah's soul made yet another move as a massive singularity bloomed in a corner of this Haven itself.","Beautifully obsidian in color and radiating the authority of Dissolution, Noah also sought to enact a Haven of Dissolution within the Infinite Hyperversal Haven!","—","Across the folds of spacetime.","Past the broken-down walls of the Seven Aeonic Havens of Extremity, a circular Extremity Vein continued to pulse- radiating multicolored light all around as it took the eyes of many.","At this point though, the vast majority had made their way towards Dissolution.","The vast majority.","There were still some that didn't go, whether it was through a reason of weakness, strength, or any other!","Within the Haven of Elera.","A man with deeply blue eyes stood atop a fractured crimson Planar sun, his eyes pulsing with cerulean arcs of light as his dark hair flowed grandly.","Behind him, a dark-haired woman with a gorgeous figure and sleek obsidian hair that fell past her shoulders floated over as she spoke.","\"Your sister is still stabilizing her Meridians...we're sure about not going towards Dissolution? It seems like the center point of change unfolding in these Havens is occurring there.\"","The woman was a gorgeous one all around as her identity was a unique one, stemming outside of the Seven Havens not too long ago!","The man smiled while shaking his head.","\"No, Europa. If I didn't come across that, then I would have definitely rushed over. But with it...too many other possibilities open up.\"","As he spoke, his endlessly blue eyes became dim and were replaced by an immense darkness of an authority of utmost nothingness!","\"Who could have expected clusters of Vacuous Malignancies to be so deeply embedded into the Seven Havens? And for me to Dominate the dying shred of soul a Vacuous Malignancy hunted by the Senatus of Extremity...ah, with such a thing in my hands, I'll take my path elsewhere entirely. As soon as I gain full control of its body, we shall set off outside the scope of reality and time itself.\"","...!","The dominance of the dying shred of the soul of a Vacuous Malignancy!","The being standing beside Europa thought of this unimaginable fortune, however broken and shattered it was.","Since the Vacuous Malignancy was quite literally at death's door, their Records were shattered and scattered, their Concepts of Extremity broken and scorched from their existence.","But he could still feel them.","In time, he felt like he could piece them together.","When that time came, Extremity would be within grasp.","But for now, his path was crystal clear!","His head rose as he stared out at the Aurora of crimson lights all around them.","\"The Vacuous Hyperversal Domains...my destiny will continue to unfold there. Just as there are countless possibilities within the Seven Havens, there are countless more outside of it. And who knows, maybe while outside the scope of Space and time, I may actually stand a chance of catching up to Osmont. He's already made Dissolution into his playing field from the recent news...\"","His eyes returned to their bright luster as the Vacuous Hyperversal Authority faded within them.","Beside him, Europa shook her head as she clutched onto his arm and stared out into the expanse of crimson light.","\"Who knows. But you'll have to be careful, Eckert. From the memories you've obtained about these Vacuous Malignancies...their lands are steeped with even more dangers than anywhere within the Seven Havens.\"","At her words, Noah Eckert smiled with a devilish glint while letting out a laugh soon after.","\"Dangers and opportunities go hand in hand. I want to know more, Europa. I want to understand why the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains and the Vacuous Hyperversal Domains are the way they are. I want to know more about the memory that makes Vacuous Malignancies act with such urgency...I want to know more about The Ones Above Extremity!\"","...!"]},{"number":2636,"title":"Chapter 2636: Chapter 2635 All in! I","paragraphs":["2635 All in! I","One being chose their path while they stood within a corner of Elera.","Meanwhile, countless others within the Seven Havens chose their own paths as in the Haven of Dissolution, every single Vein Rift was pulsing with battle as many beings were rejected entry, while some unique and powerful ones were granted entry as they passed through!","At this moment, in a corner that had few Inheritances cautious to even approach it, a Temporal Field of Dissolution trembled as two figures came out of it.","One was an existence actually granted the title of Lord Commander- a Perennial Oak whose aura should have been at the very top of Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity!","And yet the gaze of the titanic Perennial Oak whose visage was that of a glorious stellar tree with a dominant face curved at its center point...such an entity held shock in its eyes as it looked at the man who also came out from the Temporal Field of Dissolution.","His white robe was untouched as his sword remained sheathed behind his back, his light caramel-colored skin pulsing with a stellar radiance as this being was none other than Emperor Shao!","He had faced a Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity with an earned title of Lord Commander and came out of the battle as if nothing had happened.","The gaze of the Perennial Oak was stern as it spoke out, a light flashing in front of it as a verdant scroll of light emerged and floated towards Emperor Shao.","[You have gained entry. When you delve deeper into the Supernal Havens of Dissolution, you will come across Obsidian and Crimson Havenly Archipelagos where you can utilize this- a Havenly Plantae Recommendation.]","The scroll arrived before him as Emperor Shao waved his hands and accepted it, nodding towards the Perennial Oak as a moment later, he turned into a glimmer of light that disappeared into the obsidian mist ahead!","Only at this point did the forces of Inheritances in the surroundings feel like they could breathe again as Extremities and Apex Aeonic Lifeforms surged forward to gain entry.","In another Vein Rift.","Fluctuations of the 11th Boundary Layer of Dissolution buzzed around a Havenly Siren as she was knocked back forcefully, the visage of Erikson in light crimson beach attire standing opposite to it as a cold voice rose.","[You have gained entry.]","The words were emotionless ones as on the other side, Erikson merely smiled while taking the easy win. On his person, he held enough Extremity Treasures to propel a few of his concepts across the Boundary Layers as if it were nothing- this being the product of his father and the Sima Clan!","Yet he didn't utilize them all as he only dipped his feet into the reserves of treasures to bring his Boundary of Probability to the 11th Layer.","He wanted to give himself an easier time gaining entry as hereafter...he could begin fully devouring the trenches of Extremity Treasures prepared by his Clan to quickly go towards the 17th Boundary Layer!","He wasn't the only one doing this as when he turned his head to the distance, he could see Ayame, Atlas, and a few others that were just like him!","\"Mmm, nepotism at its best...\"","He nodded with a smile as he proceeded forward, the Extremity of Foundation and a few others who had gained entry waiting for him.","Being born into the right family or Clan was also destiny and fortune.","Erikson planned to use such a fortune fully as he would never deny something freely granted to him.","He would use it to attain a power capable of true change in these vast havens where currently, he was still one of its weakest creatures.","He wouldn't have dared to dream of it before, but with the Last Extremity Sanctification proceeding this way, many Extremities would be forged in a short period of time!","Whether he would attain Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity or Tier 4 at the end of it...remained to be seen.","With a glimmer of light and innumerable thoughts, he disappeared into the obsidian mist along with multiple forces of the Sima Clan.","One after another.","Little by little.","It was a gradual process, but the vast Inheritances and Seven Clans of the Nether Havens of Extremity converged as they went all in!","All into the unfolding wonder of Dissolution...that currently acted like a gateway into a grand stage.","A stage that at this moment already had main players running rampant...but none of them knew of the monsters stepping onto this stage and about to shake things up for better or for worse!","Across Dissolution, towards the Vein Rifts where the abundant forces of Avernus were stationed and beginning to gain entry.","Chamber Master Gayacus had a solemn expression as he stood beside multiple other Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities atop a massive Titanic vessel that looked like an exclusive ship constructed out of crystals radiating waves of silent Extremity!","In front of the many Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities, a man veiled in pristine purple light stood valiantly as everything about him was veiled, his aura and power far exceeding those behind him as beside such a figure, a veiled woman also covered by a veil of purple light stood strong.","Chamber Master Gayacus had a difficult expression as he spoke around such powerhouses.","[I realize this may be presumptuous to be a topic of conversation with Sire and all of us, but we aren't making any headway with the public enemy of Avernus. This is my failure as the Chamber Master tasked with this issue. Extremity Blue lost his tracks and hasn't gotten close to finding him even though she entered the lands ahead right after him. He is just an Apex Aeonic Lifeform but...there are instances in history where beings even weaker than him eventually became grave issues for inheritances or Clans. I don't know how to proceed with this...if Sire can shed some light.]","It was difficult for him to say these words.","After all, the enemy was an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!","Beside him, a few other Chamber Masters sneered as a woman with radiant crimson hair spoke with some admonishment.","[Merely an Apex Aeonic Lifeform and you can't even-]","[Do not treat him as a mere Apex Aeonic Lifeform.]","WAA!","Before the crimson-haired Extremity could finish, the magnetic being ahead of them spoke as all those behind him stared with astonishment!"]},{"number":2637,"title":"Chapter 2637: Chapter 2636 All in! II","paragraphs":["2636 All in! II","An Apex Aeonic Lifeform truly caught the eye of their Sire!","Of the Avernus Extremity Overlord!","The being shrouded with royal purple light continued calmly.","[Amestris, tell them of your findings.]","His words were directed to the veiled woman beside him who radiated power almost in line with his, but it felt more mysterious- more obscure!","Many eyes turned towards her as this veiled existence let out a beautiful voice.","[There are very few existences that I cannot see in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity. Even those that have achieved Extremity and enacted an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity veiling then within the Aeonic Annals of Extremity...I can still find and obtain information. And yet this Noah Osmont...I can find nothing.]","...!","Beside Chamber Master Gayacus, Extremity Ariana was entirely solemn as she and the others listened.","[This leaves very few possibilities for this being as an Entity. It means that in addition to an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity, he is either being actively masked by at the very minimum a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity, or he has a type of authority very few of us understand in his grasp in addition to Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.]","WAA!","When she arrived here, many gazes changed.","Chamber Master Gayacus turned ashen as he voiced out slowly...","[You don't mean...]","[Vitalis.]","BOOM!","Vitalis Hyperversal Authority!","Something they barely understood, and yet beings of their level knew to be an intricate part of the Seven Havens!","[All of these are theories and conjectures, but with any of them- the outcome is not ideal. The Unrecorded Histories I can view are becoming murky and cloudy. With the advent of the Supernal Havens of Extremity ahead of us, eliminating any uncertainties coming for us is crucial. So yes, this enemy...do not treat them as an Apex Aeonic Lifeform. Use all means at your disposal to find him. Your mission for these Supernal Havens of Extremity...half of it will be locating and containing this threat.]","...!","[As for the one whose actions sparked all this...]","Her veiled gaze turned to go towards a corner behind the Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities standing side by side with Chamber Master Gayacus and Ariana.","Behind them...towards the row of Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities!","Her gaze was singularly on a being whose face had turned entirely ashen as if blood was no longer flowing!","[Destruction...the only reason you are still alive is because of the Hyperversal Extremity of Chaos. She has brought you one week. If the threat of Osmont isn't reigned in at that time, your soul will be used as the basis of an Extremity Soul Compass- unless you bring another Extremity to stand on your behalf as the material for it.]","Dreadful words emanated from her as a heavy silence descended!","Extremity Ariana stared back at Destruction whose face convulsed with countless emotions.","How did he arrive here from such a high stature?","For him to even be standing alongside Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities!","All of it boiled down to choices.","And at this moment, even more choices were made as a burning purple light erupted around the Avernus Extremity Overlord that enveloped him and a select number of Extremities behind him.","When this light disappeared, they were all gone.","And an instant later, they appeared before the transparent veil of a certain Vein Rift that held a Havenly Saber Smilodon Lord Commander, Titanoboas, and Dragonflies!","The same gateway that Noah took.","The Havenly Saber Smilodon gazed at them calmly as when he saw the two beings wrapped by a veil of purple light ahead of the cluster of Extremities, his voice was a calm one.","[Your standing grants you free entry.]","...!","Without a word, the Avernus Extremity Overlord and the most terrifying Seer of the Avernus Clan known as Seer Amestris floated forward!","Behind them, 200 Hyperversal Extremities followed in order as they delved into the Supernal Haven of Dissolution.","Past the obsidian mist, they very quickly appeared as they gazed at the wondrous scene of floating Havenly Archipelagos.","Seer Amestris gazed at the surroundings quickly as her gaze came to land on the Golden Havenly Smilodon Archipelago, her veiled figure pulsing with power as a shocking voice emanated soon after.","[He was there.]","...!","He couldn't be tracked in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity, yes.","But there were other methods apart from this.","One of the more straightforward ones...was to have a terrifying Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity trace his steps!","[Amestris, lead them to track down this Osmont. The rest of you...with me. The Hyperversal Extremity Treasures within these lands must be made use of. The goal is to produce as many Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Avernus Extremities as possible...otherwise we will not even be able to carve out any domains within these lands to occupy.]","The Avernus Extremity Overlord spoke in a regal tone as the forces behind them split in half, the means and goals of the leaders of Clans being unfathomable to grasp as one moved to achieve his own ideals!","—","The surroundings were becoming filled with even greater concentrations of Dissolution.","Enclosed within a circular domain of Hyperversal Extremity Authority, Noah's Reified Wealdian Source of Indefatigable was standing beside Extremity Laeta in her Smilodon form as they had already begun their venture towards an Obsidian Havenly Archipelago!","Noah continued talking with Extremity Laeta and expanded his breadth of knowledge regarding the Supernal Havens of Extremity he had just stepped into, as well as the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages and their distinctions.","But even though his Reified Source was carrying this calm demeanor, his Soul that was stretched out across many domains was churning and moving rapidly to elevate his power and pace of progression!","This was because on the Havenly Smilodon Archipelago that he had just left, he had taken a small part of his will and left it behind- simply to observe who else apart from Extremity Blue would be making their way over here.","And he was just faced with a scene of hundreds of Hyperversal Extremities- including Gayacus and Ariana that he came across in the Cult of Endless Shadows and later learned of their positions through Erikson and the Sima Clan!","He saw the Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities, as well as the veiled beings ahead of them as one held a penetrative gaze that gave him unprecedented danger- causing him to instantly release the portion of will be left behind as he calmly analyzed everything.","His enemies this time were truly not small. They moved with power and precision as they stood like a blade above his head waiting to cleave down!","He could feel his Reified Source of Oraculum urging him on.","At this very moment, within the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.","His Reified Wealdian Source of Oraculum was gazing at Unrecorded Histories of what was to come as it had always been.","While gazing at a particular Unrecorded History at this juncture, the light of Lotra began to shine within the eyes of Oraculum as he found yet another target of Plundering!"]},{"number":2638,"title":"Chapter 2638: Chapter 2637 Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor! I","paragraphs":["Noah's Reified Wealdian Source of Oraculum was a nexus of countless waves of information and ideas that constantly flowed in.","He viewed a great deal of possible futures and even Recorded Histories to learn more about the current reality and the enemies he came across, and he eventually came across Unrecorded Histories that granted him extremely beneficial knowledge!","The Unrecorded History he was gazing at this time was a particularly profound one.","{{...The process of becoming a part of the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages was a sacred one.","While utilizing the Golden Havenly Recommendation granted by Extremity Laeta, Noah was allowed to become a part of the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage by undergoing a process called Havenly Blood Ablation.","One's old lineage would be burned and vaporized as the Blood Source of the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage would be branded into their very marrows- their being forever becoming a part of the Havenly Lineages!","{With a Golden Havenly Recommendation, you will be able to undergo Havenly Blood Ablation with a Golden Havenly Animalia Blood Source. Most beings with strong wills survive it...with the results being your Lineage fully changed to become a Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage.}","As she spoke, Laeta walked with Noah across an elevated platform radiating rivers of Dissolution.","At the very peak of this platform, there was an obsidian crystalline path that led into a circular sea that was the size of a small world!","Golden Blood Source filled with minute traces of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority could be seen within this enclosed space- a heart-shaking aura releasing from this flowing blood ahead!","Enclosed areas like these could be seen stretched out across this space as the others were not as full, with the volume of Blood Source being very limited.","{The Golden Havenly Animalia Blood Source...although the gains you will make are not going to be as much as Obsidian or Crimson Havenly Animalia Blood, the processes involving those are not things the current you can afford. Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineages have to pay a minimum of 10 Havenly Notes of Extremity just for the Obsidian Havenly Animalia Blood in order to undergo their Second Bloodline Ablation.}","Her voice traveled far as the gorgeous stellar landscape of Dissolution around them shimmered, Noah's will catching the sight of a massive enclosure of Havenly Animalia Blood Source!","But this was darker. Denser. Filled with a shocking amount of possibilities and many more streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority.","But to even gain access to it, 10 Havenly Notes had to be paid!","This was equivalent to 100,000 Units of Havenly Aurora!","It was something far outside his current scope of power.","And yet when Noah gazed at it from afar...he couldn't help but form a devilish smile.","He wondered...if this current reality was a future that was playing out and being watched by his Soul in a distant past, would he be able to do something outrageous?...}}","The Unrecorded History was a unique one.","Even Noah's thoughts in this Unrecorded History were fantastical ones as truly, his future self thought the same as his past self!","His Reified Wealdian Source of Oraculum gazed at the playing Unrecorded History as in the next moment....","{Hyperversal Plundering}.","...!","BZZT!","A bejeweled illusory golden hand formed in the skies of the emerging scene.","Its target was a unique one as it domineeringly hovered over the Obsidian Havenly Animalia Blood Source that Extremity Laeta and Noah could only gaze at from a distance!","{You are attempting to Plunder and Unrecorded History!}","{The authorities involved are at a high enough Tier.}","{The target of Plundering is at a manageable Tier.}","The glorious golden hand came down as its fingers pinched.","The History of the Obsidian Havenly Animalia Blood Source trembled as moments after, the brilliant light cascaded all around as Noah's Soul Values were squeezed out along with seas of Quintessential Hyperversal Mana Values!","But the end result was a mighty one.","{You have succeeded in Plundering the Obsidian Havenly Animalia Blood Source Sea!}","A singularity of wonder emerged as a vast Obsidian Sea was transported towards his Vaults of Quintessence.","—","Around them, the concentration of the authority of Dissolution only became heavier as they passed multiple gorgeous floating Archipelagos.","Each of them were Golden Havenly Archipelagos as after a few hours of Noah getting a view of the vastness of the Supernal Havens of Dissolution, they were finally arriving at their target as ahead of them...a floating island more massive than any of the ones observed beforehand bloomed!","It was no longer the size of a plane as the light years it extended all around were enough to make it a Minor Haven.","Drizzling gorgeous black waterfalls of emerge fell from its edges and dripped down as above it, a massive singularity spinning and collecting Vitalis Hyperversal Authority while mixing it with potent Authority of Dissolution to produce even grander Havenly Treasures could be seen.","{The first Obsidian Havenly Archipelago after the clusters of Golden Havenly Archipelagos in this region. It is a center point of power as here, we can find a Branch of the Havenly Vaults of Extremity. The Obsidian Saurischian Havenly Archipelago.}","The Obsidian Saurischian Havenly Archipelago!","One couldn't see an array of vessels or guards surrounding it as there was truly no need to.","It was still one of the most protected domains because at this very moment, one could feel an overwhelming and silent aura of a Hyperversal Extremity spread out constantly around the Obsidian Havenly Archipelago!","Its might and grandeur...was not something a Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity could release.","Seeing Noah's eyes, Extremity Laeta smiled as they entered the area of effect of the spread out will and landed on the floating landmass that looked like a paradisical domain filled with an array of vegetation and tall rising structures pulsing with Dissolution.","{Oh yes, the Obsidian Saurischian Havenly Archipelago is overseen by a Havenly Saurischian Lord Commander. Their presence here is not just for the monitoring of Havenly Treasures that only those of the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages are allowed to obtain, but truly here for the Branch of the Havenly Vaults of Extremity. They are a personage that has undergone Havenly Awakening}","WAA!","The explosive words were heavy ones to hear as they arrived at a shocking location"]},{"number":2639,"title":"Chapter 2639: Chapter 2638 Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor! II","paragraphs":["Even with the dangerous words that relayed the identity of the extremely powerful being overseeing this location, Noah's heart didn't steer as he maintained his sense of calm.","Even he couldn't yet fully grasp the extent of power a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity held when Existences such as the Adjudicator of Dissolution at the Zenith Tier 3 level were already so unbelievably powerful.","Their means and power were approaching the peak of power of the Nether Havens of Extremity and the Supernal Havens of Extremity from all the information Noah had collected so far!","And yet even while stepping into a domain that had the eyes of such an entity covering everything, he didn't worry.","His confidence didn't stem from the Quintessential Absolute Oraculum Dynamis of Extremity being able to cover him- but his Innate Vacuous Hyperversal Meridians and his Innate Vitalis Hyperversal Meridians!","Their product of him becoming an Absolute Hyperversal Inscrutable Existence!","Who else had survived millions of cycles of death until their soul accepted both the Awakenings of Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authority?","The only sliver of worry Noah held came to other Existences who had undergone Vitalis Awakening.","Would he or they be able to recognize like existences?","Even this, he was only being more cautious as his eyes swept across the Obsidian Saurischian Havenly Archipelago he had arrived in.","Here, he could see many more variations of the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineages as keeping in line with the specific Lineage of the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity keeping watch in this region, there were many Saurischians here in addition to Smilodons, Titanoboas, Dragonflies, and a few other Havenly Lineages!","{Many Havenly Lineages converge in this Archipelago for business and pleasure, and we'll likely see more Underdwellers converging here as they get acclimated to the Supernal Haven of Dissolution. The more prominent ones can fight for recognition to become part of the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages or make deals with the Havenly Beasts here for what they want. Though the cost of Havenly Aurora they will have to pay will be high!}","The reality around them constantly changed as Laeta utilized her Hyperversal Extremity Authority to quickly take them through the periphery of the Havenly Archipelago as they entered its depths.","They only came to a stop in front of a massive structure built with reinforced black metals radiating Dissolution, a massive dome covering this architectural wonder as huge double doors were open with a few Havenly Beasts entering in and out constantly.","Most were at the Apex Aeonic Lifeform level as some adorned humanoid forms while others kept their beastial forms!","The building ahead of them that rose up to be as vast as a Large World held the label {Havenly Bloodline Ablation Center}.","Extremity Laeta pulled Noah into such a grand building as the moment they crossed the double doors, the reality around them changed as they entered an area that held floating 81 kiosks that looked like vibrant Singularities- the auras of 36 Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities being behind 36 of these kiosks as the other 45 were occupied by top tier Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","Some Havenly Beasts were already in front of these kiosks discussing their own matters as Laeta went towards one of the 36 kiosks occupied by a Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity with a smile.","{Little Sister Ruby, the benefits of working for the Havenly Vaults of Extremity must really be enticing for you to still be working here after all these years.}","Her figure morphed to a gorgeous humanoid form as the visage behind the kiosk she addressed was an utterly stunning woman with light crimson hair, an air of power and authority wrapping around her as her blessed chest threatened to spill out of the black robe Extremity Relic she wore!","Gorgeous freckles covered her face as she smiled with an annoyed expression while replying.","{Big Sister Laeta, are you here on business or pleasure?}","{Bah, business. Here's a Golden Havenly Recommendation for my young friend behind me.}","Laeta waved her hands to pull out a scroll of golden light that Extremity Ruby accepted, nodding and causing it to disappear in her hands as she turned towards Noah with a professional smile.","{A recommendation that grants you the right to utilize a Golden Havenly Animalia Blood Source Sea to undergo the Havenly Blood Ablation for free. If my friend here has yet to tell you, it is a process that entirely replaces your current Bloodline and replaces it with the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage. There are minimal risks associated with it but...do you wish to proceed?}","The employee of the Havenly Vaults of Extremity spoke towards Noah calmly as he nodded.","A process that would erase his current Lineage? Noah smiled at such a thought.","'Would Quintessence truly allow for it to be burned out of existence?'","A grand question whose answer would be revealed soon enough!","With Noah's agreement, a black portal soon formed beside the floating kiosk they were standing in front of, Extremity Ruby pointing towards it and voicing out with a smile.","{Name?}","Noah raised his brows at this as the Extremity before him continued calmly.","{Your identity is entirely protected and assured by the authority of the Havenly Vaults of Extremity. Even a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity cannot forcefully attain your information without your permission. You can also use a pseudonym you wish to go by instead.}","Her words were serene as Noah's bright eyes smiled while replying.","\"A pseudonym it is then. Indefatigable.\"","WAA!","Indefatigable!","The word raised the brows of the two Extremities here as Laeta laughed lightly, but Extremity Ruby materialized a feathered pen that pulsed with the authority of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity as she began to write down.","{It shall be recorded that Extremity Laeta of the Havenly Smilodon Lineage was the backer for the Entity with the Pseudonym Indefatigable. Any grand Achievement he attains in the future or any large transactions through the Havenly Vaults of Extremity will generate proceeds to Extremity Laeta, and if significant enough, even towards the Havenly Smilodon Lineage.}","The reason for someone at Extremity Laeta's caliber or even the other Extremities who wanted to have Noah join their factions after they saw his actions with Havenly Authority!","If he turned out to be a major player in the future- they would benefit greatly from it!","After recording this down, Extremity Ruby smiled and nodded towards Noah while pointing to the obsidian portal beside her.","{I wish you success and offer you congratulations in advance for joining one of the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages.}","Her status as an Employee of the Havenly Vaults of Extremity trumped everything else as this existence led with cordiality, Extremity Laeta shaking her head at this while pulling Noah along, her head turning back briefly towards her friend.","{Tell me what new benefits they added for you guys working here. I may just join you for the next few years.}","At this, Extremity Ruby only smiled and nodded.","Noah and Extremity Laeta disappeared past the portal and appeared in a brand new location where the auras of Tier 2 and 3 Hyperversal Extremities were abundant.","Rivers of Dissolution flowed as around them, the earth was raised into small mountains that acted like roads leading to pools of viscous golden light.","Some were fully filled while others were half or barely filled, with streams of Dissolution slowly being gathered into these pools as minute traces of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority were also attracted into it!","The level they were in showed many Golden Havenly Animalia Blood Source Seas as just like Noah had seen in the Unrecorded History, events began to play out with little variation as Laeta talked about the Blood Source Seas, up until the scene of them walking up one of the elevated mountainous platforms that had a gold sea in front of them.","The scene of the Obsidian Havenly Animalia Blood Source Sea in the distance that Noah had plundered in an Unrecorded History faded from his sight.","{Alright, I've taken you as far as I can. I don't expect you to fail...but take a dip in the Golden Havenly Animalia Blood Source Sea. When you come out, you will have been purged of all your lesser bloodlines as your marrows will course with a Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineage, granting you a profound edge over others in your path to Extremity!}","...!"]},{"number":2640,"title":"Chapter 2640: Chapter 2639 Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor! III","paragraphs":["2639 Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor! III","The purging of all of his lesser bloodlines as his bone marrows themselves would produce the makeup of the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage thereafter!","These were the words of Extremity Laeta, as well as the expectation for how all of the processes of Havenly Bloodline Ablation went.","Standing on the precipice of the mountainous platforms, a smile became etched on the face of Extremity Laeta as she spoke teasingly while seeing Noah's calm gaze.","[Haha, are you getting a little sentimental to say goodbye to your old bloodlines? Don't look at this as losing something, but instead as a process of gaining something much, much grander.]","...!","As she spoke, she bent down and dipped her fair fingers into the edges of the Golden Havenly Animalia Blood Source in front of them as she spoke with remembrance.","[I've undergone the Second Advancement of the Havenly Animalia Bloodline Ablation that utilized the Obsidian Havenly Animalia Blood Source. Just having this made it so that my rate of progression towards Extremity was increased by 1,000%, the success rate of converging Absolute Dynamis of Extremity more than doubled, along with many more minute boosts to my existence all around- but the most astonishing boon for having one of the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages is the fact that in your blood...","you will now have Havenly Authority flowing through you!]","WAA!","One would have Vitalis Hyperversal Authority flowing within their blood.","All the existences of the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages held traces of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority flowing within them- the concentrations greatly differing as it would truly only be significant enough if they underwent a Second Bloodline Advancement with Obsidian Havenly Animalia Blood Source!","[So do not despair in losing something you hold dear. Know that after this, with Havenly Authority running through your veins...your chances of undergoing a Havenly Awakening will go from 0% to a numerical value that at the very least gives you a chance. Of course, one of your goals should be what my goal is currently...to collect enough Units of Havenly Aurora to undergo a Third Bloodline Advancement with Crimson Havenly Animalia Blood Source. A measly 5 Million Units of Havenly Aurora, or the equivalent of 500 Havenly Notes of Extremity...]","She shook her head as she spoke of this and pulled her fingers out.","Her eyes nudged Noah as his lips curved into a silent smile, his now humanoid figure losing the loose obsidian shirt as his chest was laid bare.","The gorgeously sculpted shoulders, pectoral muscles, and abdominal muscles seemed like the layering of celestial metal fibers as half of his body soon became covered with the blaringly stellar golden liquid.","He went deeper into the Golden Havenly Animalia Blood Source Sea as tendrils of viscous golden liquid began to rise and react with his body as if they were tendrils of lightning, his figure giving off a grand feel of an ancient entity as the golden sea around him soon began to churn and swirl with him at the very center, even more tendrils beginning to form and surge towards him as they sought access into his body!","The process of the Havenly Bloodline Ablation was about to begin.","And yet as his Reified Wealdian Source of Indefatigable was taking a dip in a Golden Havenly Animalia Blood Source Sea, his main body in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven was doing something else entirely!","His main body had briefly taken an existence from the council that was meeting to design a deadly virus for Hyperversal Extremities, his figure currently standing around a gorgeous obsidian region that had spinning obsidian Cosmos filled with the authority of Dissolution all around him.","It was the newly enacted Dissolution Aletheian Haven that was still being built even now as at the center of his proliferating Haven, Noah waved his hands to take out the Obsidian Havenly Animalia Blood Source Sea he had plundered from an Unrecorded History.","WAA!","It came out into the open as it was vast, the much greater concentrations of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority within it making Noah's body begin to buzz as he could also feel a dense concentration of Dissolution...along with a trace amount of the Authority of the Six other Supernal Havens of Extremity!","\"The change that makes Havely Lineages intricately connected to the Supernal Havens of Extremity...\"","Noah spoke with a smile as his body descended into the center of the Obsidian Havenly Animalia Blood Source Sea, its calmness instantly interrupted as it began to seethe.","At this very same moment, in the Golden Havenly Animalia Blood Source Sea far away, the tendrils of golden viscous liquid surged into his Reified Wealdian Source of Indefatigable as a moment after, this liquid traversed across the bounds of space and time through the connection Noah shared with his Reified Wealdian Source of Indefatigable as streams of gold began to appear in his Main Body!","They appeared at the same time as the stellar obsidian gold liquid he had plundered also began to pierce into his body and seek the origin of his blood.","It was like tendrils of flames coursing through him as wondrously, he was undergoing both the First Bloodline Advancement and Second Bloodline Advancement of the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage at the same time!","[A pristine and highly potent Bloodline Source is entering your Aspects of Existence.]","It didn't just enter his body.","It also thought to proliferate into his Origin and Soul as they were part of and boosted by his Bloodline!","And the gold of the Bloodline Source in all this...","[The potent Bloodline Source burns with a profound authority as it seeks to scorch and erase the records of your current Bloodlines while making itself the dominant and only present Bloodline within your Existence!]","Havenly Bloodline Ablation.","The process was a serious one as Ablation truly meant erasing everything about one's old lineage!","And nobody could truly stop this as the viscous Obsidian Havenly Animalia Blood Source Sea surging and entering Noah's body at this moment held something that made such a process possible.","It made the obsidian and golden viscous tendrils of liquid spread so quickly within one's body that it was terrifying.","It was Vitalis Hyperversal Authority!"]},{"number":2641,"title":"Chapter 2641: Chapter 2640 Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor! IV","paragraphs":["2640 Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor! IV","[The Vitalis Hyperversal Authority within the Havenly Animalia Blood Source has entrenched and anchored onto your existence and current Lineage.]","[The Havenly Animalia Blood Source is targeting your Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage!]","[The mixture of the Havenly Animalia Blood Source, Vitalis Hyperversal Authority, and the Authorities of the Supernal Havens have located Records of your Lineage as they begin the process of Havenly Bloodline Ablation!]","...!","The mixture of three different Authorities.","As Noah monitored the fantastical changes occurring within his body, his mind also blared as his eyes shone with a shocking light at this moment!","It was because...he was experiencing a phenomenon firsthand that caused millions of computations to bloom in his soul.","It was because he experienced the process of a foreign authority- the Golden and Obsidian Havenly Animalia Blood Source...entering his existence and proliferating very quickly across all of his Aspects of Existence, even to the extent that they located the Records of his Lineage that they sought to purge in order to establish the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage!","Was this...not what he wanted the virus he was designing as a weapon against Hyperversal Extremities to be?!","To be capable of even affecting the Recorded History of Hyperversal Extremities?!","The moment this thought came, his existence felt like it was being scorched inside out as the Havenly Animalia Blood Source became akin to a blazing flaming sea, seeking to dominate and erase everything about Noah's lineage.","Everything about Quintessence.","And at such a juncture, a rousing, booming roar emerged as it felt like an ancient celestial entity awakening.","The trillions of cells that made Noah's blood came to life as they shone with multicolored radiance.","They shone with profound Quintessence as filled with an Innate authority of utmost majesty, they roared out their denial!","[The Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage expresses great superbity at the authority trying to erase it!]","[The Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage fights for its sovereignty and clashes against the Havenly Animalia Blood Source seeking its eradication!]","Extremity Laeta truly believed something that was set in stone and that everybody went through to be the same for Noah.","She truly expected his Lineage to be purged and erased out of existence!","At this moment, Quintessence said otherwise as it rose with glorious splendor, pulling upon its very concept, the Dynamis it was connected to, and all of Noah's Soul and Aspects of Existence it was spread across.","It fought for its sovereignty!","But the other side had terrifyingly profound authority.","[The Havenly Animalia Blood Source erupts with Vitalis Hyperversal Authority to accomplish its purpose.]","Noah's body was akin to a battlefield as at this moment, the thick streams of Havenly Animalia Blood Source countered the rising grandeur of Quintessence, Vitalis Hyperversal Authority rising and protecting its dominant advancement as it began to burn Quintessence!","HOONG!","And such an action was received with extreme prejudice as Noah's Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage erupted with magisterial grandeur.","Quintessence.","It wasn't just a part of Noah.","It quite literally flowed in everything about him.","All of his other concepts of Extremity held Quintessence within them.","His Dynamis.","His Foundation.","His Heart.","His Havenly Organ.","His Innate Vacuous Hyperversal Meridians...and his Innate Vitalis Hyperversal Meridians.","Quintessence flowed pervasively within them!","And at this moment as its enemy sought to prove it by bringing up Vitalis Hyperversal Authority....","BZZT!","The Innate Vitalis Hyperversal Meridians within Noah's body began to tremble forcefully.","Quintessence battled for its life and glory as with shocking tyranny and majesty...it emphatically pulled on the Innate Vitalis Hyperversal Meridians as tendrils of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority instantly erupted from it!","...!","It pulled on the authority Noah could not and would not be able to actively control until he had his Second Vitalis Awakening!","It fought fire with fire as since there was a decent concentration of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority in the Obsidian and Golden Havenly Animalia Blood Source Seas, it pulled upon the pure concentrated streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority within Noah's Meridians and used them as Sword to cut across the might of the Havenly Animalia Blood Source, erasing its dominance as after it lay unprotected...","OOH!","Quintessence bellowed out as it ate up the Havenly Animalia Blood Source.","It devoured and assimilated it to become a part of Quintessence as a raging battle unfolded!","At the same time, the Havenly Animalia Blood Source realized that it was failing to achieve its purpose.","Instead of purging and erasing the records of a bloodline within a host, it was actually the one being erased.","[...]","Something undeniable then rose in the depths of this Blood Source.","Animalia.","Apart from it, there were Plantae, Riboviria, and Celestia.","They made up the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages!","Within the Havenly Animalia Blood Source, the profound and undeniable grandeur of Animalia was roused and enraged at its authority actually being denied against a bloodline it had never come across before.","And this bloodline actually erupted with dense and pure concentrations of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority!","It could not stand for this.","It could not stand to fail, especially as it was the one getting devoured and assimilated by this foreign bloodline at this moment!","But...to gain dominance once more, it needed to have more Vitalis Hyperversal Authority.","And the streams continued in the Obsidian and Golden Havenly Animalia Blood Source Seas currently surging into the body of this ridiculous Entity were not enough.","And yet the Havenly Animalia Blood Source did not have the authority to quickly amass and control Vitalis Hyperversal Authority!","In this case...it could only call in more parts of itself.","And so.","Within the depths of the Havenly Bloodline Ablation Center.","Extremity Laeta was watching with interested eyes as Noah's figure had already reduced the Golden Havenly Animalia Blood Source Sea by half, everything proceeding as usual as at this time, Laeta expected this being before her to have his bloodline entirely changed to Animalia!","'Indefatigable is a grand aspiration, but it is hard for one to stand out above others in these Supernal Have-'","BOOM!","Her thoughts were stopped short.","The Havenly Animalia Blood Source Sea she was looking at instantly erupted with fervor as if it were enraged, and in the gorgeous stellar surroundings where clusters of encirclements with some fully filled, half filled, and some almost empty Golden Havenly Animalia Blood Source Seas were...an explosive attractive force erupted out as these calm seas instantly formed into tendrils of massive rivers of effulgent light that surged towards the half depleted Havenly Animalia Blood Source Sea that Noah's figure was in!"]},{"number":2642,"title":"Chapter 2642: Chapter 2641 Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor! V","paragraphs":["2641 Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor! V","A commotion in the domain where Golden Havenly Animalia Blood Source Seas were cultivated!","The Havenly Bloodline Ablation Center was a massive structure, with spatial runic circles filled with Hyperversal Extremity Authority etched throughout it as the domain spaces within it were far faster than even the building itself.","Within, domains light years in size were contained!","The region that Noah was granted entry to was one of the many Golden Ablation Domains that held Golden Havenly Animalia Blood Source Seas.","Above it was an Obsidian Ablation Domain that Extremities could only gaze at from below!","But within the Golden Ablation Domain Noah was in, there were 81 Animalia Blood Source Seas.","At this moment, it didn't matter if there was another existence undergoing their First Bloodline Advancement or if the viscous golden seas were barely filled.","Every single one formed into glorious stellar rivers that snaked out to pierce into the body of a single being!","A being that Extremity Laeta was standing at the edges of the Blood Sea while gazing with a stupefied expression that soon turned cautious.","An instant later, space around her shimmered as the crimson-haired visage of Extremity Ruby appeared beside her.","[You're making trouble in one of the Ablation Domains I manage...what exactly was the thing that made you grant this being a Havenly Recommendation?]","The two Extremities didn't stop the occurring process as they observed closely, Laeta's eyes squinting as she spoke cautiously.","[His first time operating a Golden Aurora Accumulation Modus Operandi generated thousands of Units of Havenly Aurora- something only Extremities are capable of. I thought he possessed an Aspect of Existence that just had a greater inclination and attraction towards Havenly Hyperversal Authority. That investing in him before he even became an Extremity would yield a positive return. But this...this is more than just an inclination....]","WAA!","The surging golden streams of bloody light all tumbled forth as if they were in a hurry to enter his body- as if the very Golden Havenly Animalia Blood Source was moving with autonomy to achieve something within his body!","The figure of Extremity Ruby that had just appeared had her eyes glazed with golden light as spoke.","\"For his body to naturally and forcefully attract the Golden Havenly Animalia Blood Source Sea like this, he either has an Innate Constitution or Foundation that is very conducive to Havely Authority, or he has somehow already stepped on the Road of Havenly Awakening.]","...!","She released a few possibilities to explain what was happening before them.","The Road of Havenly Awakening!","What every being had to step on as their bodies slowly accumulated more and more Havenly Authority until...they proceeded with their First Havenly Awakening.","As for the possibility that this Apex Aeonic Lifeform had somehow already attained the First Havenly Awakening? This was something too farfetched to even entertain!","One had to be a Hyperversal Extremity for such a grand accomplishment. This was a type of logic akin to light and darkness. Akin to night and day. Akin to life and death.","It had never been violated across Recorded History, nor would it be something violated by an Apex Aeonic Lifeform that was a full Underdweller mere moments ago- a being from the Nether Havens of Extremity that held a very limited access to Havenly Authority!","As Extremety Ruby finished her words, Laeta smiled brightly while continuing to gaze at the scene ahead with great attention.","[My investment may just pay off to be something grand. An Innate Inclination towards Havenly Authority or already an existence that has embarked on the Road of Havenly Awakening...it is something envious even for me and you!]","Even they, as Extremities...had not embarked on the Road of Havenly Awakening.","The Havenly Authority within their Aspects of Existence and flowing through their Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineages had remained stagnant and immovable even now!","They had Havenly Authority flowing within them in trace amounts, and yet they couldn't will even an iota of it to ever move according to their will.","For any being who was lucky or talented enough to be capable of storing the Havenly Authority within their bloodline vessels- within their meridians....they had embarked on the Road of Havenly Awakening.","The formation of complete Havenly Meridians was indicative of an existence undergoing their First Havenly Awakening!","They were not even close to this.","They gazed towards Noah's visage with looks of expectations and unveiled envy as Ruby abruptly spoke amidst all this.","[Oh, I'll be putting all the Golden Havenly Animalia Blood Source Seas being pulled towards him on your tab by the way. Your investment, your responsibility.]","The words instantly roused Laeta as her dark hair shimmered with incredulousness.","[The hell I am...you want me to go broke? I should be getting remuneration for discovering someone like this instead!]","While their wills observed with rapt attention, the two Extremities talked amongst themselves as even they didn't know something even more crucial occurring within Noah's body.","They didn't know that the Blood Source Seas converging towards him were doing so because his current Lineage was actually devouring and assimilating the Hyperversal Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage!","And as the Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage began this process, its standing also began to rise.","[The Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage has begun its ascension towards becoming a Havenly Lineage!]","Instead of it being purged out of existence, it had turned the tables and continued to devour every ounce of Golden Havenly Animalia Blood Source Seas that came in- with Noah's main body making the most rapid gains by devouring the Obsidian Havenly Animalia Blood Source Sea.","Even as larger quantities of the Havenly Animalia Blood Source flowed in, the trace amounts of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority couldn't compare to the readily available reserves of pure Vitalis Hyperversal Authority contained in Noah's meridians.","It was akin to more and more fuel being added to an ever-burning flame that only devoured and assimilated with greater intensity!","It was to the extent that all of the Obsidian Havenly Animalia Blood Source Sea entirely disappeared into Noah's body- not a single drop missed.","And the 81 Blood Seas in the domain within the Ablation Center were also quickly drying up as...","[The Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage is being born through sheer and unabated Quintessence!]","...!"]},{"number":2643,"title":"Chapter 2643: Chapter 2642 Primitive Vitalis Manipulation!","paragraphs":["2642 Primitive Vitalis Manipulation!","A Havenly Lineage.","The Hyperversal Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage granted beings like Extremity Laeta boosts to their rate of progression towards Extremity and more, and Noah was devouring and assimilating such a lineage to elevate his own!","At this point in time, the flow of quite literally everything within him felt unabated and free.","This was because the moment of its formation, he felt the uncontrollable Vitalis Hyperversal Authority that had only been ushered forth to move by unique instances...he felt his connection with such an authority strengthen in an unimaginable manner- as if he had crossed a gateway of an absolutely endless path!","And this change was ushered forth by Quintessence.","[The 16th Boundary Layer of Quintessence has revised an additional feature to its standing.]","[The Feature of Primitive Vitalis Manipulation has been generated through the 16th Boundary Layer of Quintessence!]","[You have gained an extremely rudimentary, low level of control of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority before your Second Vitalis Awakening!]","...!","His cells cried out with euphoria.","His whole existence felt like it had taken a step forward as his swathes of Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage blood flowed within him like roaring rivers across his vessels and Aspects of Existence, and they carried with them Vitalis Hyperversal Authority!","They cycled Vitalis Hyperversal Authority across Noah's Aspects of Existence- this authority no longer being contained in the Innate Vitalis Hyperversal Meridians.","And when Noah focused on the glorious streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority...","His will descended on the raging streams of Vitalis coursing within his Blood as when he beckoned...","BZZT!","A small, miniscule, snaking stream of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority deviated from its flow as it followed Noah's will.","This was Primitive Vitalis Manipulation!","It was small.","It was Primitive.","But it was manipulation nonetheless!","The manipulation of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority was something that should have only become available at the Second Vitalis Awakening.","That was how astonishing the actions of Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage were as one of its first boons was a small yet significant manipulation of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority.","And what did this translate to?","It meant that he now had a controlled methodology and vessel to transport his poisonous virus being forged to infect Hyperversal Extremities!","And in addition to this...","[The Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage has been recorded in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.]","[When a Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Blood Source is extracted from you and placed into a targeted existence, it is possible to alter the Lineage of a targeted existence entirely by altering their records. Depending on the potency of the extracted Blood Source, the target can gain a different level of purity of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage.]","...!","His Lineage was solely shared by his close family members as others did not enjoy the benefit of the Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor.","And yet now...Noah could spread his Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage Blood Source onto his Vassals as he could grant them a semblance of his lineage!","A semblance of Quintessence.","This was the way it was supposed to be utilized. But...if Noah took it into an entirely different direction and used his Blood Source wrapped with Vitalis Hyperversal Authority to carry a poison into his enemies- would this not achieve what he wished so long as he tweaked to make sure his enemies would only attain destruction and nothing else?","All of these were currently possibilities.","But the sheer fact that his Lineage could be spread freely left behind shocking implications as he thought of the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages that were widespread across the Supernal Havens of Extremity...and just who would be benefiting from these Lineages the most.","He had to ask this question because of the next prompt that followed.","[Whenever an existence with the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage gains any achievements towards Extremity and scales past the Gradations of Extremity, you and those with an extreme level of purity within this lineage will obtain increasingly purer concentrations of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority reinforced into your Aspects of Existence.]","...!","The authority that could be considered the most important thing within the Seven Havens- whether it was the Nether Havens or the Supernal Havens.","It could be attained with even greater and purer concentrations from the mere achievements of others of his Lineage.","It also shed light on the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages.","It showed that at the very top of these lineages...there were some extremely terrifying beings that had been getting baptized by Vitalis Hyperversal Authority for a great number of years!","Noah...would only just be starting now.","His body continued to cycle the blood of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage across his existence as any Havenly Animalia Blood Source still flowing in was quickly burnt and devoured- this fight being on its last death throes unless an even greater concentration of this Blood Source entered Noah's body.","But prompts continued to come as this elevated Lineage truly settled within Noah!","[As the Progenitor of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage, you express the boon of 100,000% Increased Rate of Progression towards and past Extremity.]","[The Innate Lineage Ability of the Illuminating Light of Quintessence has been born!]","[Illuminating Light of Quintessence]:: A holder of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage is able to activate the Illuminating Light of Quintessence at the cost of 50% of the Soul Values. While under this Illuminating Light, the convergence of Concepts of Extremity will be guaranteed to succeed for 9 Concepts or Less, and those with a profound level of purity of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage can even converge 21 Concepts of Extremity with a high chance of success. The Progenitor of this Lineage is now able to converge up to 36 Concepts of Extremity into a single Dynamis of Extremity...","[The Innate Lineage Ability of Havenly Quintessential Animalia Entity Form has been born!]","...!","One after another.","The prompts rained down with glory as they ushered the advent of a stupendous Havenly Lineage.","A lineage that stepped on the limelight by devouring the Source of an already existing Havenly Extremity Lineage!"]},{"number":2644,"title":"Chapter 2644: Chapter 2643 Splendiferous! I","paragraphs":["2643 Splendiferous! I","Many prompts cascaded down with the advent of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage, with some of them shedding light of truly grand things to come in the future.","Any holder of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage...was guaranteed to be capable of forming Absolute Dynamis of Extremity with 9 Concepts or Less!","Any!","And for those with a great level of purity of such a lineage like his Son...","Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity could be forged as the upper tier of converged boundaries was brought to 21.","This alone was worthy to make any lineage the backbone of the Seven Havens, and yet this was only a singular feature of Noah's lineage!","Then, there was the term Gradations of Extremity introduced in the description of what Noah as the Progenitor of this Lineage would benefit from.","Gradations of Extremity!","They should relate to the different Tiers of Hyperversal Extremities, and why some beings were segmented into Tier 1, 2, 3, or 4.","What was truly crucial was just how these stages were demarcated...and the fact that Noah's lineage will grant benefits to him whenever existences scale towards and past the Gradations of Extremity!","It meant he needed to spread his Lineage far and wide.","To spread it towards Apex Aeonic Lifeforms and Hyperversal Extremities alike!","And with the boons of such a lineage...would it truly be such a hard thing to do?","Just like how there was the Havenly Animalia Bloodline Ablation Center where beings were granted a Havenly Bloodline and knew they would gain boosts to aid them ever closer to Extremity, he could do something even more profound.","If he approached a Hyperversal Extremity and told them to take into their Aspects of Existence an extracted Blood Source that would further aid them across the Gradations of Extremity and improve their power...why would they deny it?","As he thought of this, Noah's brilliant eyes swirling with multicolored blood of Quintessence shone.","His thoughts naturally went to the poor and hungry.","The Cult of Endless Shadows that had just lost their Armament of Extremity and dreams of becoming a genuine Aeonic Inheritance of Extremity!","They held unbound anger towards the Avernus Clan, and yet they couldn't do a single thing against their power if the Senatus of Extremity didn't enforce the rules.","And with the advent of the Culmination Step of Dissolution that led to the opening of the Supernal Havens of Extremity...everything else had taken a back burner as nobody cared or even mentioned how the Investiture of Extremity was immensely violated just days ago by one of the Seven Clans.","As Noah thought about the Cult of Endless Shadows and felt the continued changes of his unfolding Lineage, he couldn't help but form a devilish smile!","[The Values of Hyperversal Dignity and Hyperversal Mastery are generated for all those with the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage, with greater values correlating with the level of purity.]","[The Innate Progenitor Exclusive Lineage Ability of Havenly Quintessential Link has been born!]","[Havenly Quintessential Link]:: Across space and time, across Walls of Realities and Dimensions...this ability allows for only you as the Progenitor of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage to share the senses of any chosen existence carrying your lineage. Through the link of blood, you can even go a step further to open a Havenly Bloodline Rift and appear anywhere within a thousand light years of a chosen existence carrying your lineage...","[The Innate Lineage Ability of Havenly Quintessential Obfuscation has been born!]","[Havenly Quintessential Obfuscation]:: The Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage is a grand one as everything about it can easily become the center of attention. It also holds the capability to obscure and erase any knowledge or records of oneself actively and passively. As the Progenitor, you will display this ability to the fullest, with its activation coming at no cost to you. Your Records and very existence become thin and veiled to the extent that even if you were floating next to other Existences and passing by them, their eyes would not be able to perceive you. This ability actively alters records of the unfolding reality around you as even existences that have reached the Second Tier of Hyperversal Extremity cannot bypass its veil. When you take an action against Tier 1 and Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities, their senses will then be capable of perceiving you as the effects of Obfuscation will only be reestablished once 5 seconds pass without another action being carried out. The extent this ability can be displayed by those with lesser purity of your lineage will determine up to which level of existence it works against. An increased accumulation of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority within the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage will allow for this feature to be elevated to an even greater stage...","...!","The utterly ridiculous boons of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage continued to come as magisterial things like Havenly Quintessential Link and Havenly Quintessential Obfuscation came to be!","Each unfolding feature of this bloodline seemed grander than the last as after the last set of prompts, things seemed to slow down.","The incoming tendrils of Golden Havenly Animalia Blood Source Seas carried over by his Reified Wealdian Source of Indefatigable continued to be devoured the moment they appeared as his multicolored blood was fully in control.","It flowed with streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority as well as minute traces of the authority of the Supernal Haven of Dissolution.","His body brimmed with Lifeforce and power as any remaining boons and extra features that had yet to be quantified would be known by the time everything settled and this glorious Lineage was packed full of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority!","This was because even at this moment, Noah utilized Primitive Vitalis Manipulation to allow streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority to flow from his Innate Vitalis Hyperversal Meridians and into his Blood.","This would cause Vitalis to be slowly depleted within his Meiridans as thereafter, streams of unseen Vitalis Hyperversal Authority entered his Aspects of Existence to refill the missing areas within the Meridians.","And as Noah made his Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage even more pure and even more filled with Vitalis Hyperversal Authority as the features yet to enfold in the future would be nothing but splendiferous wonders!"]},{"number":2645,"title":"Chapter 2645: Chapter 2644 Splendifirous! II","paragraphs":["2644 Splendifirous! II","[The Hyperversal Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage has been fully assimilated into the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage as the essence of Animalia can be displayed outwardly by choice.]","Slow and steady.","Like the flow of an endless river of time.","Like the pulse of an entity that had lived through eons.","This was the feeling that Noah's Reified Wealdian Source of Indefatigable gave off while it began to display the effects of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage- but the feeling it gave off was that of one of the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages!","Animalia.","Extremity Laeta and Ruby watched as Noah entirely drained the 81 Blood Source Seas, Ruby carefully watching the veil separating them from the Obsidian Havenly Animalia Blood Source Seas above to make sure they weren't affected.","Even if this existence held unknown means and potential, they couldn't freely allow him to carry out what just occurred here with something as pristine as Obsidian Havenly Animalia Blood Source Seas!","That would be millions of Units of Havenly Aurora.","But after they saw the last tendrils of the Blood Source Seas disappear into him and his body begin to emanate the grandeur of the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage, the two Extremities nodded with pleased expressions as Laeta was the first to speak as she looked at Noah's figure.","[He can no longer be referred to as an Underdweller...]","As she spoke, her will peered at every part of Noah as his sculpted bare chest was somehow giving off an even gender sense of magnetism, his muscles glowing with a Havenly splendor as one could almost feel the pulsing of Havenly Authority flowing within the blood coursing through these muscles!","Everything they saw was indicative of this being expressing the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage as his own blood and disposition would decide what Animalia form he would take when he transformed.","With everything calming down, Noah's bare body opened its gaze as his eyes released an animalistic sense of wonder and power!","—","In the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","His Main Body opened its eyes at the same time as ever now and then, prompts continued to pass over them.","[Your Blood Source is passively extracted and channeled towards the Existences that currently carry the lesser version of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage.]","The extraction of his Blood Source!","He felt his Quintessential Hyperversal Mana and Soul Values burn as a portion of his Blood was isolated and contained in a singularity- the authority of Dissolution and Vitalis Hyperversal Authority retained in this singularity as after it was formed, it warped across the lineage connection Noah held with his closest family.","Three of such Singularities were extracted as it didn't cost much for him to do this, and these three Extracted Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Blood Source Pearls went towards Henry, Adelaide, and Noah's own mother!","Their Records were about to be charged and elevated to something even grander as Noah didn't stop there.","He rose up from the swirling mist of Dissolution in the newly budding Dissolution Aletheian Haven as his figure disappeared.","Minutes ago, he had already sent word to all of his pertinent Vassals to leave their current tasks and gather their main bodies just below the newly formed Haven of Dissolution that currently looked like an expansive floating island light years in size, waterfalls of Dissolution cascading from it and drizzling onto the other Havens below as the authority of this Havenly Boundary of Extremity was slowly permeating across the Infinite Hyperversal Haven!","And it was part of the authorities that would be required for what was to come.","Below the Dissolution Aletheian Haven, Noah's figure reappeared as in front of him, the figures of Barbatos, Aurelia, Katelyn, Orion, Hyperion, Kazuhiko, Caesar, Oathkeeper...many of his pertinent people gazed towards him with interest, while some held looks of reverence!","Noah smiled at them as his right hand rose, Mana and Soul Values churning out gloriously as the skin of his palm split open.","Crimson gold Singularities that shone with multicolored radiance of Quintessence then began to proliferate around him and float towards the beings before him, his voice magnetic as his Extracted Blood Source Pearls were produced en masse!","[Drink.]","WAA!","When he spoke, his voice carried forth the Vitalis Hyperversal Authority that was now flowing with his thick blood across his existence- his presence seeming ethereal and grander than all those here even though he had yet to achieve Extremity!","[Drink, and take a step closer to Extremity. Drink, and get ready to enter the Supernal Havens of Extremity.]","...!","With the advent of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage, Noah had to spread his Source wide and let loose the Existences seeking Extremity upon the Seven Havens.","His people...were only the first step!","—","In the Nether Haven of Dissolution.","In front of a small Vein Rift towards the very corner where many Inheritances and the Seven Clans were clustered, there were tendrils of Shadows in this region as the atmosphere was a heavy one!","The faces of the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms and Hyperversal Extremities were dark and somber as these...were the remnant forces of the Cult of Endless Shadows after they called over everyone from all the branches they had.","They had sent in many of their Apex Aeonic Lifeforms and even the injured Flashing Shadow who barely made it out of the battle with Extremity Blue with the help of the Shadow Extremity Overlord, and yet none of them had gained entry!","Absolutely nothing seemed to be going right for them.","They had lost their Armament of Extremity as their forces were splintered, and they could only watch from afar as the ones responsible faced no repercussions- and they couldn't even speak up as a few of the Tier 3 Hyperversal Avernus Extremities making a move would mean an end to their Inheritance!","Thus, the morale of the Cult of Endless Shadows was at an all-time low.","At such a time...","SAA!","The figure of Noah's Fantasia Aletheian Chassis appeared nearby, floating towards the cluster of existences belonging to the Cult of Endless Shadows.","His entrance caused no fluctuations as gloriously, the effects of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage were displayed fully.","The effects of Havenly Quintessential Obfuscation were displayed fully!","His figure floated close to the visage of the Primeval Elder Silas as this Apex Aeonic Lifeform and Apex Aeonic Lifeforms around him did not even notice, sense, feel, nor see that there was anyone near them.","The Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage was this domineering as the reality around Noah was actively warped to fool the senses of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms inches away from him!","But this wasn't all.","Noah continued floating ahead as his grand figure near the Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity who was Silas's Master.","Extremity Laos.","A Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity!","Even though he was within the lowest Gradations of Extremity, this was still a being that Noah could currently not do anything again as if they made a move against him, they would be able to kill his clones over and over again.","Noah couldn't yet contend with such a being, and yet at this moment...he came to float inches away from this Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity.","He saw the wrinkles of worry and uncertainty on his face.","He saw the coiling tendrils of Hyperversal Extremity around his body.","He looked straight into the eyes of this Hyperversal Extremity...and this being could not perceive him.","This being didn't even know that Noah was standing right there!","The possibilities and applications of this unfolding reality...were too glorious to even imagine!"]},{"number":2646,"title":"Chapter 2646: Chapter 2645 Isn’t it unfair? I","paragraphs":["2645 Isn't it unfair? I","He stared at a Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity, and this being didn't even know he was there!","That was how astonishing the power brought about by his Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage was!","The feature of Havenly Quintessential Obfuscation was simply that obscene as just imagine if he was actually capable of damaging a Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity...and he could arrive right in front of them without their knowledge.","Or whenever he finishes the poisonous virus he wanted to create...he could integrate and infect a being before they could even react!","Many possibilities and ideas bloomed with this terrifying feature as Noah moved in after gazing at a Hyperversal Extremity who couldn't even notice him.","His figure moved past other legions of Shadowlings and Apex Aeonic Shadow Elders, bypassing multiple more Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities as he even passed inches away from Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities!","And still, nothing.","When such a reality played out, it truly made it seem like he was an entirely different Lifeform on another plane of existence compared to those around him, to the extent that even to the best of their abilities...they wouldn't even realize his existence unless he wanted them to.","That is until...","[Hmm?]","The senses of the Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities ahead noticed an incongruency.","The Flashing Shadow and The Shadow Extremity Overlord were the first ones to turn and gaze towards Noah's direction as their expressions changed, even more so when their gazes received blank questioning stares from the Tier 1 and 2 Hyperversal Extremities as if they didn't know why they had suddenly gazed at this direction!","It was at this point that Noah released the effects of Obfuscation as...","[Motherfu-]","BZZT!","He was right next to a Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity who instantly flashed away into shadows the moment she sensed an existence who had bypassed her senses appear near her!","When her will and the wills of others refocused, they were even more shocked to find that it was an Apex Aeonic Lifeform that was among them whom they couldn't even sense before!","And even more so...the identity of this Apex Aeonic Lifeform.","[You.]","The Shadow Extremity Overlord uttered out as this single word meant too many things.","In their current state, one could blame a myriad set of choices and actions that contributed to how things played out.","Some from the Cult of Endless Shadows placed blame on the being who had declared war on the Avernus Clan and was supposed to be viewing the very Armament of Extremity that was stolen that day!","At the same time, they all knew how the events had truly gone down as their gazes towards Noah were complex.","In the midst of all of these gazes and before they could react any further, Noah nonchalantly floated among them as he spoke out.","\"Isn't it unfair?\"","WAA!","His voice wasn't filled with the heaviness and grandess of the Vitalis Hyperversal Authority, and yet it resonated in the minds of all those here!","\"Isn't it unfair that when you are weak and poor, the rules are always enforced against you? But when you have influence and power...the rules are merely suggestions that can be broken without consequences? That the Investiture of Extremity is merely a glorified agreement meant to control the masses but not the ones who contributed in forging its commandments?\"","...!","His words struck deep into the hearts and minds of the Cult of Endless Shadows- especially their leadership!","It was the the extent that while the Shadow Extremity Overlord remained silent while gazing towards Noah, Flashing Shadow's visage spoke vigorously against Noah's words.","[The Cult of Endless Shadows is not weak..nor are we poor.]","\"And yet the Avernus Clan came into your home, killed your Extremities, and took your Armament of Extremity. And now, they're right over there going about their lives like nothing happened.\"","...!","His words caused waves of flaming shadows of wrath to rise within the Hyperversal Extremities around him as Noah continued before anything else unfolded!","\"You all can glare as much as you want, or you can read between the lines. Being weak and poor is not a crime. But being weak and poor and choosing to stay on such a path without any drive for change...that is the biggest waste of life in all of Extremity.\"","When he arrived at these words, Noah snapped his fingers as above him, tendrils of a profound authority that caused the Origins of all nearby beings to tremble and be drawn to it!","\"So..here is an opportunity for change. Something I obtained in the Supernal Havens of Extremity that you all cannot even manage to enter yet. Something that will reform your very being into one that is capable of easily forming Absolute Dynamis of Extremity, and even increasing your rate of progression towards Extremity and past it in the thousands.\"","...!","Terrifying words only entered the minds of the existences belonging to the Cult of Endless Shadows as after Noah uttered them...","HOONG!","A massive veil of shadows erupted from the Shadow Extremity Overlord as it covered everything in the surroundings, isolating the vast numbers of beings from the Cult of Endless Shadows away from the eyes and senses of others!","It now seemed like they were in a churning domain of stellar darkness.","And yet above Noah, many points of multicolored Singularity bloomed as they radiated an intense light of grandeur!","[...What?]","The Shadow Extremity Overlord uttered out slowly while others gazed forward with caution and incredulity.","Yet Noah remained impassive as more and more extracted Blood Sources proliferated around him!","\"Exactly what I stated and more. These are Blood Sources that will grant a thorough change to your existence. As a Hyperversal Extremity...you should be able to discern the truthfulness of my words at the very least. Out of every opportunity and fortune that you have come across in your lifetimes, this will be the most significant one!\"","His words domineeringly let the facts be known as the figure of the Shadow Extremity Overlord flicked his fingers, one of Noah's Blood Sources instantly appearing between his index finger and thumb as he gazed at it closely!","He could feel his very existence vibrating with excitement as it told him to devour this singularity in his hands right away!","And as a Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity, he also felt something within this Singularity that he recognized from the few times he came across it.","[Vitalis...?!]","An authority that had eluded even him as he held very little of it in his Aspects of Existence!"]},{"number":2647,"title":"Chapter 2647: Chapter 2646 Isn’t it unfair? II","paragraphs":["2646 Isn't it unfair? II","The Shadow Extremity Overlord gazed at the blinding singularity in front of him as his soul pulsed with power.","He was an Overlord.","A title granted to any leader of an Inheritance or Clan who had at the very minimum reached Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity Authority.","There was a heavy responsibility on his shoulders as unlike other Extremities who moved carefree, he had quintillions of Existences to think of!","Recent events had made his heart heavy.","Recent events had made him question.","He had denied joining any of the Seven Clans and Major Inheritances in order to elevate Domains of Shadows, and yet he found himself questioning if he made the right choice!","Now, Vein Rifts pulsed in the distance holding immense opportunities they couldn't even grasp.","And then the first being to enter these Vein Rifts came out to dangle an opportunity of profound proportions as the Shadow Extremity Overlord once more found himself at a crossroads!","Everything that was uttered from the mouth of this existence surrounded by hundreds of these dazzling singularities was not a lie.","And yet...","[What do you gain out of all of this? Why would you freely give off something that makes all of that possible?]","He couldn't help but question this existence surrounded by a light of mystery as at this, he tilted his head calmly.","\"Does it matter?\"","...!","He didn't deny about any benefits he would receive. And he didn't need to as did it truly matter to them what he received out of all of this when they were in such dire straits and such a profound opportunity lay before their feet?","The gaze of the Shadow Extremity Overlord became stern as he looked around to see his forces gazing at the Singularities around Noah with a greedy light, his voice coming out as he focused on an Apex Aeonic Lifeform in the distance.","[Silas, come forward.]","The Primeval Shadow Elder who connected them all to Noah Osmont.","The one who made an oath with him for the Shadow Sword!","This being stepped away from behind Extremity Laos as the Shadow Extremity Overlord waved his fingers, the Blood Source within his hands rushing over to him as his intentions were clear.","Silas would be the first one to test this.","Surrounded by ever-increasing extracted Blood Sources, Noah smiled as he looked at the being he had an oath to elevate to Extremity.","This Apex Aeonic Lifeform could no longer look at him with the same gaze as before as with complex emotions, he took the extracted Blood Source in front of him and swallowed it!","\"...\"","THUMP!","He felt the beat of his heart.","And then...for the first time in his life, he experienced Quintessence.","BOOM!","His body exploded with a light of authority as his eyes opened wide, whatever lineage he held being exposed and erased from his records as a single Lineage took its place!","And this Lineage...had blood that flowed with Vitalis Hyperversal Authority.","It had tendrils of the Authority of Dissolution coursing within it!","And it came with shocking elevations as Silas felt his soul and boundaries cry out in euphoria, prompts beginning to flash before his eyes as waves of information emerged in his mind!","[You have devoured the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage Blood Source.]","[Your Aspects of Existence are being transformed as all lesser bloodline records are erased.]","[The level of purity of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage you have attained is less than 5%.]","The initial prompts that came were mild as they showed him just what he had swallowed.","But the prompts that came afterwards...caused Silas's figure to tremble as all eyes were on him for what would happen!","\"What the hell? This...!\"","\"How is this possible?!\"","BOOM!","A pristine authority radiated from him as he screamed out incoherently while gazing towards the Shadow Extremity Overlord who was using him as a test, his skin gaining a stellar hue as his eyes pulled with multicolored radiance.","\"A Lineage! An Ancient Lineage! 10,000% increased rate of progression towards Extremity and past it! An Absolute Dynamis...I can form as many as my soul can handle with a 100% chance of success! Ah...there's more!\"","His words were explosive.","The hearts of other Apex Aeonic Lifeforms trembled.","The wills of Hyperversal Extremities wavered as they looked at each other!","A heavily injured Extremity Gabriella who barely kept a sliver of her life after Extremity Ariana's attack felt her heart pulse with life and possibility.","Flashing Shadow and the Shadow Extremity Overlord looked at each other as countless waves of information were exchanged in an instant!","And a moment later...","A scramble began as Extremity Laos, Silas's Master, was the next and first being to move the fastest and appear in front of the extracted Blood Sources that had reached a few thousand around Noah and still continued to increase.","He instantly devoured one of these dazzling Singularities as his actions were akin to the tipping of dominoes, other Hyperversal Shadow Extremities scrambling forward as Apex Aeonic Lifeforms followed behind them!","They could currently only see thousands of the extracted Blood Sources.","They didn't know how many this being ahead of them could provide as they didn't want to miss out!","And because of this, a glorious scene unfolded in a hidden domain of shadows outside of the Vein Rifts as the splendiferous visage of Noah raised his arms out wide- a profound authority emanating from him as waves of Quintessential Hyperversal Mana and Soul Values were burnt to produce thousands of flickering Singularities of Blood Sources!","Blood Sources that caused Extremities and Apex Aeonic Lifeforms to flock towards him on all sides in a scene that deserved to be recorded in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.","The Shadow Extremity Overlord once more had another singularity in his fingers as while staring at the image of Noah with his arms outstretched as tens of thousands more Singularities proliferated out...he moved his hands in what seemed like the heaviest choice he would make in his life.","And then...he devoured the magisterial singularity.","One hundred. One thousand. Ten thousand!","Thousands of existences from the Cult of Endless Shadows devoured the Blood Sources and attained the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage.","Some had already grasped Extremity, some had only arrived up to the 15th Layer of Shadows, and others were at the 17th Layer with Extremity forever out of their reach no matter how much they tried to grasp it these past years.","Out of thousands of the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, there was one such being among those who devoured a Blood Source and underwent an unbelievable phenomenon at this moment- a phenomenon that never in her wildest dreams would she have thought would come on this day!","She had been stuck at the 17th Boundary Layer of Shadows for the last 10,000 years.","10,000 years, and not a single step forward could be taken!","But after she devoured the Blood Source and attained the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage, the wall she could never scale all these years...she felt it fracturing as her 17th Boundary Layer of Shadows went towards the 18th- what she found so difficult to comprehend before falling into place ever so easily as if she had gained another set of eyes. As if her existence was now more geared to head towards a certain far away prize.","Towards Extremity!","\"Ah...\"","Her soul was dazed as she stared blankly- a profound transformation beginning around her as her authority was slowly transformed to become Hyperversal Extremity Authority!","Such a shocking scene was captured by all the Shadow Extremities here as of there were any with reservations, they were utterly destroyed as every single member of the Cult of Endless Shadows here scrambled to attain a dazzling Singularity of a Blood Source...","—","In the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, Noah's Main Body was overseeing the changes of his people as they attained the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage when in the stellar space above him...","CRACK!","Reality split open as waves of profound authority of utmost purity gushed out.","Transparent and yet laced with a stellar white hue.","It was streams of none other than Vitalis Hyperversal Authority- and they came due to nothing else other than the grandeur of Noah spreading his Lineage to thousands of beings so far as they made accomplishments towards Extremity and past it!"]},{"number":2648,"title":"Chapter 2648: Chapter 2647 Hyperversal Anomalous Virion! I","paragraphs":["Initially, Noah had come in contact with Vitalis Hyperversal Authority by accomplishing a grand feat of Plundering an Unrecorded History.","It meant that when other existences performed feats astonishing enough, they would also have their existence bathed with Vitalis Hyperversal Authority.","This was why in the upper echelons of the Seven Aeonic Havens, the more powerful Extremities knew of and had even come in contact with Vitalis!","But none of them could continue to gain a source of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority freely. Otherwise, many of them would have undergone their First Vitalis Awakening.","This...was the case for the Nether Havens of Extremity anyway. The Supernal Havens of Extremity were much different as Vitalis was termed Havenly Authority by its inhabitants, and it could be accessed in these Haves much more freely!","It was why a great deal of their most powerful existences had undergone Vitalis Awakening.","And the four major powers within these Supernal Havens...were all tied to Lineages that had existences at the very top benefitting from those below them ascending towards and past the Gradations of Extremity.","Within the first day of entering the Supernal Havens of Extremity, Noah established a Havenly Lineage just like the major powers of these Havens as at this moment...he already began to benefit from it!","Pure, unadulterated streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority flowed into his Existence as everything was further refined by it.","His Blood attracted it most of all as the concentration of Vitalis coursing through him became even purer and denser!","[Your existence is gaining extremely pure concentrations of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority.]","[The purity of your Havenly Lineage is increasing as with it, the grander the boosts it provides.]","And in addition to his blood, streams of Vitalis also flowed into something else!","[Your Innate Vitalis Hyperversal Meridians absorb even purer concentrations of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority as they embark on a path taking you closer to the Second Vitalis Awakening.]","...!","His path to power was a unique one.","Other beings would achieve a grand foundation or embark on the Road of Havenly Awakening as after they began, they would proceed on it slowly to go towards a grander path. And yet Noah...seemed to be finding means that made his path faster and faster the stronger that he became!","And at this moment, the pathway towards the Second Vitalis Awakening opened up as he began walking on it speedily.","He wouldn't even have to do anything as he just had to let those he had obtained his Havenly Lineage continue getting stronger and ever closer towards Extremity, and his Lineage made that even more possible for them as it was a glorious positive feedback loop of power.","HOONG!","The first burst of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority was immense as it was the inclusion and strengthening of thousands of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms and 26 Shadow Extremities!","They were all that remained from other Branches of the Cult of Endless Shadows after the incursion of Avernus!","After this initial burst, the inflow of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority became slower, almost turning into a drizzle, but it continued to bathe Noah nonetheless.","The Havenly Authority he emanated became even more potent as his presence could be mistaken for an esteemed personage of the Hyperversal Extremity Stage!","And yet...he hadn't even undergone Apexification with his Main Body yet.","\"Hoo...\"","His eyes opened as he breathed out stellar brilliance, his gaze landing on his Vassals who currently had an average achievement of the 13th Boundary Layer after they utilized the Loot obtained from the Apex War that Noah had multiplied through RUINATION.","Their existences were currently being elevated and resonated with his Havenly Lineage as many of them had already begun converging boundaries to form their Absolute Dynamis of Extremity that they couldn't do before!","He didn't need to guide them for this.","The Havenly Lineage would do it all for him as a moment later, Noah's figure disappeared from this location and returned to where the Wealdian Council was gathered.","Dr. Hall had received his extracted Blood Source as he looked at it with immense focus and marvel- his eyes burning with a shocking light as if he wanted to break down everything that made this singularity before him!","The figure of the Haven Lich was an Entity that stemmed from Noah as its bony body was already crackling with a Havenly Authority, the massive Champions of Thanatos that were being constructed in the distance also beginning to pulse and transform in a maddening way!","Noah's Wealdian Sources of Extremity looked at him as all of them smiled devilishly, Noah's voice ringing out.","\"It seems like all the parts of a diabolically quintessential virus have come together...let us design the first one.\"","WAA!","With his eyes becoming immensely sharp, Noah took out a Blood Source filled with Vitalis Hyperversal Authority and the Authority of Dissolution as he placed it in one hand, while his left hand pulsed with immense darkness as Vacuous Hyperversal Authority rose!","All the pieces had fallen into place.","He had Vacuous Hyperversal Authority that he could hide within the folds of the Vitalis Hyperversal Authority. The forged virus would gain access into the body as Vitalis Hyperversal Authority, and after it was in...there was Noah's Blood Source to spread across the Records of the target.","What Noah had to do was edit the Blood Source to make sure the target wasn't granted a Havenly Lineage, with the clashing effects of Vitalis and Vacuous that would be released being allowed to infect and spread across the Records of this being!","This was his poison.","This was his virus.","The part of his soul that was Pathogenic Will shone as the Boundaries of Pathogenicity, Biochemistry, Epidemiology, Essensology, Pharmacology, and a few others were reigned in by Quintessence as Noah altered the quality and purpose of the particular Blood Source before him into something vile!","His Vacuous Hyperversal Authority formed into a sliver of nothingness that became covered by heavy waves of Thanatos, Lotra, Quintessence, Manadynamics, and Infinity, followed by the altered Blood Source splitting apart and forming into tendrils of crimson gold light that also went to cover the sliver of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority!","And then...Primitive Vitalis Manipulation was utilized as Noah called forth a stream of pure Vitalis Hyperversal Authority to cover the concoction.","A thin layer of Thanatos, Lotra, Quintessence, Manadynamics, and Infinity along with his altered Blood Source separated Vacuous and Vitalis as the moment these barriers faded...a heavy clash would occur- and especially so if it was within the soul of an existence!","And as Noah's soul intricately controlled all of these pieces to come together...","[You are forging an extremely unstable Hyperversal Anomalous Virion!]"]},{"number":2649,"title":"Chapter 2649: Chapter 2648 Hyperversal Anomalous Virion! II","paragraphs":["The prompt identified what Noah was about to make!","Hyperversal Anomalous Virion.","And in addition to this...","[The Infinite Hyperversal Haven's Alchemy Hall is recording down the process and formation of the Hyperversal Anomalous Virion!]","The Infinite Hyperversal Haven itself gazed at Noah's actions as things it may have to replicate as it recorded everything down!","The formation of the Virion caught the rapt attention of the Haven Lich Ra'Zan and Dr. Hall as it was a profound alchemical achievement that was carried out from the mixture of many different authorities.","[The Authorities within the Hyperversal Anomalous Virion have so far remained stable!]","When looking at it, it seemed like any normal stream of Havenly Authority as one wasn't able to grasp any of the other authorities hidden within it.","Noah's eyes shone with unprecedented focus as after maintaining the Primitive Vitalis Manipulation to maintain its stability for another few seconds...","[The Hyperversal Anomalous Virion has successfully come to fruition!]","The transparent and yet gorgeous white stream of authority flowed by itself freely as it was recognized as completed!","[A unique construct with profound potential effects Unrecorded in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity!]","\"Mmm...\"","Noah nodded happily as he waved his hands and caused the pulsing stream of authority to flow around him, its innocence being the most gorgeous factor as when it settled in his hand, its details flowed out.","[Hyperversal Anomalous Virion]:: A construct formed under the guise of many authorities to achieve the purpose of infecting and causing irreversible damage onto the intended target. Layers of an altered Blood Source flow between Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authority as the qualities of the Blood Source have all been degraded, excluding the quality of quickly attaching to the records of the targeted existence. Lotra flows in between the two Hyperversal Authorities as any damage done will be sought to grant Loot- the severity of the damage to the target's Aspects of Existence determining the quantity and quality of loot as the effects of the Virion unfold. Its results have yet to be seen, but to spark its effects, simply allow it to flow into the Aspects of Existence of the target unhindered and remove the layers of authority standing between Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authority, and the clash of these two authorities will do the rest...","A profound wonder was made.","Its true usefulness and power still had to be tested as its purpose was meant to target enemies that Noah couldn't yet damage.","He was relying on Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authorities to do this on his behalf as he would even attain Loot depending on the level of chaos caused by the Virion!","Now, all that was left was to find an opportunity to utilize it!","—","In another part of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","In a region within the Apollyon Aletheian Haven, waves of Sources of Chaos surged like endless storms as in one area, there were tendrils of Ruin thundering in all directions.","At the center of it all, there was a young woman whose body shone with a gorgeous makeup of quasars, every part of her brimming with a terrifying sensation of chaos and ruin as this was none other than Xiaomi!","Currently, a Havenly Aura surrounded her figure that made her seem even more exquisite, her dark hair composed of stellar quasars dangling part her shoulders as her eyes opened with a profound radiance.","Beside her, Noah's Apollyon Aletheian Chassis gazed with scrutiny as he asked.","\"How is it?\"","\"Still on the 16th Boundary Layer of Ruin and the 15th layer in other Sources of Chaos...but I feel like the 17th layer of Ruin is not too far away. Especially after obtaining another increased rate of progression from the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage!\" Her voice was no longer meek as it still held some of its innocent charm, her smile brightening up the surrounding space as her words held shocking implications.","The 16th Boundary Layer of Ruin!","Apart from Noah, this existence had reached the highest Layer in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven as it was due to nothing else other than her Unrecorded Innate Pellucid Hyperversal Extremity Foundation of Ruined Chaos that Noah unearthed when he saved her with the Extremity Panacea!","The description of this Foundation had explicitly stated that her Foundation could elevate Ruin and 8 other Sources of Chaos towards Extremity in a short period of time.","And it was truly living to this description as when Xiaomi cultivated near Noah who unearthed this foundation, it was stated that she would have an increased rate of progression of all her Boundaries linked to Sources of Chaos by 100,000% to 1,000,000%!","With no outside help, no absorption of Aeonic Treasures of Extremity...with nothing at all apart from the soul and comprehension of the existence holding it, the Innate Pellucid Hyperversal Extremity Foundation of Ruined Chaos took its holder towards Extremity with the fastest speed.","On the other hand, Noah only benefitted by 10,000% to 100,000% in the increased rate of progression by Cultivating near or with the Holder of the Unrecorded Innate Pellucid Hyperversal Extremity Foundation of Ruined Chaos.","He looked at the young Quasarian woman before him as he spoke calmly.","\"It is time to take you towards Extremity.\"","...!","Seconds ago, the Reified Wealdian Source of Oraculum had begun to see different versions of Unrecorded Histories playing out- moments after the creation of the Hyperversal Anomalous Virion!","One of them related to this unique existence before him with a constitution that guaranteed her Extremity at the fastest possible pace.","It showed that depending on the results of the Hyperversal Anomalous Virion, Noah could gain something significant enough to further propel himself towards Extremity...but also significant enough to be given to Xiaomi as with her disposition, Extremity would be within her grasp in a matter of days!","She would be the first existence to gain the authority of a Hyperversal Extremity in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","And through her, Noah would experience the ascension of a concept towards Extremity and the subtle changes it brought!","Through her, Oraculum felt an inkling of Noah's own progression towards Extremity near instead of a hazy light of uncertainty on whether it would take weeks or months!"]},{"number":2650,"title":"Chapter 2650: Chapter 2649 Change in the Vacuous Domains! I","paragraphs":["Extremity was not so hazy anymore.","There was an idea of how far it could be as Noah rushed towards it with even more fervor!","Different parts of him were doing many different things- and each of them were geared towards Extremity as Noah waited for it all to fall into place.","And at this time, another one of his bodies was coming across something utterly critical!","It was a body that had been in the Haven of Penumbra when the Avernus Clan attacked the Cult of Endless Shadows, and in the face of Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities, it had entered the Vacuous Hyperversal Domain Rifts that were called forth by the Domain Expansion of Indefatigable Quintessence!","He had entered the Vacuous Hyperversal Domains with his Reified Source of Quintessence- the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity.","And during this whole passage of time- or truly non-passage of time, this body has come across exactly what it was in.","Nothing.","To the senses of this body, time did not exist as it was a truly mind-bending thing to experience with different parts of his soul both the passage of time and the absence of it!","In such a space, Noah's thoughts came and went as he pondered on Quintessence.","As he pondered on Infinity!","He continued to move across the Vacuous Hyperversal Domains as soon enough, he had adorned the Vacuous Havenly I Entity Form that was accessible after the First Vacuous Awakening.","And the form was an astonishing one.","His body had enlarged to a Titanic size as he became a thousand miles in length, which paled in comparison to Major Worlds, much less Cosmos or Realities in size- but it seemed like the base size of a Vacuous Havenly 1 Entity.","His body retained its humanoid stature, but his feet turned into obsidian hooves that pulsed with Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.","His upper body showed a stellar obsidian existence whose makeup was the very Vacuous Hyperversal Authority itself, with a forged eight-pack being laid bare to all as above the muscular chest was a head that was adorned by nine horns rising in a circular fashion!","The horns converged at the top to reveal burning flames of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.","His face carried magnetic devilish charm, his eyes seeming like endless swirls that would devour everything as the authority of [Hyperversal I Assimilation] was fully displayed by this form!","[Vacuous Havenly I Entity]:: A state of existence you can call upon that grants you a body uniquely yours, and yet aligning with the forms of the Vacuous Lineages stretched out across the Vacuous Hyperversal Domains. It can display the authority of Hyperversal I Assimilation with utmost ease as any part of your body is capable of absorbing essence, authority, resources, and any entities you come across to assimilate them into a Source Authority that can be applied to any part of your existence. Being in this form while within the Vacuous Hyperversal Domains will allow you to absorb Vacuous Hyperversal Authority freely and cycle it across your existence in order to achieve even more purity. This form is still juvenile as only when you attain the Vacuous Havenly II Entity form will you be granted access to a transformation that will greatly alter the power you can display...","Basically, he gained the identity of what the inhabitants of the Seven Havens called Vacuous Malignancies.","And with such a form, he moved across swathes of nothingness.","Only endless waves of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority surged around him as his body innately took it and cycled it across his existence, his soul continuing to experience elevation and strengthening!","And he floated in such an environment for what seemed like millions of years until...","\"Hmm?\"","His will caught something.","It wasn't signs of life or anything like that, but the dense and overpowering appearance of even grander waves of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.","And it was stretching out for light years as it rapidly moved across nothingness- with Noah's eyes very quickly beginning to see outlines of Titanic figures crossing across the Vacuous Hyperversal Domains towards his right!","Each of them held different humanoid variations and statures, their bodies gloriously shining with an obsidian light as they radiated power and wonder!","The one thing was that...there were too many of them.","Noah saw the ones passing to his right as when his gaze peered deeper, he couldn't see the ends of their forces!","Among those passing, many turned their wills and eyes towards his direction before they continued forward, their figures moving across Vacuous Hyperversal Authority in a sort of tune and rhythm as it felt ancient.","As it felt like the beat of an ancient force moving since the beginning of nothingness!","The thousands passing nearest to Noah barely spared him a glance, and the only reason he even received any glances was due to his form of a Vacuous Havenly I Entity that was more distinguished than the masses of Vacuous Lineages passing beside him.","Such a scene continued as Noah counted hundreds of thousands of Entities passing with every passing moment, and an instant later...the voice of a Hyperversal Extremity thundered out.","[Soudeour...fall back into rank and continue the march. Even if you are distinguished, you will follow the March of the Commander Legeionnaire.]","...!","Even if he was distinguished.","Even if he had undergone his First Awakening!","He had to follow the Commander Legionnaire who led this Legion of Vacuous Lineages before him!","His gaze went to this Commander Legionnaire who actually had a small humanoid female figure, her skin shining with a stellar obsidian hue as she had nine horns twisted into a flaming vacuous crown of flames.","Dense waves of Hyperversal Extremity Authority emanated from her as at her words, Noah nodded sharply and floated to stand on the fringes of the passing Legion.","The Commander Legeionnaire snorted at his actions and floated above others who moved in a single plane, her gaze overseeing this region as a distance away, another Hyperversal Extremity floated above another legion...and the deeper into Legions of Vacuous Malignancies Noah gazed into, the more Hyperversal Extremities he could see as above those moving in a single file, there were thousands of Extremities floating above them as each one held an aura more terrifying than the other!"]},{"number":2651,"title":"Chapter 2651: Chapter 2650 Change in the Vacuous Domains! II","paragraphs":["Noah had actually come across the fringes of Legions of Vacuous Malignancies as they were marching.","Just with his perception, he could feel billions of Apex Vacuous Malignancies stretched out in countless legions as this...was just what he could see.","The clusters and forces of Vacuous Malignancies continued to spread out even further than where his will could currently cover on this domain of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority as there were likely billions more there.","And since Noah was on the fringes of these vast legions...he was seeing their weaker forces now as towards its center and forefront should be maddeningly powerful existences!","As he joined the ranks of the Apex Vacuous Legionnaires, the ones he came across uniquely made space for him after gazing at his body that gave off a calm glow of power.","Noah's Vacuous Havenly I Entity Form held a status among others as one who had achieved their First Vacuous Awakening, and his figure saw the treatment in status as he was able to pull in deeper into the Legions until he came across another existence giving off a similar glow to him.","Others like them seemed to be stretched out from here in larger numbers as Noah stopped going inward when he arrived at this position, joining the march as the Vacuous Malignancy that had achieved their First Vacuous Awakening gazed towards him with eyes of power and brutality as he spoke.","\"Did you get cold feet, Comrade? Why fall out of ranks for such a Holy Mission?\"","The words were carefree as if one family member was talking to another, with Noah's bright eyes showing annoyance as he harrumphed and replied.","\"I'm lazy by nature, I just don't understand...why now?\"","Why now?","Why were endless legions of Vacuous Malignancies marching?","Noah didn't have to wonder where these endless legions of Vacuous Malignancies were marching towards.","He could feel the direction they barreled towards as the other parts of his soul were moving within those lands freely.","The place where he could feel the tug of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority.","The endless legions of Vacuous Malignancies were marching towards the Seven Havens of Extremity!","\"Why now? The passed word from the Commander Legionnaires is that something happened within the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains. Something significant enough to spread their forces and spur us to move in a way we never have before. Even if you are lazy, this is a time for glory, Comrade. Imagine ripping into the soul of an Extremity who cannot defend against Vacuous Hyperversal Authority...imagine assimilating their soul onto your own concepts. By devouring and assimilating a single one, Extremity arrives right at your doorstep!\"","WAA!","Something significant had occurred within the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains!","The Vacuous Lineages knew full well what was happening within the Seven Havens as the Culmination Step of Dissolution was a match that had triggered too many things.","As Noah thought of this, his eyes radiated immense brightness as the Apex Vacuous Legionnaire beside him laughed.","\"Bahaha, I see that hungry light in your eyes. Be patient, Comrade...for we are close. I am Igor, you are?\"","Igor was a burly humanoid Apex Vacuous Lifeform, his body built like stones as his face had eyes aflame with obsidian light that formed complex tattoos across his whole body- his whole figure seemingly set aflame.","Noah looked at such a being as after an instant of pondering, he smiled while replying gloriously.","\"Aleksandr, comrade. I am Aleksandr!\"","Noah hit it off with another Vacuous Havenly I Entity as he talked freely to obtain more information, an ancient rhythm coursing through the Legions around him as they matched forward with purpose!","They didn't consider themselves Vacuous Malignancies just like those from the Seven Havens didn't consider themselves Vitalis Malignancies.","And yet both sides called each other Malignancies who wanted to spread their cancerous authorities into the other's homes.","Both sides thought they were fighting a holy war to save their dominion and home from extinction!","Amongst the Vacuous Lineages, Awakenings were widespread and greatly supported, with institutions built within the Vacuous Hyperversal Domains that directed and taught newly born Vacuous Lifeforms towards Vacuous Awakening.","Those talented enough like Igor and many more would achieve it even before grasping Extremity, with the only possibility for the Second Vacuous Awakening truly only rising after one became a Hyperversal Extremity.","As for the Third Vacuous Awakening? It was too far for many Extremities to even dream of!","Waves of such information entered Noah's mind as with the absence of time, it wasn't entirely clear whether they had quickly arrived and taken a long period of time to do so, but the endless nothingness all around them began to change.","The Legions stopped moving.","Because ahead of them, in the midst of all of this darkness and emptiness...","The allure of a blinding white light could be seen as even getting near it for most Vacuous Malignancies was unbearable!","OOOM!","The rhythm of the Legions reached a crescendo as they stayed far in the distance.","Their glare towards the blinding white light far ahead was sharp, with perceptive existences being able to appreciate that as the obsidian of Vacuous and the transparent white of Vitalis neared each other, a hazy field of misty gray light was formed in between as the two authorities seemed to dim when they got close to each other!","But one thing was clear.","The transparent white light of Vitalis was ever radiant as more of it blared out with glory, with Vacuous not even coming close as left and right....the ends of the transparent white light couldn't be seen.","And similarly, the ends of the obsidian Vacuous Hyperversal Domains also couldn't be seen as it felt like two endlessly vast walls trying to encroach on each other in a constant and endless battle that would never end!","Vitalis was more potent and powerful as it reigned in Vacuous.","And yet Vacuous was vastly grander in quantity as even though the transparent white domain seemed endless all around, it stretched towards an illusory horizon and seemed to make a turn.","The Vacuous Hyperversal Domains were much larger and vaster than the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains.","And on this day, after countless past skirmishes and battles...an untold number of Legions of Vacuous Lineages were knocking on the door of Vitalis!"]},{"number":2652,"title":"Chapter 2652: Chapter 2651 Two Sides Seeking Destruction! I","paragraphs":["The scene was an ecstatic one.","Endless swathes of Legions of Vacuous Lifeforms stared at the distant lands of Vitalis as they did not enter the grayish region of contention between the two authorities yet.","They were still within the folds of the light of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority as the stopped Legions felt a wave of Hyperversal Extremity Authority wash over them from above, their Commander Legionnaires beginning to speak as each one emanated a wave of valor and anger that only their region could hear!","[Before you lies the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains...a cancerous thing that has been spreading its light into our homes and eradicating our very existence everywhere it spreads. Just imagine if this cancerous thing is successful, imagine if its light that burns us for merely existing covers all of the Vacuous Hyperversal Domains!]","Dangerous words echoed out as the faces of all Apex Vacuous Lineages became stern.","If everything was covered by the light of Vitalis...would they all be dead?","Only those capable of withstanding Vitalis Hyperversal Authority would remain alive as their Lineages would all face extinction!","[That is how dangerous and of utmost importance our holy mission is.]","The voice of the Hyperversal Extremity echoed out as Noah saw her pass over their bodies, her visage brimming with immense battle power as truly...she and all others here believed that they were fighting for their home and livelihood.","[With every passing moment, Vitalis spreads its horrific light of extinction. With every passing moment, Vitalis brings into our folds the constraints of the very reality and time. This is why we're here.]","Her gaze became forlorn as her words were filled with unprecedented emotion.","[We...are here to fight for our very right to exist before such a choice is taken away from us!]","...!","OOOOH!","A clamor and heavy waves of agreement erupted out from the Apex Vacuous Lineages in this region, and those stretched out across the Legions where thousands of other Hyperversal Extremities gave similar speeches!","Noah listened to such a speech with a smile as he looked at the perspective of the Vacuous Lineages.","Did they truly have an argument and fair reasoning to do what they were doing? And in this fight where Vitalis Hyperversal Authority was poisonous to them where they had to fight it the whole time...just how would they invade the Seven Havens?","HOONG!","As if to answer Noah's question.","As if to let the blinding radiance in the distance know they were coming!","From the depths of Legions of Vacuous Lineages, blinding obsidian light erupted out as the Hyperversal Extremity above spoke out with even more emotion and reverence!","[To achieve our purpose of protecting our home, our Holy Champions have sacrificed their very existence to bring forth the tools to fight against our enemies...the Hyperversal Savior's Ark!]","...!","An unprecedented feeling of power and glory rose as Noah turned his will towards the depths of the countless Vacuous Lifeforms.","There, a unique aura rose as nine crystalline obsidian wheels could be seen, these wheels making up the backbone of a massive construct that overshadowed hundreds of Legions below it.","The circular rings of these wheels were spinning in the same vector as at their very center, one could shockingly see the visage of a Tier 3 Hyperversal Vacuous Extremity with their arms and legs tucked into their body in a fetal position, a bubble of obsidian light surrounding them as the moment the 9 wheels began spinning, a light of authority began to be drawn from the bubble of light at the very center!","This caused this construct called the Hyperversal Savior's Ark to light up brightly as a moment later, an expansive and wide domain of light spread from it and covered Legions led by hundreds of Extremities.","In the distance, similar Hyperversal Savior's Arks also rose as when they began to spin and draw from the authority of the Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity at their very center, a wide domain expanded outwards to cover everything as after a short period of time...Noah was able to utilize his authority to discern what he was looking at!","[Hyperversal Savior's Ark]:: A Construct of Extremity born with the fusion of 50% of the Aspects of Existence of a Hyperversal Extremity who has undergone their Second Vacuous Awakening and holds Innate Vacuous Hyperversal Meiridans. It allows for a Vacuous Savior's Field of Benevolence to be released once activated- forming a domain that rejects Vitalis Hyperversal Authority and can block off basic attacks containing Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity Authority. The domain will continue to be maintained for as long as the Soul of the Hyperversal Extremity at the very center can continue providing the required expenditure. The longer and more frequently this Hyperversal Savior's Ark is utilized, the faster the soul of the Hyperversal Extremity at the very center will be fused with the construct until they become one with it...","...!","An utterly terrifying Construct of Extremity rose as Noah gazed towards it with surprise!","[Remain within the Light of the Savior's Ark and take down our enemies from within it. Follow the lead of your Commander Legionnaires and we shall have our salvation!]","As she spoke, her figure entered the depths of the Hyperversal Savior's Ark, floating right outside the spinning 9 wheels of this construct as 99 other Hyperversal Extremities floated over from different directions to protectively surround the rings of the Hyperversal Savior's Ark.","Thereafter, the millions of Apex Vacuous Lifeforms who were under the banner of the 100 Hyperversal Extremities that had entered the Hyperversal Savior's Ark also surged over into the expansive Vacuous Savior's Field of Benevolence, the Legion Noah was in doing the same as within moments, he also appeared within the expanded field of the fantastical Construct of Extremity!","[You have entered the Vacuous Savior's Field of Benevolence.]","[All abilities relating to Vacuous Hyperversal Authority are granted a 50% Boost within the bounds of this field.]","[Any existences that die from the attacks of enemies within the Vacuous Savior's Field of Benevolence will have 50% of their Existence devoured as fuel for the Hyperversal Savior's Ark.]","[If you die within an hour of being within the Vacuous Savior's Field of Benevolence, your dying Aspects of Existence will be recalled into the Hyperversal Savior's Ark to be used as fuel.]","...!"]},{"number":2653,"title":"Chapter 2653: Chapter 2652 Two Sides Seeking Destruction! II","paragraphs":["100 Hyperversal Extremities entered a Hyperversal Savior's Ark as approximately 100 Million Apex Vacuous Lifeforms followed them, every single one contained in the massive Vacuous Savior's Field of Benevolence released by this Ark as thereafter...its nine crystalline obsidian wheels radiated ancientness and power as it began to move forward!","Those within faced a profound sensation where they felt as if their bodies were anchored into the Vacuous Savior's Field of Benevolence and moving along with it, never having to worry about somehow being taken out of its domain.","In other regions, other Hyperversal Savior's Arks also became filled with Hyperversal Extremities that protected its core all around, 100 Million Apex Vacuous Lifeforms also filling every other Ark.","The Legions were in abundance, and the Hyperversal Savior's Arks were more so.","Just with what Noah's senses could perceive, over a hundred Hyperversal Savior's Arks had risen and began to move towards the gray region between Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities.","That was 10,000 Hyperversal Extremities, and over 10 Billion Apex Vacuous Lifeforms alone!","It was a grand show of power that showed the utmost seriousness of this venture was as even this number...was not the highest.","There were other Hyperversal Savior's Arks Noah could barely discern in the far distance!","They all barreled forth as while wrapped up in an Ark himself, Noah had a myriad of choices opening up before him.","Wars...were frankly where he benefited the most.","His power rose the quickest and highest during times of conflict as the conflict unfolding before him was one of utmost severity.","It involved too much history and too many things as how should he personally navigate it?","He had bodies within Vitalis, and he had his Quintessential Emperor of Extremity within the Vacuous forces.","The Vacuous Lineages were fighting for their home and very existence, and the Vitalis Lineages were doing the same!","There were many paths he could take.","And some...held much, much greater possibilities of Loot compared to others!","With the Hyperversal Anomalous Virion he had just designed and yet to utilize, the recent developments were about to provide a chaotic battlefield where utilizing such a thing was going to be the most opportune path.","He closed his eyes.","He felt the movement of the Hyperversal Savior's Ark carrying him and millions of other Apex Vacuous Lifeforms towards Vitalis.","The golden light of Oraculum was veiled deep within as possible Unrecorded Histories tried to be unearthed!","—","Towards the center of the endless forces of Vacuous Lineages now entering Hyperversal Savior's Arks.","An entity shrouded in darkness was surrounded by Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities held 10 floating miniaturized Hyperversal Savior's Arks above his palm as his gaze was far-reaching.","He gazed towards the radiant light of Vitalis in the far distance as he voiced out grandly.","[Little Svetlana...we haven't heard from you since you became an Adjudicator of a Haven. Are you and the other Champions going to be ready to move when you are called upon? Will you be ready to sacrifice?]","WAA!","The words were filled with a brutal light of power that seemed to buzz at the very Zenith of Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity!","The light was one of maddening grandeur as it pierced across the veils of nothingness and Vitalis to flash far in the distance.","In the region surrounded by a transparent white glow.","A dull glow of Vitalis covered everything around here as in one region, a golden platform floated into the grayish domain where Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities clashed.","The golden platform was light years in size as it was filled with auras of existences, and towards the very center of it...a prominent aura of a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity could be felt!","An aura that was blazing brightly at this moment as it spoke to the Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities around it.","[Let all branches and forces of the Senatus of Extremity know to send as many forces back as possible. To even return some of those who delved into the Supernal Havens of Extremity...otherwise we may not have a Haven to protect.]","His words were terrifying ones as the Extremities around him moved rapidly, their wills seeing the heavy and overpowering aura of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority coming from the distance!","A woman clad with silver hair nodded with a heavy expression as she replied.","[Yes, Esteemed Cornelius!]","On the body of the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity that was addressed as Great Cornelius, tendrils of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority moved with pristine control as this was a being that had undergone his Second Vitalis Awakening!","His body was pushing with a metalloid Armament of Extremity in the form of a full body armor, his two hands also grasping an ancient saber and sword that also radiated the aura of Armaments of Extremity!","Such a being had eyes shining with a light of power as he turned towards a certain direction where amidst the scrambling Extremities, one being with a white rob, caramel-colored skin, and a sword on his back sat down calmly while gazing at the spinning 9 ringed constructs light years away.","[Shao...we could use your main body here. One of you will be capable of filling up the battle power of more than a hundred Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities.]","...!","The words were directed to Emperor Shao whose visage pulsed with silent glory, but he shook his head calmly as he replied to the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity.","[I waited for the Supernal Havens of Extremity to open and undergo my Awakenings successively. My main body is at a critical moment currently as it cannot come. And these Vacuous Lifeforms...will not be throwing everything they have at once. They will probe and see just to what extent we can defend ourselves. They will wait to see the extent of the forces that will come from the Supernal Havens. Their spies within our lands are working hard, but even they didn't have access to the Supernal Havens until now. Only after they see the extent of all the forces of Vitalis will they throw everything they have. Until then...there is time.]","The words were filled with utmost certainty and confidence as Esteemed Cornelius calmly received them while shaking his head!","[Even we do not know the extent of their power. But since they were the ones chosen to bask in grander concentrations of Vitalis...they should have triple or quadruple what we have amassed over the years. Thadeus has gone into the Supernal Havens to represent the Senatus of Extremity and communicate with their leadership as we will know soon enough.]","...!","The two beings exchanged words as Extremities scrambled around them, billions of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms stretched out across this Golden platform that was known as the Third Bastion of Vitalis pulsing with power and getting ready for what was to come!","Around the radiant light of Vitalis, many other Bastions of Vitalis were stretched throughout as the entities here all had the same thought- to defend their home.","Two sides.","Both of them sought to defend their livelihood.","Both sides...sought the destruction of the other as the ultimate solution to prevent their extinction!"]},{"number":2654,"title":"Chapter 2654: Chapter 2653 17th Layer! I","paragraphs":["In the gray region where Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities clashed.","Space was distorted as even though this area seemed calm, it was akin to the eye of the storm when one was actually within it.","Reality constantly twisted and folded as Vitalis established it, while Vacuous eradicated it.","The whole region was a source of immense entropy and disharmony as any being below the stage of a peak Apex Aeonic Lifeform would likely be shredded out of existence just by being in such a space.","And within such a region...a woman with dark hair and pristinely azure eyes floated in a sitting position as the chaos around her twisted and reflected only other sources of chaos, her figure becoming veiled amidst all of this disorder as very few beings could actually find her!","She went by multiple monikers, but she was most well known as the Extremity of Chaos.","A being who thrived and grew stronger from the ever-increasing entropy and chaos!","At this moment, her gaze shifted between the far away Hyperversal Savior's Arks and the Bastions of Vitalis standing on opposite sides.","Both sides would soon begin clashing as from it, even more chaos would bloom.","[But just because there is more chaos, it does not necessarily translate to more power.]","Her voice was one that only she could hear as she spoke with a pondering mood!","The connection between a concept and Extremity as just because a certain concept was a truth of unfolding reality- it did not mean one was guaranteed to ascend to a shocking peak with it!","A more recent example was Destruction.","Someone she was connected to as his concept was one that defined something constantly occurring day in and day out.","He should have quickly attained Zenith Tier 3 and gone to become a pillar of support as a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity, and yet he actually regressed to Tier 2.","Within Extremity, nothing was guaranteed.","The concept had to be great, yes...but one also had to move properly if they wanted to raise their Concept past the Gradations of Extremity!","This was why for this coming conflict and chaos...","[I hold no allegiances.]","WAA!","The Extremity of Chaos spoke to herself as she made a shocking choice.","[Whoever the victor is matters not...as I will only follow chaos to the very end.]","...!","The moment she made this choice, her restrained aura that had profoundly stood at Zenith Tier 3 began to warp and distort as...it began to edge upwards ever so slowly.","Renowned geniuses of the current eon like her made their choices.","Each one held their own dreams of Extremity and what they wanted at the end of it all, with nobody being the wiser on whether they would actually be able to attain what they wanted at the very end!","The only thing that could be said for certain...was that their choices would either take them where they sought to go, or they would be the exact reason for their downfall.","—","In the Nether Haven of Dissolution, the visage of Alexander King- Noah's Vitalistic Clone, had the Curagulus Mask adorned as the display of this glorious relic flashed speedily and with warnings, everything else being pushed aside as a single blaring task took the spotlight.","[Crimson Tier Mission]:: Support, Defend, and Destroy- Aid in stopping the advancement of the Vacuous Malignancies that have appeared with swathes of their Legions around the Seven Havens of Extremity. Every Apex Vacuous Malignancy or Vacuous Hyperversal Extremity Malignancy killed with be recorded as an Achievement Point, with accumulated points capable of being exchanged in real time For Hyperversal Treasures of Extremity, Armaments of Extremity, and anything else within the Vaults of Curagulus. Guardians wishing to participate in this mission will be guided to specific coordinates within every Haven where a Tier 3 Guardian will be waiting and departing every hour to bring forces towards the Bastions of Vitalis outside of the Seven Havens of Extremity....","Missions relating to the recent appearing legions of Vacuous Lineages began to bloom en masse as in addition to the main one, there were other missions dealing with reconnaissance of the enemy lines, obtaining information regarding the circular vessels that had appeared, and any useful energy from the enemy side that could be beneficial in the future to come!","Noah looked at the many missions through the eyes of Alexander as he accepted all of them, his gaze flickering with unknown thoughts as he began to head towards the specified location within Dissolution where a Guardian of Extremity would be transporting all Apex Guardians towards the Bastions of Extremity.","He needed a great deal of resources- much more than others due to the path he walked on.","The only reason he kept the pace of his rapid progression was his continued acquiring of loot through enemies and his ridiculously established foundation.","But while other beings going towards Extremity had a single concept to support, Noah had dozens!","While it was immensely difficult for others to cross from the 17th Boundary Layer and into the 18th Layer to attain Extremity, it was almost an impossibility for Noah.","Because the moment he did, it was equivalent to taking 80 other concepts to also achieve Extremity.","An impossibility.","Yet Noah dealt with making the impossible happen as if it were normal!","His foundation guaranteed this. His Origin deemed it...and Quintessence would assure it!","So he continued to seek more resources and open pathways even while concurrently walking on multiple other paths.","As Alexander crossed Dissolution, his gaze turned towards the risen Extremity Vein as he could see the burning authorities of Helios and Genesis at this very moment along with the other Havens.","In the aforementioned Havens, two of his bodies had arrived at the prizes of two paths as Noah sought to use the rewards of these unfolding Histories to break past another Wall that took others years.","The first path to progress first was in the Aeonic Haven of Helios.","At the entrance of the Infinite Oni Haven.","Three beings stood on the doors of a Haven where an Armament of Extremity was being born!"]},{"number":2655,"title":"Chapter 2655: Chapter 2654 17th Layer! II","paragraphs":["In front of the crimson portal of the Infinite Oni Haven- standing beside the figures of Noah and Ayame, the gaze of a Hyperversal Extremity changed as he cursed while throwing a crimson medallion towards Ayame.","[Infinite Balor will stand guard here while you guide him in...it seems something even more pressing has happened!]","The Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity about to enter with them into the Infinite Oni Haven that held an Armament of Extremity being born quickly left as only a single aura of Hyperversal Extremity remained in this region!","Ayame blinked sternly as they had already been delayed in entering when the Extremity Vein rose and the Culmination Step began, where after they gained Entry and began slowly exploring the Supernal Haven of Dissolution, things were back on track.","Now...what had happened?","Her eyes flickered as she read the uncertainty and chaos spreading within the Aeonic Annals of Extremity, her gaze becoming increasingly stern as she took light steps towards the portal while Noah followed along.","Attaining more strength and completing promises came first.","The medallion in her hands shone as an authority wrapped around her and Noah, the two of them disappeared into a wormhole and passed through layers of twisted space to finally arrive in a reality of utmost serenity and grandeur.","The skies were tinted with a crimson light as all around them, the peaks of mountainous horns seemed to be facing each other and pointing towards a central location in the whole Haven.","The skies and earth were all littered with mountain-like horns light years in size as their tips shone with the iridescent glow of billions of suns, golden liquid constantly dripping from them as shockingly...Noah felt traces of abundant authority of Helios from it!","Tendrils of this extremely scorching golden liquid twirled from the many massive mountain peaks and went towards the massive Singularity in the center of it all where Noah could barely make out....a Bow.","\"Very few Armaments of Extremity require three Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity to guard it, much less one that hasn't been fully born. And yet our Infinite Extremity kept such guard over this one until now because in this unique Haven...threads of Helios with higher potency than within any other region of the entire Havens gather. They gather as tendrils of their authority are constantly being devoured by the Armament of Extremity, allowing it to express a semblance of Infinity in the Aspect of Heat. This is what I seek...\"","As she spoke, the aura around Ayame subtly changed as it had been the past few minutes, her body radiating authorities of Boundaries at the 13th Layer in one moment as now, she radiated immense heat of the 14th Layer!","This was due to her main body that had just entered the Supernal Haven of Dissolution with the Extremities of her Infinite Extremity devouring the resources accumulated by this major Inheritance and set aside just for her similar to Erikson!","Her power was rising in real time as her entering this Haven again after stepping to become an Apex Aeonic Lifeform with an Extremity Foundation was meant to be her rebirth as well.","She had grand designs to bypass hundreds or thousands of years worth of work by assimilating the Hyperversal Extremity Treasures from her Inheritance, and refining it all and stabilizing her foundation with the pressure of the Armament of Extremity being born here.","The pressure the both of them currently withstood was immense as the Armament of Extremity neared completion, Ayame feeling the stifling heat and being able to handle it as when she turned towards Noah...","...!","Her eyes opened wide as she saw his body had already turned a shade of crimson gold light as a mountain peak near them releasing the scorching golden liquid that was flowing towards the Armament of Extremity...it had suddenly changed directions to come towards Noah's body!","And before his eyes, waves of prompts rose.","[The Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage is reacting to the potent Authority of another Havenly Authority.]","In his Aspects of Existence connected to his main body, the Vitalis Hyperversal Authority flowing within his body buzzed along with the Havenly Boundary of Dissolution.","Another function of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage unveiled itself as at this time, it felt the extremely potent waves of Helios and began to draw them into Noah's body naturally!","Prior to this, he would need to go to the other Supernal Havens of Extremity to attain an Entry Albatross of their specific authority to begin stepping on its path towards Extremity.","But now it seemed that with his Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage, so long as he was in a region that had enough potent Havenly Authority...the dense Vitalis and already attained Havenly Authority within his Aspects of Existence would draw in the other Havenly Authorities!","BZZT!","The tendrils of extremely scorching golden liquid entered his body as they turned to ash the clothes he was adorned in, his glorious figure blazing with golden light and becoming laid bare as the potent scorching liquid was taken across his Aspects of Existence and into his main body.","Very quickly, the distinction of [HELIOS] began to form in his soul in an astonishing turn of events.","The Vitalis Hyperversal Authority is his body became extremely active as it seemed intent on making many impossible things a reality.","And Quintessence took the wheel as within moments...","[The 1st Havenly Boundary Layer of Helios has been attained.]","[An authority connecting to the very Vitalis Havens of Extremity!]","[The Authority of Helios has been subtly altered by Quintessence.]","Scorching golden light of utmost heat and purity.","It rose within his soul and caused everything to heat up as Noah's mind pulsed with possibilities.","'Vitalis and the Havenly Authorities share an intricate connection...'","Above the Archipelagos of the Supernal Haven of Dissolution, Vitalis mixed with Dissolution to bring forth a myriad of Havenly Treasures that could only be obtained by Havenly Aurora...something that was also made up of streams of Vitalis and Dissolution.","Even at this moment, within Noah's Fifth Aletheian Haven, Vitalis and Dissolution were mixing to produce Havenly Treasures within his Origin!","Now, his Bloodline that was filled with Vitalis Hyperversal Authority attracted the Havenly Authority of Helios as the moment it began blooming in his Aspects of Existence...tendrils of it also flowed towards his Origin.","They seamlessly and without rejection flowed towards the Singularity at the peak of the Fifth Aletheian Haven where Vitalis and Dissolution were already mixing.","BZZT!","And a profound radiance shone at its inclusion as Noah's thoughts were further affirmed at this scene!","'What will occur if all Seven Havenly Authorities are freely flowing in my body?'","A daring thought.","A thought that asked what possibilities lay if Noah followed this path to do something phenomenal!"]},{"number":2656,"title":"Chapter 2656: Chapter 2655 17th Layer! III","paragraphs":["[The 2nd Havenly Boundary Layer of Helios has been attained.]","[The 3rd Havenly Boundary Layer of Helios has been attained.]","The scene was one of brilliance!","The mountain-like horns that were coursing with the Authority of Helios nearby altered their path as instead of flowing their scorching golden liquid filled with the authority of Helios towards the incandescent flaming bow towards the center of this Haven, they were pulled towards Noah.","His fair skin was tinged with crimson gold flaming light as he seemed like a living furnace, Ayame watching this scene with complex emotions as her face hardened soon after.","She was also here for a reason.","She was Ascending across the Boundary Layers at a fast pace due to her Inheritance's resources, and she had to cement the boundaries as truly her Records!","Beside her was an entity of unfathomable brilliance and genius, but she wouldn't simply gape in shock at his actions as moments later, she continued on her own path as she began floating towards the flaming bow in the distance.","It was so excruciatingly hot that even from afar, she had already grasped its record as it tried to melt everything around it.","[The Hyperversal Bow of Helios]","That was its distinction.","That was how immense of a treasure this was!","Just as Ayame began taking her first steps towards it, Noah's body also floated forward as if it was being pulled- the pace forward much faster as the closer he went towards the Armament of Extremity, the more scorching the authority of Helios was and the close he went towards the other mountain peaks that instantly had their crimson gold liquid diverted towards him.","And with this, his progression only became more insane as Helios was quite literally branded into his soul, Noah already taking measures to have it placed in his Extremity Meridians as the moment he did so...","BOOM!","The eruption of it cascading past the Boundary Layers caused his soul to feel even hunger for Helios, the body of his clone in the Infinite Oni Haven turning into an abyss that swallowed every nearby shred of crimson gold light.","[The 14th Havenly Boundary Layer of Helios has been attained.]","[The 15th Havenly Boundary Layer of Helios has been attained.]","...!","The Havenly Boundary Layers of Helios continued to be scaled just like Dissolution.","His bodies were undergoing massive transformations during this process, but Noah's soul was calmly analyzing all of these changes as his will gazed at the pure, dense, and concentrated waves of Helios in the Infinite Oni Haven.","Even though his body here was swallowing everything nearby, the total concentration of the dense authority of Helios in this Haven had barely reduced by .1%.","The waves of Helios were never-ending in this Haven that had been accumulating them for billions of years until a singularity of an Armament of Extremity was forced to be born.","As he looked at such a treasured Haven under the control of Infinite Extremity...","'Let's put all of this authority to use...'","His will domineeringly did want to put to waste such a dense and pure concentration of Helios.","So amidst the rising of the Havenly Boundary of Helios...he focused on his Origin as officially, another singularity bloomed in the Fifth Aletheian Haven of Extremity","[The Source of a New Haven has emerged in your Origin.]","Firefly shining with a crimson gold light and radiating immense heat.","[The Haven of Helios has been born in your Origin.]","The Haven of Helios came to be as raising it, Noah would need many Treasures and Loot like Epione's Golden Realm Blessing.","But since he had access to a rich and pure source of Helios preserved and collected in a Haven for an unknown number of years...","BOOOM!","His body exploded with an even greater explosive force as his Origin hungrily called in pure waves of Helios.","The newly born Haven of Helios exploded as a Singularity as trillions of Hyperversal Quintessential Royal Cosmos bloomed in addition to an ever expanding landmass!","And as a consequence, even more waves of Helios joined Dissolution towards the spinning singularity where Vitalis Hyperversal Authority was flowing in for the purpose of forging Hyperversal Extremity Treasures.","[A new Havenly Authority is contributing to the feature of Hyperversal Extremity Treasure Generation above the Fifth Aletheian Haven!]","[Two Hyperversal Extremity Treasures can now be forged within 24 hours.]","[The Quality and Quantity of possible Hyperversal Extremity Treasures that can be generated is gradually increasing.]","His Origin soon became paired crimson gold as he sought a single goal while feeling the seas of pure Authority of Helios flowing into him through his clone in the Infinite Oni Haven.","'Why didn't we go for the completion of the Fifth Aletheian Haven by devouring everything here?'","...!","His eyes shone with tyranny at such a thought!","It would mean that a majority of the Fifth Aletheian Haven would be covered by Helios.","It would create an unstable structure for now, but the concentration and proportion of Havens could always be organized later.","A chance like this to be in a Haven guarded by one of the more powerful Major Inheritances may not come again!","And so, Noah would make the best use of it.","—","In another Haven entirely, there was yet another one of Noah's clones who was given the opportunity to experience an Armament of Extremity.","Within the lands of the Sima Clan in the Haven of Genesis, Noah was led through the Ancestral Hall of Sima as the stout Extremity Clone of the terrifying existence known as the Iron Fist led him and Erikson into the Planar Vault holding an Armament of Extremity!","His gaze was currently dark as he spoke.","[Vacuous Malignancies are making a move with a force they've never displayed before...troubled times of war are coming.]","His voice was filled with strength that shook the very air around them when he spoke, Erikson's expression hardening as the three of them arrived in front of a massive royal purple door!"]},{"number":2657,"title":"Chapter 2657: Chapter 2656 17th Layer! IV","paragraphs":["In the Ancestral Hall of the Sima Clan, there were many such doors like the one Noah stood in front of right now as one wouldn't know that past this one was a Planar Vault holding an Armament of Extremity!","Their arrival here was also masked by the news of the Legions of Vacuous Lineages appearing, with all of their three clones proceeding forward nonetheless as Erikson shook his head.","\"The Senatus must have planned for or at least expected something like this, right?\"","His eyes were deep as he looked at his father in the corner of his eyes, wanting to understand the larger picture that only a being like him knew as at his probings, the Hyperversal Extremity of Foundation actually let out a smile while opening the door ahead of them.","[There are always plans behind plans, and even more plans hidden behind what seems like complacency. You've seen the forces of the Senatus of Extremity and of the Clans and Inheritances moving about and being spurred by the Supernal Havens of Extremity, but...have you seen the Existences you've only heard legends about come out of the woodwork?]","WAA!","The existences whose feats and stories were etched across the Aeonic Annals of Extremity and even had their legends passed down over the eons!","Beings like the Extremity of Reality.","The Extremity of Madness.","The Extremity of Steel who designed 81 Armaments of Extremity that showed he had grasped Extremity in at the very least 81 concepts!","Where were these beings now?","Their legends were rarely heard of as had they perished in the river of time, or were they something the Havens of Extremity were keeping in a tight reserve for what was to come?","The words of the Extremity of Foundation caused many thoughts to bloom within Erikson and Noah as he laughed while the double doors closed behind them, the reality ahead of them brightening up as the scene was a unique one to see.","The whole space was bathed in a neon purple light with a heavy concentration that only pressed on one's body- where if they were too weak physically, they may just be ground down to dust!","[But don't think about all that and focus on elevating your own strength amidst this coming war. It will not end in a day as the stakes are much too high...and no side will reveal their strongest trump cards until they are sure the other side has nothing to counter it. Geniuses will rise, and even legends may fall. But at the end of the day...your own individual strength is what will matter the most. For now, see if the Iron Heart can help you temper your bodies.]","The Iron Heart!","The Extremity of Foundation spoke as he pointed in the far distance where one could see a massive full body armor floating and being the source that was radiating the intense neon purple light!","It emanated intense waves of a sensation Noah had continued to feel from Erikson's father who continued to introduce what he was seeing.","[It was an Armament forged with Foundation as its basis. If you can feel and absorb the pure waves of Foundation, you should be able to quickly pass through the initial layers. This...is the Armament I will be adorning soon when I am called to the front lines.]","The Iron Heart.","A defense type Armament of Extremity that covered an existence from head to toe, its crystalline purple visage making one thing it was the Armament of an Emperor ruling over celestial lands as it even had blazing purple metalloid wings behind it!","Noah already had the pure tendrils of Foundation enter his body the moment he arrived as Quintessence altered this concept ever so slightly, and he already stepped on its first layer.","This was shown by a dim purple light blooming from Noah that The Hyperversal Extremity of Foundation looked at with shining eyes while stroking his chin!","[Get as close to it as you can. The more pressure of the pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority you withstand, the more advanced you can make in Foundation. If you can hold on to it, you should be close to or at the 17th Layer. If you can actually equip it...you have achieved Extremity in Foundation!]","WAA!","The words of a Hyperversal Extremity were resonant as they foretold of many possibilities, but he left out that unless someone was already at the 17th Boundary Layer relating to their physical strength or foundation, it would be nearly an impossibility to actually arrive close to the Iron Heart...","For Noah, he had already touched an Armament of Extremity once before as another clone of his was making his way towards a Hyperversal Bow of Helios.","His steps were light as his already quintessential body floated ahead serenely- as if the pressures others would feel were absolutely nothing to him.","—","Quintessential.","This was truly the only word Noah could describe everything he was doing right now as many parts of him were spread out across the Havens and even outside of it, and each one had their own part to play that brought him ever closer towards Extremity.","Currently, his Main Body was...discussing Extremity with Xiaomi as with the collective boosts they had while dual cultivating with each other in addition to the increased rate of progression towards Extremity of his Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage, it felt like they were walking on a smooth path that only needed time and accomplishments to traverse as at the end of it, Extremity would be in their grasp!","His Main Body balanced everything occurring as the tendrils of Helios flowed into him and cycled with every Quintessential Breath, and now the concept of Foundation was doing the same.","From the first to the tenth boundary layer, the path was filled with ease as his clone delved ever closer to the Iron Heart in the Haven of Genesis!","Until...","[The 16th Boundary Layer of Foundation has been attained!]","[The 16th Boundary Layer of Helios has been attained!]","He came upon the door holding him from the 17th Boundary Layer.","And this time...there wasn't an Extremity to take the Armament of Extremity away from him before he achieved glory!"]},{"number":2658,"title":"Chapter 2658: Chapter 2657 17th Layer! V","paragraphs":["Extremity.","For some, it was a concept that was as far as their wildest dreams, while for others...it was but a certainty.","Noah was one of the few beings who inherently knew that for them, Extremity was a certainty. It was only a matter of when!","Erikson was another such being.","Ayame was one. Atlas was another!","There were a myriad more hidden across the Aeonic Annals of Extremity as they bid their time and worked away from the spotlight, with Hidden Inheritances that didn't involve themselves with the outside matters and only focused on Extremity.","There were Scions of destroyed and long-forgotten Clans carrying the last vestiges of their inheritance on their shoulders as they tried to re-elevate their people to their past heights.","There were many of them...but none were like Noah!","BOOOM!","His main body buzzed with such a stupendous level of glory that the figure of Xiaomi that he was discussing Extremity with under him felt an influx of torrential waves of pure Authority- some of this being Helios and the newly obtained Boundary of Foundation as in addition to this, the streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority within Noah were dancing wildly!","They seemed to resonate with the trace amounts of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority with Xiaomi's body who had attained the Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage as with such a catalyst...","The crimson light of Ruin around her body flourished like a blooming rosebud as her pupils became crimson Singularities of Chaos.","Within her body, the dense authorities of Chaos that were at the 16th Boundary Layer pulsed as from among them, Ruin took a step forward.","It blazed with ever-increasing brilliance and change as within Xiaomi's Aspects of Existence, the 17th Boundary Layer of Ruin was born!","Noah's eyes were luminous as bathed with the light of Quintessence, they could see every flow of authority within Xiaomi.","He saw the newly elevated authority of the 17th Boundary Layer of Ruin.","He saw...and then he pulled on it through their current connection as he breathed a Quintessential Breath.","And the authority of a newly risen 17th Boundary Layer of Ruin flowed into his body.","He took a step towards this door!","And he was ready to smash it down with a myriad of means as Xiaomi was one, and then there were his clones in the Havens of Genesis and Helios!","In the Infinite Oni Haven, Noah's body was akin to being the center of a spinning Abyssal singularity that devoured everything as seas of pure Helios Authority were flowing into him","Ayame was left far behind him with her eyes buzzing with disbelief as somehow, Noah had floated close to the Hyperversal Bow of Helios.","He withstood its pressure like it was nothing and appeared right in front of the pulsing Bow.","Touching it before attaining Extremity would scorch the records of average Apex Aeonic Lifeforms!","And yet at this moment...Noah's hand moved forward to at the very least come in contact with the scorching object that was already making his skin and skin tingle!","At the same time, under the visage of Erikson who shook his head while whispering 'Monster' under his breath with a light of competitiveness in his eyes, Noah also seamlessly traversed the seas of neon purple light to arrive at the Iron Heart.","His Foundation was already far exceeding even unique Apex Aeonic Lifeforms as the essence of Foundation hammering down and refining his body only made him stronger the closer he was.","And so he came close to it as his clone here also reached out to come in contact with this glorious full body armor.","Separated across reality, different parts of him coalesced with the same intent and goal at the same time as simultaneously, his two clones exceeded the terrifying pressure given off by two Armaments of Extremity and came in contact with them!","...!","'Hoo...'","His soul took a steady breath.","He felt the hard and indestructible metal of the Iron Heart.","He felt the unfinished product that was the Hyperversal Bow of Helios.","He only came in contact with them, and yet he could feel the intense and interminable Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority.","Vast seas of it surged into his body as this was his goal!","He felt how it was right before his grasp, and also so far away.","His heart thrummed in resonance as Foundation and Helios were taken in and cycled!","Simultaneously, Noah took a Quintessential Breath to experience a Boundary Layer he had yet to achieve from Xiaomi.","BZZT!","His body vibrated like a blooming celestial treasure as crimson gold light of Helios and the neon purple of Foundation built up in such a shocking level of concentration in his Aspects of Existence that with the sheer quantity and quality of these authorities paired with the burrowed authority of Ruin from Xiaomi...","CRACK!","A door was shattered.","Noah's heart was bright as his eyes radiated wonder when they watched the prompts arrive while his body further exploded with even grander waves of power!","[The 17th Boundary Layer of Foundation has been attained!]","[The 17th Boundary Layer of Helios has been attained!]","Ever so silently since the burst of the Boundary Layers of Helios and Foundation, Noah had already placed them in his Extremity Meridians.","Them taking the step to the 17th Boundary Layer meant that Quintessence, Infinity, Dissolution, Loot, Manadynamics, and many others also took this step along with them!","His Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridians deemed it so.","And due to this, his Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Values and all other Values began exploding upwards!","Austere waves of information emerged as the profound Layers of 81 Boundaries unveiled themselves before Noah.","Some granted Tens of Thousands of Hyperversal Values.","The 17th Boundary Layer of Blood alone granted an increase of 150,000 Quintessential Hyperversal Values!","The information of the 17th Boundary Layer of Dissolution, Helios, Foundation, and Infinity were just as astonishing if not more, but none of them compared to the waves of information that thundered in Noah's mind.","Information on Quintessence!","Its 17th Boundary Layer was so vast that its description was divided into two parts!"]},{"number":2659,"title":"Chapter 2659: Chapter 2658 17th Layer! VI","paragraphs":["The first half of the description of the Seventeenth Boundary Layer of Quintessence showed itself.","[[The Seventeenth Boundary Layer of Quintessence]:: You have traversed many layers to reach this stage as you are a step away from the Extremity of Quintessence. Extremity is a step that many beings never cross no matter the passage of time nor how many Treasures they consume if they do not represent what their chosen concept truly stands for. Quintessence relays to you that attaining Extremity for it and concepts like Infinity, Manadynamics, and many others you are expanding is much, much harder compared to what other Existences seek. The sheer weight of a single one of these concepts attaining Extremity is enough to make significant progress across the Gradations of Extremity as taking this last step may take you weeks or months. Such a passage of time to attain Extremity is not truly Quintessential and not befitting the weight of this concept. Quintessence lays out a maximum of 7 Days for you to achieve Extremity. If the last step is not taken within this period of time, the Extremity of Quintessence will forever be out of your grasp, no matter the means you take in terms of your Meridians, Origin, or Foundation...]]","\"...\"","Noah's eyes were sharp as he read half of the description of the 17th Boundary Layer of Quintessence.","It was supposed to grant him a stupendous Boundary Layer with resplendent reality altering possibilities, and yet it started with a warning!","Achieve Extremity within 7 days, or the Extremity in Quintessence will forever be out of his grasp.","This was a shocking reality, but it also showed how obscene this concept was.","His thoughts veered off to the idea of Dead Paths.","Concepts that were too grand that Existences who embarked on them only found nothingness at the very end.","A dead end as even if they achieved Extremity in other concepts, they could never achieve Extremity in a certain one!","Quintessence was considered a Dead Path to others whenever they heard this was something that Noah Osmont was expanding towards Extremity.","And how could it not be? If any normal genius was told that right after achieving the 17th Boundary Layer, they had to achieve Extremity within Seven Days...this would be akin to a death sentence for them!","Many beings were stuck on this stage for thousands or millions of years, with others never crossing it.","But Noah only had a smile on his face.","He ended the discussion of Extremity he was having with Xiaomi as waves of authority wrapped around her, her body floating away as she held a face of concentration to reign in the newly advanced 17th Boundary Layer of Ruin as well elevate the other Sources of Chaos within her.","Noah's visage became adorned in a regal white Emperor's Robe as he waved his hands to cause a blinding singularity of multicolored light to appear!","The reason for his smile.","The reason for his confidence even under the pressure of achieving Extremity within 7 days!","It was contained in the second half of the description of the 17th Boundary Layer of Quintessence!","[[...Of course, the 17th Boundary Layer of Quintessence shines with ever radiant glory as it illuminates the path towards Extremity, so long as you can correctly take hold of and utilize it. The 17th Layer opens the path of the Quintessential Hyperversal Sporos of Extremity- a tool that opens up multiple pathways of Extremity. Due to Quintessence, this tool was geared towards aiding you to achieve Extremity in the shortest possible time, with the Sporos of Extremity being capable of blooming into the Quintessential Hyperversal Ash Tree of Gradation when it has been cultivated to maturity. To bring a Sporos of Extremity to maturity, tremendous amounts of Loot Light, Relics, Armaments, Vitalis Hyperversal Authority, Vacuous Hyperversal Authority, Havenly Aurora, Loot, or even the defeated Aspects of Existence of your enemies can all be used as fuel towards the maturity of the Sporos of Extremity. Once the Sporos of Extremity blooms into the Quintessential Hyperversal Ash Tree of Gradation, it will grant quintessential boons as thereafter, it will revert to become a Quintessential Hyperversal Sporos II of Extremity. Every subsequent cycle of the Sporos will require even more resources to cultivate to maturity as its subsequent boons will be even grander...]]","[[...When the Quintessential Hyperversal Ash Tree of Gradation blooms, half of its essence will grant a baptism to your soul and greatly elevate, refine, and prepare it to become a Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul- with its elevation even capable of granting you a Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul even before you achieve Extremity if you are baptized by enough cycles of the Ash Tree of Gradation. The other half of the essence of the Ash Tree of Gradation will allow you to choose any of the Seven Havenly Authorities stemming from the Vitalis Havens of Extremity to be generated in their Purest Form in quantities that will be sufficient to complete 1 Aletheian Haven of Extremity within your Origin. This boon is meant to guide you towards Extremity in the shortest possible time if you can make the best use of it, with the feat of having enough Pure Havenly Authority of the chosen Haven to establish 1 Aletheian Haven kept even as you near the completion of the Ninth Aletheian Haven of Extremity. The caveat is that the maturity of future Sporos of Extremity will be that much more improbable to achieve as it will require quintessential might to do so. For the feat of attaining the 17th Boundary Layer of Quintessence, the First Quintessential Hyperversal Sporos of Extremity that has been generated is fully matured and waiting to be utilized...]]","...!","The seed that appeared in his hands.","The dazzling multi colored Quintessential Hyperversal Sporos of Extremity that was radiating such a heavy and tyrannical authority as his own Aspects of Existence were put under pressure!","It was something that truly opened up a pathway towards Extremity as one lay in Noah's Soul, and the other was his Origin!"]},{"number":2660,"title":"Chapter 2660: Chapter 2659 The Ash Tree of Gradation! I","paragraphs":["A grand seed!","A Quintessential Hyperversal Sporos of Extremity that for the feat of attaining the 17th Layer of Quintessence, Noah gained an entirely matured one.","Its purpose was twofold as through it, he could go towards a Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul. And through it, the hopes of building 9 Foundations to achieve Extremity became more realistic!","He could choose any of the Havenly Authorities corresponding to Havens of Extremity as enough of such authority to forge a complete Haven would then be granted.","And this was only half of the essence contained in the Quintessential Hyperversal Sporos of Extremity.","Noah couldn't take his eyes off of it as even though he held it within his palm, it felt denser and heavier than anything he had ever held onto before!","His soul cried out for it as he didn't outline it just yet.","He was waiting for a confirmation of something critical.","His luminous eyes that didn't look away from the Sporos of Extremity reflected the scenes within two different locations.","One was in the Vaults of the Sima Clan, and the other was within the Infinite Oni Haven.","Here, his two clones still held their hands on the Iron Heart and the Hyperversal Bow of Helios as the extremely Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority flowed into him and coiled on the Sources of Foundation and Helios.","And yet...","They only flowed and cycled, but did not grant any changes.","Pure waves of Helios and Foundation flowed into him as they resonated, but that was it!","No further advancement.","Extremity was not so easy that only by continuing to absorb Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority would take one towards it!","If this was the case, Clans and Inheritances would have produced millions of Extremities.","But even with this reality, Noah still wanted to test his limits as his hand that was touching the Bow of Helios moved- his intention being to take hold of the Armament of Extremity!","To wield such an Armament, one had to have attained Extremity.","So if someone who did not have this authority try...","KAAA!","A piercing cry rang out from the Bow of Helios as if it were a living thing, a burst of molten Helios Authority erupting out as an instant later, Noah's right hand was entirely missing- burnt and scorched out of existence!","It was a shocking scene as up to his shoulder, immense waves of heat simmered- and he couldn't even heal this hand fully as it felt like minuscule records of it were almost erased!","\"...\"","His gaze was brilliant as he gazed at the terrifying Bow of Helios.","Behind him, a shout came from Ayame who witnessed this scene.","\"Are you okay?\"","He turned back with a smile as the opportunity of the Infinite Oni Haven had granted what it could, and it showed a harsh reality that to go from the 17th Layer and reach Extremity...was an unscalable wall that wouldn't be breached so simply.","The same applied to the Iron Heart that radiated Foundation!","After Noah affirmed this, the eyes of his main body blinked.","The scenes showing his two clones within Helios and Genesis faded as his gaze was only on the Sporos of Extremity in his hands.","His ticket towards Extremity...if he could utilize it well!","If he had the resources for it.","As his eyes gazed at the completely matured Quintessential Hyperversal Sporos of Extremity, he released silent waves of Quintessence of this seed and uttered out simply.","\"Genesis.\"","HUUM!","An aurora of multicolored light began to blaze around the Sporos of Extremity.","This blinding light rose along with the seed from Noah's hands as it came to float in the space before him, beginning to spin like a singularity that would birth a whole Haven as from it, a milky white light of utmost purity began to pulse!","Genesis.","Noah had many options to choose from as with the imbalance of the Fifth Aletheian Haven of Extremity being entirely composed of Helios so far with a corner of it being Dissolution, he could have chosen the Havenly Authority of Dissolution to bring back a sense of balance between the authorities making up this Haven. But the grander option was to open up access to his Third Havenly Authority.","He had the Boundary of Genesis from the musings of Orion that he made his own, but he didn't have the Havenly Boundary of Genesis.","He didn't have Genesis as it related to the Authority of the Haven!","And so...","THUMP!","Like a flourishing organ coming to life, the Sporos of Extremity thumped while radiating pure milky white light, a sprout gloriously rising from the seed with seven leaves that all shone with a pristine light of Genesis.","The sprout then became larger and larger as even though it didn't cause any surging waves of essence in the surroundings, reality itself creaked at the sheer pressure and grandeur that was contained in this emerging sprout!","A sprout that grew to be over a light year in an instant, the Sources of Chaos in the surroundings being calmed as within moments, the thousands and tens of thousands of light years around Noah within this Apollyon Aletheian Haven where he was discussing Extremity with Xiaomi...they all became utterly still and docile.","The Sporos of Extremity sprouted as the Ash Tree of Gradation came to be.","And during its first appearance, the entropy of reality and everything else was brought to a halt.","The active and fiery Apollyon Aletheian Haven was calmed and became docile starting from this point and throughout the whole Haven, a shocking scene arising for those worthy enough to feast their eyes on it.","It was a scene of an Ash Tree of Gradation shimmering with illusory milky white light as its trunk rose throughout the Apollyon Aletheian Haven, its innumerable branches and leaves spreading out across the very peak of this Haven!","With a contained pressure and power, its innumerable branches and leaves moved as they dropped down towards a single being!"]},{"number":2661,"title":"Chapter 2661: Chapter 2660 The Ash Tree of Gradation! II","paragraphs":["[The Ash Tree of Gradation has bloomed.]","[The chosen Havenly Authority is Genesis.]","The seed would bloom into the Ash Tree of Gradation, and this tree would grant Noah a baptism of his soul along with enough Havenly Authority of a chosen Haven to complete a single Aletheian Haven!","Such unreal boons were truly expressed at this moment as after the Ash Tree of Gradation bloomed, its innumerable branches all drooped and pointed towards Noah's head.","The moment the first branch came in contact with him...","BOOM!","A blinding light flashed as his soul trembled.","A cooling sensation spread across his aspects of existence as his soul couldn't help but cheer. Because in the next moment, unimaginably pure waves of Hyperversal Authority washed over him and made it seem like every part of his soul was being burned by ever incandescent white flames!","His soul values instantly began to nudge upwards.","[The Baptism of the Quintessential Hyperversal Soul towards the Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul has begun.]","[The forging of a complete Aletheian Haven with the Havenly Authority of Genesis has begun!]","The immense quantity and quality of essence required to complete just the Fifth Aletheian Haven of Extremity were utterly insane as even with Noah absorbing the pure authority of Helios in the Infinite Oni Haven as its concentration continued to thin from his actions, he only barely completed 15% of this entire Haven.","And yet the moment the essence of the Ash Tree of Gradation flowed into him, resplendent milky white cosmos and an expanding white earth began to expand and proliferate within the Fifth Aletheian Haven, its size and magnitude quickly passing the lands of Helios already built as rapidly, Noah's Fifth Haven surged towards completion!","It felt like the formation of a planar circular domain where a sliver of it was Dissolution, over 10% of it was Helios, and now, a majority of it shone with milky white grandeur as Genesis finished the rest.","The proportions of the Havens occupying the Fifth Aletheian Haven were not at all equal as while this wouldn't prevent it from being completed, Noah still planned to equalize them later on as he approached the Ninth and final Aletheian Haven.","The process was a grand one, but also a quick one as the moment the branches of the Ash Tree of Gradation transmitted their terrifying authority to Noah, its massive trunk began to flicker and fade away into an array of stellar dust ever so slowly!","Dust that spread out and flickered out of existence as if it had never appeared, not even leaving behind a flicker of brilliance or what it was accomplishing within Noah.","Ashes to ashes, dust to dust!","Noah's will saw the infusion of authority into him and the gradual disappearance of the Ash Tree of Gradation as profundity surged within his eyes, the flow of time seemingly absent from them as he fantastically experienced the vicissitude of the fading tree before him from its lifetime as a seed to its maturity, to its disappearance right now!","His mind was wrapped up in such a profundity as he only came to moments later, not knowing how much time had passed as the Ash Tree in front of him now had its entire trunk gone, stellar dust continuing to disappear as only a few branches remained.","In his blank moment of profundity, he blinked as he felt his soul had made shocking advancements, his Soul Values alone being 50% greater than any of his other Values!","There was also a backlog of Prompts as when he gazed at his Origin...there lay a brilliantly shining Fifth Aletheian Haven radiating dazzling milky white light, a small portion of it burning with a Golden glow while a sliver of it was black!","And above this Fifth Haven, a Sixth one had already begun forming.","Noah saw an array of prompts that showed just how much had happened in the blink of an epiphany.","[The 16th Havenly Boundary Layer of Genesis has been attained!]","[The Fifth Aletheian Haven of Extremity has been completed!]","[The Sixth Aletheian Haven of Extremity has begun to be forged!]","[Your soul had drawn out even more power from the Ash Tree of Gradation due to a profound epiphany, its strength nearing the Unscalable Wall of Extremity!]","[The Ash Tree of Gradation has reverted to become the Quintessential Hyperversal Sporos II of Extremity.]","Along with its trunks, the few branches of milky white stellar light that remained faded away as the remnant ash didn't fade away entirely, accumulating into a Singularity that caused a dazzling multicolored seed to appear once more.","Noah beckoned towards it as it landed in his hands once more, its weight feeling even heavier as a line of words rose from it.","[Quintessential Hyperversal Sporos II of Extremity]:: 0% Maturity...","The freebie was gone.","He now had to cultivate it himself!","And just as a means of probing, he pulled from his soul and reached into the Infinite Forge that had been expanded and elevated along with his soul, taking away all of the accumulated Loot Light within it that RUINATION hadn't devoured as he channeled all of it towards the seed within his hands.","BZZT!","The gold grandeur of loot light blazed in his hands and sank into the Sporos II of Extremity silently.","The seed barely vibrated as after it devoured every remaining Loot Light from the Infinite Forge...","[Quintessential Hyperversal Sporos II of Extremity]:: .0001% Maturity...","\"...\"","The percentage of maturity was barely moved.","Seeing the accumulated Loot Light from the Infinite Forge sink into the multi-colored seed and show the percentage of maturity reach .0001%, Noah affirmed he would need a crazy amount of Loot!","He would need to farm crazily over the next week if he was to succeed in attaining Extremity, Loot from terrifyingly powerful enemies was what he required the most.","Loot...from Hyperversal Extremities!","\"Hmm...\"","His eyes radiated a profound light of hunger as he communicated with Oraculum.","Some of his cautious moves and paths had to be changed.","It was time for him to take some calculated risks and target Extremities!"]},{"number":2662,"title":"Chapter 2662: Chapter 2661 Preparations! I","paragraphs":["Calculated risks.","Different beings could take different levels of risks as so far, Noah's level of risk he exposed himself to was really low.","His body was already beneath layers and layers and Recorded Histories as if wasn't even moving around in Reality, with his safety placed behind many doors that even Extremities would have a hard time getting to!","Seeing the sheer resources and immense clusters of loot that he would require if he was to achieve Extremity within 7 days, he would take just a little more risk as he moved forward with the Hyperversal Anomalous Virion.","A virus that targeted not just any Extremities- but the Vitalis Hyperversal Extremities who thrived under Vitalis Hyperversal Authority!","Far outside the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains, there were legions of the Vacuous Lineages about to wage a war as this was a source of loot within itself.","But this was only a possible source of loot.","And it was one where Noah's participation was filled with peril as many Tier 3 and Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity Authorities had their wills spread out and ready to act at any level of discrepancy!","So, he would also prepare his battlefield within the Vitalis Domains.","Within the Supernal Havens of Extremity, he had Hyperversal Extremities coming for him and hunting him down.","Now, it was time to turn the tables and ask whether he was the one truly being hunted!","WAA!","Quintessence shone with brilliance as Noah breathed in to assimilate the great advancement that he had just made.","\"First of all...\"","He turned his attention inwards.","The greatly strengthened soul and the Sixth Aletheian Haven of Extremity beginning its expansion fell under his gaze as he came to focus on the Perennial Weald of Extremity in his soul.","The massive illusory tree that had branching Yggdrasil of Extremity in the form of his Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity!","With the advent of Noah's Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage, he gained the Illuminating Light of Quintessence that allowed him as the Progenitor to converge up to 36 Boundaries into a single Dynamis of Extremity.","His current Dynamis that were barely breaking 21 Concepts in each...could undergo a profound elevation and have their authority raised further.","Especially so for Dynamis like Oraculum that was going through Recorded and Unrecorded Histories to provide Noah information and pathways, along with Lotra for the generation of even more Loot, and then Aletheian for his Origin!","The rest would also follow at this juncture, Noah breathed in.","It was a Quintessential Breath of Extremity as the authorities within him were roused.","The expansion of the Dynamis of Extremity would begin first as Noah was looking closely at Oraculum and Aletheian!","For Aletheian, it was time to pack more concepts and begin including what was already in his Origin- especially the Havenly Authorities he had collected so far as he looked forward to its changes.","HUUM!","The Perennial Weald of Extremity began to illuminate as its concepts were called upon to be altered.","While this began, the sharp eyes of his main body turned up and gazed past the Havens he was in, pricing across the veils of Records in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity and coming to see with the eyes of the Reified Wealdian Source of Indefatigable within the Supernal Havens of Extremity.","It was time for this part of his will to make some major moves!","—","He had shown a wondrous scene with the Golden Havenly Animalia Blood Source Seas as at this point in time, he couldn't be considered an Underdweller anymore!","He was currently being escorted out of the Ablation Center with Extremity Ruby and Laeta at the forefront as these beings were still gazing at him as if they could peel the layers of secrets and try to see through him.","This was especially so for Laeta as she felt the profound Havenly Authority emanating from Noah that showed just a glimpse of the Vitalis Hyperversal Authority flowing in his Blood.","Laeta looked at this and blinked as a terrifying thought rose.","Why did this being before them...seem to hold the disposition and aura of a Havenly Noble, even if ever so briefly?","...!","[Are you seeing the same thing as me?]","Laeta blinked as she asked while gazing at Noah's following figure.","Extremity Ruby had sharp eyes that gazed at Noah from all directions as their figures returned to the lobby.","Havenly Noble.","The existences distinguished at the top of the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages as in their bodies flowed dense reserves of Havenly Authority.","All were those that had undergone their First Havenly Awakening!","They didn't entertain this though, but could this being...","\"Hmm?\"","While they pondered, they were roused from their thoughts by his voice as he gazed at the side opposite to the 81 kiosks where beings like Extremity Ruby were working.","There, illusory screens were displayed that showed the playing reality within multiple Challenger Arenas, only 1 being of a battle between Apex Aeonic Lifeforms while three screens showed clashes with Hyperversal Extremities!","And in one screen in particular...","[Hahaha! Yare yare!]","The maddened visage of Extremity Blue could be seen as she fought against a Tier 3 Saurischian Hyperversal Extremity- a Velociraptor!","An aurora of white wings stretched out behind the Tier 3 Velociraptor as it clashed with an endless sea of blue, the Extremity of Lunacy rising up and spreading her arms wide in a show of utmost grandeur as Extremity Ruby clicked her lips at this scene.","[More and more Underdwellers have been converging here since this is the first Obsidian Havenly Archipelago nearby.]","...!","They were on the Obsidian Saurischian Havenly Archipelago that was overseen by a terrifying Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity, this place being a center of power for many light years as even a Branch of the Havenly Vaults of Extremity was established here- with many Havenly Lineages doing business and battling in the Challenger Rifts that when exciting matches began, their illusory screens would be displayed across the Archipelago for others to watch!"]},{"number":2663,"title":"Chapter 2663: Chapter 2662 Preparations! II","paragraphs":["While he underwent Bloodline Ablation and officially became someone from the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage, his enemies and other Underdwellers that had been entering had arrived towards the nearest Obsidian Havenly Archipelago as on the illusory screen showing Extremity Blue, Noah could see some faces of the Avernus Clan members watching the battle with rapt eyes.","He stroked his chin with a pondering gaze as he looked at the few Hyperversal Extremities there.","For what he wanted to do, they weren't nearly enough.","He was evading them before, but he now needed as many of them as possible to fall under the effects of the Hyperversal Anomalous Virion as after the first time, affecting them when their guard was up with knowledge of something like that being possible was going to be hard!","So he affirmed once more with Oraculum.","He closed his eyes momentarily and hummed as he perused multiple possible Unrecorded Histories in a matter of seconds as a moment later, he opened his eyes and focused on the two Extremities in front of him.","\"Say, after becoming part of the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage, what level of protection does one gain?\"","His words were probing as when Laeta heard them, she raised her brows while looking at the visage of Extremity Blue on the illusory screen as she smiled.","[A member of the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage cannot be touched. In the case you are killed, you will definitely be avenged!]","\"...\"","Noah smiled at her words as ideas slowly rose in his mind.","He had long since gone past relying on the strength of others and only hoping for the best as currently, he wanted to create his own deterrent.","To do this, he had to make even Hyperversal Extremities think twice about trying to come after him!","He would allow the deterrence of the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage and the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity here to act as a buffer before he made his move, with a Golden path gradually unfolding in his soul as his body began to change.","The fair skin and radiant visage full of devilish beauty of none other than Noah Osmont was unveiled as for his plan to succeed, he needed to attract his enemies here!","\"I'll be going out to have some fun.\"","He spoke with a smile as he began to walk out of the Bloodline Ablation Center, Laeta looking at his figure and voicing out before he disappeared beyond the door.","[The Havenly Master of this Archipelago maintains order, but if you antagonize your enemy Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity and she quickly makes a move against you, you will just become a case of a Havenly Animalia needing to get avenged. There's no harm in you staying hidden while you grow your strength.]","Extremity Laeta warned him to be cautious even while under the protection of the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage as when an Extremity made a move, they could still die!","Even if their enemy faced consequences thereafter, so what? One was still dead!","But at this, Noah only smiled while leaving behind thunderous words.","\"And what if it is someone of the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage...who had undergone their First Havenly Awakening?\"","...!","BOOOM!","A calculated risk was taken after innumerable paths were looked at.","The pupils of the two Extremities behind Noah constricted as his figure disappeared before their eyes!","Laeta's gaze was incredulous as beside her, Extremity Ruby instantly became stern and took out a white gold medallion brimming with authority as she spoke into it hurriedly!","A moment later, these two Extremities finally reacted as they shot out of the Bloodline Ablation Center, coming into the swathes of Lineages moving about into different buildings and structures of this bustling Archipelago as even when they spread out their wills, they couldn't find Noah's figure anymore.","Their figures then rose as they gazed far past this region they were in- towards the area past illustrious mountains and stellar cosmic trees where the huge coliseum-like style of the Challenger Arenas were standing proudly!","His destination was likely there as while they were shocked at the fact they couldn't even find his figure, Ruby and Laeta shot out towards the Challenger Arena that contained the Underdweller known as Extremity Blue!","[I've alerted the Havenly Master...if you truly sponsored a being that has already undergone their First Havenly Awakening...]","Ruby left the rest of her words in the air as in both of their faces, the disbelief could not be hidden as even after they heard the words from his mouth, they still didn't believe it to be possible! But...it would explain everything so far!","—","Warping across space, Noah's figure had activated Obfuscation and became hidden from any existences at the Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity and below, his soul buzzing with possibilities and change as he went towards the Challenger Arena where some of the forces of the Avernus Clan had already arrived.","His Vaults of Quintessence were already filled with dozens of Hyperversal Anomalous Virions as his Main Body made more even now, every single one seeming like a pure concentrated stream of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority as they were ready to be utilized!","SHAA!","Like flashes of lightning, the figures of Laeta and Ruby quickly passed by his figure without even knowing he was there, Noah's gaze calm as he planned to guarantee at least a few Tier 1 and 2 Hyperversal Extremities to be affected by the Hyperversal Anomalous Virions before he revealed himself.","He flew across the Obsidian Saurischian Archipelago as within moments, 9 massive colosseum-like structures radiated grandeur and light and they rose and fell in space like movable Titanic vessels.","9 Challenger Arenas for which most were packed with audiences watching terrifying battles, others being less filled and with a few Apex Aeonic Lifeforms rising to challenge each other every now and then!","But the biggest Challenger Arenas had waves of Hyperversal Extremity Authority bustling around them as Noah headed towards the one that currently had half of its area painted with a maddening blue light.","On the millions of throned obsidian seats of this Arena that pulsed with weak tendrils of Dissolution, Apex Havenly Animalia Lineages filled them in humanoid forms while others grandly- retained their animalistic forms.","In a small area of this arena, a section of the forces of the Avernus Clan Noah had seen arrive in the Havenly Smilodon Archipelago was here as the maddeningly powerful Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity was nowhere to be seen!","Five Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities and Twenty Tier 2 and 1 Hyperversal Avernus Extremities stood in a cluster as they watched Extremity Blue's battle, all of them gaining knowledge of Units of Havenly Aurora and how one could attain the Havenly Treasures radiantly seen atop the Archipelagos as they also waited to battle and increase this resource themselves.","And all of them badly wanted to get their hands on a Golden or Obsidian Aurora Accumulation Modus Operandi so they could begin drawing in Vitalis Hyperversal Authority and the Havenly Authority of Dissolution as Extremity Blue had described.","If they could begin to accumulate Vitalis Hyperversal Authority within their bodies, wouldn't the unreachable goal of Vitalis Awakening they only heard Records of from the most powerful forces within the Seven Havens and aspired to attain themselves come ever closer?","They badly sought Vitalis Hyperversal Authority.","What they didn't know...was that streams of it prepared just for them were about to be unleashed in the form of a deadly plaque whose effects were yet to be recorded!"]},{"number":2664,"title":"Chapter 2664: Chapter 2663 Merely the Avernus Clan! I","paragraphs":["2663 Merely the Avernus Clan! I","The 9 Challenger Arenas were massive circular colosseum-like structures arranged in a round formation, their architecture being built with wonders of technomancy as they floated up and moved serenely in a set motion- a terrifying gravitational force supporting them as an obsidian crystalline platform shone below with arcs of Dissolution.","Around them, tall ancient trees radiating traces of Vitalis and Dissolution rose to the skies as they towered over the Arenas.","Noah's obscured figure appeared in the Challenger Area whose walls radiated a gold and black light, millions of throned seats stretched all around as he bypassed the main gateway where an Apex Saurischian Tyrannosaurus Beast was collecting 1 Unit of Havenly Aurora as an entry fee into this Arena to watch the battles of Hyperversal Extremities up close!","The atmosphere was wild and lively as gorgeously dressed Smilodons and Saurischians in half-human half-beast forms could be seen as their animalistic curves paired with humanoid bodies were a feast for all beings.","They carried with them floating folded trays filled with multicolored liquids that carried infinitesimal traces of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority, along with lavish roasted Dragonoid Necks, Wings, and Thighs stemming from the Draconian Farm on this Archipelago that cultivated the Rock Dragon Serpents in the thousands of Herds.","The trays carrying meals of Dragonoid Wings, Thighs, and even Brains carried trace amounts of Vitalis that were conducive to one's cultivation!","The fantastical meals and drinks could be purchased by exchanging different prices of Units of Havenly Aurora, with Apex Aeonic Workers carrying them between walkways on the throned seats and selling them to those who could afford to buy.","Waves of power, valor, and enjoyment echoed throughout as millions of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms and at least a few hundred Extremities in this Arena enjoyed themselves while watching the grand battle between Extremity Blue and the Saurischian Hyperversal Extremity Velociraptor.","Noah glanced at this glorious atmosphere as while still obscured, his hand bypassed the weak field of Havenly Authority around an Apex Aeonic Saurischian as he grasped a golden chalice with vibrant multi-colored liquid.","He sipped on the drink while appreciating the lively environment here, his voice ringing out only for him to hear.","\"Such a vibrant atmosphere...it's a shame with the chaos about to ensue!\"","He spoke as if he was detached from it all- as if he wasn't just about to be the prime cause of the unfolding chaos!","He could see the figures of Extremity Laeta and Ruby looking in the surroundings with rapt eyes trying to find his figure, and he could even feel a rousing will of the existence all beings could faintly feel the pressure of at the center of this Archipelago begin to move silently!","The Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity known as the Havenly Master of this Archipelago had been informed of the possible appearance of an existence that had undergone Havenly Awakening.","Such beings were too pristine and full of potential, not to mention their intricate uses and possibilities within the Supernal Havens of Extremity that was filled with Vitalis Hyperversal Authority.","Even though Noah couldn't be easily discerned, he knew that this Tier 4 Entity would very quickly locate him.","He would begin making his moves before then!","SHAA!","He waved his hands lightly.","And from them, streams of gorgeous Vitalis Hyperversal Authority flowed out like starry rivers.","Yet they weren't just streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority!","Inside them, Vacuous Hyperversal Authority was mixed in along with an altered Blood Source in addition to multiple other authorities!","It was the release of the Hyperversal Anomalous Virions.","Their target was the location that held the Tier 3 and 4 Hyperversal Extremities, with multiple streams floating towards Extremity Blue who had just become the victor of the Challenger Arena.","[WOOO!]","Her bellow of victory roused the wills of all those watching even though she was an Underdweller, her voice echoing out with valor.","[Who else?! Keep them coming...I hold 100,000 Units of Havenly Aurora now!]","She invited challenge.","Unless a Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity came, she would not be defeated!","And even if a Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity came...she would use them as a whetstone to see if she could make advancements and arrive at this height herself.","Her snow white hair danced wildly as she stood on the Challenger Arena victorious, the very Havens seeming to complement her as at this moment, streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority burst from the cracks of space and streamed towards her.","She looked at this scene with bright eyes as feeling the pristine and pure Vitalis Hyperversal Authority, she reached her hand out and let it fall on her palms- the pristine authority sinking into her and causing her very existence to cheer as she nodded in affirmation!","Yes","This was her path.","She would collect as many units of Havenly Aurora as she could, deposit them into the Havenly Vaults and change them into Havenly Notes when they became significant, and she would continue the cycles of battle until she had enough resources to allow her to jump past Zenith of Tier 3.","Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity was her immediate goal- and she would achieve it no matter what had to be done!","—","On the stands of the Challenger Arena.","Chamber Master Gayacus and Extremity Ariana stared at Extremity Blue's victorious figure with wry smiles as Ariana shook her head while biting into the Dragon Wing in her hands.","Within this meat, she could feel infinitesimally small traces of Vitalis Authority, and yet even these caused her soul to buzz with brightness as she sighed!","[We've wasted enough time already. We need to keep searchi-]","SHAA!","Her words came to a stop.","They had to as in a region near them, extremely pure streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority erupted from the cracks of space and showered down into the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms below, their figures looking up in astonishment as the vibrant authorities sank into them- their bodies brimming with life soon after!","It was a phenomenon that pulled many eyes over, the wills of Avernus Extremities being the closest as they even felt the tremendous grandeur of the Vitalis Hyperversal Authority in the distance!"]},{"number":2665,"title":"Chapter 2665: Chapter 2664 Merely the Avernus Clan! II","paragraphs":["2664 Merely the Avernus Clan! II","Extremity Ariana and the other Hyperversal Avernus Extremities gazed at the burst of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority in the distance in shock as before an instant passed...","SHAA!","An explosion of streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority burst into existence above their region.","...!","Their souls pulsed as they sought this power.","Their very existence wanted to grasp into themselves as Extremity Ariana was the first to follow the need of her soul and raise her arms up to grasp onto the falling tendrils of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority!","An authority that was at the very center of the Havens of Extremity.","An authority that the ones who have crossed the Gradations of Extremity were hoping to attain and gain an Awakening through it, and they now had easier access to it in the Supernal Havens of Extremity!","So seeing the burst of streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority above them, the souls of the Avernus Extremities below only felt an attractive pull of this authority they had always sought so hard for as they even rose up quickly to absorb as many streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority as they could.","There was no warning.","There was no danger.","After all, their very existence sought for this authority!","Tier 2 and Tier 3 Extremities alike rose and took the streams of pure Vitalis Hyperversal Authority into their bodies as they marveled at it.","Extremity Ariana's purple flames became even more roused and wild at this development!","As soon as she felt the vibrant Vitalis Hyperversal Authority sinking into her hands and revitalizing her very existence, Extremity Ariana's will that was about to revel in the euphoria buzzed for a moment as she was taken out of her reverie.","She gazed away from the skies sparking with a pure transparent authority.","Her eyes refocused as she blinked a few times, gazing towards a certain direction where she thought she saw the elusive figure of the being they were all looking for this whole time simply standing there while gazing towards Extremity Blue with a devilish smile!","And the more her will and eyes focused, the more she affirmed in shock and incredulousness that he really was the one they were seeking!","[Motherfucker, he's right there!]","Her words boomed out as the Hyperversal Extremities around her initially didn't understand what she was talking about.","It was only when they followed her gaze and saw Noah's calmly smiling figure did they stare in a dumbfounded fashion before a moment later, vibrant authority began to cycle in their bodies!","Extremity Ariana's body burned with purple flames as if she faced a great enemy, her whole body shining ever brighter as she bellowed out.","[Blue!]","In a shout that roused even the audiences in this Challenger Arena.","In a shout that drew the gazes of Laeta and Ruby in the distance as their wills gazed at them and where their eyes were, seeing Noah's figure there as their faces changed when they felt the astonishing hostility from 5 Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities and 20 Tier 1 and Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities on the stand!","At such a moment, the deeply cerulean eyes of Extremity Blue blinked on the center of the Challenger Arena as they turned towards the direction many gazes were gathering at this moment.","She saw Noah's figure as his eyes...were looking directly at hers.","She saw his devilish smile.","She saw the light of grandeur and confidence in his eyes.","She didn't erupt with power or lunch at such a moment as when she gazed at his smiling figure, her sharp eyes couldn't help but feel unease.","...!","The moment such a thought rose in her mind, she felt a sense of incredulity rising with it!","Unease? From her stature as a Hyperversal Extremity against an existence who had yet to even achieve Extremity in a single concept?!","She found such a thought wild as before she could think anymore, she saw Noah's figure rising from the stands and beginning to float toward the vibrant arena she was in.","His eyes were filled with serenity as he spoke while floating with majesty.","\"You were looking for a Challenger?\"","WAA!","Shocking words that caused Extremity Blue to feel even more unease!","Her intuition was never wrong as at this moment, she felt something was truly off.","He had been evading them this whole time, so why did he suddenly appear here?","It was a logical question that would not yet receive an answer.","Because even though she had an astounding intuition marching her endless lunacy, others did not.","Because a moment later...","[Do not let him escape again!]","The voice of Extremity Ariana thundered out as a purple cage of flames rose with her descent, radiating a profound spatial authority that could even lock down the current reality.","The four Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities beside her had also arrived meters away from Noah, their Hyperversal Extremity Authority erupting out as their maddening power caused a tremendous pressure to rise!","All of this...was directed towards a single existence who had yet to even achieve Extremity.","The Extremities from the Havenly Animalia Lineages first looked at this scene with shock, which then soon turned into anger as they saw the Underdwellers actually surround and release such a power against one of their own- the glow of Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage vibrantly emanating from Noah as they all rose from their seats and prepared to act!","But they didn't have to.","BZZT!","The cage of flames called out by Extremity Ariana.","The pulsing Hyperversal Extremity Authority emanating from the other four Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities and the twenty Tier 1 and Tier 2 Extremities following right behind.","All of these vibrant authorities...instantly came to a halt as a grand, undeniable, and mighty authority coalesced from the skies and descended in the form of Hyperversal Haki of Extremity!","This authority far exceeded all of them as Extremity Ariana's cage of flames froze before it turned into dust an instant later.","The erupting authorities from the other Avernus Extremities were forcefully retracted into their bodies as they felt a profound sense of suffocation descend along with a magisterial voice!","[Barbarians.]","WAA!","[You are now in civilized lands...even if you are Underdwellers, you will act with some decorum.]","A voice filled with an undeniable authority they had only ever felt from a few beings in their lifetime.","One was the Avernus Extremity Overlord.","It was a pressure of a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity!"]},{"number":2666,"title":"Chapter 2666: Chapter 2665 Merely the Avernus Clan! III","paragraphs":["2665 Merely the Avernus Clan! III","The Challenger Arena felt a sense of suffocation unlike anything they had come across before.","It was the feeling a tiny little rabbit felt when a lion locked onto it and hunted it down.","A feeling of prey being stared at by a predator!","The gazes of Extremity Blue and other Avernus Extremities changed at such words as in the center of their encirclement, Noah remained utterly calm.","His eyes were gazing above.","There, cracks split across space and time as from within, the figure of a middle-aged man carrying the grandeur of an unparalleled Emperor appeared!","His body was adorned in an obsidian full body Armament of Extremity as on his head, an obsidian crown lazily hung down.","His hair was a simple dark color that faded on the sides while his fair face carried an enticing charm, his eyes seeming like endless black abyss singularities that emanated infinite power!","This illusion was caused by the status and grandeur of this being as an Existence that had reached the Fourth Gradation of Extremity.","Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity!","His eyes carried a chilling and regal light as when he appeared, the masses of Apex Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineages and Extremity Havenly Animalia Lifeforms all became filled with respect as they bowed their heads silently.","This includes Laeta and Ruby who gazed at this scene from a distance!","This was the Havenly Master of this Saurischian Archipelago!","His true form was something they had only witnessed once during his coronation- a Titanosaurus that stood at the very peak of the Saurischian Lineage within Animalia.","The Abyssal gaze of this being was piercing as it moved from Extremity Ariana, Gayacus, Blue, and all the other Avernus Extremities as his mouth opened.","[The doors of the Supernal Havens of Extremity opened for others to seek Extremity, and for beings like you to ascend the Gradations of Extremity at a faster pace. Your purpose should have only been this as even at this moment, enemies are knocking at our doors. And yet supposedly esteemed beings like yourselves are here being roused and excited to burn down the records of an existence that has yet to even achieve Extremity?]","...!","The Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification of the Last Haven!","It was meant for Apex Aeonic Lifeforms and Extremities alike all for the sake of exceeding or going past Extremity!","His words were admonishing the Avernus Extremities for using such an opportunity to focus on hunting an Apex Aeonic Lifeform.","His words were telling them to quickly take a step back, and yet Ariana and the others were put in a difficult spot as they couldn't do this!","They knew the threat of this being.","They knew the orders from the Avernus Extremity Overlord!","On the other hand, Extremity Blue was eerily silent as her vibrant and talkative demeanor was nowhere to be seen, her figure continuing to gaze at Noah silently.","It was as if she could feel something was very, very wrong- and yet she couldn't put her finger on it.","Since she didn't speak, Extremity Ariana's eyes vibrated as she spoke slowly towards the Havenly Master.","[Esteemed Extremity...this being before you has a death feud with our Clan as it is either us or him on the road of Extremity. Our history extends far from the Nether Havens of Extremity as we simply wish to close things off and put this feud to rest.]","...!","Her words were very careful as she felt her skin prickling and tense at every moment. The sheer pressure the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity above them displayed was just that obscene!","And his words were even more domineering.","[I don't give a damn if your history extends to the farthest reaches of Extremity. Drop it, or I will end the feud myself by eradicating all of you here...because it will definitely not be a Soldier of Vitalis that will perish from whatever inconsequential feud you all have.]","WAA!","A Soldier of Vitalis.","As he spoke, the Havenly Master's gaze came to lock onto Noah with scrutiny while the gazes of the Avernus Extremities changed!","They gazed towards Noah with complaints in their hearts as what had this being done in the last few hours that granted him the stout protection of a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity?","But they truly couldn't step back as their silence caused the suffocating pressure to only increase.","But a moment later, a smile bloomed on Extremity Ariana's face as she gazed up.","Her gaze was followed by a descending voice that was just as astounding as the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity above them, this one feminine and filled with endless mystery and charm as it was someone who put ease in Ariana's heart!","[I will offer you the Millennium Nexus Records of a Zenith Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity if you simply look the other way on this matter.]","...!","The voice was astounding as it didn't make a threat or begin by fighting, it instead began with an offer that caused the eyes of all Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities to flash with a shocked light!","It was a set of words that even caused the Havenly Master to raise his brows as he looked up.","Beings at their stage of Extremity had very few resources to aid their path forward.","There was a major reliance on Vitalis Hyperversal Authority among a few other things- one of these being the Records of Existences grander than them who had arrived at the place they wanted to go to!","It was basically akin to looking at a path another being had successfully walked on and making inferences on how to get there themselves.","The voice of the Entity who was gradually becoming apparent while bringing in towe dozens of Hyperversal Extremities had spoken about the Inheritance of the Millennium Nexus Records of a Zenith Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity as one had to wonder how she got her hands on it!","She was a being highly in tune with the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.","She was the Right Hand of the Avernus Extremity Overlord.","It was Seer Amestris of the Avernus Clan!"]},{"number":2667,"title":"Chapter 2667: Chapter 2666 Merely the Avernus Clan! IV","paragraphs":["2666 Merely the Avernus Clan! IV","The Seer of the Avernus Clan.","Her body radiated purple grandeur as a veil made it so that her gorgeous face couldn't be seen by others draped over her head, and yet her body emanated stifling waves of power at the Fourth Gradation of Extremity.","Behind her, dozens of the Avernus Clan Extremities followed her arrival as they had received the news of Noah's appearance and made their way here right away!","The Havenly Master looked at this newly arriving being as the words she had spoken about the Millennium Nexus Records of a Zenith Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity caused his eyes to pulse with light, and yet this light was quickly squashed as he spoke with authority towards the incoming beings above.","[The rise in strength of one will not be critical on what is to come. Any gains I could make with such an Inheritance are inconsequential to the life of another Soldier of Vitalis. Turn back...whatever feud you have with this being needs to end now.]","His reply was staunch as the veiled purple visage of Seer Amestris remained calm!","Her power flowed and ebbed carefully as she almost seemed to be probing, the wills of two Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities pushing and pulling in the atmosphere of the surroundings as space creaked and shuddered!","And in the midst of this contest, the man at the center of it all made a move.","Noah's eyes flashed as he pulled from his main body, Primitive Vitalis Manipulation being overworked as for the first time, he called out nearly 80% of all of this reserves of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority flowing within his Innate Vitalis Hyperversal Meridians!","Over a hundred Hyperversal Anomalous Virions were already made as Noah mixed them among the vibrant streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority, and his will then made an action through the Reified Wealdian Source of Indefatigable standing amidst Hyperversal Extremities on the Saurischian Archipelago.","And in the next moment...","BZZT!","The vibrating space where two Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities were competing with their wills creaked as above, there was an explosion of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority!","An explosion of dense and austere streams of transparent white light that numbers in the hundreds exploded out at the very peak of the Challenger Arena as many thought it was the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities beginning to make a move against each other.","But even they sternly looked at this glimmer of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority as all beings nearby felt their souls cry out for it!","And since it exploded in the peak of the Challenger Arena, the dozens of Hyperversal Extremities that came with Seer Amestris were nearest to it as they felt the pristine authorities raining down around them.","Their very souls sought it as some of them raised their hands to feel this pristine authority, the moment it landed on their skin making their Aspects of Existence even in more need for it as they allowed it to enter their bodies and enjoy its inexplicable euphoria!","Other Hyperversal Extremities collected and contained the streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority while up front, the visage of Seer Amestris prevented anything from getting near her as her voice was authoritative!","[What is this? Dangling Vitalis Hyperversal Authority in front of us as if we would jump at its appearance?]","The streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority didn't seem natural as she thought it was the work of the existence below her wanting to show off his power, but this entity shook his head while feeling the pure streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority that were very similar to the ones coursing through his veins, his eyes becoming brighter as his will silently focused on the Soldier of Vitalis below him!","And before any of them could continue their discussions...","\"It seems like all those who should be here have made it.\"","...!","The grandiose voice of none other than Noah rang out as he gazed at the Hyperversal Extremities around him.","His emotions were vibrant at this time as he had truly arranged things in a way where he arrived at a point in time where he was currently targeting Hyperversal Extremities!","Sighing at his brilliance, he felt the gazes of all Hyperversal Extremities turn towards him, along with the fewmillion Apex Aeonic Lifeforms quietly discussing amongst themselves on the throned seats of the Challenger Arena.","\"I showed myself here to send a warning to the Avernus Clan as I tire of this cat-and-mouse game. I showed myself here to warn you all.\"","He spoke with authority and power as if he was on the same stage as them.","He gazed at the Extremities around him without an ounce of respect as the one nearest to him scoffed, Extremity Ariana's voice ringing out as she regained her bearings with the arrival of Seer Amestris!","[Warn us? The only thing you are doing is hiding behind the power of an Esteemed Extremity. You are the Master of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, yes? The one who promised to extend the War of Annihilation to the entirety of the Avernus Clan! Should we expect you to jump on the bandwagon of one Extremity after another for the years to come?]","Her rousing words were targeted at Noah as smiled at them and came to focus on her in particular.","Ariana.","She has 'killed' a part of him in the Cult of Endless Shadows while taking the Shadow Sword away.","It was time for such a debt to be paid.","\"My warning to you all is a simple one.\"","As he spoke, he raised his right hand while pointing his index finger towards Extremity Ariana.","\"It is a reminder that I am not someone you can freely hunt, and that if you are coming for me...be prepared for your own death.\"","....!","His words caused a profound sense of suffocation to rise as in the next moment, he tapped his finger towards Extremity Ariana's direction.","A simple motion.","[...]","And nothing occurred.","Extremity Ariana's face pulsed with sternness as she began to speak.","[Was that supposed to do someth-]","BZZT!","Her words couldn't finish as her gaze very quickly changed.","She felt something billowing within the core of her existence as waves of shocking authorities instantly erupted out, her body beginning to convulse as her face instantly became utterly horrified!","This was because something drastic had occurred in her existence.","The trace of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority that had sunk into her suddenly pulsed as layers of authority that were keeping it separated from the Vacuous Hyperversal Authority contained within it were released, these authorities mixing as Vitalis and Vacuous also mixed with the crimson obsidian blood source in addition to the other pathogenic tendrils of authority!","And the moment such a concoction came to be, it instantly exploded out as Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities clashed.","But they didn't just clash, with their impacts bathed by the crimson gold light of the blood source being carried over across the various parts of the entity they were in as it was seeking the Records of this being to affect!","It was the explosion of the first carpule of the Hyperversal Anomalous Virion.","It began with a spark as the moment it rose, it began to spread wildly as the body of a Hyperversal Extremity began to be ravaged by two austere Authorities!"]},{"number":2668,"title":"Chapter 2668: Chapter 2667 Merely the Avernus Clan! V","paragraphs":["2667 Merely the Avernus Clan! V","The demarcation between Extremity and those who had not achieved Extremity was absolute.","It could not be crossed!","An existence that had not attained Extremity could never in their lifetime be able to overcome this wall.","A Non-Extremity could never kill a Hyperversal Extremity.","At this point in time, Noah wanted to violate this inviolable reality as his Hyperversal Anomalous Virion was his weapon to do so!","It wasn't his own power acting out, and he was actually borrowing the power of two Authorities he had just barely grasped- authorities that some Extremities had yet to grasp themselves.","This, paired with Havenly Blood Source that chased after the Records of the Existence, allowed for the targeted clash of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities!","It allowed for the scene where Noah pointed at an Extremity as next, under the eyes of astonished beings, various areas on the body parts of this Extremity vibrated as if bombs were exploding within.","BOOM! BOOM!","The impacts were enough to shake the hearts of listening Extremities and cause them to turn utterly somber.","Not just because an Apex Aeonic Lifeform had pointed their finger towards an Extremity and done something.","But at the fact that it was actually working!","And the eyes of Extremities knew this more than others as what their vision showed...was something that existences who had yet to reach Extremity would never see.","They saw...the breakdown of Extremity Ariana's Hyperversal Extremity Authority.","Noah and all others only saw the various parts of Ariana's body pulse as the skin became stretched out explosively before it retracted, but Extremities saw something break down that no Apex Aeonic Lifeform should be able to cause a breakdown of!","Ariana's face was utterly distressed and shocked as she gazed towards Noah.","[What did...how do you-GOOH!]","Her mouth uncontrollably opened as she spewed out tendrils of chaotic Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authority that fizzled out of existence the moment they were out of her body, but she couldn't keep talking as to stop the spread of the ravaging authority within her body, she had to place the focus of all of her authority inward!","Her goal was isolation and dispersion.","After all, she was a Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity.","She faced a shocking predicament, but it was unknown whether she could solve it or not!","Yet Noah only gazed at this shocking development coldly as his finger remained up.","He looked like a young Emperor rising up and violating ancient laws as he tore down ancestral beings who could not be brought down to his level","Before the Hyperversal Extremities could fully react to this shocking phenomenon, he turned his eyes towards the floating figure of Extremity Blue who had shockingly already noticed something and acted at this moment.","She moved purely based on her intuition as after she saw Ariana spit out a storm of Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authority, she recalled the streams of Vitalis that had sunk into her body as she first tried to expel them out.","But this was Vitalis Hyperversal Authority!","She had not even undergone the First Vitalis Awakening, much less the second.","So how could she control this essence?","When she realized it was immovable even with her Hyperversal Extremity Authority, she moved for an even more drastic action because there were streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority in her left hand...","SHING!","Her right hand moved like a blade as she instantly bisected her whole hand from the shoulder.","And she didn't stop there as next, she ruthlessly used her right hand to slash at her curvaceous lower body from the waist down!","But...","\"It is far too late.\"","BOOM!","Noah's voice felt like blazing thunder in the ears of the Avernus Extremities as his finger had pointed at Extremity Blue.","And her cold eyes filled with madness changed as near her heart, a Virion was activated and set loose.","Her body trembled and began to distort and deform a moment later!","...!","The hearts of Extremities shook.","Before they could understand the situation any further, Noah's voice continued as he came to stare at the cluster of Extremities Ariana was with, as well as those that came with Seer Amestris!","\"Ashes to ashes.\"","SNAP!","He snapped his fingers.","And multiple Avernus Extremities changed their gazes to shock as their bodies felt a storm exploding within them.","Noah's eyes lastly became locked onto the figure of Seer Amestris who was gazing at him with eyes that seemed to depict him dead in innumerable paths!","\"Dust to dust...at the end of the day, I want to show you that even your high stature as Extremities does not mean you cannot turn from predator to prey.\"","He stared at the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity fearlessly as all around her, Avernus Extremities cried out and groaned as shocking storms erupted within their bodies.","The Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities seemed to have it the worst as they couldn't even support themselves to remain in the skies, beginning to fall like dying stars!","[...!]","It was a scene of utter astonishment as the Havenly Animalia Extremities in the surroundings could only watch in disbelief.","The gaze of the Havenly Master was complex and filled with many thoughts at this astonishing scene, with Noah's dominant grandeur not done as there were Extremities behind Seer Amestris who didn't take any streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority into their bodies.","They weren't affected by the Hyperversal Anomalous Virion, even though their figures were tense with profound apprehension.","Yet in a show of power, Noah gazed at them as he raised his hand again- about to point towards their glorious figures.","...!","And at the mere raise of his hand towards their direction, the Hyperversal Extremities of the Avernus Clan scattered and scrambled.","Genuine Extremities...moved away with apprehension from the mere raise of his hand!","It was such an incredulous reality unfolding at this moment as Noah shook his head while his voice rang out majestically.","\"Merely Extremities...\"","WAA!","\"Merely the Avernus Clan...and you think you can act wildly before me?!\"","...!"]},{"number":2669,"title":"Chapter 2669: Chapter 2668 Forcing Extremities to Retreat!","paragraphs":["2668 Forcing Extremities to Retreat!","Merely.","A single word meant to demean and bring down the stature of their target.","Today, Noah demeaned the grandeur of the Avernus Clan before the eyes of the Hyperversal Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage in a shocking display of power!","Seer Amestris was the only one who didn't scramble back at the fear of the unknown as to how Noah was doing all of this, her body glimmering with waves of incandescent purple light that flew out like the fall of stars to land on the bodies of the Tier 1 Avernus Extremities who were fighting with everything they had and were even falling out of the skies.","Their bodies were stabilized as the Tier 2 and Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities were in a slightly better shape, their faces only convalescing as they battled with their own Aspects of Existence to stop a virus from spreading into their records and eating everything away!","Extremity was still Extremity.","They had shocking means and power that set them apart from prior Lifeforms as gradually, the Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities seemed to be the first ones to have their states improve as they used all of their power to isolate the clashing Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authorities while trying to separate it from their existence.","The only issue was the Pathogenic Blood Source that latched onto their records and spread to other parts of their existence- this allowing more streams of Vitalis and Vacuous to follow as the flash continued in other parts of their existence!","Noah's will was observing the Pathogenicity and action of his Hyperversal Anomalous Virion closely as his will was contained in the capsules he had released into the bodies of Extremities, and he looked at their defense mechanisms and how they were currently reacting to see how he could improve this Virion even more in the future.","After using it now, Extremities would be careful against him as those with brains already felt the initial chain reaction start with the steam of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority they absorbed as their bodies were clashing with both Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authorities.","Tier 3 and Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities could now theoretically defend against this as they could notice Noah and the authorities he utilized.","As for Tier 2 and below...they couldn't discern him under his Obfuscation as this Virion would still be effective against them.","And he wanted it to continue being effective.","It had to because while the Virion was doing its work and destroying the Aspects of Existence of Extremities from within...there were the streams of Lotra that he had packed into the Hyperversal Anomalous Virions.","Glorious streams of loot that benefited from the destruction of the Aspects of Existence of Hyperversal Extremities!","When the storm of Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authority raged within the heads of the Avernus Extremities like exploding bombs as the eyes of these being deformed and were stretched outwards to nearly explode...","[2x Shards of the Hyperversal Havenly Eye of Extremity have been attained!]","When the two authorities flashed across the musculature and bones of the Avernus Extremities at Tier 1 and Tier 2...","[4x Golden Hyperversal Bones of Gradation have been attained!]","And when they raged within Ariana, Blue, and other Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities...","[3x Obsidian Hyperversal Bones of Gradation have been attained!]","When the authorities clashed as his Pathogenic Blood Source surged towards different aspects of the Bloodline and soul...","[6x Hyperversal Marrow Soul Singularities have been attained!]","The more that his Virions laid destruction within the Hyperversal Extremities, the more Loot he received.","As they spread pathogenically while the Avernus Extremities tried to isolate and expel them out of their bodies, Noah affirmed that killing an Extremity in this manner had a very low chance.","It may have been possible with the Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities if they were ravaged enough, but they were currently being supported by Seer Amestris as her authority coursed through them with the same purpose.","Isolation and expulsion.","They were all using such means as Extremity Blue in particular was even more ruthless, her body parts reforming as moments after, she isolated the storm of Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authorities into her limbs before she cut them off again decisively.","The only thing that was left behind was traces of the Virion in her blood carrying small clashing streams of Vitalis and Vacuous which once they began spreading across their records again, other storms began to rise.","It was a cyclical process as no Extremities had yet to figure out a way to completely dispel it.","Extremity Ariana gazed at Noah with a ferocious gaze full of bloody murder as her arms had made a crack on her chest- pure golden blood mixed with pungent obsidian poisonous mixture being expelled constantly as she sought to eject the pathogenic blood source- but this constant outflow of her own Blood Source was gradually taking away her Vitality Values!","Receiving her deadly glare, Noah's eyes were sharp.","\"Don't glare at me like that, otherwise I may be compelled to just...\"","PAH!","Noah's finger tapped out again in Extremity Ariana's direction.","And an Inactivated Hyperversal Anomalous Virion became activated as Noah had allowed multiple Virions in the bodies of the Extremities that took them in!","He didn't activate them all at once as his deterrent tool continued to remain in control.","The moment he tapped out, the left side of Ariana's body ballooned out in a shocking explosion as if it were the first time once more, causing this regal Extremity to bellow out in utmost wrath as she moved back!","She wasn't the only one.","Seeing Noah's actions, the Avernus Extremities began moving away from him one after another, going towards the skies of the Saurischian Archipelago behind Seer Amestris as some moved even further away!","A tool of deterrence.","As Hyperversal Extremities moved away from him like flies, Noah showed that he could use his own power to defend himself!","\"Run back to your caves and simmer in worry and hatred.\"","His voice echoed out grandly as he stood unfettered amidst retreating Extremities.","Even the figure of Extremity Blue gazed at him coldly as she continued cutting limbs and throwing them constantly, expelling as much of the Hyperversal Anomalous Virion as she could.","And the moment she left the Challenger Arena...streams of Units of Havenly Aurora left her being and surged towards Noah!","[You have gained 113,254 Units of Havenly Aurora!]","He appeared to challenge her.","She didn't damage him as she currently left in defeat after his machinations!","He was considered the victor against a Hyperversal Extremity in this Challenger Arena as his gains were stupendous!","\"Appear before me again, and who knows what will happen to you. The Foundation and Records you've built up all these years...I may just tear them down!\"","As he spoke, his Emperor's Robe fluttered as he floated up freely and without fear.","He went towards the dazzling singularity above the Saurischian Archipelago that had hundreds of thousands of halos of Havenly Treasures floating freely.","And no Extremity followed after him.","Seer Amestris had an utterly cold look as before she did anything, she felt the gaze of the Havenly Master. She also saw the states of the dozens of Avernus Hyperversal Extremities around her.","They had to be taken care of first as at this clash, they were truly defeated!","She didn't want any accidents of Hyperversal Extremities somehow meeting their end as her body glimmered with endless purple light, covering all Avernus Extremities here as they began to disappear silently.","All this while, Noah's figure didn't even look back as he floated towards a myriad of Havenly Treasures, his eyes still seeing prompts cascading down as his Vaults of Quintessence welcomed glorious loot.","Loot from Hyperversal Extremities!","[9x Shards of the Hyperversal Havenly Eye of Extremity have been attained!]","[18x Golden Hyperversal Bones of Gradation have been attained!]","[8 Obsidian Hyperversal Bones of Gradation have been attained!]","[23x Hyperversal Marrow Soul Singularities have been attained!]","Loot pulsing of Hyperversal Extremity Authority flowed into his Vaults!"]},{"number":2670,"title":"Chapter 2670: Chapter 2669 The Establishment of the Infernal Havenly Commerce! I","paragraphs":["2669 The Establishment of the Infernal Havenly Commerce! I","As Noah rose towards the precipice of the Saurischian Archipelago, he left behind shock and awe- as well as the retreating figures of Avernus Hyperversal Extremities.","Light years away from the Saurischian Archipelago.","[Haha...this is fucking ridiculous! An Apex Aeonic Lifeform...an Apex Aeon-]","Before Extremity Ariana's voice finished, her mouth spat out a storm of Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authorities as she released what all other Extremities here were feeling!","They couldn't believe what had just occurred as they actually retreated, with Seer Amestris' face being utterly cold as her voice authoritatively rang out.","[Forget anything else and stabilize yourselves. ]","The most powerful among them had extremely cold gazes.","Apart from Seer Amestris, Extremity Blue had an utterly frosty expression as her body battled the storm of authorities inside here, their eyes simmering with a light of unimaginable wrath after today's event!","Their eyes foretold their thoughts as this...was far from over!","—","In front of the endless wall of Dissolution near the Golden Havenly Smilodon Archipelago, right at the entry point past the Vein Rifts.","The figures of the powerhouses of the Cult of Endless Shadows could be seen as after they had attained the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage, their combat power rose by a notch as 80% of them were able to gain entry into the Supernal Havens of Extremity!","Not too far behind them, the magnificent figures of Henry, Aurelia, Orion, Kazuhiko, and many other Commanders of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven could also be seen as after their acquisition of his Lineage, Noah also released them into the Supernal Havens of Extremity.","His voice was light and yet filled with firm power as he spoke towards the Shadow Extremity Overlord who seemed to be conflicted at the power being expressed by the lineage his people obtained and its connection towards this being before them.","\"I have gravely injured and put dozens of Avernus Extremities in compromising conditions light years from this location. If you all were powerful enough, I would tell you this would be the best time to attack them!\"","...!","[What?!]","Words of utmost disbelief rang out from Noah's mouth as even Orion and others stared at him blankly- not being able to believe what he just said at this juncture.","He gravely injured multiple Extremities? How did that even make sense?","And yet Noah nodded as if he was speaking about the most common thing in the world.","\"Yes. The only caveat is that they're likely still being protected by a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity who is still tending to their injuries. Because of our own weakness, that wall cannot yet be scaled. So for now...you all can acclimate to the Supernal Haven of Dissolution and begin accumulating Havenly Treasures that will take you towards and further past Extremity. On the Archipelago in front of us alone...you can even claim Shards of an Armament of Extremity!\"","The stronger the beings who attained his Lineage became, the stronger he became.","Thus, he would let them run free as at this moment, Noah was actively moving to expand his Lineage in unique ways that only he would be able to do!","Much of this...involved him putting to use his Clones and Reified Sources of Extremity, and even the Reified Wealdian Sources of Extremity.","He had them obscure their auras and gain entry across multiple different Vein Rifts that led to entry regions far from the Havely Smilodon Lands, with all of them arriving in regions with variations of the Hyperversal Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineages.","His eyes were sharp as gazed to his right, where millions of light years from here, another one of his bodies had gone past a Golden Havenly Komodo Archipelago as a hundred light years away, he stopped and tapped his feet in the space below him as a dreamy golden landmass formed.","It spread out only for a few thousand miles as it was the size of a small world, with sandy waves of dreams moving across its earth as in the center of this island, this figure of Noah's body transformed into the visage of a mysterious old man whose aura could not be felt by anyone.","Due to his authority as an Absolute Hyperversal Inscrutable Existence, what he portrayed outwardly was what any being saw- regardless of their stage of power, as he transformed himself into an unknown existence filled with age and mystery, and he allowed the Havenly Authority of his Lineage to freely overflow from his body as its grandeur of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority within it radiated outwardly!","Next, he laid down a simple crystalline golden table that began to be filled up with Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage Blood Sources, causing the whole region to pulse with a light of glory and treasure that even exceeded the Halos of Havenly Treasures in the Archipelago light years ahead of him.","Noah had deployed 36 of his bodies currently into different Vein Rifts to test out just how fantastical this path he was taking would play out, with each one adopting an image of a mysterious entity whose aura couldn't even be felt as thereafter, they set up treasured stalls that laid out Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage Blood Sources!","Thereafter, his bodies waited.","And within minutes, light years away from the Komodo Archipelago, Noah's first customers arrived.","The auras of 32 Hyperversal Extremities followed by a few hundred Apex Aeonic Lifeforms who had gained entry could be seen flying forward, the leading Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity turning his head far in the distance where he felt the pulsing waves of Hyperversal Extremity Authority as he motioned with his hands and turned this whole party in this direction.","As they appeared Noah's figure gradually became apparent to them, their gazes changing when they felt the aura of the crimson gold Singularities on his table and the aura they gave off as these beings landed on his dreamy floating landmass.","They were all adorned in silver robes that had the symbol of a crescent moon, this group being part of the Havenly Moon Clan of the Aeonic Havens of Extremity!","One of the powers of the Seven Clans.","The Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity took the lead as seeing the glow of Havenly Authority on Noah they had only discerned on the bodies of Extremities they saw in the Archipelago behind them, they naturally knew that the being before them was a native of the Supernal Havens of Extremity.","One that held an extremely potent Bloodline at that as the grave of Vitalis was particularly domineering around him!","The Zenith Tier 3 Extremity of the Havenly Moon Clan nodded towards Noah's figure that he couldn't sense any aura of as he spoke with calmness.","[What would Esteemed Extremity be doing here with a display of these Havenly Treasures?]","While being referred to as an Esteemed Extremity, Noah's first customers arrived before him in the Supernal Havens of Extremity!"]},{"number":2671,"title":"Chapter 2671: Chapter 2670 The Establishment of the Infernal Havenly Commerce! II","paragraphs":["2670 The Establishment of the Infernal Havenly Commerce! II","The Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity had to motion with his hands behind him to make sure his people didn't surge forward- the allure of the crimson gold Singularities on the table ahead of them being so strong that their souls seemed to innately want to devour them as quickly as possible!","The Apex Aeonic Lifeforms behind them were already breathing hard, their Circulation Modus Operandi moving rapidly as their very cells sought for the treasure ahead.","Noah's visage as an old man was calm at this as he spoke out lazily, filling his voice with Vitalis Hyperversal Authority.","[Vacuous Malignancies are at our gates as you Underdwellers are not as prepared as the Havenly Lineages for what is to come. Very few of you have even undergone your First Vitalis Awakening...]","His words were explosive as the Extremities before him trembled, the leading Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity who was known as Extremity Brightsword gazing at Noah with a complex gaze as he continued!","[What I have here are some things to change your abysmal fates and little connection to Vitalis Hyperversal Authority...]","As he spoke, he picked up one of the crimson gold Singularities on the table and pinched it causing the hearts of the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms behind to drop as if they wanted him to be more careful with it.","[...it is something that will allow traces of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority to flow in your blood, increase your rate of progression towards and past Extremity, allow you to form Absolute Dynamis of Extremity with ease...","among other things. You can trade Extremity Treasures, Relics, Herbs,Havenly Treasures, or even Units of Havenly Aurora if you all aren't too poor for it.]","WAA!","The eyes of the Extremities behind Extremity Brightsword shone as they already slapped their Extremity Relics to release treasures from their storage spaces to pay!","Their souls shuddered when the Entity before them spoke of what these singularities before them could grant.","Their Extremity Souls innately knew the words to be true as this was a boon they truly needed!","The authority of Extremity Brightsword still reigned all of his people in as he nodded towards Noah and waved his hands to reveal a few thousand strands of Havenly Aurora that he had gained by defeating a Zenith Tier 3 Komodo before entering here.","[What is the Esteemed Extremity's Title? I have 13,455 Units of Havenly Aurora here, I wonder how many of the...treasures before us we can buy?]","Everything around Noah was too mysterious.","The glow of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority around him was too glorious as the fact that none of them could sense his aura...either meant he was a monstrous Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity, or something far above this!","Before they affirmed things, they couldn't afford to offend him as they had already seen the cohesiveness of the Havenly Lineages from the Archipelagos they just came from.","At his question, Noah waved his hands to cause 13 crimson gold beads to rise up as he spoke calmly.","[You can call this old man the 9th Infernal Lord. A single Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage Blood Source can trade for 1,000 Units of Havenly Aurora or equivalent Extremity Treasures.]","...!","Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage Blood Sources.","For any beings who attained them from here on out, this would be the name they see as even the Lineage they attained would show itself as the Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage!","The distinction of Quintessence was hidden from them as Noah could do this much as the Progenitor of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage.","Extremity Brightsword nodded at his words while sending the strands of 13,000 Units of Havenly Aurora over, 13 Blood Sources arriving in his hands as under the watch of the Extremities and Apex Aeonic Lifeforms who were watching him intently, he motioned one of the Blood Sources to enter his mouth.","[...]","Everybody watched with bated breaths as an instant later, the pupils of Extremity Brightsword constricted as his body began to glow with terrifying grandeur, a glorious aura erupting around his body soon after as an astounding change occurred in his Lineage- impurities being burnt away as his soul and Concepts cheered when a new lineage carrying traces of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority occupied his existence!","Information flowed into his mind as he truly affirmed all the words this mysterious entity had spoken of before them, not being able to help but laugh gloriously.","[Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage...capable of easily forming Absolute Dynamis of Extremity, increased rate of progression towards and past Extremity...haha, with this, my Havenly Moon Clan can produce astounding geniuses en masse!]","The eyes of Extremity Brightsword radiated even greater power than before as his words caused the Extremities behind him to get restless.","They all looked at the Blood Sources before them as the voice of Extremity Brightsword echoed out in their minds.","'Empty out your storages or any Units of Havenly Aurora you have...we must attain as many Blood Sources as we can!'","The group of beings gazed at the Blood Sources with a light of greed as next, scintillating lights of Treasures of Extremity rose along with dozens of Extremity Relics.","Noah looked at the piles of Loot about to fall in his hands with a veiled smile as he kept his lazily mysterious look outside, the voice of Brightsword continuing to ring out at this moment.","[9th Infernal Lord, I wonder if you also accept Treasures of Extremity conducive in aiding one towards the 18th Layer? They may not be worth much to you...]","[Treasures are treasures...] Noah waved his hands dismissively at the words of this Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity and continued. [...they will only require a higher number, but they will be accepted regardless.]","...!","A moment after these words, scintillating Aeonic Treasures of Extremity in the form of Herbs and other stellar oddities appeared as they formed into a gorgeous mountain above this region!","Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage Blood Sources began to rise as Noah made his first trades- granting existences his Lineage as this gave him fantastical boons to his own power, and he also got a myriad of Loot in return as for the sake of the cultivation of the Quintessential Hyperversal Sporos II of Extremity, vast and endless sources of Loot would be made to flow in!","This was only one of the 36 bodies Noah had released into different Vein Rifts to arrive in 36 different regions of the Supernal Haven of Dissolution.","There would undoubtedly be some risks if an Entity somehow didn't respect the terrifying glow of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority right after seeing how cohesive the Havenly Lineages were, but this risk was currently low as Noah planned to spread his Blood Sources wide while attaining loot for as long as possible.","He would be planting seeds of his power across many Extremities and those about to be Extremities as the more powerful they became...the more powerful he would become!","This...was only the start."]},{"number":2672,"title":"Chapter 2672: Chapter 2671 The Establishment of the Infernal Havenly Commerce! III","paragraphs":["2671 The Establishment of the Infernal Havenly Commerce! III","Atop a starry golden floating island swirling with the essence of dreams, a trade was made.","Noah was given an influx of prompts for all the new treasures he obtained into his Vaults of Quintessence as thousands of golden lines of words rained down.","[You have gained the Soul Nourishing Herb of Extremity.]","[You have gained the Extremity Relic- Glass Cannon.]","[You have gained the Extremity Relic- Earring of the Deceiver.]","Aeonic Treasures of Extremity, Extremity Relics, and much more flowed into his pockets as this...was only the first step.","After Extremity Brightsword secured enough Havenly Blood Sources and the Extremities and Apex Aeonic Lifeforms behind him now radiated a Havenly glow of a lineage that was filled with traces of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority, he affirmed just how revolutionary this power would be for their Clan as he already sent his thoughts into a Communication Medallion to pass the word to the other groups of his Havenly Moon Clan, and even towards the Havenly Moon Extremity Overlord whose main body was in the Bastions of Vitalis facing Vacuous Malignancies!","Extremity Brightsword turned towards Noah's mysterious visage as he spoke hesitatingly.","[Will the Esteemed 9th Infernal Lord continue to be here for the foreseeable days? I will have some more members of my Clan come by to exchange for the Havenly Treasures here...]","9th Infernal Lord.","As he said this title, Brightsword theorized how shocking of a backing and history this being had!","The 9th.","This number always held a profound uniqueness as one of the major questions was...what about the Infernal Lords preceding him? Just how terrifying were they?","At his question, Noah only nodded dismissively as he leaned back on the simple throne he was on, staring out into the vastness with utmost profundity as streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority began to swirl around him!","It was a scene that caused utter shock and awe from the mind of Extremity Brightsword who had reached Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity and knew that even having Vitalis Hyperversal Authority in one's body was already nearly impossible, much less to be capable of controlling it.","This being before them...had to have already undergone the untouchable Vitalis Awakenings!","The image Noah built to scam others was utterly profound as after linking with one of the clusters of one of the Seven Clans, he may as well have gained access to the forces of this whole clan to trade with him as he only had to wait.","More would come, and Loot would flow into him while he freely spread his Lineage!","The first trade was with one of the Seven Clans who were rich in resources, but it wasn't always like this.","After some more time passed, in another region of the Supernal Haven of Dissolution- behind a Havenly Mammoth Archipelago.","One of his clones in this region had members of an Inheritance of Extremity come to his landmass that were much poorer- an inheritance hidden under the eyes of many but holding powerful combatants who managed to gain entry!","They were known as the Extremity Cicada Inheritance.","The most powerful among them was a Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity who gazed at Noah's austere figure with a gaze of hesitation after only being capable of obtaining 20 Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage Blood Sources, blinding eyes of greed of a dozen other Extremities and 28 powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeforms behind him.","This being also addressed Noah as he introduced himself to them.","[Esteemed 9th Infernal Lord, are there any other methods we can use to obtain more Havenly Blood Sources...? We've alerted our forces in the Nether Haven of Dissolution to open up the Vaults to trade even more, but if there are other methods...]","The Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity was actually trying to reason and wiggle around with Noah as he hid his brilliant smile while looking at another path that Oraculum had seen!","He laid this path out now as he spoke with serenity.","[Since you all are too poor, you can also be employed and gain remuneration for your services. My wares are only being sold in the Supernal Havens of Extremity as if you all head back into the Nether Havens and trade on my behalf, you will gain commission of a few Blood Sources depending on your performance. ]","...!","His words caused the eyes of the Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity from the Extremity Cicada Inheritance to constrict as he continued.","[To be employed under my Infernal Havenly Commerce, you just need to be an Extremity and accept this...]","Noah waved his hands to reveal a shockingly Pure stream of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority that caused many gazes to change.","They saw something astounding, not knowing that Vacuous Hyperversal Authority and many more pathogenic authorities were hidden in here!","[This is something to ensure my peace of mind- and the tool to make your employment possible. It will be able to monitor the trades you do and to make sure you act accordingly. If anyone tries anything unsavory past their employment...do not blame me for what happens next. Anyone who becomes part of my Infernal Havenly Commerce will automatically obtain 3 Havenly Blood Sources, with future remuneration depending on performance.]","His words buzzed in the minds of the Extremities as all the ones here found themselves stepping forward with seriousness.","Noah's devilish smile was hidden from them as he waved his hands to cause over a dozen Hyperversal Anomalous Virions to appear, going towards the bodies of the Extremities that could not turn down such an opportunity to obtain more of these resources to provide for their Inheritance!","After they were successfully implanted with the Virions, Noah provided them simple golden blue robes with a lemniscate infinity symbol shining with a crimson flaming light.","His voice was majestic as he employed Hyperversal Extremities to spread his Lineage for him, the threat of the Hyperversal Anomalous Virions falling on them should they ever violate any terms as with the air of mystery he had already built- it was hard to say if, or when, an employee of his newly enacted Infernal Havenly Commerce would try to violate his terms.","The Hyperversal Anomalous Virion would also serve as the Nexus of the trades as since it held his authorities and a trace of his will, he could easily take out Blood Sources through it or take in other Loot into his Vaults of Quintessence through this Virion!","This was something he affirmed with Oraculum as with the authority of Lotra and Quintessence flowing in the Virion among many others, achieving something like this was not an impossibility.","[The Infernal Havenly Stream I've placed inside of your Aspects of Existence will grant you the Blood Sources you will need to trade, and any Extremity Treasures you obtain will be taken into the Infernal Havenly Stream.]","As if to express his words in action, his will activated within the Hyperversal Anomalous Virion as it didn't erase the layers of Authority between Vacuous and Vitalis Authorities, it instead utilized Quintessence to transfer three Havenly Blood Sources from his Vaults of Quintessence and into their Aspects of Existence!","The Extremities before him who had undergone a change in their lineage to attain his Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage took out the three Blood Sources with shining eyes as Noah spoke while waving his hands dismissively.","[3 Blood Sources for becoming employees of the Infernal Havenly Commerce. Use whatever means you have trade as this will decide how much more you receive in remuneration...work hard.]","He...truly began putting Hyperversal Extremities he had never met before to use.","With shining eyes, they communicated amidst each other as over 80% of the Extremities from the Cicada Inheritance turned around and headed back towards the misty wall of Dissolution that led into the Nether Havens of Extremity!","Only Noah could make such a grand thing possible!"]},{"number":2673,"title":"Chapter 2673: Chapter 2672 A Refulgence of Loot! I","paragraphs":["2672 A Refulgence of Loot! I","The Infernal Havenly Commerce.","Noah established it and employed the first set of Extremities from the Cicada Inheritance, this being yet another pathway for him to quickly gain a stream of constant loot.","Another one...was through his already established connections with another Clan of the Seven Clans and a powerful Aeonic Inheritance of Extremity!","—","In the Vaults of the Sima Clan.","Noah's figure had moved away from the Iron Heart that he couldn't make any more gains from, the Extremity of Foundation laughing freely while appreciating the fact that Noah was able to even touch the Armament of Extremity!","[Coming in contact with it means you've already attained the 17th Layer if not close to it. You must have your own secrets and fortune that brought you here so I won't pry...]","Both he and Erikson were looking at Noah like the monstrous being he was as he waved his hands freely.","\"No, I have to thank you for the opportunity. To that end...I can share with you something critical that I obtained with my body that first stepped into the Supernal Havens of Extremity.\"","As he spoke, Noah waved his hands to reveal 10 dazzling Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage Blood Sources that instantly caused the Extremity of Foundation to become somber!","He could feel the silent yet ever-present glow of Vitalis on these crimson-","gold singularities as Noah spoke with a grave tone.","[For being the first existence to step into the Supernal Havens of Extremity, I gained these at a much cheaper cost compared to others from a Havenly Archipelago under the banner of something called the Infernal Havenly Commerce. It is a Blood Source that alters your Lineage to increase your rate of progression towards and past Extremity, form Absolute Dynamis of Extremity easily...]","Noah listed just some of the boons of the Blood Sources as the figure of Extremity of Foundation became more somber at every word, motioning as one of the Blood Sources fell into his hands as he studied it closely!","His soul was much more reserved than others as he asked in a grave tone.","[You've taken it yourself?]","\"Mmm.\" Noah nodded lightly as he motioned the rest of the 9 Blood Sources to float towards father and son.","\"I've shared them with my own people too, so I'll use these as thanks.\"","Lies were woven with truths as Noah spoke with a straight face, Erikson and the Extremity of Foundation grasping the Blood Sources and looking at them closely as the latter voiced out in a powerful tone.","[I'll have the Seer of Sima take a look and confirm if there are any detrimental effects. If they're everything you say...they will change the course of power for those who consume them! You said you got them from the Supernal Haven of Dissolution?]","The Extremity of Foundation asked in a heavy tone as Noah smiled.","This was another one of the Seven Clans latching on to the bait as Noah only had to wait until they also began attaining his Lineage speedily!","It wasn't just the Sima Clan as in the periphery of the Infinite Oni Haven, Noah was beside a heavily breathing Ayame who was trying to get ever closer to the Bow of Helios, 10 Blood Sources also stretched out before her as Noah spun a similar story.","The Aeonic Inheritance of Infinite Extremity would also soon gain access to his Blood Sources as their terrifying Entities were bound to be connected to Noah's Lineage one way or another.","And then, there was one last avenue that Noah was currently pursuing.","In the Nether Haven of Dissolution.","One of his bodies had appeared far from the dense number of Vein Rifts that had more and more forces entering, his figure above the lands of the Planeswalkers as he gazed at the endlessly dark skies while calling out.","\"O Adjudicator of Dissolution.\"","WAA!","His voice didn't travel far.","And yet within the next second, pristine waves of Hyperversal Extremity of Dissolution descended and wrapped around him, and his figure appeared in the unique space that seemed to be overlooking the stretches of planes and light years of Dissolution, the scene of Vein Rifts and the endlessly extending Extremity Vein being seen far in the distance.","Noah didn't pay attention to this as his eyes were on the Extremity Clone of the Adjudicator of Dissolution, their deal of him siphoning her aura of Extremity still standing, but he arrived while waving his hands to reveal 10 dazzling Blood Sources!","With a smile, he spoke out.","\"I wonder what the Curagulus of Extremity would think about a treasure like this...\"","Another pathway he had foreseen was with the Adjudicator of Dissolution and the Curagulus of Extremity she was connected to, this being a major network of powerhouses extending across multiple Clans and Inheritances as some of them were even secretly Members of the Senatus of Extremity!","An example was the Adjudicator of Dissolution...she was elected to be the Adjudicator of the Haven of Dissolution as of course, she was a Member of the Senatus of Extremity.","And yet she also had her secret identity as a member of the Curagulus of Extremity.","Her veiled face at the sight of the Blood Source was extremely stern, where even though she was veiled, Noah noticed a much more pronounced reaction from her compared to other Extremities that caused him to raise his brows.","But all this faded an instant later as she motioned and took one of the Blood Sources into her hands.","[...Where did you get this?]","Her gorgeous voice rang out with authority as Noah's eyes turned into devilish crescent smiles.","—","In the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, Noah stared at a Quintessential Hyperversal Sporos II of Extremity while waves of Quintessence and other Havenly Authorities coalesced around him.","He had moved away from the Apollyon Aletheian Haven as he now stood at the center of the newly built Havens of Dissolution, Helios, and Genesis that Noah didn't create in multiple separate layers- but he had instead begun the construction of these havens as if they were pieces of a large pie, with the Havenly Authorities of Dissolution, Helios, and Genesis meeting at the very center where an overabundance of Quintessence flourished.","The land itself shone with a stellar multicolored radiance as above Noah, obsidian, crimson gold, and white Cosmos of massive stature spun in the skies, with the earth filled with paradisiacal mountains and small floating islands gushing Dissolution, Helios, and Genesis freely.","In the center of such a landmass, Noah sat down on the stellar multicolored grassland as he motioned his hands towards the Sporos II of Extremity, a stream of Aeonic Treasures of Extremity and other types of Loot he had gained from the Havenly Moon Clan and Inheritances that his body were currently meeting...all this loot was flowing towards this dazzling set to aid in its maturity.","Many sources of Loot were established as Noah now enjoyed a steady stream, with the Loot entering his Vaults of Quintessence cycled to go into his Infinite Forge where they were multiplied by Ruination by a varying factor that so far ranged from 10x to 20x depending on the type of Loot!","This was how stupendous her capabilities to multiply loot had become as she sought to exceed her limitations as an Extremity Relic and become an Armament of Extremity.","After the loot was multiplied by Ruination, it was cycled back to his Vaults of Quintessence where Noah's will sorted through it to see whether some could be designated towards his people, or if all of it flowed towards the Sporos II of Extremity.","Then, apart from all this, there was the continued Refulgence of Loot that was coming from the raging storms of Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authorities that the Avernus Extremities were still unable to solve!","Noah stared at the shocking piles of three mountainous waves of pulsating Hyperversal Extremity as their details rose before him.","[Shard of the Hyperversal Havenly Eye of Extremity]:: Those who have not attained Extremity can never truly understand what Extremity is or what it entails. Through your authorities raging within the Aspects of Existence of an existence that has attained Extremity, you have discerned some of the truths and gained the Shard of Hyperversal Havenly Eye of Extremity. 100 of such Shards will allow you to gain the Hyperversal Havenly Eye of Extremity that grants you the authority to observe and see the higher dimension of power known as Havenly Hyperversal Extremity Rune Scriptures that are the backbone of the power of Existences that attained Extremity. The Extremity Rune Scriptures are only born when a concept reaches Extremity, and being capable of at least viewing this higher form of power may aid you in achieving Extremity yourself, or aid you in comprehending how to destroy Extremity Rune Scriptures of your enemies...","...!","The first Loot to come from damaging Hyperversal Extremities was an astounding one!","100 Shards of such loot were required, and in his Vaults of Quintessence...","there lay 76 currently.","And the Avernus Extremities had yet to overcome his Hyperversal Anomalous Virion as steadily, more of such Loot continued to come!"]},{"number":2674,"title":"Chapter 2674: Chapter 2673 A Refulgence of Loot! II","paragraphs":["2673 A Refulgence of Loot! II","The Shard of the Hyperversal Havenly Eye of Extremity looked like a piece of an ancient pupil filled with a profound splendor- the 76 pieces Noah had collected acting like pieces of a puzzle that were gradually coming together to reveal a multicolored pupil with an astonishing runic character etched in unique strokes that translated to [EXTREMITY].","It was literally an Eye to allow one to gaze upon Extremity.","To see the Havenly Hyperversal Extremity Rune Scriptures that made the core strength of Extremities!","And this was only one of the three types of Loot Noah had attained from the bodies of Hyperversal Extremities.","The other ones...were even more astonishing.","[Golden Hyperversal Bones of Gradation]:: The very structure of a Hyperversal Extremity is filled with grand Extremity Rune Scriptures, and your actions shook these very scriptures in a show of a grand achievement. The product of shaking the foundation of a Hyperversal Extremity made way for the Hyperversal Bones of Gradation- tools that once you absorb the authority of, your bones will begin a process of being forged to become Hyperversal Extremity Bones of Gradation. If your whole skeleton can be forged to become filled with Hyperversal Extremity Bones of Gradation, you're halfway towards Extremity as you will already have the skeletal structure to support it...","[Hyperversal Marrow Soul Singularities]:: The very structure of a Hyperversal Extremity is filled with grand Extremity Rune Scriptures, and your actions shook these very scriptures in a show of a grand achievement. The product of shaking the Soul of a Hyperversal Extremity made way for the Hyperversal Marrow Soul Singularities that once absorbed, your soul will be forged to become a Hyperversal Extremity Soul...","The former was a cluster of golden stellar bones releasing an air of ancientness and majesty, each of them seeming like Titanic skeletal realities that could not belong to a single being!","About 98 Golden Hyperversal Bones of Gradation came from Tier 1 and Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities, with 22 Obsidian bones on the side that stemmed from Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities that were affected by Noah's Virion- their effectiveness being that much greater in their description.","The latter was shaped like an ever spinning dew that radiated waves of pure Hyperversal Authority- their purpose being similar to what Noah's Sporos II of Extremity would achieve, but to a lesser extent as they would only grant him a Hyperversal Extremity Soul.","The Quintessential Hyperversal Sporos II of Extremity would grant Noah a Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul that was one of a kind!","So Noah wasn't at all prompted to use this loot as he asked the most important question.","\"What do you think?\"","His words were directed to a single entity as her light of grandeur flashed over the Loot from Hyperversal Extremities.","And her reply was a magisterial one.","[They carry a semblance of Extremity as since I haven't reached it myself, the effectiveness of multiplying them had been reduced greatly. I may be able to double or triple them at the very least, but an upside of this is that my own tier will continue to rise by processing loot like this and multiplying it- since it means things that carry a semblance of Extremity are being processed through me. Once I achieve the qualitative change to become an Armament of Extremity, I should be able to multiply loot like this by a factor of 10 or even 20.]","...!","Her words were sweet ones that could act like a lullaby to Noah if ever he wanted to doze off.","Even though she hadn't achieved the stage of an Armament of Extremity, she could still multiply the times before him- albeit in a very limited fashion!","But this was more than enough for Noah as he spoke while Quintessence radiated from his body.","[Start with the Shards of the Hyperversal Havenly Eye of Extremity, and then proceed with the rest.]","...!","HUUM!","As soon as he spoke, it was like an engine came to life.","The dazzling shards forming a pupil before him were sucked into his soul towards the Infinite Forge, Noah observed the crimson gold humanoid figure of RUINATION wave her hands calmly while her body radiated a profound power!","She looked like an artificer from eons ago as she worked her wonders, a Shard being taken between her palms as a blast of a Singularity bloomed from thereafter, and one became two.","These two were then out aside as another shard came between her palms, a singularity exploding forth as this time, three shards in total appeared!","An approximate product of 2 or 3 loot from a single one- loot that carried traces of Extremity at that!","It was why that in real time, Noah watched the 76 Shards of the Hyperversal Havenly Eye of Extremity he had attained begin to scale upwards as within a minute...","SHAA!","188 Shards of the Hyperversal Havenly Eye of Extremity appeared!","Noah waved his hand to collect 100 that came together to complete a dazzling pupil with a runic character of Extremity, the other 88 Shards being taken out of the forge and funneled towards the Sporos II of Extremity that after a steady stream of multiplied Loot Noah had already given...this seed had only moved from .0001 to .01 Maturity.","But when the first Shard of Hyperversal Havenly Eye of Extremity was devoured by this endlessly hungering seed...","[Quintessential Hyperversal Sporos II of Extremity]:: .11% Maturity...","It moved from .01 to .11!","Noah smiled at such a scene as he affirmed the crucial reality of Loot.","\"Destroying Extremities is the most profitable...\"","His eyes pulsed with a light of tyrannical greed as the other 87 Shards flowed into the Sporos II of Extremity, the maturity rising all the way to 8.81% in a single swoop.","Nearly a tenth of the way there for a completely cultivated seed that would birth an Ash Tree of Gradation to grant Noah yet another completed Aletheian Haven and a baptism of his Soul!"]},{"number":2675,"title":"Chapter 2675: Chapter 2674 A Refulgence of Loot! III","paragraphs":["2674 A Refulgence of Loot! III","After the seed swallowed up the Shards of the Hyperversal Havenly Eye of Extremity, Noah observed RUINATION begin to multiply the Obsidian and Golden Hyperversal Bones of Gradation along with the Hyperversal Marrow Soul Singularities as while this process was underway, he took the completed wonder of 100 Shards of the Hyperversal Havenly Eye of Extremity into his Aspects of Existence.","...!","An incandescent beam of light was what manifested first from his eyes- his nine pupils that rotated like ancient engines all blaring out with maddening grandeur as the pupils of the character of [EXTREMITY] was merged into them.","Nothing was taken away as they only added on to the majesty swirling within Noah's eyes, with his soul feeling like a branding was being burnt into his very pupils as the pain was immeasurable!","And yet Noah only observed closely as gradually, what he was actively seeing changed.","[You have obtained the Hyperversal Havenly Eye of Extremity!]","His Nine-Pupiled Eyes shone with an iridescent light as in their very center, the character of EXTREMITY was carved in with valor and glory!","He gained a sight that would allow him to see things he hadn't been able to see before.","When he gazed at an Extremity now...just what wondrous sight would he see?","The authority within his eyes was branded onto his soul and carried over across his bodies, his Existence being capable of ascertaining a glimpse of what Extremity truly was as he was able to quickly focus his gaze on such beings right away!","Above the Obsidian Havenly Saurischian Archipelago.","Noah's figure had rebuffed the Avernus Extremities as he was floating amidst dazzling Halos of Havenly Treasures, over 100,000 Units of Havenly Aurora pocketed by him from forcing Extremity Blue to retreat along with other Avernus Extremities.","He glanced at the expansive light of Halos all around him as Loot capable of aiding one across the Boundary Layers, Extremity Relics, Fragments of Armaments of Extremity, and many more wonders lay before him, but before he could grab any of them...","[Let's talk.]","The grandiose voice of none other than a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity rang out behind him.","The Havenly Master of this Archipelago.","A Havenly Titanosaurus!","When turned around and laid his eyes on this being...he had to squint and almost turn away at the shocking brightness he emanated.","His whole existence seemed like a swirling storm of utmost majesty and power as this grandness didn't just remain in his body, with Noah observing the Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures for the first time as the being before him held so much that they spilled out from his body and affected the nearby space around him!","—","As Noah laid his eyes truly on Extremity for the first time, a significant event was taking place innumerable light years away- towards the very center of the Supernal Haven of Dissolution.","The speed of some Existences was vastly different compared to others.","The speed of a unique Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity...was utterly monstrous as one such being was among the first to gain entry into the Supernal Havens of Extremity!","Emperor Shao had crossed the Supernal Haven of Dissolution as if he had an intent and direction of exactly where he wanted to go, crossing over countless light years and passing across many Golden and Obsidian Havenly Archipelagos.","He crossed regions where the Hyperversal Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineages were common, until he entered regions governed by the Hyperversal Havenly Plantae and Riboviria.","Ultimately, he reached a titanic Crimson Haven Archipelago that was filled with terrifying auras across it, its size alone being something akin to hundreds of thousands of minor Havens.","Such a landmass was one that held representatives of all the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages, and the Main Branch of the Havenly Vaults of Extremity in the Supernal Haven of Dissolution!","Complex and innovative structures, vessels, and wonders floated across it as 20% of it was filled with archaic vegetation and forests that vibrated with life.","Emperor Shao arrived at such a location as he gazed at the beginnings of the floating landmass with utmost coldness.","He didn't enter, instead pulling out a golden paper talisman that began to burn with a brilliant white flame in his hands.","Halfway through this burning talisman, the space in front of Emperor Shao fluctuated as a terrifying aura warped in!","It had to at the very minimum be a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity as a burning golden misty light covered everything about them, their face barely becoming visible to show halcyon colored skin and white-gold strands of hair flowing gorgeously past her shoulders.","Golden colored skin!","She had glazed eyes that contained an uncountable number of Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures, their gaze piercing as if they could see through the vast majority of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.","Her body radiated the Havenly Authority of the Hyperversal Havenly Celestia Extremity Lineage as around her skin, streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority freely flowed.","This was an Existence that had at the very least undergone their Second Vitalis Awakening!","A crescent smile covered her lips as her eyes could be the downfall of entire Havens, her words profoundly resonant as she spoke while gazing at Emperor Shao.","[The Son of Celestia cast from Haven and into hell is finally able to return...it is good to see you again, Shao.]","...!","Her eyes held a myriad of complex emotions at the coldness that this man before her displayed, but Emperor Shao kept his gaze as he nodded and freely spoke to this Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity!","[I'm assuming what is mine has been prepared and is ready for me?]","His words were calm, his tone as if he were talking to someone of his own level or even slightly below him!","And yet the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity Celestia only smiled and nodded at his words as a blinding light rose from her to wrap around the both of them.","[Everything that was promised on the Oath. Come...]","With a glimmer of light, the two Existences disappeared into the grandiose Archipelago behind them.","An Archipelago that had many auras of Existences at Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity, not to mention the unknown number of Existences radiating the grandeur of Tier 4!"]},{"number":2676,"title":"Chapter 2676: Chapter 2675 An Endless War! I","paragraphs":["2675 An Endless War! I","Inside the Crimson Havenly Archipelago that Emperor Shao had just disappeared into.","Within its depths, layers of pockets of planes of existence were stretched across the massive structures and complex architecture.","Across the many planes of this Archipelago, there was a small one that was constructed entirely of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority, the space within it simmering with a pristine transparent white light as it seemed spotless and utterly empty of any filth!","In such a domain, a simple hut radiating age and vicissitude floated, the figure of a middle aged man with iridescent golden skin and white gold hair sitting outside of this hut as when he breathed in, Vitalis flowed into his nose.","When he breathed out, even more waves of Vitalis flowed out as the surroundings became that much richer!","He adorned a simple white robe that pulsed with the silent light of an Armament of Extremity","His body itself didn't emanate any waves of power as one couldn't be sure if he was at Tier 1 of Extremity, Tier 4...or even possibly beyond it.","He seemed to stare out into nothingness, and yet he could see things that other Extremities could not even imagine with his gaze alone!","At this moment, the calm area around him was interrupted as another figure warped in, bowing respectfully with her curvaceous figure as her golden skin smoothly absorbed the Vitalis Hyperversal Authority in the surroundings.","[Shao has returned, Master.]","[Mmm...]","Her coming to inform him of this was only protocol as this being had long since foreseen this many years ago when he was perusing Unrecorded Histories!","Seeing his calm response, the woman bowing towards him and emanating profound waves of power at the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity level had a difficult expression arise.","She sighed in her heart, but as if this being before her could read her soul, his words rang out.","[You question why I rebuked him so harshly and sent him to the Nether Havens of Extremity all those years ago. It had to happen this way. What we need are not coddled children, but Champions. Now that he has returned, he won't lose out much from not being here all these years as an inheritance worth billions of Units of Havenly Aurora is being accepted by him. What remains to be seen is what his years worth of work will amount to once his potential explodes all at once...]","His voice was serene and filled with ancientness.","Vitalis Hyperversal Authority seemed to become more active at his words as the woman bowing towards him became all that more respectful!","—","Outside the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains.","Atop a Bastion of Vitalis, a white robed Emperor Shao was in a seated position while stroking his sword.","Around him, the scene was constantly changing as waves of Extremities proficient in Vacuous Hyperversal Authority were being deployed, while those who hand grasped this authority yet stayed within the bounds of Vitalis as reinforcements and support.","All of them stared gravely at the massive and numerous Hyperversal Savior's Arks that were made of 9 spinning wheels of exterminating light, a dense number of Extremities protecting the depths of this Ark as around it- a terrific domain was released that pushed away Vitalis Hyperversal Authority!","In the field of this domain, tens of millions of Apex Vacuous Lifeforms brimmed with power, while within the Savior's Arks themselves, 100 Hyperversal Extremities remained with grandeur!","They had gotten ever closer as it seemed a flash was imminent, these massive vessels already entering the gray field where Vitalis and Vacuous constantly repulsed each other.","The visage of Emperor Shao gazed at all this as he spoke towards the blazing aura at the center of this particular Bastion of Vitalis- the aura of the Esteemed Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity overseeing this defensive like!","[Since the day I was born, I was told that Vacuous Malignancies were our greatest enemies that were seeking our very Annihilation. Even then, we were at war.]","...!","As he spoke, his seated figure began to rise.","His simple rising motion caused the surrounding reality to begin trembling, the nearby Extremities beginning to feel a heavy pressure rousing from him as he became alarmed!","The Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity his words were directed to radiated light as he entirely focused on Emperor Shao who continued at this moment.","[Before I was born, Vacuous Malignancies were still our enemies as a war was being fought even then. Cornelius...do you remember when we weren't at war?]","WAA!","His word caused the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity to pulse with a grandiose light as he didn't reply!","This was because before he was even born, there was a war. And after he came to be, he simply became another being to fight in this war!","At this point, Emperor Shao had entirely stood up as the pressure he radiated caused the surroundings to shake even more, the nearby Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities feeling a stifling pressure as they moved away in shock.","He grasped the sword he had been stroking this whole time as from his hands, transparent white streams of light began to gather and flow into the sword.","[This...!]","Seeing this scene, Esteemed Cornelius was shocked as the words of Shao continued!","[It seems that we have always been at war, and we will continue to be at war. Even me...I do not think I will be significant enough to stop this war. I do not know what or who needs to rise...in order to finally put this war to rest.]","HOOONG!","His body exploded with horrific and fantastical power.","The streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority around him became denser and denser as they transformed into a raging river of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority that wrapped around the sword and roared out with maddening grandeur!","His caramel-colored skin began to be tinted with a golden hue as his dark hair gained traces of white gold, a glorious Havenly Authority erupting around him as every single action he took caused great alarm and shock to rise.","What was this?","Was this the same being who had not even undergone his First Vitalis Awakening minutes ago?","Why was he now controlling Vitalis Hyperversal Authority, and in such an obscene fashion at that?!"]},{"number":2677,"title":"Chapter 2677: Chapter 2676 An Endless War! II","paragraphs":["2676 An Endless War! II","The pressure alone that Emperor Shao released caused other Hyperversal Extremities to scramble away from him in shock, not able to bear the sheer pressure he emanated as his whole body seemingly became a sharp sword of Vitalis!","The pressure was so maddening as it continued to build up that in no time...","this expansion Bastion of Vitalis they stood on no longer had a single blaring aura that stood excellently at Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity.","An unknown and spectacular change was occurring within Emperor Shao in real time as the pressure he released rose from the Zenith of Tier 3 to Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity!","His body resonated with the sword in his right hand.","A resplendent glow of transparent white light engulfed him and everything nearby as the Vitalis Hyperversal Authority that was always immovable was freely wrapped around his sword!","KAAA!","A fearsome cry thundered out from the sword that now revealed itself to be an Armament of Extremity, and Emperor Shao spoke out calmly as he swung the sword down.","[On this day, I shall join the ranks of innumerable fodder that have been ground down by this endless war..hoping that before every part of me is gone, I may be able to see an end.]","...!","With a light wave of his sword, brilliance unfolded.","The Extremities nearby felt their souls shudder as if their records were being erased from existence just by being near this sword strike!","A Sword of Vitalis!","Many of them couldn't break out of this illusion instantly as only after some time passed did they come back to attention- just in time to capture the shocking effects of Emperor Shao's simple swing.","Across the gray region where Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities clashed, a dazzling sword light of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority struck out as it stretched out for light years!","It was so quick that it traversed the gray region and instantly entered the Vacuous Hyperversal Domains, cutting apart the obsidian authority as if it were tearing through musculature as in a matter of moments- the sword light arrived before a Hyperversal Savior's Ark.","And with a flash of brilliance, the tens of millions of Apex Vacuous Lifeforms in front of the domain released by the Ark were illuminated by the sword light as countless sword marks instantly bloomed over their bodies, and an instant later...they flickered to ash as every record about them was eradicated.","The sword light then struck on the rings of the Savior's Ark as only now did the reactions of the 100 Extremities protecting it bloom!","And the result, was utter terror as if these Extremities were akin to meat on a chopping block, the sword light swung forth!","[HO...!]","[Ah!]","Aspects of Existence and Records alike were filled with innumerable sword wounds dripping with Vitalis as a dozen of the forefront Extremities had their bodies turn into flickers of sword dust in an instant.","The Sword of Vitalis smashed into the Hyperversal Savior's Ark in a shocking fashion as a jagger wound instantly formed, the sword light seeming unstoppable as it was bound to cut right through this Ark within the next moments!","But this was when a sea of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority descended from the depths of the endless legions of Vacuous Malignancies.","It radiated the grandeur of a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity as this Sea intently surged to block the Sword of Vitalis, the visage of a gorgeous dark-haired woman appearing in front of it as her hand gushed out Abyssal waves of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.","BZZT!","And yet the Sword of Vitalis still buzzed and cracked as her gaze changed, the nothingness to her left side warping as yet another figure appeared- a man radiating the same power as her at Tier 4 as his hand swung down, manifesting a massive illusory obsidian hand from above that grabbed on to the Sword of Vitalis!","The flicker of sword lights roared out with glory and wonder as only after the massive illusory hand and sea of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority from two Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities wrapped around it...did it weaken its brilliance before moments after, it was swallowed up into nothingness.","[....]","The battlefield was silent.","The dark haired Vacuous Malignancy had a somber gaze as she stared at the Hyperversal Savior's Ark they had stopped the destruction of- half of it being cleaved as Vacuous Hyperversal Authority was flowing into it en masse to heal its structures.","Her gaze and the gazes of many then turned to the innumerable Bastions of Extremity in the distance, focusing on the Bastion that had the visage of a single man with a white haired robe and a sword in his hands.","Emperor Shao!","His single Sword strike had ushered forth a shocking start to this battle as two Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities had to come together to stop it, such a start rousing the wrath of all Vacuous Malignancies as beginning with the dark haired woman...","[OOOOH!]","She released a horrific bellow as her jaws opened wider and wider, millions of tentacles sprouting from them as her whole body soon enlarged into a massive monstrosity, a sea of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority following her as she thundered forth towards the gray region!","Behind her, swathes of Legions of Vacuous Malignancies followed as the Hyperversal Savior's Ark carried their forces forward!","And in the midst of this unfolding battle...there was a man who gazed at everything with Quintessence and tyranny.","Mixed in an Ark that was only 1 away from the target Emperor Shao, Noah marveled at the transparent white sword light that nearly tore apart a Hyperversal Savior's Ark had it not been for the interference of two Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities!","The source of the sword light could be seen clearly even from this distance as he...was shining so brightly.","Noah's Eyes of Extremity were now able to see so much more as from what wasn't veiled to him and others, he was able to see what the Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures really were.","Each one had its own unique identity as a single Extremity Rune Scripture had its glorious strokes representing a concept that had achieved Extremity!","The Extremity Rune Scripture Noah could see the most of around Emperor Shao...was a crimson colored scripture reading [SWORD].","And such a scripture wasn't alone as innumerable clusters of Scriptures of the [SWORD] seemed to fill all of Emperor Shao's existence- with Noah only being able to discern those outside of him as he actively used them!","But it seemed that within his body, Extremity Rune Scriptures of the [SWORD] and an unknown number of other concepts that had achieved Extremity were what made up his entire existence.","His existence and the existence of all Extremities...were supported by the very concepts they took to Extremity in the form of Extremity Rune Scriptures!","Even though he found it hard not to, Noah pulled his eyes away from this being as he glanced at the other Extremities.","The female Vacuous Hyperversal Extremity who had erupted with endless tentacles from her mouth was now a circular monstrosity with tendrils of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority all around it, seeming like a cosmic devourer as around her figure, Noah saw crimson colored Extremity Rune Scriptures that read [VACUOUS] in abundance, as well as obsidian Extremity Rune Scriptures that read [ANNIHILATION], [VOID], [TITAN], and more.","He turned his head to all the myriad of Extremities around him as he gradually peeled back the secrecy of Extremity.","The Vacuous Malignancies.","The Vitalis Malignancies.","He saw different things between all of these beings.","He saw crimson, obsidian, and on the bodies of Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities...he saw Golden Extremity Rune Scriptures.","Every single Scripture represented a concept at Extremity...and yet some of these concepts were colored gold, obsidian, and the most pristine ones were crimson!"]},{"number":2678,"title":"Chapter 2678: Chapter 2677 An Endless War! III","paragraphs":["2677 An Endless War! III","The grandeur of Golden, Obsidian, and Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures was astounding to gaze upon, and simply being able to view it gave one a glimpse of just how powerful the Extremity was.","Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities held dim Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures, and there weren't all that many in abundance around their bodies.","Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities were the beings Noah began seeing Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures around, the glow of their dim Golden Scriptures being slightly brighter as their obsidian ones overshadowed everything they held.","Then there were the Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity who shone with a crimson glow around some of their Scriptures.","Then, there were beings like the one who had struck out with his sword.","Vitalis Hyperversal Authority coiled around him like a snake as the potency and sheer number of Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures were blinding to look at.","And as Noah and the others watched the forces of the Vacuous Hyperversal Legions thunder forward while the Bastions of Vitalis sent out their own forces, the more prominent forces on both sides noticed how the aura of the being who had thrown out the first strike continued to rise!","He was watching and observing this being with scrutiny as his records were barely visible even to him now, the Annals of Extremity seemingly resounding and booming his name across them at this moment!","[Shao...! Shao...! Shao...!]","It was a surreal scene even for Noah as he had done astounding feats and gotten awarded with waves of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority that led to his First Awakenings.","But what he was seeing now was utterly ridiculous as the very Aeonic Annals of Extremity recording the currently playing realityseemed to be chanting this being's name!","Emperor Shao!","His aura and majesty reached a precipice at such a juncture as Noah watched his Scriptures radiate a blinding light, and an instant thereafter...","WAA!","His radiance instantly vanished.","No more Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures could be seen from him.","When Noah gazed at his again, the Scriptures pulsing and swirling around him had seemingly all disappeared as under the eyes of all, so did his aura!","He no longer gave off the pressure and majesty of a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity.","\"...\"","And yet his mere existence to the Vacuous Hyperversal Legions seemed to become that much more immense, multiple Tier 4 Hyperversal Vacuous Extremities gathering in front of the Hyperversal Savior's Ark coming directly before the path of Emperor Shao as if they had met one of the more terrifying combatants on this battlefield!","Noah observed this scene closely as it seemed after reaching a certain level, the auras existences radiated outwards could be forcefully reigned in as one wouldn't be able to tell of their shocking level of power.","This was something that would bode well for him who was an Inscrutable Existence who also held the capabilities of Obfuscation!","Nobody could see through him as when it came to keeping his mystery as the 9th Infernal Lord of the Infernal Havenly Commerce, no immediate problems should arise.","These were his thoughts, but he still couldn't fully turn his will away from the terrifying being that even the Aeonic Annals of Extremity were resonating accolades of!","And with such an entrance and start to the battle, the forces of both sides finally came close enough within the gray region as they were about to clash.","'Hoo...'","At such a juncture, Noah focused and breathed out as his body mixed in with the tens of millions of Apex Vacuous Lifeforms was pulled along the path of the Savior's Ark he was in.","Others made their grand entrances into this battle as he...would make a silent one!","He wouldn't be showy.","At least, not now.","His body brimmed with a unique power as he felt the soul that had gotten baptized with the Ash Tree of Gradation once.","His thought process and everything else regarding the control of his authorities and essence reached an immaculate level as at this moment, streams of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority rose out of his body and silently joined the waves of nothingness all around him.","And yet within these streams of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority, there were thousands of Hyperversal Anomalous Virions that Noah had already altered to fit this battle!","Beforehand, the Virions had Vacuous Hyperversal Authority hidden within, and they had a layer of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority outside that made the Extremities within the Seven Havens feel an Innate need to take it in.","Now, Noah had flipped this around and placed Vitalis in and utilized Vacuous as the cover, his Soul having been rapidly producing these Virions in this unique absence of time and space as tens of thousands of Virions were being produced every moment!","And now, they needed into the waves of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority in the surroundings as Noah directed his poisonous will towards a Hyperversal Savior's Ark to the right of the massive one he was in.","100 Million Apex Vacuous Lifeforms and 100 Extremities were within this Savior's Ark.","Every so silently and without notice, the streams of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority all around them became permeated with tens of thousands of Virions that were quickly blooming up towards Hundreds of Thousands, Noah's soul moving like a vast and endless engine as he mass produced Virions carrying Lotra and Quintessence among other authorities, his altered Blood Source bringing it all together as he prepared for a massive incursion!","It was all for the sake of Loot that would make his pathway of achieving Extremity within 7 days possible.","A pathway of loot was opened through his Infernal Havenly Commerce.","Another one through the Avernus Extremities affected by the Hyperversal Anomalous Virions.","His Infinite Forge continued to release waves of Loot Light as within it, RUINATION multiplied all received loot to even more alarming levels.","Now...Noah would create another pathway of loot through the war occurring against legions of Vacuous Malignancies!","He chose a side as his blade did not point towards the Vitals Malignancies!"]},{"number":2679,"title":"Chapter 2679: Chapter 2678 An Endless War! IV","paragraphs":["2678 An Endless War! IV","He carried both the Innate Vitalis Hyperversal Meridians and Innate Vacuous Hyperversal Meridians as to others, he could be considered an abomination of Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authorities.","But many of his interests lay in the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains currently.","In the Seven Aeonic Havens where he had just begun devouring the Planes of Existence into his Infinite Hyperversal Haven!","He had not yet arrived into the Vacuous Hyperversal Domains nor had he devoured any of their lands.","At this moment, the ties with Vitalis were much, much stronger as his Quintessential blade pointed itself towards Vacuous Lifeforms.","His Virions silently permeated across the waves of nothingness and began entering the bodies of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, and the even more specifically targeted 100 Extremities protecting the Hyperversal Savior's Ark.","Silent and deadly.","These were his current means as by the time that the two sides clashed, his Virions were spread across 50% of the existences within the single Savior's Ark!","[Your soul is mass producing the altered Hyperversal Anomalous Virions at a Quintessential pace.]","[Your proficiency in the production of Hyperversal Anomalous Virions is quintessentially rising!]","Majesty begets even more majesty.","Power allows one to attain even more power!","Millions of Virions were mass produced by Noah as within moments, 100 Million Apex Aeonic Lifeforms and 100 Extremities ranging from Tier 1 to Tier 3 were infected!","In between the Domain Fields of the Savior's Arks, the brilliant auras of Vacuous Malignancies at Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity could be felt, with Noah's senses sending him warnings that similar to Seer Amestris, they would be unsuccessful- and there was an even greater chance of his methodologies being discovered early.","There was no doubt it would be discovered.","It was a matter of when a connection would be made as until then...","'Let the play unfold...'","His thoughts vibrated with tyranny as he closed his eyes.","He felt the streams of tens of millions of Hyperversal Anomalous Virions he had released and infected Vacuous Lifeforms as he breathed in Quintessence.","And a moment later...he triggered all of them!","...!","BOOM!","It coincided with the many clashes that were beginning across stretches of light years as the Savior's Ark to Noah's right had just had its Apex Vacuous Lifeforms and Vacuous Hyperversal Extremities release waves of output of their power to flash against the Vitalis Lifeforms.","And at such a juncture, a horrid reality unfolded for the tens of millions of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","The extremely pathogenic Hyperversal Anomalous Virion was activated as the spark of Vitalis and Vacuous instantly mixed, only to be wildly spread by the altered Blood Source across their records along with Lotra and Quintessence as with their level of power...","It was utter devastation.","Without Hyperversal Extremity Authority protecting one's Records and existence- without being surrounded by Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures...Noah's pathogenic tool was cataclysmic!","This was because the reality playing out thereafter showed the bodies of all 100 Million Apex Vacuous Lifeforms affected within the Savior's Ark...balloon outwards in an explosive force of shock and horror as a storming clash of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities tore apart their unprotected aspects of Existence and eradicated everything.","...!","The scene of 100 Million Lifeforms imploding thereafter unfolded as their bodies- whether small or massive, became utterly shredded apart before being swallowed by the erupting storm and turned to ashes.","\"...\"","A single Hyperversal Savior's Ark became eerily quiet and empty in an instant.","Noah's vision flashed with seizure inducing lights as tens of millions of Prompts flashed, his Vaults of Quintessence crackling as seas of Loot instantly began to manifest and rain down from above!","He kept his eyes closed.","This was 100 Million lives he had reaped in an instant.","The sheer brevity and weight of such an action were not taken lightly by Noah.","After a moment, his eyes opened.","They opened to see the utter shock of the surrounding Vacuous Hyperversal Legions as before those nearby could even register the silent eradication of a force of 100 Million without being able to pinpoint the enemy, the 100 Vacuous Hyperversal Extremities within this Savior's Ark also had their gazes change as various parts of their bodies stretched from heavy storms erupting inside of them.","Storms of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authority as for Vacuous Lifeforms...such a storm seemed to be much deadlier.","The mere inclusion of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority within their bodies caused such an astounding rejection within their existence as unlike the Avernus Extremities Noah had affected before, he saw the Vacuous Extremities uncontrollably have their limbs explode out to release the raging storms as it seemed they would have a much harder time containing it!","100 Vacuous Extremities within this Ark instantly roared out as they battled a shocking battle within, and this was when Noah's eyes turned towards the Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity whose body was fused with the Hyperversal Savior's Ark.","The one who provided it power.","He calmly gazed and activated the Virion within this entity as an instant later...","BZZT!","The nine spinning wheels of this Savior's Ark buzzed as with the Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity at the center, a heavy explosive force erupted out and spread as cracks began to form on this glorious construct!","It was unknown just what grand of a design had to be made for them to be forged.","Tools that allowed Vacuous Lifeforms to repulse and be capable of fighting against Vitalis Hyperversal Authority!","As such an authority attacked from within, there was heavy friction and impacts as the nine wheels of the Ark vibrated and roared out.","The Extremities within it were in shambles while the Ark itself Was buzzing with cracks!","It was such a sudden phenomenon that only now did a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity arrive as his authority gushed down like waves to envelop everything.","His figure was a Titanic humanoid with six arms and three heads as devilish horns rose on each one. Each of their faces were currently somber as so far, the battle had not begun well for the Vacuous Hyperversal Legions!","First, there was a sword strike that nearly cleaved a Hyperversal Savior's Ark.","Now, a silent attack that seemed to be even more deadly had all Apex Vacuous Lifeforms erased while their Extremities were fighting for their very existence- the Ark itself buzzing with cracks!","Two terrifying enemies had made their own moves, with the most recent one being extremely sinister in their methods as while watching the bursting storms of Vitalis within the bodies of 100 Extremities, the Tier 4 Vacuous Hyperversal Extremity wondered...which existence of the same level as him did this that he had to counter and prevent any more deadly attacks like these?!"]},{"number":2680,"title":"Chapter 2680: Chapter 2679 The First Extremity Falls to Quintessence! I","paragraphs":["2679 The First Extremity Falls to Quintessence! I","Whatever distinction that was required to attain Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity granted a tremendous level of power as the moment such an entity became involved, the buzzing Ark stopped fracturing and slowly stabilized itself as Noah felt Oraculum buzz with warnings.","He had to move with care.","He observed the shocking happenings as the entity with six arms and three heads who had appeared had a gaze of seriousness and anger, his authority moving to wrap around all affected Extremities as he couldn't help but change his gazes when he sensed the Vitalis Hyperversal Authority that had somehow managed to enter the bodies of the Vacuous Extremities.","At the same time, his terrifying will spread out and covered a dozen nearby Arks as he came to observe every minute thing happening.","Every movement of authority.","Every tendrils of Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authority!","Feeling the intense will pressing down all around, Noah stopped at one affected Ark for now as he knew any more than this in rapid progression while under watch, and he would run a chance of exposing himself or deal a level of damage that would warrant even more terrifying Vacuous Lifeforms to seek the source of such wanton destruction with scrutiny.","It would draw gazes towards him that he could not handle currently!","There were beings in the far back of the Vacuous Hyperversal Legions who felt like pillars holding up nothingness as none of them had made a move, only Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities like the entity with six arms and three heads beginning to flow above or in front of the Hyperversal Savior's Ark.","So, slow and steady.","No drawing unwarranted attention as after nearly decimating an entire Hyperversal Savior's Ark and getting a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity to tightly observe everything while sending seas of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority into the bodies of the 100 affected Extremities, Noah slowly began sending his Hyperversal Anomalous Virions to target widespread Vacuous Hyperversal Extremities in other Arks.","The very flow of Authority was being tracked as he let his streams of Vacuous Authority follow the flow of nothingness all around and simply spread out for now.","He wasn't worried about slowing down and going steady to maximize the potential returns.","This was because a terrifying quantity of Loot was flowing in even now!","This was because he could see a possible Unrecorded History of epic proportions about to unfold in this reality before him.","A future where instead of just heavily injuring a Hyperversal Extremity constantly with his Hyperversal Anomalous Virion...one may just fall entirely due to it.","Before he attained Extremity...he may just be capable of crossing the vast and impossible wall of demarcation through his unique means and actually kill a Hyperversal Extremity in these chaotic times of war!","Now, what would come from entirely eradicating the Recorded History of a Hyperversal Extremity and not merely just injuring them?","It was a question without an answer, but Noah was intent on finding out!","—","[66x Shards of the Hyperversal Havenly Eye of Extremity have been attained!]","[45x Golden Hyperversal Bones of Gradation have been attained!]","[20x Obsidian Hyperversal Bones of Gradation have been attained!]","[77x Hyperversal Marrow Soul Singularities have been attained!]","[13x Shards...]","Prompts and prompts of loot cascaded as Noah's main body only glanced at them while the Loot was multiplied by RUINATION before being funneled to the Sporos II of Extremity.","He wouldn't normally get redundant loot like the Shards of the Hyperversal Havenly Eye of Extremity after he already attained enough to obtain the Eye of Extremity, but since their purpose was to be devoured by the multicolored seed radiating an intense light before him, they still came!","And after funneling the Shards of the Eye of Extremity, Bones of Gradation, and Marrow Soul Singularities from the Avernus Extremities in addition to the multiplied Loot from 100 Million Apex Vacuous Lifeforms that he had just eradicated...","It caused a wonderful scene to unfold.","[Quintessential Hyperversal Sporos II of Extremity]:: 99.8% Maturity...","The second seed was near maturity!","It was all due to Noah's terrifying Accumulation as in addition to all of this, the scene above him in this region that pulsed with the Havenly Authorities of different Havens and Quintessence was a frightful one.","Above him, one could see a funnel of extremely pure Vitalis Hyperversal Authority spinning and flowing into his Aspects of Existence as his work with the Infernal Havenly Commerce continued to produce astounding results- more and more Tier 1 to Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities joining the ranks of his Lineage from the Blood Sources he was selling!","It was such an alarming amount that...","[The potency of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority in your existence is reaching a critical threshold.]","[You are approaching your Second Vitalis Awakening!]","[The Vacuous Hyperversal Authority within your existence is spurred as your body absorbs and refines more of it!]","\"...\"","He was making progress on all sides.","And yet he didn't allow himself to enter a state of pride for his current accomplishments as there was still much more to be done!","In a moment, after the recently obtained loot was processed by RUINATION and fed into the Sporos II of Extremity...","[The Quintessential Hyperversal Sporos II of Extremity has reached complete maturity!]","Refulgent multicolored light erupted all around as when Noah breathed in the sheer light and aura of the dazzling seed in front of him, his whole existence brimmed with life and power.","His will surged into it as he initiated the next profound step, choosing the direction of what this seed would bloom into!","[The Quintessential Hyperversal Ash Tree II of Gradation has begun to bloom.]","[The chosen Havenly Authority is Oceanus.]","...!","The dazzling seed became anchored in space before it began to sprout with a dazzling and gorgeous cerulean light.","Noah's Origin pulsed with joy and almost a trace of reverence that was quickly controlled as Five Aletheian Havens were completed with the Sixth Aletheian Haven started, all the lands and cosmos of this Haven simmering with the golden light of Helios.","Now...a blooming Ash Tree II of Gradation that would be enough to complete the entire Sixth Aletheian Haven had arrived- its sheer magnitude being so grand that out of the vastness of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, the sprouting of a cerulean illusory tree took center stage!"]},{"number":2681,"title":"Chapter 2681: Chapter 2680 The First Extremity Falls to Quintessence! II","paragraphs":["2680 The First Extremity Falls to Quintessence! II","Seeing the blooming Ash Tree II of Gradation and the fantastical effects it was about to give him, Noah knew his current path was the correct one.","He had created multiple avenues providing him loot as even though it was immensely hard and would become even harder for him to continue cultivating the Sporos of Extremity to maturity, he knew that it would only be an inevitability!","And all of this...was him going towards Extremity with the path that Quintessence provided.","He had other concepts that existences considered Dead Paths due to their grandness that had also reached the 17th Boundary Layer as they carried their own brilliance compared to Quintessence!","As the Ash Tree II of Gradation bloomed before him, he blinked as he pulled up the details of another path that was through nothing else other than...","Infinity.","[The Seventeenth Boundary Layer of Infinity]:: The concept of Infinity is a terrifying one to ever bring to Extremity as very few existences can withstand its meaning. Yet your existence has a part of it that already embodies a sense of Infinity as for you, the Extremity of Infinity may just be a possibility. Towards this end, Infinity leaves a path open that may just aid you in attaining Extremity- depending on how it is utilized, and it can only be utilized once in your lifetime. For an instant, you can make any Resource or Authority within your Aspects of Existence infinite...","An instant.","Not a second, microsecond, nanosecond, or any other span of time- but only a single instant.","It was an incredibly terrifying Boundary Layer that could only be utilized once.","But that once would undoubtedly produce such reality shattering effects as Noah had been having Oraculum try and find all the possible paths that this Boundary Layer could be utilized in addition to the 17th Boundary Layer of Quintessence that brought the illustrious Ash Tree II of Gradation that was blooming before him among other paths!","In the midst of his computations of possibilities...","\"Hmm?\"","His head rose as he gazed out.","Past the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","His will came to feel the Recorded History of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity that he had hidden his home in.","At this moment...he felt and heard...","DUM! DUM! DUM!","The sound of beating drums.","The sound of a beginning symphony.","It was a symphony of majesty as it seemed to be connected to him!","As for why it had begun...Noah's will very quickly focused on his Reified Source of Quintessence surrounded by Legions of Vacuous Malignancies behind him and Vitalis Malignancies ahead of him.","The faint sounds of beating drums had begun to echo out in this region as a drastic change occurred at this moment!","On the Hyperversal Savior's Ark Noah's Virions had incapacitated, the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity who was using waves of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority to stabilize everything suddenly had his three heads change their expressions as in front of him...","RIIP!","Space tore as a radiant Sword of Vitalis bloomed.","It pulsed with shocking power as he wasn't the only one, where if one's view encompassed all the nearby regions, they would see that a dozen massive illusory Swords of Vitalis were struck out against multiple targets as Emperor Shao continued to take center stage!","One of his sword strikes just so happened to come here.","BOOM!","The authority of the Vacuous Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity was forced to defend against this sword strike as the seas of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority supporting the 100 Extremities affected by Noah's Virions wavered, their Tier 3 and Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities still only having their expression be stern and in pain as they quickly sought to stop the spread of Noah's Blood Source across their Records, but the Vacuous Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities who were swirling with Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures...they had a much harder time.","Their Extremity Rune Scriptures could not defend them as proficiently as the Obsidian and Crimson Extremity Rune Scriptures attained by those above them.","Similar to the Avernus Extremities, once affected...Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities had to focus most if not all of their attention on stopping the spread of the Virion across their Recorded History!","It was why the Tier 1 Avernus Extremities had even fallen out of the skies of the Saurischian Archipelago.","The Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities...were having a much harder time due to the dominance of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority raging in their Aspects of Existence as while the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity who came to support them was kept busy by a Sword of Vitalis, a single Tier 1 Vacuous Extremity fell into a predicament.","DUM! DUM! DUM!","From afar, Noah felt the symphony of drums become ever louder as he wasn't the only one.","All beings in the surroundings heard it as it felt like the beating drums were ushering in something grand!","Yet Noah could feel their intensity.","He could feel their focus.","His eyes quickly moved as they came to focus on a particular Tier 1 Vacuous Extremity affected by his Virion.","He clutched his chest as his body faced multiple implosions from the storms of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authority, his Extremity Rune Scriptures swirling around his existence madly to isolate and take out as much Vitalis as possible!","The Scriptures read [VOID] and [DEVOURING], and only these two types of Extremity Scriptures were swirling around this existence and encasing him in a circular protective light as he had only achieved Extremity in these two concepts.","And at this moment while his Scriptures moved according to his will to isolate and remove the storms within his body, he made a mistake.","He felt the buzzing of an even purer form of Vitalis above him that the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity faced as during the impacts, tendrils of Vitalis seethed out into the surroundings.","With his fear of the Vitalis within and then feeling the tendrils of Vitalis above, a part of his Will was fearfully sent out to gaze above as he tried to move below to avoid any possible collateral attacks!","And this single choice.","This single moment of fearful decision making.","CRACK!","It caused the raging storm of Vitalis and Vacuous to locate the weakened area where he sent out a portion of his will.","An area of the circular protective light of [VOID] and [DEVOURING] Extremity Rune Scriptures suddenly had a perforation as it was no longer solid and impenetrable!","And this single perforation was akin to a chain reaction as the gaze of this being became entirely ashen a moment later, the Blood Source of the Virion in his Existence beginning to spread rapidly and gaining access deeply into his History like never before!","CRACK!","After this single perforation, another one appeared as the Extremity Rune Scriptures around this being...began to be torn and destroyed under the storm of Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authority!","...!","Noah gazed at all this and felt a profound sensation.","The symphony in the surroundings picked up pace as authorities were riled up chaotically.","And before his eyes...","[You are scaling an unscalable wall that has only been scaled once before in all of Recorded History!]","Glorious prompts that also revealed a bit of a shocking History began to appear!"]},{"number":2682,"title":"Chapter 2682: Chapter 2681 The First Extremity Falls to Quintessence! III","paragraphs":["2681 The First Extremity Falls to Quintessence! III","Something that had only occurred once before in Recorded History!","What a profound significance!","Who was Noah in the vastness of reality?","Who was Noah as an existence across the Records of eons past?","A young man who experienced an apocalypse and grasped onto an opportunity. He then turned this opportunity into a fate that took him on this grand path he now followed. He had now embarked on the Road of Extremity as towards existences who had taken concepts to their extremes across innumerable years...just who was he in comparison to all this?","What significance could a being like him stemming from a nondescript blue planet have in the grandeur of all this?!","His thoughts buzzed willfully as today, something significant occurred.","[No...!]","The scene was a heartbreaking one as after the perforation of one area, more and more perforations occurred on the protective circular protective barrier of the Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity, his Hyperversal Extremity Rune Scriptures flickering and beginning to be broken down one after another as in the depths of his existence, the Hyperversal Anomalous Virion reached critical penetration into this being's records.","As if molten lava was coursing through his veins and every record of his existence, they tore apart and erased everything before they turned it to ash!","DUM! DUM!","A symphony reached a crescendo as it was akin to the melody of an archaic funeral of a soul that would forever be lost.","Noah's eyes watched the process extensively as after a certain moment, the unwillingness, disbelief, and utter horror coursing through the Tier 1 Vacuous Extremity flashed as his Extremity Rune Scriptures began to turn dim and flicker.","They lost their golden glow and immensity that showed how far this being had come!","And as they lost their glow, the profound authority of Lotra and Quintessence wrapped around the Extremity Rune Scriptures.","Without the blazing Hyperversal Extremity Authority wrapping around them gloriously, they were overtaken and devoured by Lotra and Quintessence along with the core existence of this Extremity as all of it...would be turned into Loot!","DUM!","The beat of the drum resounding out was deep and filled with importance as it echoed out across light years amidst the ongoing battles.","The Scriptures on the dying Tier 1 Vacuous Extremity turned dim and were then taken away as within moments, his figure came to a halt in the middle of nothingness.","The light of brightness within his eyes dimmed evermore as in another moment, all of his records of existence were breached by Noah's Blood Source as the storms of Vitalis and Vacuous wreaked havoc everywhere. Ultimately...","DUM!","The brightness of Extremity in this being's eyes turned entirely dim.","Noah watched the death of an Extremity through his own hands with a profound sense of calmness and wonder as at the very end, the blank gaze of this being felt like it had been shown the one responsible for everything as the dimming eyes gazed towards Noah's direction.","And he stared deeply into the eyes of his killer as all of his Hyperversal Extremity Authority faded.","DUM!","The booming drum echoed out like an alarm signaling a great end as at such a moment, an unseen Refulgence of light and majesty erupted out before the person responsible!","Not around his Reified Source of Quintessence in the midst of this battle between the Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Legions.","But the brilliance of light unfolded around Noah's main body in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven as if the Aeonic Annals of Extremity were cognizant and considerate of Noah's path.","They didn't expose his Reified Source of Quintessence with a grand show of wonder under the eyes of Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Extremities as everything was occurring around his main body!","[You have scaled a wall not meant to be scaled!]","[Without taking any concept to Extremity, you are the second to erase the records and grant True Death to an existence that has achieved Extremity.]","[An Impossible Achievement!]","...!","For an achievement that would be the second one in all of Recorded History, but what exactly would come from it?!","And who was the first existence that had managed to violate the demarcation of Extremity and actually kill such a being before they even attained Extremity?","In this moment of profound wonder and epiphany, Noah also wondered about Unrecorded Histories.","Were they simply things that had yet to happen, or could events that occurred in the past somehow be capable of being veiled under Unrecorded Histories? Were there any other feats or existences of profound quality and power across the eons who didn't have astounding achievements recorded?","And...just how extensive was the Aeonic Annals of Extremity?!","They covered all History under Extremity as the Vitalis Lifeforms utilized the Annals of Extremity, and so did Vacuous Lifeform.","But how vast was their distinction? When a Vacuous Lifeforms made an astounding feat, would the Aeonic Annals of Extremity grant them Vacuous Hyperversal Authority as a boon similar to how Noah was granted Vitalis Hyperversal Authority before? Were the Aeonic Annals of Extremity different or entirely separate depending on the Lifeform accessing them?","And when it came to Noah who benefitted from both Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities...just what would be his fate?","There were a great deal of questions with not enough information to fully answer them, but Noah was undaunted as he continued, the prompts continuing to cascade down as above him, reality splintered while something grand threatened to descend.","[You are the First in Recorded History to have erased the Records of an Extremity before you stepped on the stage of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!]","[A Quintessential Achievement!]","[The Boundary of Quintessence has taken great strides towards Extremity.]","[The title of Extremity Despoiler has been attained.]","WAA!","An adorning reality was made bare at this moment in time.","Yes, he wasn't the first to kill an Extremity before he achieved this stage himself.","But he was the first to kill an Extremity before he even became an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!","And such a feat was gloriously Quintessential.","His main body still had the magisterial Meridian Seeds that had never sprouted even now.","Even though he was close to Extremity, he still had yet to undergo his transformation as an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!"]},{"number":2683,"title":"Chapter 2683: Chapter 2682 The First Extremity Falls to Quintessence! IV","paragraphs":["2682 The First Extremity Falls to Quintessence! IV","His very existence violated all the common norms as it was due to this that he attained such a profound achievement.","And for it...","[In addition to the Vitalis Annals of Extremity, you have now gained full access to the Vacuous Annals of Extremity.]","CRACK!","The skies above Noah in this unique domain of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven he was in fully split apart as from their cracks, extremely pure waves of transparent white and deeply obsidian light cascaded down.","They twirled around the Quintessential Hyperversal Ash Tree II of Extremity that was still growing and pulsing with a profound light, some of the waves of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authority being drawn into it!","As they neared in proximity, they roared out and churned with wild grandeur as they surged towards Noah's body, sinking into his Aspects of Existence as before they could cause havoc and destroy everything- two Innate Hyperversal Meridians blazed to life and greedily devoured everything coming down!","\"...\"","Noah turned up to gaze at the crack in space as this wasn't truly the most accurate way to describe it.","His eyes could see that this was merely a crack in this unfolding history, with the waves of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authority coming from the Aeonic Annals of Extremity themselves!","The Aeonic Annals of Extremity. The Vitalis and Vacuous Annals of Extremity!","Two Sides of the same immense Records as on this day, Noah gained access to the Vacuous Annals of Extremity.","A whole set of Records he had yet to even begin exploring and learning about.","And he would no doubt have the chance to learn even more about them as many of his authorities were scaled upwards.","[Your Authority as a Quintessential Aeonic Curator has been elevated to Quintessential Inscrutable Annals Curator!]","[The Singularity Crystal of the Record of Extremity has been attained!]","[The Singularity Crystal of the True Death Record of Diospia!]","Around his main body that absorbed shockingly Pure wave soft Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authority, Loot began to descend as the Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures that were devoured by Lotra and Quintessence along with the entire existence of a Hyperversal Extremity were processed, elevated, and transformed into wonders.","But no wonder was as bright and filled with radiance as the one that descended next.","Radiating pure halcyon light, a piece of a scroll emanating waves of pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority manifested.","[1x Remnant Golden Absolute Hyperversal Writ of Extremity has been attained.]","[You have obtained the first Quintessential Extremity Loot!]","...!","A Quintessential Extremity Loot.","What else did it mean but the sheer fact that this loot...directly led to and shared an intricate connection to Extremity?","Details of this Loot and the astounding prompts before it began to emerge within Noah's mind at this moment, and at the same time...the Ash Tree II of Extremity also had its countless cerulean branches begin to flutter before they bent down towards Noah's visage.","His Origin trembled as pure Havenly Authority of Oceanus began to flow down.","His soul cheered as it began undergoing yet another round of baptism.","And his mind buzzed as glorious waves of information came.","[Extremity Despoiler]:: A distinction and title that very few beings share across Recorded History. It can be gained in very few and limited ways, and it allows those who have previously scaled an unscalable wall to be capable of traversing it at an even easier pace. With the distinction of Extremity Despoiler, one is able to condense a False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture of [DESPOILER]. This False Extremity Rune Scripture requires 100,000 Units of either Vitalis or Vacuous Hyperversal Authority, along with immense reserves of resources, Soul Values, and authority to condense as any average existence standing before the cusp of Extremity would have difficulties condensing it, but as a being with the distinction and capabilities of an Extremity Despoiler, it should not be an impossibility for you. A Single False Rune Scripture of [DESPOILER] is capable of piercing a protective Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture on the body of a Hyperversal Extremity, granting you the chance to repeat what you already did before. Any subsequent achievements of scaling the Unscalable Wall of Extremity will only empower the distinction of Extremity Despoiler as its limits have yet to be breached...","The first wave of information came from the title gained by killing a Hyperversal Extremity before he had any concept taken to this level.","Extremity Despoiler!","Depending on whether one was extremely lucky with their circumstances to be capable of killing an Extremity, this distinction gave them the chance to repeat their impossible achievement by doing something as grand as allowing the erasure of a single Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture.","Of course, even a weak Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity had begun to accumulate many Extremity Rune Scriptures as their enemy just destroying one did not mean death was coming for them.","But it would allow the authority of an Extremity Despoiler to enter or pierce into an Extremity as in Noah's case...","He had been able to kill the Tier 1 Vacuous Extremity due to his means of utilizing a Virion that caused a storm of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities- and because of their momentary lapse in judgment, one of their Rune Scriptures was perforated by an erupting storm as this was akin to the tipping of the dominoes that gave way to much greater damage being dealt to this being's records!","More and more of their Extremity Rune Scriptures were then perforated and destroyed by Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities until ultimately...","True Death came for them.","Now, Noah didn't have to hope for a Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity to have a lapse in judgment or make a poor decision.","So long as he condensed a False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture, he could destroy a single Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture on their bodies as he could kick start their path towards True Death...and make his astounding achievement be more than a one hit wonder!"]},{"number":2684,"title":"Chapter 2684: Chapter 2683 The First is Always the Hardest! I","paragraphs":["2683 The First is Always the Hardest! I","The first was always the most special, yes, but it was also the hardest!","Getting there was always the trickiest part as after one arrived at a certain benchmark, staying on it or forging further ahead was always easier the next time around.","For any existence, erasing the Records of an Extremity were an impossibility unless they gained such a power themselves to be capable of affecting the Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures that protected the very Aspects of Existence and Records of such a being!","What Noah had done was bypass gaining any similar authority himself as he...","got himself access to authorities that even some Extremities cannot control or grasp.","Vitalis.","Vacuous.","He used these two authorities paired with his very own Blood Sourceto achieve the stellar feat that at this moment granted him...the key to making it possible again!","[Extremity Despoiler].","It provided a quantity of Units in terms of Vitalis or Vacuous Hyperversal Authority that were required along with immense resources and soul values that were not quantified on top of this.","Noah would have to find out for himself as this distinction and the capabilities it granted...was his key to butchering Extremities in the time to come!","\"Extremity Despoiler.\"","So while an Ash Tree II of Gradation was pouring its refulgent authority into his Origin and Soul, while seas of Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authorities cascaded from the cracks of records above...he called out lightly.","BZZT!","And the reality in front of him fluctuated as a singularity bloomed, the nearby reality being pulled into it as it gradually formed into a stroke that represented [D]!","Noah's soul then buzzed as under his command, streams of pure Vitalis Hyperversal Authority began flowing into this beginning of a False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture.","He was quickly able to grasp what the streams of Vitalis flowing into him were in terms of Units as they flowed into the forming Rune Scripture ahead of him.","At the same time, the input of Soul Values was immense as within moments, Noah had the Reified Wealdian Source of Vitalistic and Lotra appear beside him, waves of Soul Values in the hundreds of thousands releasing from them steadily!","As for Mana? This didn't even need to be mentioned as seas of this gorgeous blue authority flowed endlessly into the False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture to make up for any and all authorities.","Droves of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority flowed in as when the halfway mark of the requirement was met at 50,000 Units of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority, Noah found the total reserves of this authority in his Meridians to have depleted by 25%!","It meant he currently had an approximate range of 200,000 Units of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority to play with, and a similar number of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.","The only downside was that the regeneration of these two authorities was currently abysmal to Noah!","These were his thoughts, but if others who had undergone Awakening heard them, they might deviate from their circulation of authority in anger at his perspective.","He had a steady stream of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority from those joining his Lineage as it was absorbed and refined into his body in addition to replenishing the reserves he had.","He now also had pure streams of it gushing from the rupture of records above along with Vacuous Hyperversal Authority!","His current regeneration of these two authorities through such unique means was far faster than even an existence who had undergone their Third Awakening.","Waves of Authorities surged from his body and his Reified Clones as ever so slowly, more and more characters appeared in the blooming singularity above them that now radiated intense might while being at [DESP].","While this process continues, the details of the other boons to come from Noah's shocking actions unfolded.","[The Singularity Crystal of the Record of Extremity]:: Very rarely are there worthy records to view and ponder on, but the record of an established path to Extremity along with the process of advancement from the 17th Boundary Layer and into the Extremity Layer is indispensable of a record. This Singularity Crystal holds within it the Records of Extremity of [VOID] and [DEVOURING] up to the First Gradation of Extremity. The gains made from viewing and learning from such a record can be insignificant or quintessentially insightful. The Record can be viewed a total of 100 times before it is used up and collapsed into itself. Upon sending a trace of your soul to view this record, you will experience it to the extent as if you were the existence traversing from the 1st Layer to the Extremity Layer of the [VOID] and [DEVOURING]...","[The Singularity Crystal of the True Death Record of Diospia]:: The breakdown of Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures and True Death of an existence that has begun to walk the Gradations of Extremity. In death, there can be new life. In viewing the True Death Record of the one known as Diospia, it may be possible to draw inferences on the formation and breakdown of Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures. The Record can be viewed a total of 100 times before it is used up and collapsed into itself...","The first two descriptions were astonishing Records of Extremity that didn't just allow one to simply learn about the records of an existence achieving extremity and then even dying, it made it so that the one experiencing it all was actually the viewer!","It would allow one to actually feel the shocking alteration of life from an Apex Aeonic Lifeform and towards Extremity as such a tool...may just make it possible for some unique beings that needed one last nudge to reach the last Extremity Layer.","Noah's soul didn't feel any sense of grandness when gazing at the Singularity Crystals as he knew they wouldn't be able to do much for him apart from increasing his understanding of the Extremity Rune Scriptures that he could already see with his Eyes of Extremity!","But...if an existence whose very foundation and makeup was conducive towards achieving Extremity at the shortest possible time...","HUUM!","The surrounding reality released hums of grandiosity as Noah's gaze turned towards the Apollyon Aletheian Haven.","Towards the center of dense Sources of Chaos where a gorgeous young woman shimmering with quasars stood!"]},{"number":2685,"title":"Chapter 2685: Chapter 2684 The First is Always the Hardest! II","paragraphs":["2684 The First is Always the Hardest! II","Xiaomi.","The existence with the Innate Pellucid Hyperversal Extremity Foundation of Ruined Chaos!","Noah had already seen and stated that she would be the first existence to gain the authority of a Hyperversal Extremity in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","This assertion had not proved wrong just yet as after his eyes were illuminated with the light of Oraculum, he clenched his fist as space distorted and twisted.","And within an instant, the visage of a graceful young woman appeared as her body crackled with tendrils of Ruin and other Sources of Chaos.","The moment she arrived, her soul trembled as her eyes fluttered open, feeling the shocking authorities of Vitalis and Vacuous above her, as well as the glistening illusory Ash Tree II of Gradation that had its branches sinking into Noah and giving off immeasurable waves of authority!","She was baffled at such a confluence of authority and majesty that she felt extremely small in the midst of all this.","But the being at the center of it all beckoned towards her as her body moved before her soul even commanded it.","She felt the sheer pressure and majesty of this being before her released as currently, a multicolored Emperor's Robe pulsing with authority draped over him, his dark hair sparkling more than her own that was filled with quasars as his eyes...their Nine Pupils caused the surrounding space to tremble as within them, Xiaomi could swear she was seeing a stroke of runic lights that seemed to say Extremity!","She almost felt as if she was standing in front of a genuine Extremity as she continued to marvel at this being who seemed much grander than his past self- and this was compared to his past self of just hours or a day ago, not even weeks, months, or years!","\"Xiaomi.\"","He called out her name as she instantly came out of her fantasies and focused, nodding with utmost respect and reverence as she saw his devilish smile that caused her heart to beat like a drum, his hands carrying the weight of entire Aletheian Havens moving as he pointed towards one of the many dazzling things around him.","\"Send your will into this Record and let us see how much closer it gets you to Extremity.\"","His words were filled with majesty as always as Xiaomi nodded once more, her will focusing on one of the dazzling Singularities in this region as a part of her soul sank into it!","Noah watched this scene calmly as on the description of the Singularity Crystal of the Record of Extremity, the usage went down from 100 to 99.","Around him, typhoons of authority continued to spin as the massive Ash Tree II of Extremity had already spent 50% of its authority, its massive stature beginning to reduce as in his Origin, the Sixth Aletheian Haven that was composed almost entirely of Oceanus and a sliver of Helios was more than 70% completed!","Of course, in addition to all this, there was the Havenly Boundary Layer of Oceanus that came with it- the prompts of this stupendous authority simply passing over Noah's eyes.","[The 15th Havenly Boundary Layer of Oceanus has been attained!]","[The 16th Havenly Boundary Layer of Oceanus has been attained!]","Oceanus.","This was yet another Havenly Boundary Layer added after Dissolution, Helios, and Genesis. Four out of the Seven Havenly Authorities of the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains were now obtained by Noah as he aimed to have all of them under his banner.","All of them.","Not just the Seven Havenly Authorities that made the Seven Vitalis Haven. As Noah had butchered 100 Million Vacuous Apex Lifeforms and a single Tier 1 Vacuous Extremity, he had also been sifting through an uncountable number of memories from all of these beings!","Memories of the Vacuous Hyperversal Domains.","Memories of moments of nothingness stretched out across even grander expanses of the absence of time and reality itself. Within these memories, he received more than a glimpse of fantastical lands built atop the grandeur of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority, as well as Havenly Authorities that made up their lands.","But they didn't refer to them as Havenly Authorities. They were referred to as Infernal Authorities that made up their Infernal Havens of Extremity!","Such things were also within Noah's sight as he felt like he would be more complete if he could attain Infernal Authorities as well as Havenly Authorities.","And... it seemed like he would get the chance to gaze at one of such Infernal Authorities in action as while a part of his will probed the last Loot he gained from killing a Hyperversal Extremity, the [Remnant Golden Absolute Hyperversal Writ of Extremity], a stupendous change occurred within the gaze of the Reified Source of Quintessence that was responsible for killing the Tier 1 Vacuous Extremity!","—","Within the gray region of Vitalis and Vacuous Authorities where two forces had begun to clash.","The death of a single Vacuous Extremity was insignificant in the larger picture, but there were still 99 others from the Ark Noah had affected who were still fighting the storms within their bodies. There were the constant attacks from a terrifying Vitalis Extremity who filled the battlefield with sword lights.","By all accounts, since the battle had begun- the Vacuous Hyperversal Legions had been pushed back as Vitalis had shone with brilliance.","The forces behind the Vacuous Hyperversal Legions seemed to have had enough of this.","Because at this moment in time, a booming sound rang out across the gray region as in a shocking turn of events, an entity filled with extremely pure Vacuous Hyperversal Authority appeared above a Bastion of Vitalis!","They had crossed vast light years of space and somehow cut across the lines of defenses, their stature massive in size as their form was utterly massive!","Four pairs of wings made of aurora of Vacuous lights expanded behind it as any trace of transparent white Vitalis was actually burned in this Entity's presence.","The pressure he gave off was immense as this Entity...was one who had undergone the Third Vacuous Awakening at the very least- attaining a shocking form of power and might that they sought to display at this moment by targeting an entire Bastion of Vitalis!"]},{"number":2686,"title":"Chapter 2686: Chapter 2685 Infernal Brilliance! I","paragraphs":["2685 Infernal Brilliance! I","Mighty, and immeasurably fast.","The entire body of this being seemed to be made up of extremely pure Vacuous Hyperversal Authority as along with the aurora of four pairs of obsidian wings behind his back, their whole makeup seemed to be pure Vacuous Hyperversal Authority as their humanoid visage had a single head that only had spinning crimson Singularities for eyes.","The eyes burned with callousness and terror as with great speed, this being thrust his hand out towards the massive and light years spanning Bastion of Vitalis that was akin to a Minor Haven!","From the Bastion, a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity felt their scalp tingle as a woman adorned in a flaming blue Armament of Extremity radiating the grandeur of Oceanus rose up with a bellow- Vitalis Hyperversal Authority beginning to coagulate around her.","And yet comparatively, the existence made up of extremely pure Vacuous Hyperversal Authority that had appeared was much, much too fast.","The moment their hand thrust out, the surrounding space dimmed as an instant later, a gloriously shining illusory construct that looked like an Extremity Rune Scripture covered by a crimson glow manifested.","Its size alone was ridiculous as it covered and pressed towards the Bastion of Vitalis while covering all of its surface area!","As if a massive hand was pressing down from immeasurably high skies!","And for those who managed to catch a brief glance at this massive Extremity Rune Scripture...their minds would tremble while reading a stroke of characters representing a single word","[ACHERON]!","One of the Infernal Havens of Extremity stretched out across the Vacuous Hyperversal Domains!","The massive Extremity Rune Scripture had an overall glow of crimson, but it deeply shone with a topaz glow of majesty that was wrapped in the obsidian grandeur of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority as while the Tier 4 Vitalis Hyperversal Extremity was just gathering the radiant glow of Vitalis around her to react...","BOOOM...CRACK!","The illusory Extremity Rune Scripture of [ACHERON] thundered down with mad fervor.","All traces of Vitalis underneath were shredded and burned away as the Extremity Rune Scripture seemed to express how mighty it was as a concept, topaz colored flames blaring in all directions as the horrific scene of the massive Bastion of Vitalis the size of a Minor Haven fracturing could be seen next!","In the center of it all, the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity in charge of this Bastion roared out with all her might as around her body, dense Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures began to circulate.","Yet each one seemed to be getting ground down by the massive Scripture of ACHERON that continued to descend!","She seemed to be in an utterly precarious situation as her yells became ever radiant, her skin beginning to peel and turn into pure transparent white as before she could entirely carry out an extremely painful transformation on her end...","SHIING!","The sound of dense sword lights echoed out like trillions of birds as from all directions, tens of massive Swords of Vitalis struck down.","The last and mightiest sword came from below the shattered Bastion of Vitalis as inside of it, the figure of none other than Emperor Shao blazed with brilliance as he came from below, his hands wrapping protectively around the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity while his sword swung up- buzzing and causing waves of ruptured to spread as the Extremity Rune Scripture of ACHERON was finally pushed back, its illusory glow slowly fading and disappearing!","[...]","The scene was an ecstatic one as the wills watching were breathless.","Like a glorious emperor bathed in Vitalis, Emperor Shao supported the female Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity who had her will gaze around her in rage, seeing that on this Bastion of Vitalis, the scorched records of Hundreds of Extremities was the only thing that could be seen as the vast majority had died, only a dozen or so Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities still supporting themselves as half of their bodies were scorched and nearly burnt away!","As for Apex Aeonic Lifeforms? What remained of them wasn't even enough to make up dust.","[Hoo...]","The female Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity stemming from the Sima Clan breathed out with maddened wrath, gazing at the Vacuous Entity made of pure Vacuous Hyperversal Authority as she roared out while surging towards him, Emperor Shao shaking his head with a light sigh as his sword swung above to support!","This...was only a single scene out of this devastating war.","A scene that Noah took in and continued to gain knowledge of the power and expertise of Hyperversal Extremities- and truly powerful ones at that as even these beings that had come out...they weren't the major players!","Both sides seemed to be probing each other with devastating attacks every now and then.","The number of lives that would be lost was bound to be innumerable.","They would only add to those who had been ground down to nothingness under the eons of Extremity!","Hatred would breed hatred, and the war between Vitalis and Vacuous would rage on!","On such a battlefield, Noah's will took everything occurring as he marveled at the Infernal Boundary Layer displayed by a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity.","Acheron.","This and more were waiting for him to grasp in this ongoing war that was bound to last a long time before it saw any victor.","As a participant, he would play this war to the utmost and use it to rise to a level of glory that could dominate this whole battlefield!","But for now, he had to move covertly.","And...he also had many parts of him that were moving.","His Reified Source of Quintessence was in the form of a Vacuous Apex Lifeform as he followed an Ark towards Legions of Vitalis Apex Lifeforms in front of a Bastion of Vitalis.","Uniquely, near this Bastion...a dense cluster of figures adorned in gold white masks could be seen, with even more arriving in large numbers!","In their lead, a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity could be seen as he had a white horn rising above his head.","Behind them, the above average auras of Tier 3, 2, and Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities blazed as even further behind them, exceptional Vitalis Apex Lifeforms could be seen.","It was a Legion of the Curagulus of Extremity that had appeared in this region, other Legions of this deep and hidden organization stretched out across other Bastions of Vitalis to provide support!"]},{"number":2687,"title":"Chapter 2687: Chapter 2686 Infernal Brilliance! II","paragraphs":["2686 Infernal Brilliance! II","The forces of the Curagulus of Extremity!","In his identity as a Vacuous Apex Lifeform, Noah gazed towards them with great malice along with all the other Vacuous Apex Lifeforms, his eyes especially coming to lock onto a figure revealing a devilish aura while adorned in a light blue robe and the same white gold mask as all the others.","This being was surrounded not by other members of the Curagulus of Extremity, but a terrifying Haven Lich who pulsed with the aura of both life and death, and behind this Lich...there were seven titanic Champions of Thanatos that were modified from the Chthonian abominations!","The Haven Lich cackled gleefully at the aura of death in the surroundings as he turned towards the direction of the Ark where Noah's body was hidden as a Vacuous Apex Lifeforms.","The Haven Lich then bowed towards this direction as the Vacuous Apex Lifeforms in the Hyperversal Savior's Ark growled, taking such a motion as ridicule from this being and not knowing the Lich Ra'Zan was merely paying respects to his Master who was hidden among them!","[OOOH!]","The Vacuous Apex Lifeforms roared out as the domain released by the Ark extended far and wide, coming to cover even their enemies as they surged out.","Noah's wills released a great deal of power as from the forces of the Curagulus of Extremity, Alexander stared forth with a devilish smile and battle intent.","From the field of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority, Aleksandr stared forth with a hellishly dazzling smile and a bellow, his First Vacuous Awakening pulsing in the surroundings as nearby Vacuous Apex Lifeforms followed his cry as they were heeding his command- the hierarchy of these Existences being that of following the strong as they would follow Aleksandr!","And so like a grand commander, Aleksandr pointed towards the forces of the Curagulus of Extremity as he sent Vacuous Apex Lifeforms towards Alexander.","They thought they were going to a great war...but it was just Noah sending them to the butcher- who just so turned out to be another part of him!","\"Hmm...\"","Noah nodded with a playful smile as another method to obtain loot was established, the Haven Lich roaring out and commanding the Champions of Thanatos as waves of obsidian green flames exploded out!","His tasks in this war were many, but each one was getting completed smoothly thus far as for now, he waited for the False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture of DESPOILER to be completed as he would then fully begin hunting Hyperversal Extremities.","This process was arduous as he couldn't make many of them currently with his reserves of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authority, but he should only be able to increase his speed and output after all the boons of the Ash Tree II of Gradation finished and it reverted into a Sporos III of Extremity that he could then excessively pump all the new Loot into!","Step by step, Extremity came ever closer within his grasp.","And with a chilling light, his Reified Source of Quintessence turned away from the area ahead of him that had the Legion from the Curagulus of Extremity and gazed upon a Bastion of Vitalis shimmering with a purple light.","Here, a dense cluster of Avernus Extremities and Apex Aeonic Lifeforms were clustered.","While gazing at them, Noah couldn't help but radiate genuine intent to kill as his War with the Avernus Clan was still far from over!","—","In the Nether Haven of Genesis.","Within the depths of the domains of the Sima Clan, at the peak of a milky white mountain floating alone above multiple Planes of Existence that pulsed with the Havenly Authority of Genesis.","On the peak of this Mountain that was known as the Seer's Abode, an old woman could be seen walking amidst a serene meadow that was filled with pure streams of Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Genesis.","Around her aged body, a sense of beauty and grace still remained as there were dense Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of GENESIS swirling with gratitude fervor among multiple other Crimson Rune Scriptures!","At this moment, this old woman was walking while playing with a crimson gold Singularity in her hand that held no other identity but a Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage Blood Source!","Behind this woman, the Extremity of Foundation walked a step behind with a somber expression as the Identity of this being was very important.","The Seer of Sima!","To be granted the distinction of being the Seer of an entire Clan, this was something that only a being with true power could afford!","And at this moment, the Seer of Sima spoke with a smile.","[It is an astonishing treasure that doesn't hold anything negative other than the fact your current Lineage will be overwritten and a new record will come into place. It is something that allows you to attain a Lineage similar to the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages of the Supernal Havens of Extremity, but this Blood Source...the purity you will gain is something that will be hard for others to attain in the Supernal Havens unless they pay a great deal. As for its boons...even this old lady is interested in them. At its current level, even I can benefit from it. You got this from...Noah Osmont, was it?]","Her aged figure turned towards Extremity of Foundation who replied succinctly.","[They're apparently being circulated by a force known as the Infernal Havenly Commerce for a set but manageable price in the Supernal Haven of Dissolution...]","[Oh?] The brows of the Seer of Sima rose as she nodded with a smile.","Then, she threw the Blood Source in her hand up and down while she walked, and on the third time she threw it up in the air, she didn't catch it with her hand as the Extremity of Foundation watched with astonishment the reality of the falling Blood Source fall into the mouth of the Seer of Sima!","[Mmm...sugary.]","...!","Her nonchalant comments were even more astonishing as who was this being?","This was one of the few Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities of the Sima Clan, an existence of immense age and power!","She...had overwritten her bloodline just like this by swallowing the Blood Source?","BZZT!","A surge of profundity exploded from her as even in her laid back demeanor, she still showed surprise as a burst of information exploded in her mind along with the records of her Lineage being rewritten.","Feeling the trace amounts of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority within this Lineage, the Seer of Sima gave a nod as her aura became even more profound!","[Definitely worth it for you and all the other kids. Procure as many as you can for the Sima Clan, with this and other tools, maybe at least half of the Sima Clan will survive the tumultuous times to come.]","...!","Shocking words left her mouth as the Extremity of Foundation had his expression become extremely grim!","At least half of the Sima Clan would survive after utilizing this tool and many others? Just...what could be coming to cause something like this?!","While this question remained unanswered, the very real reality of the first Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity joining the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage played out as just what effect would it have on its Progenitor?"]},{"number":2688,"title":"Chapter 2688: Chapter 2687 Second Awakening! I","paragraphs":["2687 Second Awakening! I","Like the Hyperversal Anomalous Virions he was using, Noah's will and lineage spread rampantly and with wild abandon.","What he was giving out was akin to the most pristine Havenly Blood Source Seas as the Lineage granted allowed one to seamlessly get ever closer to Extremity!","At the time that a fantastically powerful Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity decided to swallow one of his Blood Sources and take hold of his lineage, Noah was watching the effects of the Ash Tree II of Gradation finish as many astounding prompts already presented themselves before him.","[The 17th Havenly Boundary Layer of Oceanus has been attained!]","[The Sixth Aletheian Haven of Extremity has been completed!]","[The Seventh Aletheian Haven of Extremity has begun to be forged!]","His Origin now held layers of Seven Havens that looked like massive rings of an ever expanding tower of quintessence.","In addition to a sliver of Helios, his Sixth Aletheian Haven was mostly composed of Oceanus as his Seventh Aletheian Haven that just started out has this same cerulean Havenly Authority in its starting stages!","\"Seven Aletheian Havens...\"","His voice was deep as he spoke while gazing at the figure of Xiaomi who was still engrossed in the Records of Extremity of the Tier 1 Vacuous Extremity Noah had killed.","He then gazed at the Quintessential Extremity Loot in his hands as seas of Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authority continued to descend from above.","He was gazing at the Remnant Golden Absolute Hyperversal Writ of Extremity!","[Remnant Golden Absolute Hyperversal Writ of Extremity]: A Writ of Extremity is an undeniable authority. Through the Records of the True Death of a Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity, their accomplishments and history were culminated into a type of treasure that actually stands opposite to the true meaning and pursuit of Extremity. Extremity is meant to be sought and achieved by one's very own existence, but this Loot is one of the 10 pieces required to forge a Golden Absolute Hyperversal Writ of Extremity that allows an existence- regardless of whether they truly stand and define the concept, to attain Extremity in it. A Golden Writ is only applicable for the lowest dredges of concepts to achieve Extremity- Planar Boundaries. Its Authority isn't able to elevate Innate or Consummate Boundaries to Extremity, much less the concepts held by the True Emperor of Quintessence. Its usage by you even with the collection of all Remnants would not be sufficient to take any of your prime concepts towards Extremity, even if you haphazardly manifest a Planar Boundaries. If you personally seek to achieve Extremity in this path, the only quintessential route is to attain 10 Remnant Crimson Absolute Hyperversal Writs of Extremity by decimating the records of 10 Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities. The decimation of a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity and the procurement of their records would theoretically grant a Quintessential Zenith Absolute Hyperversal Writ of Extremity, but...let's remain realistic here.","\"...\"","The description of the Remnant Golden Absolute Hyperversal Writ of Extremity was an astonishing one as truly, it was a loot that granted Extremity!","So long as 10 Remnants were collected, a Planar Boundaries could be taken from the 17th Boundary Layer and elevated to Extremity! And yet, Noah was barred from it as collecting 10 Remnant Golden or even Obsidian Absolute Hyperversal Writs of Extremity by killing Tier 1 or Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities wouldn't do much for him!","His qualifications would only be met if he decimated the Records of a Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity.","And the details of this Loot towards the end caused his brows to rise as when it came to the quantification and display of data in the form of prompts and details of Loot or abilities, it was in part done by Noah's Infinite System and the Infinite Hyperversal Haven as they collected and gained more information on the perceived reality- on Recorded History and Unrecorded History.","Noah's own abilities, the unique authority of his Eyes, his increased authority in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity, and other factors contributed to just how much details he could pull from his surrounding reality- to the extent that the names, identities, and Stat Panels of weaker beings could be seen by his eyes!","With the advent of his Eyes of Extremity, he could even begin to see more details of a Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity just by gazing at them as him being capable of seeing their Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures quantified for him what concepts they had, and which ones had achieved Extremity.","For progressively powerful beings, he could only see names of- being like this including Emperor Shao as when he reached a high enough level, Noah couldn't even discern his Extremity Rune Scriptures anymore.","So the details of the Writ of Extremity he held caused him to smack his lips by reminding him that decimating a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity was not at all something realistic, even with Noah's habit of breaking down walls of impossibilities!","But when he looked at all the information he knew about them and the terrifying level of power they held...he shook his head.","Before Extremity, such a thing was too much to even call a dream.","He had multiple possibilities to now look at as he took a moment to see which path lay with the most opportunity.","With the completed Golden Absolute Hyperversal Writ of Extremity, he could have someone among his Vassals attain Extremity- so long as he focused on directing a portion of the Aeonic Treasures of Extremity he was receiving through his Infernal Havenly Commerce to elevate their chosen Planar Boundaries to the 17th Layer.","This was a possible path.","He didn't need to waste the Writ on someone like Xiaomi as her Innate Pellucid Hyperversal Extremity Foundation of Ruined Chaos took care of her path to Extremity along with the tools Noah granted her- with her experiencing the ascension of a Tier 1 Vacuous Extremity at this very moment as they forged their first Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture!"]},{"number":2689,"title":"Chapter 2689: Chapter 2688 Second Awakening! II","paragraphs":["2688 Second Awakening! II","\"Mmm...\"","Noah's eyes shone with utmost brightness as with a pondering gaze of the myriad paths to take, his will then turned inwards as he looked at his Innate Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Meridians.","They pulsed and brimmed with roaring streams of these two authorities as they seemed ready to take the last step.","The feat of killing a Tier 1 Vacuous Extremity was stupendous enough to allow him to near the cusp of the Second Vitalis and Vacuous Awakening in addition to all the minute streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority he received from those joining his Lineage, but it still wasn't enough.","What he needed was something that could pierce a wall and take the last ste-","BOOOM!","His thoughts came to a halt.","Above him, a refulgence of glorious light exploded as his mind buzzed soon after, his very own Blood sending him information as at this moment, he realized that a terrifying existence had actually become part of his Lineage!","As the Progenitor, he had many tools to utilize under his belt- and gaining the basic information of those becoming part of his Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage was one of them.","And his eyes radiated magisterial splendor as the information of an existence with a unique distinction appeared in his mind!","The Seer of Sima!","An aged woman who had seen eons and lived an uncountable number of years, traversing across the Vitalis Annals of Extremity freely!","A Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity.","As soon as such a being became a part of his lineage, extremely pure streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority broke from above like a dam and surged into him, his Innate Vitalis Hyperversal Meridians vibrating and being forced to expand as this surge of authority acted like a needle that pierced a heavy wall!","BOOM!","Along with it...","[Your Aspects of Existence has reached a critical threshold of purity of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority.]","[Your Innate Vitalis Hyperversal Meridians have reached a sufficient level of size and magnitude.]","[Your Second Vitalis Awakening is beginning!]","The Second Vitalis Awakening!","The inclusion of a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity into his Lineage was the last step it took to make it happen as the influx of pure Vitalis Hyperversal Authority seethed and caused his body to brim with brilliance.","At the same time as this began, the potent Vacuous Hyperversal Authority within his existence also seethed as of sensing an imbalance, the calm flow of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority still steaming down from the ruptured records above due to Noah's achievement pulsing and releasing a tidal wave of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority unto him.","[Your Aspects of Existence has reached a critical threshold of purity of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.]","[Your Innate Vacuous Hyperversal Meridians have reached a sufficient level of size and magnitude.]","[Your Second Vacuous Awakening is beginning!]","Like dominoes falling.","After one came the other!","His body pulsed with utmost glory as in the surroundings, drums of Quintessential victory that had died down somewhat began to buzz again.","DUM! DUM! DUM!","From the skies, the rupture of records became even larger astendrils of pure Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authority roared out like serpentine rivers that snaked their way into his body.","Before, he had seen snaking streams of Vitalis wrap around Emperor Shao as he breezed into his Second Vitalis Awakening.","Now, he had both Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authority snaking towards him in vibrant tendrils of light as he seemed like a grandiose entity being forged by the flames of these ever clashing authorities existing for an untold period of time!","The transformation was bound to be a glorious one as-","HUUM!","Oraculum blared with golden grandeur.","And an instant later...","[Hello?]","...!","A sonorous voice buzzed.","A voice that wasn't his or anyone he had come in contact with as he quickly ascertained this voice came...from his very Lineage!","The voice was feminine in nature and yet filled with age, and it seemed questioning as it didn't really know who it was talking to.","But Noah very quickly knew as shockingly, this voice stemmed from the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity that had just joined his Lineage- the Seer of Sima!","[Hello? Is anything cognizant behind this? Can you hear me? Which Primogenitor is in charge of this Lineage?]","Her voice echoed out again.","Her capabilities were so frightening as she was able to somehow send a message through the Lineage she had attained...towards its very top as she was probing the identity of the existence or construct at the very peak of this Lineage!","Yet Noah remained calm as he didn't follow the connection of his lineage to say anything back.","The safeguards he had placed with Oraculum in addition to his status as an Absolute Hyperversal Inscrutable Existence and his masking capabilities with Obfuscation still allowed him to retain an impenetrable veil as this being could only even send messages towards the one standing at the very peak of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage due to her shocking power!","This was also his authority as a Progenitor of this Lineage!","She didn't know who was behind it, but she was capable enough to probe.","[Primogenitor Steel, is it you? Have you branched off to another path after Artificer to do this?]","Her voice continued to probe. It showed how Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities truly shouldn't be underestimated, and it also a testament to the power and authority of Noah's Lineage, its standing, and what his status as an Inscrutable Existence granted him.","This was something he theorized may be possible if sufficiently powerful Existences obtained his lineage, and the reality of it happening now and seeing its result left Noah satisfied!","Even Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities connected to him through his Lineage could not obtain information or see through him.","Even a terrifying Seer was only able to do what the Seer of Sima was doing now, which was already out of the realm of impossibility.","[Primogenitor Acacius, is it actually you? I've read the records that you were always interested in all things relating to Bloodlines...]","[Or is this just some blank will that can't even answer back?]","[Vitalis...is this another one of your doings? Do you actually have a will? Or are you the same cruel and non-caring construct I know of?]","\"...\"","The only issue was that her voice continued to come incessantly.","[Mmm...who could this be?]","As her voice continued to ring out, Noah shook his head and was returning to focus on his Awakenings when...","[Noah Osmont?]","BOOM!","Her voice was thundering as Noah's eyes squinted powerfully.","He remained unaffected as...","[Ara Ara, that can't be it. Primogenitor Cleisthenes, is it you?]","A guess.","She had uttered Noah's name as a guess, but it showed her terrifying intuition as Noah's sharp eyes called the Reified Wealdian Source of Oraculum here!","Even if just out of an overabundance of caution, his veil has to be made ever thicker.","And this...was something that his Awakenings may even help with as they proceeded!"]},{"number":2690,"title":"Chapter 2690: Chapter 2689 Second Awakening! III","paragraphs":["2689 Second Awakening! III","In the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, raging rivers of pure Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities roared down with fervor onto a single being.","His Innate Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Meridians were being expanded and enlarged. The concentration of these two authorities inside of his body was also being increased!","Along with this, previous Authorities were elevated as new ones were granted!","All the while this was occurring...","[The False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture of DESPOILER has been completed!]","...!","A dazzling singularity with sublime strokes reading [DESPOILER] floated before Noah's figure surrounded by waves of authorities.","His first False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture was completed!","[An achievement worthy of being heralded across the Aeonic Annals of Extremity!]","[Without attaining Extremity, you have forged a type of Extremity Rune Scripture, even if it is a false one.]","Yet another profound achievement was added to his roster as who could forge an Extremity Rune Scripture before they attained Extremity?","Around him, the rivers of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities turned even wilder as the ongoing Awakenings seemed that much more glorious and filled with ever-increasing radiance.","And at the same time, the tool that had given him access to a rapid progression of his Origin and Soul had transformed back into a seed that floated before him.","[The Quintessential Hyperversal Sporos III of Extremity has manifested and is ready to be cultivated to maturity.]","A seed that would take an even more obscene amount of Loot to cultivate to maturity appeared as Noah gazed at both it and the False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture of DESPOILER.","Both were tools he planned to use heavily in the days to come as they would eventually bring him to Extremity!","As for the False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture of DESPOILER, he planned to construct as many as he could in the next day before he unleashed them on multiple Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities affected by his Hyperversal Anomalous Virions.","Killing a single Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity was a grand achievement. Killing multiple of them at once...was even grander. And it prevented any possible countermeasures from being taken against Noah as the truly powerful Entities on the battlefield observe one Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity falling after another under the same circumstances.","His glorious path slowly had its steps laid out as his very existence continued its baptism of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities!","The only thing that interrupted this was a voice that continued to ring out across the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage that only he could hear.","[Whichever Primogenitor this is, I'll continue sending these communications until I receive a reply. I'll either anger you until I get to know who is behind all this, or you aren't even cognizant and may just be a blank construct. Either way, I have endless words and stories I can bombard you with...]","The voice of the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity that was the Seer of Sima was relentless!","[All I've gazed upon are Records, so I can talk endlessly. Did you know of the Record of the Extremity of Reincarnation? That guy kept on killing himself in Unrecorded Histories thinking they were the currently playing out reality, thinking he gained an edge over all others with his information. Alas, Unrecorded Histories don't always play out as intended, and this guy died before achieving Tier 4. His path was a unique one though. Oh, and talking about paths, have you tried traversing any of the Dead Paths? Sure, we consider them dead ends, but can you imagine taking one to Extremity? Well...]","Her voice continued to resound without any apparent end as Noah had to turn her down to a small glimmer of a whisper, a majority of his will focusing on the changes in his Aspects of Existence and just where he would be after this point.","The Reified Wealdian Source of Oraculum was floating opposite to Noah with its eyes closed as it perused the Aeonic Annals of Extremity- also preparing to begin exploring the Vacuous Annals of Extremity.","And besides Noah's figure, the clear eyes of Xiaomi opened at this time as a terrifying trace of epiphany blazed, her eyes moving from the Record of Extremity and towards the True Death Record of Diospia!","She had seen the record of this being forming his Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures.","She had seen him transform his soul and other aspects of Existence to a glorious height with these Scriptures!","Now...she wanted to see the end of these Scriptures.","To her, the end was much more profound than the beginning. She felt an inkling that after observing how this being died, she could coalesce everything and be able to have a clear path for Ruin!","Just....","BZZT!","She had to be capable of navigating the shocking amount of rivers of obsidian and transparent white lights that were dancing around Noah, where even being near him gave off an astounding sense of oppression as in the surroundings, a symphony carried by ancient rhythmic drums continued- as of it were welcoming the arrival of a grand existence!","—","[No luck?]","The Extremity of Foundation asked carefully as the Seer of Sima shook her head with a profound light.","Her aged figure pulsed with ingenuity as she spoke out commandingly.","[It's okay if we don't know who is ultimately behind it. Go to this Infernal Havenly Commerce and obtain as many as possible, other Clans and Inheritances are likely already on the move as well.]","The Sima Clan moved as it wasn't the only one.","Word of the Infernal Havenly Commerce spread. Word of the Blood Sources capable of re-writing one's lineage and granting stupendous boosts towards and past Extremity spread!","In the Nether Haven of Helios, the figure of Ayame stood before her grandfather as he pinched and played with one of the Blood Sources she had gotten from Noah, his visage surrounded by molten waves of heat and grandeur as this Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity swallowed the Blood Source soon after.","In the Nether Haven of Andromeda.","A purple Aurora of stellar light stretched out endlessly as millions of floating moons could be seen stretched out in a serene region covered by layers of Hyperversal Extremity Formations and Defensive Barriers.","This...was one of the core areas of the Havenly Moon Clan- one of the Seven Clans of the Nether Havens of Extremity!"]},{"number":2691,"title":"Chapter 2691: Chapter 2690 Second Awakening! IV","paragraphs":["2690 Second Awakening! IV","Many beings had begun to move to obtain what were known as Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Blood Sources, but none had moved to obtain as many as the Havenly Moon Clan!","The first set of beings to come across the Infernal Havenly Commerce were from this group.","And after their Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities saw the grandiose boons, they sent word to their entire Clan as Havenly Moon Vaults began to be emptied just to obtain these Blood Sources!","At this point in time, they had already obtained a million Blood Sources as this number would only increase, with the Seers of the Havenly Moon counting to analyze the Blood Sources before they were sent to their Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities.","And soon after...the Avernus Clan began to pick up on the appearance and gradual proliferation of the Blood Sources.","It wasn't yet known that this Clan was at odds with the Progenitor of the spreading lineage.","So when they got their hands on the Blood Sources...just what would this result in?","Only time would tell as in the Vitalis Havens of Extremity, reality continued to unfold.","More and more forces entered the Supernal Havens of Extremity as the Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification was fully underway, those who were capable of gaining entry and beginning to accumulate Units of Havenly Aurora","Outside of these Havens, a blazing war had fully begun and picked up pace between Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Entities.","Many beings rose and fell, with others only beginning to enact their grand history!","And like so...the minutes turned into hours.","And the hours churned on as a day passed.","—","In the Nether Haven of Oceanus.","Out of all the Seven Havens, Oceanus was undoubtedly one filled with the most beauty and wonder as the cerulean glow of the endless and ever- pervasive bodies of water alone could astonish one for years.","It also contained the largest variations of races and existences as the Inheritances in this Haven were many!","Of course, the bases of the Seven Clans were also found across this Haven.","At this moment, towards the center of the Nether Haven of Oceanus.","In the Independent Oceanus Marketplace where a dense number of Inheritances and even the Seven Clans came to barter and trade.","High-rise underwater buildings rose in all directions as rainbow-colored ocean beasts swam freely, with a white blue skyscraper at the very center having the most activity.","At this moment, in front of the doors of this skyscraper that was known as the Oceanus Iridescent Auction House, there were multiple stalls set up for beings to buy and trade their wares.","One stall in particular though, had a flurry of activity and beings surging around it constantly as a Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity adorned in a golden blue robe that had a crimson flaming infinity symbol in front of the chest had his head raised high while holding a Blood Source within his hands.","This was an employee of the Infernal Havenly Commerce who knew where to find the most customers, leaving the Nether Haven of Dissolution where a lot of the Extremities from his Extremity Cicada Inheritance had already set up shop in front of the Vein Rifts!","He came to Oceanus as here, he had already made thousands of trades as his commission would be high!","[Make way.]","At this moment, an authoritative voice echoed out as a Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity Authority descended, the groups around the Employee of the Infernal Havenly Commerce showing displeased faces as they parted ways.","They were here to obtain the much acclaimed and needed Blood Sources that could change the fate, talent, and potential of an existence. In times of war, this was much needed! Yet this authoritative voice thundered out at this moment.","From behind, the figures of multiple Hyperversal Extremities from the Avernus Clan adorned in purple robes appeared, the one at the forefront waving his hands to cause dense clusters of Aeonic Treasures of Extremity to appear!","They had already collected information on the Blood Sources being sold here as the Tier 3 Avernus Extremity at the forefront spoke.","[As many Blood Sources as this can pay for.]","His words were short and to the point as the Employee of the Infernal Havenly Commerce smiled.","He sent his will to the stream of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority inside of him and communicated with it, a light of glorious Quintessence flashing as the clusters of treasures disappeared, and a crimson gold flash of light from the stream of Vitalis inside this being ejected out 100 radiant Blood Sources!","The eyes of the Avernus Extremities lit up, the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms behind them even more so as they had collected too much information about these Blood Sources!","All clans so far had gotten their hands on them as their effects were shocking.","They couldn't be left behind as these 100 were just a trial run, their storage relics still filled with many Treasures to exchange with.","The leading Avernus Extremity waved his hands to collect the 100 Blood Sources as without delay, he took one to swallow right away- garnering envious gazes from the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms in the surroundings who couldn't even afford a single Blood Source!","Some Extremities from other Clans and Inheritances also looked on with shining eyes as they had seen this scene multiple times on the last day.","Some Extremities would radiate a shocking level of power after swallowing the Blood Sources, with there being a case where an Apex Aeonic Lifeform who had been stuck at the 17th Boundary Layer for the past hundreds of years actually making a breakthrough to attain Extremity on the spot!","What effect would the Blood Source have on a terrifying Tier 3 Avernus Extremity?","[...?]","They watched as uniquely, the glaring crimson gold light of glory didn't shine from this Extremity, his gaze changing as in front of the eyes of all beings here, the Blood Source this Avernus Extremity just swallowed flashed out of his body as crimson gold illusory words flashed above it for all to see!","[For any Avernus Clan Members seeking the boons of the Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Blood Source, an Oath of Extremity of them cutting off all ties to the Avernus Clan and barring their involvement in any of their Clan matters is required.]","...!","A shocking message rose as all eyes in the surroundings gazed in astonishment!","At the same time, the faces of the Avernus Extremities turned extremely sour and ashen!","What the hell was this?","How had the Avernus Clan offended the terrifying power behind these Blood Sources for something as shocking as this to actually occur?!"]},{"number":2692,"title":"Chapter 2692: Chapter 2691 Second Awakening! V","paragraphs":["2691 Second Awakening! V","A stunning revelation of reality!","The Avernus Clan members seemed to have a shocking history and an unfathomable enemy as when a Tier 3 Avernus Extremity tried to swallow a Blood Source, a terrifying message appeared before everyone's gaze.","His expression was bold as he bellowed out.","[Daring!]","WAA!","He took the Blood Source again as he flicked it towards a Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity behind him, this being gazing at the source with a somber expression before he also swallowed it.","And a moment after...his expression became exceedingly sour as the Blood Source appeared outside of his body, flashing a similar message soon after!","[For any Avernus Clan Members seeking the boons of the Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Blood Source, an Oath of Extremity of them cutting off all ties to the Avernus Clan and barring their involvement in any of their Clan matters is required.]","[...]","Immense silence descended in the surroundings as the forces of other Clans and Inheritances here looked on with astonished gazes, instantly beginning to transmit scenes of what was happening to their forces as this was the first time they came across this!","As far as they knew, nobody else from any inheritance or Clan had ever received such a treatment in front of the Blood Sources.","Now, the biggest question was...why was the Avernus Clan different? Just who did they offend to have the current reality playing out?!","[What is this? How come it is like this?]","The Tier 3 Avernus Extremity was enraged as he turned his might and pressure onto the Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity of the Extremity Cicada Inheritance.","The Employee of the Infernal Havenly Commerce who had sold him the Blood Sources!","Facing the pressure of an existence that had condensed Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures, the soul of this Infernal Havenly Employee couldn't help but tremble as he spoke while gritting his teeth.","[I am merely an Employee conducting business, I know not of any other matters!]","His eyes shone with unwillingness as he noted in his heart that Avernus Clan members would never again be his customers!","And yet the enraged figure of the Tier 3 Avernus Extremity still remained. But apart from releasing his terrifying pressure, no other action could be made in this Independent Oceanus Marketplace, much less before the steps of the Oceanus Iridescent Auction House.","The wills of multiple Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities had already begun to rouse because of this commotion!","Feeling despondent and stifled from the gazes of others, the Tier 3 Avernus Extremity waved his hands angrily as he and his group began to retreat.","And soon after, the surroundings buzzed as information rapidly began to circulate!","It of course circulated even faster with the force directly involved, all of that had occurred being sent to the higher echelons of the Avernus Clan as everything became known within seconds.","—","In the Nether Haven of Dissolution.","In a spatial pocket carved out by a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity, the astonishing scene of dozens of Extremities in seated positions with their faces constantly twisting in pain could be seen, with only a few having blank expressions filled with bloody murder!","Such Extremities included Ariana, Gayacus, and Extremity Blue.","Above these Extremities, a group of a few others floated behind a wondrous Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity.","The Seer Amestris!","Beside her, an illusory mirror showed the grandiose and majestic visage of the Avernus Extremity Overlord who was gazing at the scene ahead with utmost calm.","[Someone is trying to destabilize our Avernus Clan from within. Have you come up with some possibilities?]","They received the news of the message of the Blood Sources all others were assimilating and receiving shocking boons, and yet this wasn't the case for the Avernus Clan members!","Naturally, this had to be by the hands of someone.","An enemy!","The Avernus Clan had made many enemies over the years.","They were at odds with the Reality Plucking Pavilion Inheritance, the Havenly Moon Clan, and other individual Extremities that they had conflicts with in the past.","More recently, they just added the Cult of Endless Shadows as another enemy!","The Seer Amestris was silent for the following seconds before she carefully opened her mouth, pure Authority continuing to leak from her and flow into the bodies of the Avernus Extremities fighting against an infection of their Existence.","[Four possibilities come to mind, but I've eliminated two of them due to the timing. If I add origination as well...then the possibility of the one who played a hand in this may be the same one that did this to a portion of your forces.]","WAA!","She pointed towards Extremity Blue and the others as the gaze of the Avernus Extremity Overlord flickered on the illusory screen while he spoke out questioningly!","[Noah Osmont?]","A daring possibility.","And yet Seer Amestris nodded while replying.","[I'm not entirely confident in this theory, but the Blood Sources that have been spreading recently are originating from the Supernal Havens of Extremity. They are a form of the Havenly Lineages similar to the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages. The last time I left Osmont, he had the backing of a Tier 4 Saurischian Titanosaurus as he revealed his Vitalis Awakening. He may have played a hand in influencing whatever force is producing these Blood Sources to blacklist the Avernus Clan.]","...!","He may have utilized his influence to ask for the powerful force to do something like this!","Uniquely, the possibility that it was all him didn't cross their minds as such a thing was far too ridiculous and didn't have a whole lot of supporting facts.","Even their current theory was a speculation!","The Avernus Extremity Overlord simmered in authority and power as he listened, gazing at the states of his forces as his authoritative voice rang out.","[Verify this as soon as you can, pay a visit to this Infernal Havenly Commerce if you have to. As for this Osmont...to do this to Hyperversal Extremities, it is all the more reason for us to quickly erase this feud before it continues any further. But if he has joined the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage and is afforded their protection that scales up to Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities...","how should he be handled?]","A slippery enemy they hadn't been able to put down!","With the tight protection of their Lineages they had come to understand on the last day, killing him would be nearly an impossibility as they had to think of something else.","[A group of Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities or a single Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity ignoring his supposed support from the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage should do it. But they will then be hunted down soon after in these Supernal Havens of Extremity...]","The authoritative voice of the Avernus Extremity Overlord continued to ring it as Seer Amestris squinted her eyes dangerously at this point.","A light of ingenuity burned in her eyes.","[I may have a more permanent solution for this. Someone who could disregard his layers of protection and still come out unscathed after killing him..]","...!","Words with a level of certainty rose from her as even the Overlord's will beside her rose in a questioning tone!","Seer Amestris then spoke daringly as a cruel and fantastical light flashed across her eyes.","[He just recently advanced to become a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity who shows a tremendous level of power in the Bastions of Vitalis...and he still owes us a favor.]","BOOM"]},{"number":2693,"title":"Chapter 2693: Chapter 2692 Second Awakening! VI","paragraphs":["2692 Second Awakening! VI","A shocking proposed path!","Utilizing a favor owed from a being when he used to be Tier 3, and now they had achieved a shocking level of power.","Seer Amestris had a profound look as she continued.","[Emperor Shao. We can use the last favor with him to ensure the complete eradication of the records of Noah Osmont while not earning the ire of the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage ourselves. Even now, most forces haven't truly been able to quantify his power, but in the past day, he has held off five Tier 4 Vacuous Extremities by himself. Sufficient to say...a single anomaly that has yet to achieve Extremity, even one as abstruse as Osmont, should not be able to stand up to his might.]","[...]","The Avernus Extremity Overlord was quiet after this as he seemed to be contemplating.","The favor of a powerful Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity!","Should such a thing truly be used to completely wipe off the threat of a being that before they had even achieved Extremity, they held tools that could incapacitate Tiers 1 to 3 Hyperversal Extremities?","Silence continued to permeate.","The decision that would be made here was bound to be a critical one!","—","In the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","The Havens being built and remodeled within this treasured land continued to increase as a shocking amount of authority was held by the Infinite Hyperversal Haven with the Natural Laws and Dectra reaching the 17th Boundary Layer.","The Natural Laws were more so inclined to be similar to Dead Paths than the Decreta that were a level below, but Noah had elevated all of them to such a high peak as a single jump into Extremity in one meant Extremity in all of them!","And now, there were even the Havenly Boundaries added into the mix.","At this moment, Noah's figure was standing at the edge of an expanding Aletheian Haven of Oceanus, with its borders connecting with Genesis and Helios so far as Dissolution was further from it.","The glow of a stellar cerulean grandeur could be felt all around Noah as at the very edge of this Haven, his feet dangled down as a shimmering cerulean waterfall of Oceanus cascaded down with serenity.","Yet around him, rivers of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities swam freely as every now and then, they would flash and buzz before they were separated by Noah's will!","Along with the rivers of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities, one could also see 210 dazzling False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of DESPOILER, half being made of Vitalis and half being born of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.","All of these were accumulated over the last day as Noah was ready to make a grand move in the chaotic battlefield between Vacuous and Vitalis Domains!","Apart from this, a dazzling Quintessential Hyperversal Sporos III of Extremity floated while radiating multicolored brilliance, having been fed endless reserves of Loot that were multiplied by RUINATION over the last day.","Even though raising it was more arduous than the previous seeds, it was getting the inflow of 90% of the Loot from Noah's Infernal Havenly Commerce!","This...was loot gathered from many Inheritances and the Seven Clans, the number being utterly astounding, and even more so once it was multiplied by RUINATION.","Currently, its progression was an astonishing one after a day.","[Quintessential Hyperversal Sporos III of Extremity]... 53% Maturity...","Halfway there!","It was a pace other beings could only despair at as at this moment, Noah thought of the waves of information he had received based on the safeguards he had placed on the Blood Sources.","The scene that occurred in the Nether Haven of Oceanus that showed the rejection that the Avernus Extremities had received had played out as grandly as he expected!","His targets for the Blood Sources were all of the Seven Havens and the existences within it, and excluding Avernus Clan Members would not hurt him.","At the same time, he would achieve his purpose for this great enemy.","The first one was isolation.","Apart from all others, only the Avernus Clan would not be able to obtain a terrific tool that increased one's rate of progression towards and past Extremity!","While other Clans and Inheritances around them obtained the Blood Sources and became increasingly powerful, their forces would grow weaker.","The effect of this isolation and ostracization would only increase as more and more Blood Sources spread!","Gradually from this isolation...sources of chaos would continue to increase as Noah wouldn't have to do anything.","The members of the Avernus Clan would slowly renounce and cut off ties with it in order to be capable of accepting the Blood Sources, with Noah expecting Apex Aeonic Lifeforms to be the first as soon after...Avernus Extremities would follow as more stories and information spread about how much more powerful other Extremities were getting!","Then taking this action would then make them traitors as to propagate further chaos...the deserting Avernus Extremities would be hunted.","Conflict would continue to grow thereafter as Noah even planned to offer Blood Sources for free to Avernus Clan members in a day or two!","On the path of Extremity, everyone was out for themselves.","More and more of their Apex Aeonic Lifeforms and Extremities would be attracted to this irresistible allure as with this simple plan...Noah was going to fracture the massive and indomitable clan into pieces!","And he had gotten even more confident of this after the changes brought forth by the Second Vitalis and Vacuous Awakenings.","Inside of him, his Innate Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Meridians were greatly expanded, their intricate systems now coursing with both authorities as if they were sharing rivers.","They cycled across Noah's existence as with each cycle, he felt himself brimming with ever more power as if his very existence was refined and baptized to become stronger each time!","The prompts of these Awakenings were stunning ones as even now, Noah could see them shimmering with brilliance in his logs.","[You have completed your Second Vitalis Awakening!]","[You have completed your Second Vacuous Awakening!]","[Your distinction as an Absolute Hyperversal Inscrutable Existence has been elevated to Absolute Hyperversal Inscrutable II Existence.]","[The discernment of your History, Realm, Authorities, Dynamis, or anything else about you is now veiled and masked even against Zenith Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities!]","[After obtaining more information, the Transformation into Vacuous Havenly I Entity has been renamed and elevated into Vacuous Infernal II Entity.]","[Transformation into the Vitalis Havenly I Entity is now possible!]","An array of prompts had come as amidst all of the critical and astounding ones, the ever constant surge and baptism of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities while paired up with the boons of the Ash Tree II of Gradation that had just finished a day ago made way to...","[Your soul has reached the Unscalable Wall of Extremity!]","...!","A Quintessential reality!"]},{"number":2694,"title":"Chapter 2694: Chapter 2693 The Way to Scale the Unscalable! I","paragraphs":["2693 The Way to Scale the Unscalable! I","The Unscalable Wall of Extremity.","He was approaching this terrifying wall before!","After the Ash Tree II of Gradation and his Second Vitalis and Vacuous Awakenings, he was now at the wall.","Breaking it meant gaining a type of Extremity Soul even before he achieved Extremity!","It was a monumental achievement, but as for whether one could achieve it...","the wording was in the name!","Unscalable.","One had to gain Extremity to achieve an Extremity Soul! Otherwise, it would only be a pipe dream for them.","[An Unstoppable Force is required to break through such a wall, where even the direct strengthening and baptism of your soul may not be enough.]","It was unknown whether the Ash Tree II of Extremity would be enough to break through this wall when a prompt like this came.","It was unknown whether another baptism of Vitalis and Vacuous would do the trick!","Noah had to do something explosive to break such a wall.","And when it came to what this could be...he smiled while gazing towards the far away figure of Xiaomi who was lost in cycles of epiphanies- intent on finding a path towards Extremity.","Noah gazed at her as for his answer on how to break the Unscalable Wall of Extremity...","\"Is it finally time to undergo Apexification?\"","...!","Apexification!","A process his main body had never gone through as he still held Quintessential Hyperversal Meridian Seeds!","Yet his very existence was already touching upon multiple aspects of Extremity as he even wanted to use the force of Apexification to undergo a thorough transformation of his existence that would scale the Unscalable Wall of Extremity.","He knew that he had to prepare for it.","It couldn't be the process of Apexification alone as he had to pair it with one or two more unstoppable forces. And he already knew where to start!","As he thought of his current power that he held before even undergoing Apexification, he paused the perusing of the prompts that showed the boons of the Awakenings to view his stat panel.","[Name]:: Noah Osmont","[Realm]:: Seventh Aletheian Haven of Extremity(23% completed]","[Lineage]:: Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor","[Titles]:: True Emperor of Quintessence, Wrathful Quintessential Hyperversal Demon Emperor, One Who Gazes Upon Hyperversal Authority, Aletheian, Indefatigable, Tyrannical Emperor, The Tainted, Anomaly, Home of the Weald, Awakener, Inscrutable, Hyperversal Anomaly, 9th Infernal Lord, Havenly Progenitor, Extremity Despoiler, Gazer of the Unscalable Wall","[Quintessential Hyperversal Mana Value]:: Infinite","[Quintessential Hyperversal Vitality Value]:: 6,999,999","[Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Value]:: 9,999,999","[Quintessential Hyperversal Defense Value]:: 6,999,999","[Quintessential Hyperversal Damage Value]:: 9,999,999","[Hyperversal Dignity]:: 59","[Hyperversal Mastery]:: 59","[Absolute Hyperversal Authority Resistance]:: 51%","[Absolute Hyperversal Authority Penetration]:: 51%","[Dynamis of Extremity]:: Indefatigable(Quintessential Absolute II), Aletheian(Quintessential Absolute II), Vitalistic(Quintessential Absolute II), Oraculum(Quintessential Absolute II), Thanatos(Quintessential Absolute II), Lotra(Quintessential Absolute II)","[Boundaries of Extremity]:: Quintessence, Infinity, Dissolution, Helios, Genesis, Oceanus, Foundation, Blood, Manadynamics, Loot, Reality, Dimensions, Anima, Body, Origin, Soul, Genesis, Apocalypse, Prana, Dreams, Avalon...","A lot had changed in an extremely short period of time!","His Dynamis of Extremity now held an excess of 32 Boundaries in each of them as their authorities were greatly elevated, with grandiose changes taking place where in Dynamis like Aletheian, the Natural laws, Dectra, and the newly obtained Havenly Boundaries of Dissolution, Helios, Genesis, and Oceanus began to be incorporated into it.","The level of authority this Dynamis now bolstered was immense as it was his Aletheian Havens in his Origin that obtained the greatest boost.","Oraculum was another one of Noah's Dynamis that also now held the Havenly Boundaries of Dissolution, Helios, Genesis, and Oceanus into it- with the traversal of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity being all that easier when the Havenly Authorities that made up the very Havens that history was being Recorded on into the Dynamis!","When Noah looked at his status panel now and compared it to just days ago, the difference was so drastic that he seemed like a different being entirely!","What was an existence like Ahpuch who had 20,000 Values compared to his Soul Values which neared 10 Million?","What were other Apex Aeonic Lifeforms compared to him?!","They were mere ants who could now crumble from his gaze alone!","And yet...","'Be humble...be humble...' Noah smiled as he didn't let these inflated values get to his head.","His foundation below Extremity was unrivaled.","He could not truly be classified in any criterion as he exceeded some or was deficient in others!","He stood on his own stage and path as he would only forge forward without looking back.","And the tools he had on him would make all of this possible.","His eyes flashed as he returned to the logs of prompts that showed his continued growth after his Second Awakenings.","[Primitive Vitalis Manipulation has been elevated to Proficient Vitalis Manipulation.]","[The day you achieve Quintessential Vitalis Manipulation, your enemies will be forced to question their very own existence. It is unknown how many Awakenings or unique conditions have to be met in order to attain Quintessential Vitalis Manipulation.]","[Hyperversal I Assimilation has been elevated to Hyperversal II Assimilation.]","It was a collection of fantastical streams of information.","He was taken from Primitive to Proficient Vitalis Manipulation as a drop of knowledge told him that far down the line, he could even attain Quintessential Vitalis Manipulation!","And such a thing would be enough to just make his enemies give up.","Proficient Vitalis Manipulation. New Vitalis and Vacuous Entity Forms to adorn, and then the elevation of Inscrutable!","With the Inscrutable II Existence distinction, Noah was confident to do many things he knew he couldn't do before!","Before he called out the False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of DESPOILER for a hunt of Extremities that would grant him enough Loot to mature the current Sporos III of Extremity, he wanted to affirm the terror of his distinction as an Inscrutable II Existence.","He wanted to affirm the deadly things he could do with it!"]},{"number":2695,"title":"Chapter 2695: Chapter 2694 The Way to Scale the Unscalable! II","paragraphs":["2694 The Way to Scale the Unscalable! II","The Hyperversal Anomalous Virion!","It was entirely made up of Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authority that were separated by a myriad of Noah's authorities, with their core having an altered Blood Source born from Noah's very own Blood.","The storm of authorities occurring within Extremity Blue and the other Avernus Extremities...it was his altered Blood Source that attacked their records even now seeking to destroy them.","His Blood Source.","It carried his will as he could open his awareness to view things even from his enemies affected by his Hyperversal Anomalous Virions!","Before, he didn't even try as in front of the Seer of Avernus, many things could go wrong.","But now, he had attained the distinction of an Inscrutable II Existence. Even Zenith Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities could not glean anything about him as he could make his authorities seem like anything he wished!","So at this moment, he closed his eyes. He focused on the Hyperversal Anomalous Virions he had spread out.","There were millions of inactive ones in the gray region where Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities clashed. There were 99 active ones still raging within Vacuous Extremities!","Then, there were a few dozen active Virions in the Supernal Haven of Dissolution.","His Authority focused on these as with a flash of light, the trace of his will within them woke up!","A reality soon painted itself before him.","From the body of Extremity Blue who floated in a seated position with a deadly expression, his will gazed around as he located all the other affected Avernus Extremities also in a seated position fighting with the storms in their bodies, with a pristine authority of a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity washing down over their figures!","Yet this authority....didn't notice that the gaze of another being had woken up here!","Noah's will expanded its breadth as he followed the heavy authority upwards, and he wondrously saw the figure of Seer Amestris who floated with a sharp gaze of contemplation, with an illusory screen of light beside her showing the image of none other than the imposing Avernus Extremity Overlord.","Noah's will was gazing at all of them...and they didn't know!","Absolute Hyperversal Inscrutable II Existence!","This was its sheer grandness as the amount of things Noah could do with it were limitless.","The authorities of two terrifying Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities were right before him along with dozens of other Extremities, and they had no idea!","And at this time, Noah's will perked up as he heard the calculative voice of Seer Amestris ring out.","[There are a few pathways we can utilize, but the one of Emperor Shao is the highest cost...but also the one with the most guaranteed rewards. I say use the favor for it.]","Emperor Shao? Favor?","With a gaze of interest, Noah's will came right in front of Seer Amestris and the illusory screen of the Avernus Extremity Overlord.","She wasn't currently veiled as her beauty could topple main realities and parallel realities, grace and majesty overflowing from her as she shone with a blinding light of Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures.","After a few seconds, her words received a reply from the Avernus Extremity Overlord that caused Noah's will to turn utterly cold.","[Very well. Inform Emperor Shao of the last usage of the favors he owes us...","shall be the complete eradication of Noah Osmont.]","WAA!","Deadly words echoed out under Noah's watch as his gaze turned increasingly cold!","He saw the visage of Seer Amestris flicker as an Extremity Clone was soon formed, this clone disappearing soon after as the gaze of her main body then turned its entire attention towards the Avernus Extremities below them in this isolated domain who continued to battle the effects of the Virion.","[As for them, there are three methods I want to try to separate the Extremity Pathogen in them. All will require the brief separation of their souls from their Aspects of Existence as they may even enter a state of pseudo True Death. But if nothing is done, the souls of the Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities will be worn down within a few days. After that...all of their Records will be affected and destroyed.]","...!","She determined Noah's fate by directing a terrifying enemy towards him, and then she moved on like nothing to gaze at the Avernus Extremities below!","Noah's will become exceedingly cold.","Many thoughts and possibilities crossed his mind as he sought to create new paths with the new information he had obtained.","Currently, his most pressing goal was to scale the Unscalable Wall of Extremity as with Oraculum, he had theorized that his Apexification may be a strong enough trigger.","In addition to this, he wanted the baptism and transformation brought by the full maturity of the Sporos III of Extremity to occur at the same time, and he planned to make it so by utilizing the False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of DESPOILER and gaining Loot from Extremities in addition to the millions of Apex Vacuous Lifeforms he had spread it to with Hyperversal Savior's Arks!","Thereafter, he would feel ready.","And even though the information he had just obtained in front of the discussion of Seer Amestris and the Avernus Extremity Overlord was deadly, he wasn't scared of the one known as Emperor Shao!","He was a terrifying entity who stood above others, yes.","But...could he even find Noah?","So now...","'How about getting started with Avernus Extremities?'","His will radiated coldness.","He counted 34 Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities among the Avernus Extremities affected by his Hyperversal Anomalous Virions.","He saw the Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures swirling around them as their gazes constantly changed from the explosion of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities within them!","Far, far from here- across Unrecorded and Recorded Histories, Noah's main will in his Main Body was roused as he floated up from the dazzling edge of Oceanus.","He saw the 210 False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of DESPOILER that floated in front of him as with a gaze of tyranny and power, he waved his hands to cause 34 of them to disappear!","\"The first Extremity has fallen under my arms...let the rest of them begin to follow.\"","...!","DUM!","A symphony of battle and majesty began.","Quintessence was roused as the Tyrannical Emperor made a move amidst schemes and power plays from many sides, his voice being one dripping with battle!","He made an attack from his base in a distant Recorded History within the Aeonic Annals of Extremity, this attack occurring right under the nose of a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity as this was what glorious a stage Noah had now reached!"]},{"number":2696,"title":"Chapter 2696: Chapter 2695 The Way to Scale the Unscalable! III","paragraphs":["2695 The Way to Scale the Unscalable! III","With a resolute will that didn't even fear the eyes of a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity, Noah made a move to decimate the Aspects of Existence of Avernus Extremities!","This was after a day of preparations, with the changes occurring on this day being too significant.","Some significant changes were even occurring at this very moment!","Within the Supernal Haven of Dissolution.","Near the Golden Havenly Smilodon Archipelago.","A shimmering golden floating landmass that was now widely known as the Infernal Havenly Commerce Archipelago blazed with brilliance amidst the streams of Dissolution, the authority of dreams pulsing in its sandy structure as halcyon waterfalls of essence beautifully dripped all around it.","It was filled with bustling activities at this moment, as in its peripheries, groups of Hyperversal Extremities and Apex Aeonic Lifeforms from different Inheritances and Clans could be seen, many of them marveling as they forged Absolute Dynamis of Extremity with a little effort and showed off the grand things they could do after they attained the Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage!","Other beings were clustered and going into the center of the island where the Esteemed Entity trading everyone the Blood Sources could be found, a steady stream of beings from Inheritances and Clans seeking these shocking crimson gold singularities only increasing over the last day as the Tyrannical effects of the Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage became more and more known.","Outside of this island, in the space that was halfway towards the Golden Havenly Smilodon Archipelago, the aura of a few Tier 3 and Tier 2 Smilodons, Titanoboas, and Dragonflies could be seen as they gazed at the far away golden island with scrutiny!","[Did you all find anything?]","A Havenly Smilodon Extremity spoke out calmly as they had gathered a lot of information about the Infernal Havenly Commerce over the past day, and they had even obtained a few hundred Blood Sources themselves to study.","[No. We've sent word to the nearby Obsidian Havenly Saurischian Archipelago, but these Blood Sources...the purity of a Bloodline they grant and the effects it has...they may meet or exceed what one gains when they've undergone a Crimson Bloodline Ablation...]","BOOM!","A Titanoboa pulsing with black tendrils of light spoke as his words caused an immense silence to descend!","None of them here had undergone a Crimson Bloodline Ablation.","Very few had even gained enough Units of Havenly Aurora to purchase the Obsidian Bloodline Ablation!","These Blood Sources...were even appetizing for them who held the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage!","[It is a type of a Havenly Lineage...just not one of the Four prominent ones. I'm not entirely sure how the higher ups will react to its spread- and it is spreading fast as some Apex Havenly Beasts have already fallen to the temptation and used the Blood Sources. Of course, their effects and true and tempt even someone like me.]","A serene Dragonfly spoke as an immense silence descended thereafter.","In the Supernal Havens of Extremity that was dominated by the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages, what effects and reactions would propagate from here on out?","It was a question that had to be asked as the more time that passed, the more that beings were convinced of the shocking majesty of this Lineage as even more forces rushed to obtain it!","Within the Supernal Havens of Extremity, the Infernal Havenly Commerce was gradually being considered one of the most renowned and easily accessible tools of this Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification due to how affordable its treasures were and what effects they brought.","And at this moment in time, something occurred that showed just how significant the spread of the Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage was about to be as the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities of Clans and Inheritances passed their judgment and made commands to attain as many Blood Sources as possible.","And of course, the first ones to take a big step forward were none other than the Clan that had been the first to attain the Blood Sources.","Towards the depths of the Infernal Havenly Commerce Archipelago, a procession of powerful auras of Extremities adorned in silver blue robes etched with the ecriture of a crescent moon could be seen.","They were led by a terrifying Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity whose figure was veiled with cerulean cloth, her curves dangerous for others to even gaze at as nobody spared her any inappropriate glances with the shocking power she let off!","Behind her, Tier 3, 2, and 1 Hyperversal Extremities followed along with a hundred thousand Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","All of them emanated waves of power as among them, others emanated even grander waves of authority as they already held the Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage!","The appearance of these beings caused the waves of people to scatter like sand as in a short moment, the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity of the Havenly Moon Clan appeared before Noah's figure.","This clone of his was draped in a golden emperor's robe as he seemed like an old man without a single strand of an aura, the gaze of the Tier 4 Extremity before him sharp as she only waved her hands to reveal the treasure she came to trade with.","And it was a maddening one as instantly, an aura of Pure Hyperversal Extremity spread out.","Extremely Pure!","And such purity could only come from...","[How many Blood Sources for this? It is a Half-Forged Armament of Extremity with the name of Andromeda Cleaver.]","WAA!","An Armament of Extremity!","A half-forged one, but it was an Armament of Extremity nonetheless as were it not contained in a glass circular casing filled with a silent aura of Extremity, its authority would have spread out to crush all beings who hadn't achieved Extremity here!","[....!]","Silent alarms and shock spread out all around as Noah's eyes remained placid even though his mind was booming.","His Eyes of Extremity gazed ahead as he saw the glass circular casing pulsing with 9 Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures all around it that read [DIVIDER].","And contained in this glass casing, a purple scimitar with a carved and sharp end could be seen as it stopped halfway- its handle not yet being formed.","A Half-Forged Armament of Extremity!"]},{"number":2697,"title":"Chapter 2697: Chapter 2696 The Way to Scale the Unscalable! IV","paragraphs":["2696 The Way to Scale the Unscalable! IV","It was only a Half-Forged Armament of Extremity, but the aura it let off was palpating as for Noah, it meant many things.","But the major one...was that would he even be able to obtain it?!","As an existence who hadn't achieved Extremity, he could not directly grasp Extremity.","His job was made half easy since the Half-Forged Armament of Extremity was encased in a tool that contained its grandeur.","But even holding this tool required Hyperversal Extremity Authority!","His eyes turned sharp as many thoughts bloomed, and countless possibilities flashed before his eyes!","Without a delay, he waved his hand to cause a shockingly dense proliferation of tens of millions of Blood Source to bloom.","...!","It was a scene that caused the breaths of many to be held still as their eyes flashed crimson gold with greed.","[50 Million Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage Blood Sources are sufficient to exchange for this little thing.]","WAA!","His words were astonishing to many as the sight of 50 Million Blood Sources caused many beings to feel their hearts racing.","This..wasn't this enough to take the whole Havenly Moon Clan, its Extremities, and Apex Aeonic Lifeforms to attain this shocking lineage?","They could even begin to spread it to those who had yet to become Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, with their elevated lineage allowing them to very quickly ascend towards becoming Apex Aeonic Lifeforms!","Undoubtedly, this would take the strength of the Havenly Moon Clan to a whole other level.","As for Noah casually releasing 50 Million Blood Sources...it was only a show of his preparation coming to fruition as over the past day, he had been rapidly producing more and more Blood Sources as the number he had in his reserves...was in the Billions.","After a momentary lapse of shock and wonder, Noah waved his hands forward as the millions of Blood Sources went towards the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity.","And this being waves her fair hands as the encased Half-Forged Armament of Extremity floated towards Noah!","Her eyes were luminous as her actions today could also be a form of a test.","Many beings wanted to know more about this mysterious old man and many others like him from the Infernal Havenly Commerce as with the appearance of an Armament of Extremity, he would at least have to reveal some of his Extremity Authority!","So...what exactly would it be?","Noah's eyes were serene at the sight of a floating Half-Forged Armament of Extremity coming towards him.","Something that was so far out of his grasp just a day ago as he was dragged into the Vaults of a Clan and an Inheritance just to view and be near one.","And now, he was about to gain ownership of such a treasure as it also tested him!","And his will seething with Quintessence and tyranny did not delay as he moved.","So what if it was an Armament of Extremity?","So what if he couldn't touch it?!","BOOM!","His body exploded with glory as thick streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority surged from him, this scene causing the hearts of all Extremities to flutter in shock!","[Second Vitalis Awakening...Second Vitalis Awakening!]","A Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity couldn't help but shout out as they saw the pristine control of snakes of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority that surged towards the cased Armament of Extremity.","And for those with more perceptive eyes, they saw that mixed within these streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority, a dense number of Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures swirled with glory.","Crimson Extremity Rune Scriptures!","The Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity of the Havenly Moon Clan breathed out a bated breath as she confirmed her test.","The Infernal Havenly Commerce was not to be underestimated!","Her eyes were fooled as she came to a shocking conclusion, but what she didn't know was that the dense Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures she could see the light of...were all False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of DESPOILER.","What she saw was merely what Noah wanted her to see!","What was the description of the distinction of the Inscrutable Existence?","It stated that [...No existences will be able to discern your Realm, Concepts, Layers, Dynamis, or anything else about you as even when you express a form of authority, you can choose how others perceive it, or you can express it as a formless authority that isn't visible to the naked eye...]","This was its description.","After gaining the False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of DESPOILER, Noah was capable of easily altering this type of Extremity Authority to be seen as Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures- even to the eyes of a Zenith Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity, much less this Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity before him!","Thereafter, his gaze focused on the Armament of Extremity before him.","His task was even easier as he didn't have to handle it personally, but just the Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of [DIVIDER] that surrounded the circular casing.","HUUM!","The glow of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority mixed with Noah's False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of DESPOILER wrapped around the glass casing as gloriously...he was able to move it towards him.","He wasn't coming in contact or moving the Armament of Extremity himself, but he simply moved two different authorities filled with his Will to carry the circular casing forward!","And since the authorities were filled with his Will, his eyes flashed with brilliance as a moment after...","WAP!","A glimmer of light flashed as the rivers of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority disappeared.","A monumental trade took place as on the other side, the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity attained 50 Million Blood Sources, her gaze filled with an unknown light as she gave a nod of respect towards Noah's figure, her hands fluttering commandingly as she and her forces instantly began to make their exit!","As for the Half-Forged Armament of Extremity that disappeared in the eyes of others? It would never be seen again!","—","Across the folds of space and time.","Layers of reality and dimensions pulsing like strings overlapped with each other as a circular casing carrying a Half-Forged Armament of Extremity was moved, layers of Oraculum wrapping around it as its destination was the Infinite Hyperversal Haven!","Around it, Noah's will was utterly cold as he had gained a lot of understanding of Extremity already.","One crucial one was that Extremity Rune Scriptures could carry the will of the existence that forged them!","And so on the period of time as the circular cased Armament of Extremity fluttered across the Aeonic Annals of Extremity, 9 of the False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of DESPOILER flashed as they targeted the 9 Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of DIVIDER.","BOOM...CRACK!","And thundering explosive waves of authority echoed out as the first usage of Noah's DESPOILER Scriptures were actually not on any being.","And the instant the Rune Scriptures protecting the Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of the Half-Forged Armament of Extremity from leaking disappeared, a storm of this authority seethed and threatened to spill out as other False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of DESPOILER wrapped with Vitalis Hyperversal Authority still kept it somewhat contained.","It traversed across the Records of history until it arrived in the Record containing Noah's Infinite Hyperversal Haven!","A crack tore open in space above the Aletheian Havens being born of Dissolution, Helios, Genesis, And Oceanus.","There, a roaring boom echoed out as a purple scimitar appeared, Vitalis Hyperversal Authority scattering along with False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of DESPOILER as this Half-Forged Armament of Extremity exploded out with a storm of purple authority that emanated glorious waves of Pure Hyperversal Extremity!","Pure. Hyperversal. Extremity!","It was an opportunity Noah had only theorized that some Clans may give when he forged the Infernal Havenly Commerce.","He didn't know it would occur so soon. He didn't see it in the Unrecorded Histories he was perusing!","And yet here it was.","Another method for him to Scale the Unscalable Wall.","An opportunity for RUINATION.","An opportunity for his Vassals!","It was Noah and the Infinite Hyperversal Haven gaining their first Armament of Extremity...even though it wasn't fully forged!"]},{"number":2698,"title":"Chapter 2698: Chapter 2697 The Way to Scale the Unscalable! V","paragraphs":["2697 The Way to Scale the Unscalable! V","A brilliant half-formed scimitar.","It radiated glorious purple waves of Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of ANDROMEDA as similar to the Hyperversal Bow of Helios, it was an Armament of Extremity that was being formed with a Havenly Authority at its basis!","It now sat atop the Aletheian Havens of other Havenly Authorities as the Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority blared out like an unfolding sea, covering the nearby 1,000 light years in diameter before the surging tendrils of ANDROMEDA pulsed and maintained this stellar domain.","This was the Andromeda Cleaver!","And by obtaining it, Noah could possibly do a great deal of things as first and foremost...","[My people...]","HUM!","His voice roared out with majesty and grandeur as his main body appeared in the periphery of the Armament of Extremity.","His voice echoed out to all Apex Aeonic Lifeforms under his banner as through the purity of his Lineage, Henry was the first to arrive as he was soon followed up by Aurelia and Orion!","Barbatos, Guinevere, Kazuhiko, the Sword Emperor, and many others appeared soon after that as their numbers only kept increasing.","All of their main bodies were in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven as only their Vitalistic Clones ventured into the Supernal Havens of Extremity, and they were currently stretched out across multiple Havenly Archipelagos as they lived and breathed in Challenger Arenas and collected Units of Havenly Aurora!","As soon as they neared the 10,000 threshold or exceeded it to the extent that even Extremities could begin paying attention, they transferred all the Units to Noah for safekeeping as he was acting like one of the Vaults of Extremity that the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages established.","These Units would then be utilized by them whenever they wished to purchase Havenly Treasures that met their needs, with his strongest Vassals being reborn through the baptism of battles and loot as they actually put their concepts of Extremity as their own!","And now, he called them here to grant them access to something he fought hard to get multiple times.","[A Half-Forged Armament of Extremity lies before you. The Andromeda Cleaver...if you can bear and absorb the Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority it radiates, you will obtain the Havenly Boundary of Andromeda. If you are inches from it, you will achieve the 17th Layer. If you are able to wield it...","Extremity is yours...]","His voice was filled with Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authority as he spoke, his words causing clamor and shock to spread among his people- even those who thought they knew Noah better by now!","If one had to be an Extremity to wield it...then how did it get into their Infinite Hyperversal Haven?","Was Noah already....","Many gazed at his figure with astonished and questioning looks as in a corner, even the figure of the demoness Lilith could be seen observing with a difficult expression!","She seemed to bury many things in her heart at this moment as she was among the first to ask no questions.","She only walked forward.","Henry and the others were also at the forefront as with their Boundary Layers barely reaching the 13th or 14th as their highest, they came in contact with and tried to overcome the Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of a Half-","Forged Armament of Extremity!","At the same as Noah released this opportunity to his Vassals, the area surrounding him flickered as the crimson gold humanoid figure of RUINATION appeared from the depths of his soul.","Her gaze was fixated on the Andromeda Cleaver as Noah's voice rang out lightly.","\"Can you deconstruct it and at the very least duplicate it? Or can you only devour it to gain its status?\"","...!","His voice calmed and wasn't burning with authority as even after he asked...","[...]","Ruination remained quiet.","For the first time in many weeks and months, RUINATION didn't reply to Noah right away on whether she could do something or not!","She took her time as her eyes seemed to flash with glory and uncertainty at the very same time.","And soon after...","[I need to be close to be sure.]","Her words were resolute as he also began to walk into the 1,000 Light Year Domain!","At this moment, an Armament of Extremity was about to be put to full use by the whole Infinite Hyperversal Haven- the one to make this happen being the Infernal Havenly Commerce.","Its source...one of the Seven Clans.","The Havenly Moon Clan had traded a Half-Forged Armament of Extremity for millions of Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage Blood Sources.","Such a reality and knowledge was spreading far and wide as it was easy to speculate...just what effect it would have on the current state of affairs of the Seven Clans? And what of the Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity?!","—","In the Nether Haven of Genesis.","The Seer of Sima was looking at a man shrouded in a billowing storm of golden white brilliance, his aura sharp and oppressive to all others as around him, tendrils of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority swan freely!","He was filled with power, and yet the Seer of Sima treated him normally as she spoke at this time.","[The Havenly Moon Clan has just used an Armament of Extremity to buy all of their most important forces the keys to unlock the Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage. I've told you that if the Sima Clan is to survive with a decent number of us keeping our lives, something like this will be critical. I know you've had everyone collecting and filling up the Vaults of Sima all these years...it is time to empty them. If not an Armament of Extremity, then other oddities and rarities you haven't let go all these years..]","Her words were resolute.","The man billowing with white gold storms of brilliance was quiet before he gave a light nod a moment later!","This...was just the Sima Clan.","The other members of the Seven Clans reacted in varying manners after learning of the actions of the Havenly Moon Clan, but there were others with an even stronger reaction who held just as much power as the Seven Clans!","The most powerful Inheritance of Extremity!"]},{"number":2699,"title":"Chapter 2699: Chapter 2698 The Way to Scale the Unscalable! VI","paragraphs":["2698 The Way to Scale the Unscalable! VI","Around the same moment in time, within the Nether Haven of Helios.","In a plane of existence located amidst trillions of burning suns, within a domain termed the Royal Infinite Scorching Chambers.","The visage of Ayame floated in a unique domain with her eyes closed, multiple Hyperversal Extremity Authorities washing over her body on all sides as they seemed to be analyzing everything about her.","A crimson gold Aurora of lights covered this whole region as behind her floating figure, her grandfather could be seen.","And far ahead of them, 9 crimson gold flaming thrones radiating intense might and grander floated as they were the ones analyzing everything about Ayame after she had taken a Blood Source!","Thereafter, one of the 9 voices thundered out.","[This Havenly Lineage is one of the most conducive things to seek an Aspect of Infinity that I've ever come across. Hidden within it...I can even sense a thread of Infinity!]","WAA!","A thread of Infinity!","The voice that thundered out caused Ayame's grandfather to squint his eyes in shock as he asked in a low voice.","[This thread of Infinity...was successfully taken to Extremity? The one to enact this Lineage has actually made Infinity no longer be a Dead Path?!]","If an existence ever took a concept that was considered a Dead Path and elevated it to Extremity, its Hyperversal Extremity Authority would be born.","Thereafter, it was akin to a forefather taking the steps forward and giving a chance for those behind him to follow, with the chances of others opening up this dead path also increasing if they were given access to the pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of the Dead Path!","Infinity...was something that nobody in the Inheritance of the Infinite Extremity had achieved.","They only sought Aspects of Infinity in other concepts as a vast majority focused on Heat. Others called it Incandescence, or Calefaction. Others focused on entirely opposing concepts of Coldness!","But at the end of the day, they sought Infinity.","[No, it shouldn't have been taken to Extremity just yet. Otherwise, this Lineage would be something that may change the fate of our Nether Havens. But...we do need to obtain more of these Blood Sources, as well as any connections they hold. You said Ayame obtained these from a...Noah Osmont?]","Another authoritative voice thundered out as it clasped a Blood Source within their hands.","Ayame's grandfather nodded as a moment later, another voice echoed out from a far left throne.","[Invite this Noah Osmont over. In the meantime, the completed Hyperversal Bow of Helios does not yet have an owner...are any of you opposed to using this to obtain everything our Inheritance needs?]","...!","Shocking words emanated out as from the surroundings...","[Nay.]","[Nay...]","No opposition!","When asked if there was anyone opposed to utilizing the recently completed Hyperversal Bow of Helios, nobody denied such a thought as the motion was quickly passed!","[Very well, make the trade with the Infernal Havenly Commerce. Let us see if this is the key that shall finally let us grasp the ever distant Infinity...]","A breath of billowing heat from the speaking Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity boomed out as Ayame was finally awoken from her slumber, her will gazing around and not knowing just what monumental choices were made!","—","In the Supernal Haven of Dissolution.","Towards the depths where one would find Supernal Vein Rifts leading to the other Supernal Havens of Extremity, within one of the largest Crimson Havenly Archipelagos.","Across its vastness and quintillions of Lifeforms moving about, towards the very center of this Archipelago- there was a Restricted Domain that only some of those with the purest Celestia Extremity Lineage could enter!","In one such restrictive domain, streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority flowed serenely as crystal white trees rose majestically, glistening white grass sewing in the wind as it surrounded a lake of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority.","At the center of this lake, the figure of Emperor Shao's main body could be seen seated in a meditative position as in his hands...he grasped the tool that made it possible for him to attain his First and Second Vitalis Awakening successively.","His tan gold skin reflected its crystalline white luster as it was a smooth round crystalloid object the size of his fist, and yet its weight alone was hard for the past him who was at the Tier 3 Gradation of Extremity to even hold onto!","It was something that could only be forged by Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities with a strong inclination to Vitalis Hyperversal Authority- and those who also had a Billion Units of Havenly Aurora to buy a Modus Operandi that allowed one to refine Vitalis Hyperversal Authority and forge such a treasure!","It was known simply as...a Vitalis Planalith Krystallos.","A Havenly Extremity Treasure that contained within it the densest and most concentrated forms of pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority as even though it was the size of his fist, it contained inside of it enough Pure and dense Vitalis Hyperversal Authority to fill an entire plane of Existence!","Vitalis Planalith Krystallos!","A single one was equivalent to the baptisms of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority he had received for his grand achievements.","And he...had already devoured 10 Vitalis Planalith Krystallos that were refined by the very same being who threw him out of these lands long, long ago.","They were part of his inheritance that cost Billions of Units of Havenly Aurora as even among the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages, getting one's hands on any Vitalis Planalith Krystallos was nearly an impossibility.","Shao breathed out serenely as tendrils of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority burst around his body, continuing to slowly take in the essence of the Vitalis Planalith Krystallos in his hands when his gaze changed.","He waved his hands to pull out a communication medallion that showed the illusory visage of Seer Amestris rising up before him, her figure unveiled before his eyes as she even smiled!","[Emperor Shao, we are ready to redeem the last favor.]","WAA!","His dark hair shone with a glorious luster. His now golden-colored skin pulsed with incandescence as he spoke with sharp eyes.","[You know my methods. Send over all the information.]","All of the information.","The background, who it involved, their Recorded Histories, affiliations, recent events and conflicts- everything!","He always wanted a clear picture before he ever made a move as information was critical.","The medallion he held wavered and flashed with light as soon after, multiple Singularities containing information floated out as Shao's will permeated into them.","And soon after, his eyes flickered as his gaze changed.","The Singularities of information he had received all had a single being contained within them!","[Noah Osmont again?]","His voice was light as he turned to stare directly at the illusory figure of Seer Amestris.","The Seer didn't hide anything and let him know that by completing this favor, he would very likely be hunted by the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages- at the very least the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage!","[You realize that by forcing me to complete this favor, it will also make me your enemy? You are making me do something that a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity like yourself doesn't have the will to do, to make enemies of the forces of the Supernal Havens of Extremity.]","...!","[I know.] Seer Amestris replied with a light nod as her smile faded ever so slowly.","[I know...and yet, it is better to earn your ire than keep this threat of Noah Osmont active. I hope you understand our position.]","BOOM!"]},{"number":2700,"title":"Chapter 2700: Chapter 2699 {WEAK}! I","paragraphs":["2699 [WEAK]! I","It was better to earn the ire of a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity than to keep alive the threat that was Noah Osmont!","Such a statement was a shocking testament to the might and mystery that Noah Osmont represented!","Emperor Shao's eyes shone with utmost sharpness as he gazed at the visage of Seer Amestris calmly.","He owed the Avernus Clan favors as he had received their help in gathering the rest of the materials to forge his Armament of Extremity that his Extremity Clone carried a version of while protecting the Bastions of Vitalis, among other rare treasures over the years.","After he gained a sufficient foothold, he stopped handing out favors as he knew one day, the cost of one may be exceedingly high!","And now, such a time had come.","With utmost serenity and power, he replied to the illusory figure before him.","[Then I will work to the best of my abilities to complete this favor. Since it is someone who stumped even you and your Overlord, I cannot provide any guarantees.]","...!","Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities talked amongst each other as shockingly, they couldn't say with confidence that they would be able to kill a single being who had yet to even achieve Extremity!","Seer Amestris nodded after hearing this as her figure began to flicker.","[Then I wish you a good hunt.]","WAP!","Thereafter, the illusion entirely flickered and disappeared.","All that was left behind was Emperor Shao as his gaze remained one of placidity and grandeur, his voice echoing out to himself as he perused the many Records he just received.","\"Noah Osmont...just what are you to warrant such an unfolding reality?\"","An existence that hadn't even achieved Extremity, and yet his hidden attacks had incapacitated even up to Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities.","While viewing the records of this being in the Obsidian Havenly Saurischian Archipelago, and how he had remained utterly still while his capabilities affected Tier 3 to Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities, as well as the eruption of storms of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authority in their bodies...","[Hmm?] Shao blinked a few times as he viewed this scene again.","The erupting storms of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authority!","Didn't he see something similar to this early in the unfolding War occurring between Vitalis and Vacuous Legions right now?","His thought process quickly moved as he brought up the reality he viewed in the periphery of his will a day ago.","And there...he saw it once more.","He saw a whole Hyperversal Savior's Ark incapacitated as when he made his moves, one of the affected Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities had even perished under a storm of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities!","[He...is already active in this large-scale war? Fighting for Vitalis?]","Shao's eyes were deep as he affirmed his thoughts!","He also confirmed that this being- before he even became an Extremity, he had already grown capable of decimating those at this stage!","Shao knew his own history as he was never capable of killing a Hyperversal Extremity when he was an Apex Aeonic Lifeform.","Now, an entity who could do this and more had risen as...his path and destiny in all this was to do his best to destroy this being?","A being that had the potential to grow and be even more exceptional than him?","An existence who may have undergone their Second Vitalis Awakening. Their Second! This was what remained most unbelievable, because Shao knew the difficulty of achieving the Second Awakening.","Even though he had achieved it successively after the first Awakening, he relied on things all others didn't even know existed- the Vitalis Planalith Krystallos!","The Records Seer Amestris had given indicated for Shao to go to the Saurischian Archipelago to locate one of Noah's bodies and then use his means to scorch everything about him from existence.","But now that Shao affirmed this being was active in the war between Vitalis and Vacuous Legions, he could observe him and just what this being stood for on this battlefield!","[Noah Osmont...] Shao uttered out this name again as he wondered.","What was this being doing right now, and how should Shao exactly react to this favor?","—","Waves of silent tyranny simmered.","In the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, there was now a domain of 1,000 Light Years of Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of ANDROMEDA, with many beings currently seeking to advance towards the tool radiating all this grandiose light!","After Noah's closest Vassals, hundreds of Enders of Extremity could be seen making their way into this domain as in the lead was none other than Hyperion!","His elephantine trunk blared out maddeningly while swallowing up the purple tendrils of Authority while he advanced forward slowly.","Among those who had made the greatest headway towards the Half-Forged Armament of Extremity, Henry was actually in the lead as an Entity next in line with the highest level of purity of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage.","After him, through sheer pride and glory...it was actually the Emperor Penguin!","Orion, Aurelia, Ophelia, and uniquely Lilith were somehow on the same page- the last mentioned being having come to a shocking resolution to change herself as she did not like sitting on the sidelines.","She was the Daughter of Hatred.","The Dimensional Deceiver!","Her loss had been mind-numbing and mind-shattering as she had lost her way briefly, but the actions of the being who came to dominate her showed her a path forward.","He didn't care about her.","After defeating her and dominating her, she felt fairly discarded!","It wasn't that he was just apathetic- but he simply surrounded himself with those who were useful. After her loss, had she been useful?","She knew this answer herself as since the Master of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven didn't care about old enemies like her joining his folds, she could still seek what her heart desired so long as it aligned with his goals.","And so...she took another step forward.","HUUM!","Bells resonated around her as she saw a prompt telling her she had attained the 9th Boundary Layer of Andromeda.","Her steps were light and firm.","She was the Defiler of Souls.","Her strongest point was her soul as her machinations had spread across Dimensions!","At this moment, her soul cried out and flourished as her obsession to reclaim her grand status but under the banner of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor was grander than anyone else!"]}]);
